L["Azshara's broken towers still hold the secrets of the highborne, and everyone has come to dig for them. Night elf sentinels at Talrendis Point fight the Spitelash naga for the ruins of Eldarath, while at Valormok the Horde has paid in blood for trusting a blood elf mage.\n\nTo the north, the Blackmaw furbolgs shelter in the camps of Ursolan, driven from their home by the Legashi satyr and sickening from the corruption the demons spread. Their gatekeeper is looking for allies."] = "艾薩拉殘破的高塔中仍藏著上層精靈的秘密，所有人都趕來挖掘。夜精靈哨兵在塔倫迪斯營地與鞭笞者納迦爭奪艾達拉斯廢墟，而在瓦羅莫克，部落則因輕信一名血精靈法師而付出了血的代價。\n\n北方，黑喉熊怪棲身於厄索蘭的營地中。他們被雷加希薩特趕出了家園，又因惡魔散播的腐化而染病。他們的守門人正在尋找盟友。"
