L["The old feud between the Magram and the Gelkis has spilled into Shen'dralas, where elven ruins hide a valley of bones and a dark magic that answers to whoever reaches for it. Whichever clan you call friend, the dead there will not stay quiet.\n\nBeyond the centaur battle lines, cracked pylons hum in the forest, a reclusive order of elves still keeps its temple, and a gardener wonders what became of the treants she left to guard her flowers."] = "瑪格拉姆與吉爾吉斯之間的宿怨已蔓延到辛德拉拉斯。這裡的精靈廢墟中隱藏著一座白骨之谷，以及一種會回應任何伸手索取者的黑暗魔法。無論你與哪個部族結為朋友，那裡的死者都不會安息。\n\n在半人馬的戰線之外，破裂的晶塔在森林中嗡嗡作響，一個隱世的精靈教團仍守護著他們的神殿，還有一位園丁想知道，她留下來守護花朵的樹人後來怎麼樣了。"
L["Desolace / Shen'dralas"] = "淒涼之地 / 辛德拉拉斯"
