L["Zephras Isle floats in Skywall, the realm of Al'Akir, held aloft by anchor pylons the wind spirits left behind. The spirits are gone, the pylons falter, and the Al'Aketh cult preaches that only devotion to the Windlord can save the Skyborne.\n\nCome of age in Thendal Grove, then carry the island's troubles from Shen'dar Village to the port of Valanaar, where the High Order and the Windshapers distrust each other almost as much as they fear High Priestess Lorthuna."] = "澤弗拉斯島漂浮在奧拉基爾的國度天空之牆中，靠風之靈留下的錨定晶塔支撐在空中。如今風之靈已經離去，晶塔搖搖欲墜，而奧拉凱斯教派則宣揚，只有虔誠侍奉風王才能拯救天裔。\n\n在森達爾林地迎來成年，然後將島上的種種危機從辛達爾村帶到港城瓦拉納爾。在那裡，至高教團與塑風者之間的互不信任，幾乎和他們對高階女祭司洛蘇娜的恐懼一樣深。"
