L["Myrokos Silentform has work for Ravenholdt's agents. The Syndicate has grown bold in the hills of Alterac and Arathi, and someone must cut it where it will bleed the most."] = "麥洛克斯有任務要交給拉文霍德的特務。辛迪加在奧特蘭克和阿拉希的山丘間日益猖狂，必須有人在最能讓它失血的地方下刀。"
L["You began by removing Lord Tomas from Durnholde Keep. Later, Myrokos had you lift a scouting report from a Syndicate pocket and beat its searchers to the heirlooms of House Perenolde in the ruins of Alterac. In a stolen uniform you walked into Stromgarde Keep, found the leverage to make Anastasia talk, and broke up the secret handoff at Thoradin's Wall, carrying the prize back to Ravenholdt."] = "你的第一項任務是將托馬斯領主從敦霍爾德城堡中除掉。後來，米洛克斯讓你從一名辛迪加成員的口袋裡偷出一份偵察報告，並搶在辛迪加的搜尋者之前，在奧特蘭克的廢墟中拿到佩瑞諾德家族的傳家寶。你穿著偷來的制服走進激流堡，找到了讓安娜絲塔西亞開口的把柄，並破壞了在索拉丁之牆進行的祕密交接，把戰利品帶回了拉文霍德。"
