L["the Shrine of Aessina, Ashenvale"] = "艾森娜神殿，梣谷"
L["Nobody in the Circle is ever in a hurry, and the spirits are worse. I was sent to sit with the great spirit of the bear, and it took its time telling me what a bear is. Strong, mostly. I had guessed that part, but it's polite to let a spirit finish.\n\nThe trial that followed had claws. There was a beast to face, and it was not interested in my reasons. I won. Winning, it turned out, was the easy half. The other half was what the spirit had been getting at all along: strength is for something. A bear doesn't brawl for the fun of it. It stands between its own and the world, and then it goes back to its berries.\n\nI came home able to wear that shape whenever I like. People step out of your way more. I find it very restful."] = "塞納里奧議會裡沒有人會趕時間，那些先靈更慢。我被派去陪巨熊之靈坐坐，牠慢條斯理地跟我解釋熊是什麼。大概就是：很壯。這部分我自己也猜得到啦，不過先靈在講話，讓牠講完是基本禮貌。\n\n接下來的試煉是有爪子的。我得面對一頭野獸，而牠對我有什麼理由一點興趣都沒有。我贏了。結果贏反而是簡單的那一半。另一半，才是先靈從頭到尾想讓我懂的事：力量是拿來做事的。熊不會為了好玩去打架。牠擋在自己人和這個世界中間，擋完了，就回去吃牠的莓果。\n\n回家之後，那個樣子我想變就變。路上的人比較會讓路了。我覺得這樣非常清靜。"
L["The Circle never hands you a spell. It hands you a problem and sits back to see what you'll do with it.\n\nThis time it was the deer of Darkshore, sickening up and down the coast. I went up to Cliffspring Falls to find where it began, and Alanndarian Nightsong in Auberdine turned what I brought back into a salve.\n\nThen I spent a slow, pleasant afternoon walking Darkshore from the river nearly to Ashenvale, finding sick deer and putting salve on them. Ten in all. Not one of them said thank you. Each got up, gave me a look as though I'd been rude, and wandered off into the trees.\n\nHealthy, though. Gratitude is a people habit. Deer just get on with things, and the older I get, the more I think they have the right idea."] = "議會從來不會直接塞給你一個法術。他們塞給你一個問題，然後往椅背一靠，看你怎麼處理。\n\n這次是黑海岸的鹿，沿著整條海岸一隻接一隻病倒。我跑上峭壁之泉去找病是從哪裡開始的，再把帶回來的東西交給奧伯丁的奧蘭達利亞·夜歌，調成了一罐藥膏。\n\n接著我花了一個悠哉又愉快的下午，從河邊一路走到快到梣谷，把黑海岸整個走一遍，看到生病的鹿就幫牠抹藥。總共十隻。沒有一隻跟我說謝謝。每一隻都爬起來，瞪我一眼，好像我很沒禮貌似的，然後晃進樹林裡去了。\n\n不過都好了。懂得道謝是人的習慣。鹿就只是好好過自己的日子，而我年紀越大，越覺得牠們才是對的。"
L["Druids learn healing the way everyone learns anything: somebody's sick, and you're the one standing there.\n\nThe somebody was the gazelles of the northern Barrens. I climbed Dreadmist Peak to find where the sickness began, and Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads set about making a salve. He needed kodo horns. The kodos had a view on that. We came to an arrangement.\n\nThen I spent a long, warm day north of the Crossroads, chasing sick gazelles and dabbing salve on them. Ten in all. Have you ever tried to doctor a gazelle? They're quick even when they're poorly. Not one stopped to thank me. They got up and ran.\n\nWhich is the point, really. A gazelle that runs is a gazelle that's well."] = "德魯伊學治療，跟大家學任何東西都一樣：有誰病了，而剛好站在旁邊的人是你。\n\n這次的「誰」，是貧瘠之地北邊的瞪羚。我爬上鬼霧峰去找病源，十字路口的圖加·符文圖騰則開始動手做藥膏。他需要科多獸的角。科多獸對這件事有意見。最後我們達成了某種協議。\n\n然後我在十字路口北邊度過了又長又熱的一天，追著生病的瞪羚跑，幫牠們抹藥。總共十隻。你們有試過幫瞪羚看病嗎？牠們就算生病了還是跑超快。沒有一隻停下來謝我。爬起來就跑了。\n\n說真的，這才是重點。會跑的瞪羚，就是健康的瞪羚。"
L["Moonglade is the one place in the world where nobody rushes you, so naturally it's where they teach you to swim.\n\nThe first trial meant hunting the bottom of Lake Elune'ara for a shrine bauble and carrying it up to the Shrine of Remulos. Tajarri was waiting there to tell me I'd passed. I was too waterlogged to argue.\n\nThe second was the Pendant of the Sea Lion, which comes in two halves, and nobody would simply tell me where they were. You ask the folk of Moonglade, and they give you a hint and a kind smile and go back to whatever they were doing. Druids. I'm allowed to say that.\n\nI found both halves and brought the pendant to Dendrite Starblaze, and I've had the sea lion's shape ever since. Finest way to travel I know. No boats, no docks, and nobody asks you for a fare."] = "月光林地是全世界唯一沒人會催你的地方，所以理所當然，他們就選在這裡教你游泳。\n\n第一個試煉，是潛到月神湖底找一顆神殿靈珠，再把它帶到雷姆洛斯神殿。塔加里在那邊等著告訴我，我過關了。我整個人泡得濕透，懶得跟誰爭。\n\n第二個是海獅墜飾。它分成兩半，而且沒有人肯直接告訴我在哪裡。你去問月光林地的居民，他們就給你一個提示、一個和善的微笑，然後繼續忙自己的事。德魯伊嘛。這話我講可以。\n\n我把兩半都找齊，把墜飾交給德迪利特·星焰，從那之後我就能變成海獅了。這是我知道最棒的旅行方式。不用搭船，不用碼頭，也沒人跟你收船錢。"
L["Dendrite Starblaze called me back to Moonglade to meet a cat. The spirit of one, anyway, up in the southern hills, and cats, as everybody knows, don't teach just anybody.\n\nBefore it would say much, it wanted three relics: the Fang, the Claw and the Silent Shadow. All three were down in the Stormrage Barrow Dens, a long, dim place where it pays to be quiet. I went in, came out with all three and laid them in front of the spirit. It looked at them for a good long while. Cats do.\n\nThen it gave me its blessing, and the shape that goes with it: soft feet, sharp claws and the knack of not being noticed. Dendrite didn't look the least bit surprised. I suspect the whole thing had been arranged before I ever arrived."] = "德迪利特·星焰叫我回月光林地去見一隻貓。好啦，是貓的靈魂，在南邊的山丘上。而大家都知道，貓可不是誰都肯教的。\n\n牠在多說什麼之前，先要三件聖物：尖牙、利爪和寂靜暗影。三件都在怒風獸穴裡，那地方又長又暗，保持安靜準沒錯。我進去，帶著三件聖物出來，擺在先靈面前。牠盯著看了好一陣子。貓就是這樣。\n\n然後牠給了我祝福，還有跟著祝福來的形態：軟軟的腳掌、利利的爪子，還有不被人注意的本事。德迪利特一點也不意外。我懷疑整件事早在我到之前就安排好了。"
L["Every hunter starts the same way. Your trainer hands you a rod, points at something with teeth and tells you to go and make friends.\n\nThe Taming Rod does half the talking. You get close, you hold steady, and if you've got it right the beast stops trying to eat you and starts following you about instead. Then you work together a while, so you both learn the job. I did that three times, with three different beasts, and handed the rod back each time with all my fingers.\n\nAfter that I was sent to a proper trainer to learn how to keep a beast of my own. I've had a partner at my side ever since. Finds the trail, takes the first bite, holds them still while I shoot. I get paid. It gets fed. Best bargain either of us ever made."] = "每個獵人的起點都一樣。訓練師塞給你一根棒子，指著某個有牙齒的東西，叫你去跟牠交朋友。\n\n馴獸棒負責一半的溝通。你靠近，穩住，如果做對了，那頭野獸就不再想吃你，反而開始跟著你到處跑。接著你們一起搭檔一陣子，彼此學會怎麼做事。我這樣做了三次，三頭不同的野獸，每次把棒子還回去的時候，手指都還是十根。\n\n之後我被派去找正式的訓練師，學怎麼養一頭自己的野獸。從那時起，我身邊就一直有個夥伴。牠負責找蹤跡、咬第一口，把對方按住讓我射。我拿錢，牠吃飽。這是我們倆這輩子做過最划算的交易。"
L["Out of Molten Core, if you're lucky, comes a leaf. Ancient Petrified Leaf. Looks like nothing. Its owner turned out to be Vartrus, an ancient up in Felwood, and Vartrus wanted four demons dead.\n\nThey weren't hard to kill. They were hard to find, because they were living among ordinary folk under friendly names. Artorius the Amiable, for one. Very amiable. Less so after the first arrow.\n\nIt had to be done alone, the ancients said. My pet and I agreed the pet didn't count. The pet did most of the tracking, so that seemed only fair.\n\nThe other two ancients wanted sinew from a grown black dragon and a grown blue one. Neither dragon was in a giving mood. What I got for it all was Rhok'delar, the longbow of the Ancient Keepers. My pet still hasn't forgiven me for not getting one too."] = "運氣好的話，熔火之心裡會掉出一片葉子。古代石化葉片。看起來毫不起眼。結果它的主人是古樹瓦特魯斯，住在費伍德森林深處，而瓦特魯斯要四個惡魔的命。\n\n殺牠們不難，難的是找到牠們，因為牠們混在普通人裡面，還取了很親切的名字。像是「和藹的阿托瑞斯」。真的很和藹。第一箭下去之後就沒那麼和藹了。\n\n古樹們說，這件事必須獨自完成。我跟我的寵物一致認為寵物不算。反正大部分的追蹤都是牠做的，這樣算很公平。\n\n另外兩位古樹要的是成年黑龍和成年藍龍的龍筋。兩頭龍都沒有要施捨的心情。這一切換來的是洛克迪拉，上古守護者的長弓。我的寵物到現在還沒原諒我沒幫牠也弄一把。"
L["Every mage needs a focus, and the clever ones have theirs made by the best. In Valanaar, the best is Belann Windwood, who has been shaping staves and wands for the High Order for more than a century.\n\nThe price is one of the order's oldest traditions: a fallen bough from the oldest trees on the isle, the kind the wind has been working on longer than anyone has kept count. A Wind-Infused Bough, to be precise, and I always am.\n\nYou'd think a fallen branch would be easy to find. Fallen branches are everywhere. The right one is not. I found it anyway, because I'm good at this.\n\nOut of it Belann made a focus that answers to me and nobody else. It's a tradition, apparently. I prefer to think of it as overdue recognition."] = "每個法師都需要一件法術聚焦器，聰明的法師會找最頂尖的人來做。在瓦拉納爾，最頂尖的就是貝藍‧風木，替高天盟打造法杖和魔杖已經超過一百年了。\n\n代價是教團最古老的傳統之一：島上最古老的樹落下的枝條，那種被風吹了不知道多少年、久到沒人算得清的枝條。精確地說，是一根風能灌注樹枝。而我向來很精確。\n\n你會以為找根掉下來的樹枝很簡單。掉下來的樹枝到處都是。對的那一根可不是。但我還是找到了，因為我就是厲害。\n\n貝藍用它做出了一件只聽我使喚的聚焦器。據說這是傳統。我比較喜歡把它當成遲來的肯定。"
L["Tabetha lives out in Dustwallow Marsh, and she's who the trainers send you to when you're ready for a wand. Practical sort. Knows her business.\n\nShe wanted a book called Rituals of Power, which Magus Tirth keeps in a strongbox out on the Shimmering Flats. The box only opens to the right phrase, and nobody was going to just tell me the phrase. I had to go and find it. Frankly, that was the easiest part of the whole affair. Words are what I do.\n\nAfter a little shopping, jade and a bramble with lightning still crackling in it, Tabetha did her ritual. I watched very closely. I walked out with a wand of my own school.\n\nMost people think a wand is a stick that throws sparks. Most people are right. But it's my stick, and the sparks go exactly where I tell them."] = "塔貝薩住在塵泥沼澤，訓練師覺得你準備好拿魔杖了，就會叫你去找她。務實的人，很懂門道。\n\n她要一本叫《能量儀祭》的書，被大法師提爾斯鎖在閃光平原的一個保險箱裡。那箱子只有說對口令才會開，而且當然沒人會直接告訴我口令。我得自己去找。老實說，這是整件事裡最簡單的部分。文字就是我的本行。\n\n稍微採買了一下，一點翡翠，還有一根上面還劈啪冒著閃電的荊棘，塔貝薩就開始做她的儀式。我看得非常仔細。走出來的時候，我手上多了一根屬於自己學派的魔杖。\n\n大多數人覺得魔杖就是一根會噴火花的棍子。大多數人說得沒錯。但這是我的棍子，火花我叫它往哪飛，它就往哪飛。"
L["Archmage Xylem keeps a tower on the cliffs of Azshara, and when an archmage that far from anywhere asks for help, it's never boring.\n\nPolymorph does something odd to the Spitelash naga. Turn one into a sheep, and a few seconds later a copy of it falls out of the spell, as though the magic can't decide what it's holding. You kill the copy. Xylem needed fifty.\n\nFifty. I sheeped half the coast. It was the most scientific afternoon of my life.\n\nAnd what do fifty scraps of broken magic teach you? How to turn someone into a pig. Is a pig better than a sheep? It's funnier, and I've come to believe that counts."] = "大法師克希雷姆在艾薩拉的懸崖上有一座塔。一個住得這麼偏僻的大法師開口找人幫忙，事情絕對不會無聊。\n\n變形術對惡鞭納迦有種怪怪的效果。把一隻變成綿羊，過幾秒，法術裡就會掉出一隻牠的複製品，好像魔法搞不清楚自己抓著的到底是什麼。你把複製品殺掉。克希雷姆要五十隻。\n\n五十隻。我把半條海岸都變成了羊。那是我這輩子最有科學精神的一個下午。\n\n那麼，五十片碎掉的魔法能教你什麼？怎麼把人變成豬。豬有比羊好嗎？比較好笑。而我越來越相信，好笑也算數。"
L["The errand was a Prismatic Shell, and a warlord called Krellian had one. Had. The real work came after."] = "差事是一個稜彩貝殼，有個叫克雷利安的軍閥手上就有一個。曾經有。真正的工作在後面。"
L["Dire Maul has a library, the Athenaeum, and in it sits Lorekeeper Lydros, who looks after a great many books and a few very good spells. I liked Lydros at once. Anyone who stays in a ruin for the reading has their priorities in order.\n\nThe spell's price was the essence of Hydrospawn, a water elemental loose in the Warpwood Quarter. Hydrospawn didn't care to be anybody's price. It was a damp afternoon. I brought the essence back.\n\nWhat I got for it isn't flashy. No fire, no frost, nothing anyone will write a song about. But a fight is a short thing between two long rests. Anyone can throw a fireball. Not everyone can bring refreshments, and at the end of a long day underground, you'd be amazed which one people remember."] = "厄運之槌裡有座圖書館，裡面坐著博學者萊德羅斯，照顧著一大堆書，還有幾個非常好用的法術。我一見到萊德羅斯就很喜歡。願意為了看書待在廢墟裡的人，輕重緩急一定分得很清楚。\n\n法術的代價是海多斯博恩的精華，那是一隻在扭木廣場亂跑的水元素。海多斯博恩可不想當任何人的代價。那是個濕答答的下午。精華我還是帶回來了。\n\n我換到的東西一點也不華麗。沒有火，沒有冰，沒人會為它寫歌。但一場架，不過是兩段長長的休息中間短短的一段。誰都會丟火球。可不是每個人都能變出吃的喝的。在地底下熬了一整天之後，你會很驚訝大家記得的是哪一個。"
L["My training started in Deathknell, under Aramis Hammerhand. What I learned there: the Light doesn't care what you were, only what you do with it. Also, it takes some getting used to.\n\nAramis put me to work on the injured Deathguard. Five of them, five times the Holy Light, five soldiers back on their feet. Not glamorous. It's the job, and I've always liked the job.\n\nThen there was a frightened paladin in Deathknell, a brother of the order who couldn't make his peace with what he'd become. I didn't have a speech ready. I offered what help I could and hoped it was a start. Some wounds the Light reaches slowly.\n\nAfter that, Aramis pointed me down the road to Brill, where Shari Stilwell was waiting to take over my education. I'm good at going where I'm pointed. It's one of my better qualities, and I have several."] = "我的訓練是在喪鐘鎮開始的，帶我的是阿拉米斯‧錘手。我在那裡學到：聖光不在乎你以前是什麼，只在乎你拿它來做什麼。還有，這需要一點時間習慣。\n\n阿拉米斯叫我去照顧受傷的亡靈衛兵。五個人，五次聖光術，五個士兵重新站起來。一點都不光鮮。但這就是工作，而我一直都滿喜歡這份工作的。\n\n接著是喪鐘鎮一位嚇壞了的聖騎士，教團裡的一位弟兄，沒辦法接受自己變成現在這個樣子。我沒準備什麼演講。我盡我所能幫了點忙，希望這算是個開始。有些傷口，聖光要慢慢才照得到。\n\n之後阿拉米斯把我往布瑞爾的方向一指，夏莉‧斯迪威爾在那裡等著接手我的教育。叫我往哪走，我就往哪走，這是我的優點之一。我的優點還不少。"
L["Bandarion Keep sits at the far western edge of Tirisfal, where a company of paladins is building a home for itself. Old stone, good walls, and murlocs at the gate. We sorted out the murlocs first. You can't make anywhere a home with murlocs at the gate.\n\nDanitha Morr showed me round and told me what the place could become, and I believed every word. Not everyone in paladin's armor out there is a friend, though. The Tarnished still turn their blades on their own kind. I dealt with a good many of them, and then with their commander, Rudolph Gelhardt.\n\nDanitha had me carry Gelhardt's head to Sylvanas Windrunner, a token of good faith from an order she barely trusts. I'm not sure a severed head builds much trust. Still, it's the thought that counts."] = "班達利昂要塞位在提里斯法最西邊的邊緣，有一群聖騎士正在那裡替自己打造一個家。古老的石頭，牢靠的城牆，門口還有魚人。我們先處理魚人。門口有魚人，哪裡都住不成家。\n\n丹妮莎‧莫爾帶我四處看看，跟我說這地方將來可以變成什麼樣子，她說的每個字我都信。不過在那一帶穿著聖騎士盔甲的，不見得都是朋友。那些晦暗者到現在還會把刀口轉向自己人。我收拾了一大票，然後再收拾他們的指揮官，魯道夫‧格爾哈特。\n\n丹妮莎要我把格爾哈特的頭顱送去給希瓦娜斯‧風行者，算是一個她根本不太信任的教團所表達的誠意。我不太確定一顆砍下來的頭能建立多少信任。不過嘛，心意最重要。"
L["Danitha Morr holds that a paladin does good because it's good, not because anybody's watching. To make the point, I was sent to the Undercity to help Tanis Alderwood.\n\nTanis needed linen. Ten pieces, to hold his wife together, because she was failing and he was doing what he could. He couldn't work out why a paladin would bother with something that small. Ten linen is a small thing. That was rather the point.\n\nThe bigger lesson came with the Symbol of Life. Out at Venomweb Vale, Deathguard Falgan lay dead for the second time, and I brought him back. The Scarlet Crusade were camped right there with their attack plans for Brill, so I took those too, and the Deathguard were ready before the blow fell.\n\nLinen for a stranger, plans off the Crusade. Turns out it's the same lesson."] = "丹妮莎‧莫爾認為，聖騎士行善是因為那是好事，不是因為有人在看。為了證明這一點，我被派去幽暗城幫塔尼斯·奧德伍德的忙。\n\n塔尼斯需要亞麻布。十塊，用來把他太太縫補起來，因為她的狀況越來越差，而他只能盡力而為。他搞不懂一個聖騎士幹嘛管這種小事。十塊亞麻布確實是小事。重點就在這裡。\n\n更大的一課來自生命符記。在毒蛛峽谷，亡靈守衛法爾甘第二次死在那裡，我把他救了回來。血色十字軍就在旁邊紮營，手上還拿著進攻布瑞爾的作戰計畫，所以我也順手拿走了，亡靈衛兵在攻擊來臨前就做好了準備。\n\n給陌生人的亞麻布，從十字軍手上搶來的計畫。結果是同一課。"
L["Two Earthen Ring travelers had gone missing in Silverpine. The keep saw a chance to prove itself to the Horde. I saw two people who needed finding. Either way, I went.\n\nFenris Isle held half the answer. One of the travelers lay dead. The other, Lumina Windsinger, was locked up in Fenris Keep. I took the key off the gnolls, opened the door, and we fought our way out together. Lumina is a Windshaper. You should see what a Windshaper does to a gnoll.\n\nA worgen had struck them on the road, Lumina said, and one of those beasts would not stay dead. That calls for a special sort of blade. Ott in Tarren Mill forged it while I stood by, and I'll say this for Ott: the talent is badly underrated.\n\nThen I went looking for Old Fire-Eye. Some things will stay dead if you ask them properly."] = "有兩個陶土議會的旅人在銀松森林失蹤了。要塞覺得這是向部落證明自己的好機會。我看到的，是兩個需要有人去找的人。不管怎樣，我都去了。\n\n芬里斯島上有一半的答案。其中一個旅人已經死了。另一個，露米娜‧風歌，被關在芬里斯城堡裡。我從豺狼人身上拿到鑰匙，打開門，我們一起殺了出來。露米娜是塑風者。你們真該看看塑風者是怎麼對付豺狼人的。\n\n露米娜說，他們在路上遭到狼人襲擊，而其中一頭野獸怎麼殺都不肯死透。這種東西得用一把特別的刀。塔倫米爾的奧特當著我的面把它打了出來，我得替奧特說句公道話：這手藝實在被嚴重低估了。\n\n然後我就去找老火眼了。有些東西，只要你好好拜託，還是會乖乖死透的。"
L["Duthorian Rall teaches at the Cathedral of Light, and Rall's view is that having the Light with you is the easy part. The hard part is what you do when evil walks into your lands and you're the one standing there.\n\nSo Rall sent me to Westfall, to Daphne Stilwell, and the Defias picked that very afternoon to come for her. They came in waves. The rule was simple: she lives and I live, or the test is failed. Nobody gets to fall over and try again.\n\nI won't pretend it was tidy. The Defias don't fight fair, and there were more of them than I'd have liked. But I stayed in front of her and kept the Light going, and when it was over we were both still standing.\n\nThat, apparently, is valor. I'd have called it a long afternoon. I suppose it can be both."] = "達索瑞恩·拉爾在光明大教堂教書，拉爾的看法是：有聖光在身邊，是簡單的那部分。難的是，當邪惡走進你的土地，而剛好站在那裡的人是你，你要怎麼做。\n\n所以拉爾把我派去西部荒野找達芙妮·斯迪威爾，而迪菲亞偏偏就挑那天下午來找她。他們一波接一波地來。規則很簡單：她活著，我也活著，不然考驗就算失敗。沒有人可以倒下去再重來一次。\n\n我不會假裝打得很漂亮。迪菲亞打架不講規矩，人數也比我希望的多。但我一直擋在她前面，聖光一刻沒停，等一切結束，我們兩個都還站著。\n\n這，據說就叫做英勇。要我說，那只是一個很長的下午。我想兩者可以同時成立。"
L["Jordan Stilwell works a forge outside the gates of Ironforge, and Jordan's idea of a test is a shopping list. Lumber, ore, a Kor gem, and Jordan's own smithing hammer, which was somehow anywhere but with Jordan.\n\nI'll spare you the roads. There were a great many roads. The gem alone came to me corrupted and had to go all the way to Darkshore to be made clean.\n\nBut I stood by the anvil when it all came together, and I watched Jordan make Verigan's Fist. They say the Light is in all honest work. I'd believed that in a general sort of way. Standing at that forge, I believed it properly.\n\nRighteousness, it turns out, is mostly carrying things and not complaining. I managed one of the two."] = "喬丹·斯迪威爾在鐵爐堡大門外打鐵，而喬丹所謂的考驗，就是一張購物清單。木材、礦石、一塊科爾寶石，還有喬丹自己的鍛造鐵錘，那把錘子不知怎麼的，哪裡都可能在，就是不在喬丹身邊。\n\n路上的事我就不多說了。路非常多。光是那塊寶石，到我手上時就已經被腐化了，還得一路送到黑海岸去淨化。\n\n但所有東西湊齊的那一刻，我就站在鐵砧旁邊，看著喬丹打造出維里甘之拳。人家說，聖光存在於一切誠實的勞動之中。我以前也算信啦，籠統的那種信。站在那座熔爐前面，我才是真的信了。\n\n結果所謂的正義，大部分就是搬東西，外加不抱怨。這兩件我做到了一件。"
L["Danitha Morr called me home to Bandarion Keep, and for once it wasn't to send me off somewhere else. It was to give me something.\n\nA paladin's warhorse isn't bought at a stable. It's consecrated for battle, and it comes when you call. Danitha taught me how. The first time mine appeared, I just stood and looked at it for a while. They say a paladin's steed is as fearless as the paladin it carries. In my experience, the horse has the better claim.\n\nI've walked a great many roads in the Light's service, and I'd walk every one of them again. I'd simply rather not, now that there's a horse."] = "丹妮莎‧莫爾叫我回班達利昂要塞，而且難得這次不是為了把我派去別的地方。是要給我一樣東西。\n\n聖騎士的戰馬不是在馬廄買的。牠是為戰鬥而聖化的，你一呼喚，牠就會來。丹妮莎教我怎麼做。我的馬第一次出現的時候，我就站在那裡盯著牠看了好一陣子。人家說，聖騎士的坐騎跟背上的聖騎士一樣無所畏懼。依我的經驗，這句話馬比較擔得起。\n\n我為了聖光走過非常多的路，每一條我都願意再走一遍。只是現在有馬了，我寧可不要用走的。"
L["Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker doesn't hand out horses. A paladin's charger is a spirit, and you earn it.\n\nYou also pay for it, which nobody mentions at the start. A hundred and fifty gold for a censer to cleanse Terrordale. A hundred and fifty more for barding. Fifty more to Merideth Carlson in Southshore for the horse feed, that fifty being to soothe her ruffled sensibilities. Nobody had told me sensibilities came so dear.\n\nThe part worth telling happened under Scholomance, in the Great Ossuary. I used the scryer, judged the spirits it raised, and then Death Knight Darkreaver came for me. He had the soul of a fallen charger, and he did not intend to give it up. He gave it up.\n\nThe charger came to me redeemed. Three hundred and fifty gold, all told. Worth every coin."] = "格雷森·沙東布瑞克公爵是不發馬的。聖騎士的軍馬是一個靈魂，得靠自己去掙。\n\n而且你還得付錢，這件事一開始沒人提。一百五十金買一個香爐，去淨化恐懼谷。再一百五十金買馬鎧。另外五十金給南海鎮的梅麗德絲·卡爾森買馬飼料，這五十金是用來撫平她受傷的心情。從來沒人告訴我，心情這麼貴。\n\n值得講的部分發生在通靈學院底下，大骨窖裡。我用了預言水晶球，審判它召喚出來的靈魂，接著死亡騎士達克雷爾就衝著我來了。他握著一匹陣亡戰駒的靈魂，完全不打算交出來。他交出來了。\n\n那匹軍馬回到我身邊的時候，已經得到了救贖。總共三百五十金。每一枚都值得。"
L["A charger is a spirit, not a purchase. Nobody mentions the bill.\n\nA hundred and fifty gold for a censer to cleanse Terrordale. A hundred and fifty more to Ott for the barding, and worth it. Then fifty to Nathanos Blightcaller for the horse feed, the fifty being for his time. Nathanos values his time very highly.\n\nThe part worth telling happened under Scholomance, in the Great Ossuary. I used the scryer, judged the spirits it raised, and then Death Knight Darkreaver came for me. He was holding the soul of a fallen charger. The rite's last step is called Justice and Retribution, and I gave Darkreaver plenty of both.\n\nThe charger answered me after that. It has every time since."] = "軍馬是一個靈魂，不是買來的東西。只是沒人提帳單的事。\n\n一百五十金買一個香爐，去淨化恐懼谷。再一百五十金給奧特打馬鎧，這筆花得值。然後五十金給納薩諾斯‧凋零者買馬飼料，那五十金是付他的時間。納薩諾斯非常看重他的時間。\n\n值得講的部分發生在通靈學院底下，大骨窖裡。我用了預言水晶球，審判它召喚出來的靈魂，接著死亡騎士達克雷爾就衝著我來了。他手裡握著一匹陣亡戰駒的靈魂。這套儀式的最後一步叫做「正義與懲戒」，這兩樣東西，我都很大方地送了達克雷爾不少。\n\n從那之後，那匹軍馬就會回應我的呼喚。每一次都會。"
L["The Eye of Divinity came out of Molten Core and into my hands, and it led me to Eris Havenfire in the Eastern Plaguelands. Eris had a test in mind.\n\nPeasants. A whole stream of them, running for their lives with the Scourge behind them. My task was to get fifty through alive. If fifteen fell first, I'd failed. A post nearby keeps count of the dead, and you learn quickly not to look at it.\n\nYou learn other things, too. That frightened people run straight into trouble. That you can't heal everyone at once, so you choose, and keep choosing. That shadow is very good at clearing a path, and the Light is for whoever's on it.\n\nFifty made it. Eris gave me what I'd earned, and with the Eye it became Benediction. I never learned a single one of their names. I remember a good many faces."] = "神性之眼從熔火之心落到我手上，把我引到東瘟疫之地去找艾瑞斯·哈文法。艾瑞斯早就想好了一場考驗。\n\n農民。一大群農民，後面追著天譴軍團，拚了命地逃。我的任務是讓五十個人活著通過。如果先死了十五個，我就失敗了。旁邊有根柱子在記死了幾個人，你很快就學會別去看它。\n\n你也會學到別的事。像是嚇壞的人會直直衝進麻煩裡。像是你沒辦法同時治好每一個人，所以你得選，而且得一直選下去。像是暗影很會清出一條路，而聖光是給走在那條路上的人的。\n\n五十個人活了下來。艾瑞斯給了我應得的東西，配上神性之眼，就成了祈福。他們的名字，我一個都不知道。但我記得好多張臉。"
L["Shaw doesn't do pep talks. He sends me to Westfall to see his man Kearnen, and Kearnen points me at a Defias tower full of people who'd love to see me dead. Fine. I lift the key, I'm up the stairs, and there's a chest with a lovely lock on it. I open the lovely lock. Whatever was waiting inside opens me right back.\n\nBy the time I'm standing in front of Shaw again I'm a funny color and the floor won't hold still. The Touch of Zanzil, it turns out, and the only cure in Stormwind is a goblin in the barracks cellar called Doc Mixilpixil. First he has me lie down on his floor so he can look at me. Then he calls it the itis and sends me shopping: wildflowers, a vial, a tube, a spool of thread. Still don't know what the thread was for. It worked, though. And I learned something about poison that day. I'd rather be on the handle end."] = "肖爾不搞精神喊話那一套。他派我去西部荒野找他的人吉爾妮，吉爾妮再把我指向一座迪菲亞塔樓，裡面滿滿都是巴不得我死的人。行。我摸走鑰匙，上了樓，那裡有個箱子，掛著一把漂亮的鎖。我打開了那把漂亮的鎖。裡面等著我的東西，也很有禮貌地回敬了我一下。\n\n等我再站到肖爾面前，我的臉色已經很不對勁，地板也一直在晃。原來是贊吉爾之觸，而整個暴風城唯一能治的，是兵營地窖裡一個叫道克·米希匹克斯的哥布林。他先叫我躺在他的地板上讓他檢查。然後他宣布這叫伊提斯綜合症，就把我打發去買東西：野花、一個瓶子、一根管子、一卷線。那卷線是幹嘛用的，我到現在都不知道。反正有效就是了。那天我也學到一件關於毒藥的事。我還是比較喜歡站在握柄那一端。"
L["Shenthul's idea of hello is a salute you have to learn first. Shattered Hand business. So I learned it, and then he sent me out to the Barrens to fire two flares at a Venture Co. tower and do the salute again for his man inside, Taskmaster Fizzule. Very subtle, the Shattered Hand.\n\nFizzule wanted the tower taken apart, quietly. I lifted the foreman's key, put a few of their people down, and Grand Foreman Gallywix didn't get to keep his head. His lockbox was full of Zanzil's mix, and some of it ended up in me. Shenthul knew the one man who could fix that, Serge Hinott, all the way up in Tarren Mill. Long walk. Then I sat on a stool while he brewed the cure, which is the most patient I have ever been.\n\nFizzule got the head. I got the story."] = "申蘇爾打招呼的方式，是一個你得先學會的軍禮。碎手氏族的規矩。所以我學了，然後他把我派到貧瘠之地，對著一座風險投資公司的塔樓打兩發信號彈，再對他安插在裡面的人，工頭費蘇勒，行一次軍禮。碎手氏族，非常低調。\n\n費蘇勒要那座塔被悄悄拆掉。我摸走工頭的鑰匙，放倒他們幾個人，大工頭加里維克斯的腦袋也沒能留住。他的保險箱裡塞滿了贊吉爾的藥劑，其中一些跑進了我身體裡。能處理這玩意的人，申蘇爾只認識一個：瑟爾格·希諾特，遠在塔倫米爾。好長一段路。然後我坐在凳子上等他熬解藥，那是我這輩子最有耐心的一次。\n\n費蘇勒拿到了腦袋。我拿到了故事。"
L["Best letter I ever got had no name on it. Just a place, a cabin outside Pyrewood, and one letter at the bottom. C.\n\nIn the cabin there's a chest, and in the chest there's a job. Get the Horn of Xelthos out of Shadowfang Keep, and go alone. Alone, into Shadowfang. Sure. A goblin called Veenix up in Stonetalon got me past the courtyard gate, and after that it was me, the worgen and a lot of standing very still in corners. I put the horn in the chest and walked off, and a while later another letter tells me my pay is waiting. It was. Good pay, too.\n\nNext job was the Eye of Bhossca, in the Scarlet Monastery. I found a disguise on the grounds and strolled through the place like I'd been converted. Nobody blinked.\n\nNever met C. Never asked. When the money's that good, you don't."] = "我收過最棒的一封信，上面沒有署名。只有一個地點，焚木村外的一間小屋，還有底下一個字母。C。\n\n小屋裡有個箱子，箱子裡有份工作。去影牙城堡把澤索司號角拿出來，而且要一個人去。一個人，進影牙城堡。好喔。石爪山脈那邊一個叫維尼克斯的哥布林幫我過了庭院的大門，接下來就是我、狼人，還有在角落裡一動也不動地站上好久好久。我把號角放進箱子就走了，過了一陣子，又來一封信說我的酬勞在等我。真的在。而且給得很大方。\n\n下一份工作是血色修道院裡的伯絲卡之眼。我在修道院那一帶找到一套偽裝，就在裡面大搖大擺地逛，好像我早就皈依了一樣。沒人多看我一眼。\n\n我從沒見過C。也從沒問過。錢給得這麼好的時候，你不會問。"
L["Somebody in the city who knows somebody slips me a seal with a raven on it. Ravenholdt. It's a manor up in the hills above Hillsbrad where the best of us keep house, and you don't just walk up and knock. There's a test of cunning on the way in. I'm writing this, so you can guess how that went.\n\nFahrad met me inside. Lovely old place. Everybody's very polite and nobody turns their back on you. I liked it right away."] = "城裡有個認識某人的某人，偷偷塞給我一枚印著烏鴉的印記。拉文霍德。那是希爾斯布萊德上方山丘裡的一座莊園，我們這行最頂尖的人都住在那裡，可不是你走上去敲敲門就能進的。進門之前有一場考驗狡詐的測試。既然這篇是我寫的，結果你們應該猜得到。\n\n法拉德在裡面接我。很棒的老房子。每個人都非常有禮貌，而且沒有人會背對著你。我馬上就喜歡上這裡了。"
L["Somebody in the city who knows somebody slips me a seal with a raven on it. Ravenholdt. It's a manor up in the hills above Hillsbrad, and you don't just walk up and knock. There's a test of cunning on the way in. I'm writing this, so you can guess how that went.\n\nOnce you're in, Myrokos Silentform keeps you busy. The Syndicate has been getting cocky up in Alterac, and Myrokos has opinions about that. Lord Tomas, Durnholde Keep: no longer a problem. A scouting report, lifted right out of a Syndicate pocket. The old Perenolde heirlooms, out of the ruins of Alterac before their diggers got there.\n\nBest one was Stromgarde. I put on a stolen Syndicate uniform and walked into the keep like I owned it. Found Anastasia, found the money she'd rather nobody knew about, and suddenly she was very chatty. Then I broke up their little handoff at Thoradin's Wall and carried the prize home."] = "城裡有個認識某人的某人，偷偷塞給我一枚印著烏鴉的印記。拉文霍德。那是希爾斯布萊德上方山丘裡的一座莊園，可不是你走上去敲敲門就能進的。進門之前有一場考驗狡詐的測試。既然這篇是我寫的，結果你們應該猜得到。\n\n一進去，麥洛克斯就讓你忙個不停。辛迪加在奧特蘭克越來越囂張，麥洛克斯對此很有意見。敦霍爾德城堡的湯瑪斯領主：不再是問題了。一份偵察報告，直接從辛迪加的口袋裡摸出來。匹瑞諾德家族的老傳家寶，搶在他們的挖掘隊之前，從奧特蘭克的廢墟裡拿了出來。\n\n最精彩的是激流堡。我穿上偷來的辛迪加制服，大搖大擺走進城堡，好像那是我家。找到安娜絲塔西亞，再找到她不希望任何人知道的那筆錢，她突然就變得非常健談。接著我在索拉丁之牆攪了他們的小交易，把東西帶回家。"
L["Here's a fun way to find out you've been played. A letter shows up from Ravenholdt. Fahrad. Come home, we need to talk. So I go, and Fahrad sits me down and tells me C has a name. Caius Blackwood. Some big spellcaster in bed with the Syndicate, the very Syndicate I'd been cutting up for Myrokos, and there I was fetching his trinkets for him like a good dog.\n\nSo we fixed it. C wanted one more thing, the Talisman of Kazdor, out of Zul'Farrak. I went in alone, like always, and brought it out, but this time it went to the manor first. Zan Shivsproket took it down to the basement and put a little surprise inside. Anybody tries to pour magic into it or out of it, boom. Then I set it in the chest, same as ever, and walked away whistling.\n\nFahrad says now we wait. Fine by me. Waiting's half the job."] = "想知道自己被耍了，有個很好玩的方式。拉文霍德寄來一封信。法拉德寫的。回來一趟，我們得談談。於是我回去了，法拉德讓我坐下，告訴我C是有名字的。凱烏斯·黑木。某個跟辛迪加掛勾的大施法者，就是我一直在替麥洛克斯一刀一刀砍的那個辛迪加，而我居然像條乖狗一樣，一直在幫他叼小玩意。\n\n所以我們把這件事處理了。C還想要最後一樣東西：祖爾法拉克裡的卡茲多咒符。我照例一個人進去，把它帶了出來，但這次先送回莊園。薩恩·刀鏈把它拿到地下室，在裡面放了個小驚喜。誰想往裡面灌魔法，或是從裡面抽魔法出來，碰。然後我跟往常一樣把它放進箱子，吹著口哨走人。\n\n法拉德說，現在就等著吧。我沒意見。等待本來就是這份工作的一半。"
L["Earth is the first element a shaman meets, and the slowest to say anything. I respect that. I don't always enjoy it.\n\nAfter a small errand to prove I'd do as I was asked, I was handed the Earth Sapta and sent to a holy place to drink it. The world goes very quiet when you do. And then the earth was there in front of me, a spirit of it made small enough to talk to.\n\nIt didn't give a speech. It gave me a rock. A piece of rough quartz, plain as you like, and I carried it home as though it might break.\n\nFrom that rock came my first totem. I set it in the ground, and the ground answered. I've argued with the earth plenty since, mostly about how long things take. It has never once failed to show up."] = "大地是薩滿第一個遇見的元素，也是開口最慢的一個。我尊重這一點。但不見得每次都很享受。\n\n先跑了個小差事，證明我會乖乖照吩咐做事，接著我拿到了大地靈契，被派到一處聖地去喝下它。喝下去之後，整個世界會變得非常安靜。然後大地就在我面前了，是它的一個靈，縮成剛好能跟人說話的大小。\n\n它沒有發表什麼演說。它給了我一塊石頭。一塊粗石英，要多普通有多普通，而我一路捧著它回家，好像它隨時會碎掉一樣。\n\n我的第一根圖騰就是從那塊石頭來的。我把它插進地裡，大地回應了。從那之後我跟大地吵過不少次，大多是在吵事情怎麼要花這麼久。但它從來沒有一次沒到場。"
L["Fire is the loud one. Ask it a question and it shouts the answer, usually at your eyebrows.\n\nThe rite starts with a torch that won't light, the Torch of the Dormant Flame, and you carry it about feeling foolish. Along the way there's a spirit to face, and it wanted a fight. Fire generally does. I gave it one and won, which is the only way that conversation ends well.\n\nAt the end there's a brazier at a shrine, and a flame that doesn't go out. I carried it back like it was the last fire in the world. Whatever the name says, I was not about to be the shaman who let the eternal flame go out.\n\nAfter that, fire came when I called. Not politely. But it came, and it's been at my side ever since, crackling away and offering opinions nobody asked for."] = "火是最吵的那一個。你問它問題，它就用吼的回答，通常是對著你的眉毛吼。\n\n儀式從一支點不著的火炬開始，叫眠炎火炬，你得拿著它到處走，覺得自己像個傻瓜。途中有個火靈要面對，而它想打一架。火通常都想打架。我陪它打了，而且贏了，這是那種對話唯一能好好收場的方式。\n\n最後，在一座聖壇有個火盆，裡面燒著一團永遠不會熄的火焰。我把它帶回去，好像那是世界上最後一把火。不管它名字叫什麼，我可不打算當那個讓永恆之火熄掉的薩滿。\n\n從那之後，我一呼喚，火就會來。不怎麼客氣。但它會來，而且從此一直待在我身邊，劈哩啪啦的，發表一堆沒人問的意見。"
L["Water doesn't hurry, and it doesn't want you to either.\n\nHervdana Saegrund in the Wetlands gave me an empty waterskin and directions. When I brought it back full, she gave me another, and then another. One of them had to be filled at Stonewatch Falls, right among the Nightcrawler murlocs, and I told the water the murlocs were its problem, not mine. It disagreed. Another meant crossing the sea to Astranaar. Out of the three, she made a vial of the purest water I've ever seen.\n\nAfter that came Stendel's Pond in Westfall, where something had gone foul. I fought the corruption out of it, and when the pond ran clean, its spirit rose and gave me a shard of itself for my totem.\n\nWater gives freely once it trusts you. Getting it to trust you takes about half of Azeroth."] = "水不趕時間，也不希望你趕。\n\n濕地的赫芙達娜‧賽格倫德給了我一個空水袋和一些指示。等我裝滿帶回去，她又給了我一個，然後又一個。其中一個得在石望瀑布裝，就在夜行者魚人的地盤正中間，我跟水說，魚人是它的問題，不是我的。它不同意。另一個得渡海去阿斯特蘭納。用這三袋水，她做出了一瓶我這輩子見過最純淨的水。\n\n接著是西部荒野的斯特登的池塘，那裡有東西變質了。我把腐化從池塘裡打了出去，等池水重新變清，池塘的靈就浮了上來，把自己的一塊碎片給了我，讓我做圖騰。\n\n水一旦信任你，就會毫不吝嗇地給。只是要讓它信任你，大概得跑掉半個艾澤拉斯。"
L["Water teaches patience, and it teaches it by sending you everywhere.\n\nBrine keeps a hut above a watering hole in the southern Barrens. Brine gave me an empty waterskin and told me where to fill it. When I brought it back, I got another, and then another. One of them had to come from the well in Tarren Mill, which is a very long way to go for a drink. Out of the three, she made a vial of the purest water.\n\nWhat was left of it went to the Brazier of Everfount in Silverpine, where a corrupted spirit of water was waiting. I beat it, and the water's true spirit rose clean and gave me a shard of itself to take home.\n\nI grumbled about the walk. The water, as far as I could tell, found that funny. Water goes everywhere and never complains."] = "水教的是耐心，而它教的方法，就是把你派到天涯海角。\n\n布瑞恩在南貧瘠之地一處水窪上方有間小屋。布瑞恩給了我一個空水袋，告訴我去哪裡裝。等我帶回去，又拿到另一個，然後又一個。其中一個得從塔倫米爾的井裡打水，為了一口水跑這麼遠，真的是很遠。用這三袋水，她做出了一瓶最純淨的水。\n\n剩下的水帶去了銀松森林的永恆之泉火盆，那裡有個腐化的水之靈在等著。我打敗了它，真正的水之靈乾乾淨淨地升了起來，把自己的一塊碎片交給我帶回家。\n\n我一路上都在抱怨要走這麼遠。就我看來，水覺得這很好笑。水哪裡都去，而且從來不抱怨。"
L["Air was the last of the four, and the one that made me work hardest for it.\n\nThe quilboar had been working a ritual with twisted totems, one for each element, and Veyric up in the Arathi Highlands wanted it stopped. Charlga Razorflank down in Razorfen Kraul had the notes on it, so I went down and took the notes, the usual way. Then I collected their totems and turned them on their own ritual. What was left when it broke was the Eye of the Tempest, and I carried it to Bath'rah the Windwatcher in the Alterac Mountains.\n\nSo now I have all four. They argue constantly, mostly through me. I wouldn't have it any other way."] = "空氣是四元素裡的最後一個，也是讓我最費功夫的一個。\n\n野豬人一直在用扭曲的圖騰進行某種儀式，每種元素一根，阿拉希高地的維里克想讓它停下來。剃刀沼澤底下的卡爾加‧刺肋手上有相關的筆記，所以我下去，用老方法把筆記拿走了。然後我收集了他們的圖騰，拿來對付他們自己的儀式。儀式崩潰後留下的，是風暴之眼，我把它帶去奧特蘭克山脈給捕風者巴斯拉。\n\n所以現在四個我都有了。它們整天吵架，而且大多是透過我在吵。換別種日子我還不要呢。"
L["After earth, fire and water, I braced myself for air. Air, it turns out, mostly wants you to show up.\n\nMy trainer sent me to Thousand Needles to find Prate Cloudseer, and that was the trial: go there. Mind you, it's a long way down and a long way back, and the wind up on those mesas will push you off one if you let it, so perhaps the walk was the point.\n\nPrate gave me the last totem, and the circle was closed. Earth under my feet, fire at my side, water in my hand and air at my back.\n\nFour elements, and not one of them likes the others. Earth thinks air is flighty. Fire thinks water is dull. Water thinks everybody's in too much of a hurry. And there's me in the middle, keeping the peace, which is about what a shaman is for."] = "大地、火和水都搞定之後，我做好心理準備迎接空氣。結果空氣大部分時候，只要你肯到場就好。\n\n我的訓練師派我去千針石林找普拉特·雲眼，而那就是試煉：去那裡。話說回來，那段路下去很遠，回來也很遠，而且那些石台上的風，你一個不注意就會把你吹下去，所以搞不好走路本身就是重點。\n\n普拉特給了我最後一根圖騰，圓就這樣補齊了。大地在腳下，火在身旁，水在手中，風在背後。\n\n四個元素，沒有一個喜歡其他幾個。大地覺得空氣很輕浮。火覺得水很無聊。水覺得大家都太急了。然後我夾在中間當和事佬，說穿了，薩滿就是幹這個的。"
L["Long after my first totems, Kardris Dreamseeker in Orgrimmar decided I was ready for the harder lesson: holding all four elements at once instead of one at a time.\n\nThat meant Bath'rah the Windwatcher, up in the Alterac Mountains, and Bath'rah wanted a sample of each element. The real thing. You don't buy elemental fire off a cart. You take it from something made of fire, and the something objects.\n\nThen came the spirit totem, which wanted eight spider eyes and eight black claws. I asked the spirits what those had to do with anything. The spirits did not say. Spirits rarely do when you most want them to.\n\nMastery, they call it. I'd call it a truce. Four elements that can't stand one another, agreeing to work through me at the same time. Some days they even manage it."] = "在我拿到第一批圖騰很久以後，奧格瑪的卡德里斯‧尋夢者認為我已經準備好上更難的一課了：同時掌握四種元素，而不是一次一種。\n\n這代表要去找奧特蘭克山脈的捕風者巴斯拉，而巴斯拉要每種元素各一份樣本。要真貨。元素之火可不是在路邊攤買得到的。你得從某個火做成的東西身上拿，而那個東西會有意見。\n\n接著是靈魂圖騰，要八顆蜘蛛眼和八隻黑爪。我問先靈這些東西到底有什麼關係。先靈沒說。你越想要它們開口，它們就越不說。\n\n他們管這叫精通。我會說這是停戰協議。四個看彼此不順眼的元素，同意同時透過我來做事。有些日子，它們甚至真的做到了。"
L["Eldrun Stormbreaker was building a scryer to see through the shadows of the Great Ossuary in Scholomance, and a scryer like that wants diamonds. Two good ones. I found them. That was the easy part.\n\nThen I took the scryer down to the Ossuary's basement and set it going. The spirits came first, every one of them bound to a death knight called Darkreaver, and none of them pleased to be seen. I fought them down. When the last went, Darkreaver came himself.\n\nEarth held my feet, fire did the shouting, and between us we finished him. I carried his head back to Eldrun, and the restless dead under Scholomance are a good deal less restless now.\n\nMost of my life I've listened to spirits. Some of them, I've learned, you just have to shout over."] = "伊德倫‧破颶者正在打造一顆預言水晶球，要用來看穿通靈學院大骨窖裡的陰影，而這種水晶球需要鑽石。兩顆上好的。我找到了。那是簡單的部分。\n\n然後我把水晶球帶到大骨窖的地下室，啟動它。先來的是那些靈魂，每一個都被綁在一個叫達克雷爾的死亡騎士身上，沒有一個高興被人看見。我把它們一一打倒。最後一個消失後，達克雷爾親自來了。\n\n大地穩住我的腳，火負責大吼，我們合力解決了他。我把他的頭帶回去給伊德倫，現在通靈學院底下那些不得安息的亡者，安分多了。\n\n我這輩子大部分時間都在傾聽先靈。但我學到了，有些靈，你就是得用吼的蓋過它們。"
L["Every warlock remembers their first voidwalker. Mine came out of the dark looking about as pleased as you'd expect.\n\nFirst my teacher sent me to fetch something the summoning couldn't be done without. Teachers like mine are never in a hurry to tell you why. I fetched it.\n\nThen the binding. You call, and something big and blue and hollow comes through and makes it plain it would rather not work for you. That's the part nobody can teach. You subdue it. You keep at it until it stops arguing and starts listening.\n\nIt's been with me ever since. Doesn't eat, doesn't sleep, doesn't talk. Stands between me and whatever's angry, takes the beating and never once asks about wages. I'd call it a friend, but I don't think it would know what to do with that."] = "每個術士都記得自己的第一隻虛無行者。我的那隻從黑暗裡出來的時候，表情就跟你想的一樣開心。\n\n一開始，我的老師派我去拿一樣召喚時少不了的東西。像我老師那種人，從來不急著告訴你為什麼。我拿回來了。\n\n然後是束縛。你一召喚，就有個又大又藍又空洞的東西穿過來，擺明了寧可不要替你工作。這部分沒人教得了。你得制服它。你得一直跟它耗，耗到它不再頂嘴，開始聽話。\n\n從那之後它就一直跟著我。不吃、不睡、不說話。擋在我和任何在發火的東西中間，乖乖挨揍，而且從來沒問過一次薪水的事。我會說它是朋友，但我不覺得它知道朋友要怎麼當。"
L["Gakin the Darkbinder is a patient teacher, as long as you don't mind being sent across the sea for your lessons.\n\nA succubus needs the right focus, and Gakin sent me to Takar the Seer in the Barrens to learn what it was. Takar sent me north into Ashenvale for heartswood. I came back with it, and Gakin turned it into the Heartswood Core.\n\nThen the circle. I called, and a succubus answered. They always look you over first, as though they're the ones doing the choosing. She looked. I subdued her. We've had an understanding ever since.\n\nShe's charming, vicious and doesn't like me one bit, and I wouldn't trade her for any bodyguard in Stormwind. You always know where you stand with a demon. Usually it's slightly too close."] = "黑暗縛靈師加金是個很有耐心的老師，只要你不介意為了上一堂課被派到海的另一邊。\n\n魅魔需要對的聚焦物，加金派我去貧瘠之地找先知塔卡爾，問問那是什麼。塔卡爾又把我往北派到梣谷去找同心樹。我帶著它回來，加金把它做成了同心樹之核。\n\n然後是法陣。我一召喚，就有一隻魅魔回應了。她們總是會先把你從頭到腳打量一遍，好像是她們在挑人一樣。她打量了。我制服了她。從那之後，我們就有了某種默契。\n\n她迷人、兇狠，而且一點都不喜歡我，但拿暴風城任何一個保鑣來換，我都不換。跟惡魔相處，你永遠知道自己站在哪裡。通常是站得稍微太近了一點。"
L["For a succubus you need hearts. Pure ones. That narrows the field more than you'd think.\n\nGodrick Farsan in the Temple of the Damned gave me two names: Dalin Forgewright and Corma Villard. I came back with their hearts. I didn't ask what made them pure, and they weren't in a position to tell me.\n\nThen the circle. I called, and a succubus came through and looked me up and down as though she were the one doing the hiring. They all do, the first time. I subdued her, which is the polite word for it, and since then she's been the most charming thing in my employ.\n\nPeople ask whether she's dangerous. Of course she is. That's rather the point of her."] = "要召喚魅魔，你需要心臟。純潔的心臟。這個條件刷掉的人，比你想像的還要多。\n\n詛咒神殿裡的高德瑞克·法杉給了我兩個名字：達林·弗治維特和珂瑪·韋拉德。我帶著他們的心臟回來了。我沒問是什麼讓他們這麼純潔，而他們也已經沒辦法告訴我了。\n\n然後是法陣。我一召喚，就有一隻魅魔穿了過來，把我從頭到腳打量一遍，好像是她在面試我一樣。第一次都是這樣。我制服了她，這是比較客氣的說法，從那之後，她就是我手下最迷人的一位。\n\n有人問她危不危險。當然危險。她存在的意義就是這個。"
L["A felhunter eats magic. That's the whole appeal. The trouble is you need a book to bind one, and the book was in pieces.\n\nStrahad Farsan down in Ratchet knew the binding, and Krom Stoutarm back in Ironforge knew books, and I spent a good while carrying scraps of moldy paper between the two of them. Eventually Krom had the thing put back together, and Strahad put the Tome of the Cabal in my hands.\n\nI drew the circle, and a felhunter came through starving, and I am, to a felhunter, a walking supper. I got the binding on it before it got a taste.\n\nNow it trots at my heel and sniffs at every mage we pass. I keep my own spellbooks off the floor."] = "惡魔獵犬吃魔法。牠的魅力就在這裡。麻煩的是，你需要一本書才能束縛牠，而那本書碎成了好幾片。\n\n棘齒城的斯坦哈德·法爾杉懂束縛，鐵爐堡的克羅姆·粗臂懂書，於是我花了好一段時間，在他們兩個之間搬運發霉的紙片。最後克羅姆總算把那東西拼回原樣，斯坦哈德把陰謀之書交到了我手上。\n\n我畫好法陣，一隻餓壞了的惡魔獵犬穿了過來，而對惡魔獵犬來說，我就是一頓會走路的晚餐。我趕在牠嚐到味道之前，把束縛套上去了。\n\n現在牠跟在我腳邊小跑步，見到法師就湊過去聞。我自己的法術書，絕對不放在地上。"
L["A felhunter takes the Tome of the Cabal, and the Tome of the Cabal, naturally, was in pieces.\n\nStrahad Farsan down in Ratchet knew the binding, and Jorah Annison back in the Undercity knew books, and I carried scraps of moldy paper between the two of them until I knew that road better than some caravans do. Eventually Jorah had the thing put back together, and Strahad handed it over.\n\nI drew the circle, and a felhunter came through hungry. Magic is what they eat, and I'm made of the stuff. I got the binding on it before it got a bite.\n\nNow it walks at my heel and makes mages nervous. I count that in its favor."] = "召喚惡魔獵犬需要陰謀之書，而陰謀之書，理所當然地，碎成了好幾片。\n\n棘齒城的斯坦哈德·法爾杉懂束縛，幽暗城的約拉·安尼森懂書，我就在他們兩個之間搬運發霉的紙片，跑到那條路我比某些商隊還熟。最後約拉總算把那東西拼回原樣，斯坦哈德把它交給了我。\n\n我畫好法陣，一隻餓壞了的惡魔獵犬穿了過來。牠們吃的就是魔法，而我整個人就是魔法做的。我趕在牠咬下去之前，把束縛套上去了。\n\n現在牠跟在我腳邊走，讓法師們很緊張。這點我算牠加分。"
L["Most people buy a horse. Warlocks get sent to Ratchet.\n\nMy trainer pointed me back down to Strahad Farsan, who by then was practically family, to learn to summon a felsteed. It isn't bought and it isn't bred. You call it, it comes, and it carries you, and it would very much like everybody to know it's from somewhere worse than here.\n\nI've never named mine. It wouldn't answer to it anyway. But it doesn't tire, it doesn't spook, and it has never once wanted a stable or a bucket of oats. The hooves are on fire, mind. Keep it away from anybody's haystack.\n\nA warlock's mount ought to frighten people a little. It saves on conversation."] = "大多數人是買馬的。術士則是被派去棘齒城。\n\n我的訓練師又把我指回去找斯坦哈德·法爾杉，那時候他簡直已經算是我家人了，這次是去學怎麼召喚地獄戰馬。牠不是買來的，也不是養出來的。你一召喚，牠就來，載著你走，而且非常希望大家都知道，牠來自一個比這裡糟糕得多的地方。\n\n我從來沒幫我的馬取名字。反正取了牠也不會理。但牠不會累，不會受驚，也從來沒要過馬廄或一桶燕麥。不過先提醒一下，牠的蹄子是著火的。別讓牠靠近任何人的乾草堆。\n\n術士的坐騎就該讓人有點怕。可以省下很多寒暄。"
L["Anyone can call a felsteed. A dreadsteed of Xoroth you earn, and Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes made very sure I knew it.\n\nThe shopping list for that ritual would make a dragon weep, partly because thirty-five black dragonscales were on it. But my favorite errand was the imp. Gorzeeki Wildeyes handed me an imp in a jar and had me take it to school. The Scholomance, I mean. It needed their alchemy lab to make a parchment. Only imp I know with an education.\n\nAt the end, in Dire Maul, I set it all out and called. The dreadsteed came through furious. I put it down, and when its spirit rose, I bound it.\n\nIt's still cross about that. We get along fine."] = "地獄戰馬誰都能召喚。克索諾斯恐懼戰馬可得靠自己掙，燃燒平原的莫蘇爾·召血者非常確定我明白這一點。\n\n那場儀式的購物清單會讓一頭龍哭出來，部分原因是上面列了三十五片黑龍鱗。但我最喜歡的差事是那隻小鬼。戈瑟奇·邪眼交給我一隻裝在瓶子裡的小鬼，要我帶牠去上學。我是說通靈學院。牠得用那裡的鍊金實驗室做一張羊皮紙。這是我認識唯一受過教育的小鬼。\n\n最後，我在厄運之槌把所有東西擺好，開始召喚。恐懼戰馬穿過來的時候氣炸了。我把牠打倒，等牠的靈魂浮起來，就把牠束縛住。\n\n牠到現在還在為這件事生氣。我們處得很好。"
L["Warriors learn to hit first. Then they learn to get hit. The second one keeps you alive.\n\nMy first trial was a job, and the job was a fight. It always is. I won, and I brought back what they'd asked for. Nothing clever. Hit the thing, carry the thing, come home.\n\nThen the lesson. Feet set. Shield up. Weight low. Let the blow land where you can take it. You hit softer standing like that. Doesn't matter. The other side tires first.\n\nI hated it at first. Standing still feels like losing. Then I took a few hits in that stance that would have dropped me flat a week before, and I was still up. I came round fast after that.\n\nPeople think a warrior is all swing. The good ones are mostly stand."] = "戰士先學會打人。然後才學會挨打。救你一命的，是第二個。\n\n我的第一場試煉是一份工作，而那份工作就是打一架。一向如此。我贏了，把他們要的東西帶回來。沒什麼高明的。打那個東西，搬那個東西，回家。\n\n然後是那一課。腳站穩。盾舉起。重心放低。讓攻擊落在你扛得住的地方。這樣站，你打出去會比較輕。無所謂。對面會先累。\n\n一開始我很討厭這樣。站著不動，感覺像在輸。後來我用那個架式挨了幾下，那幾下要是早個幾天，早就把我打趴了，結果我還站著。從那之後我很快就想通了。\n\n大家以為戰士就是一直揮。好的戰士，大部分時間是在站。"
L["Here's how I got this.\n\nThe Islander runs a fighting pit on Fray Island, out in the Barrens. You step on the grate and they come at you, one after another, and then Big Will comes. Big Will is well named. I put Big Will on the ground.\n\nThat got me sent to Bath'rah the Windwatcher, up in the Alterac hills. Bath'rah wanted charms and tusks and roots, a cauldron's worth, all to call up an air elemental named Cyclonian.\n\nCyclonian came. Cyclonian is a storm with a temper. I hit it until it stopped being a storm, and I took its heart.\n\nBath'rah set the heart into the weapon I chose. Now it spins. So does anybody standing too close."] = "這東西是這樣來的。\n\n島民在貧瘠之地的勇士島上經營一個格鬥場。你一踩上格柵，他們就一個接一個衝過來，然後比格維爾登場。比格維爾，人如其名，很大隻。我把比格維爾撂倒在地。\n\n這讓我被派去找捕風者巴斯拉，在奧特蘭克的山上。巴斯拉要護符、獠牙和樹根，裝滿一整個大鍋，全是為了召喚一隻叫塞克隆尼亞的風元素。\n\n塞克隆尼亞來了。塞克隆尼亞就是一場脾氣很差的暴風。我一直打它，打到它不再是暴風為止，然後拿走它的心臟。\n\n巴斯拉把那顆心臟鑲進我挑的武器裡。現在它會轉。站得太近的人也會。"
L["Shaw sends me to Theramore to meet his man there, Sully McCleary. Sully won't say a word in the inn. Too many ears. Out behind the graveyard he hands me a disguise kit, and next thing I know I'm one of Jaina's marines, standing guard in her tower while she and her people talk.\n\nYou learn a lot standing still in a room full of important people who think you're furniture. A man had washed up on the shore, and what he claimed had them all worried. And there it was again and again in their talk: the island.\n\nI walked out of there slow, like a marine with nowhere to be, and didn't breathe right until I was back in the marsh."] = "肖爾派我去塞拉摩，跟他在那裡的人蘇利‧麥拉利碰頭。蘇利在旅店裡一個字都不肯說。耳朵太多了。到了墓地後面，他才塞給我一套偽裝工具，接下來我就成了珍娜的陸戰隊員，站在她的高塔裡站崗，聽她和她的人談事情。\n\n當你站在一屋子大人物中間一動也不動，而他們都把你當家具的時候，你會聽到很多東西。有個男人被沖上了岸，他說的話讓他們每個人都很擔心。而他們的談話裡，一次又一次地提到：那座島。\n\n我慢慢走出那裡，像個沒地方要去的陸戰隊員，一直到回到沼澤裡，才敢好好喘口氣。"
L["Eitrigg doesn't waste words. A band of Kor'kron went into Dustwallow Marsh and didn't come back. Find out. That's the whole briefing.\n\nAt Brackenwall, Nazeer Bloodpike remembered them all right. Loud, proud, and talking about the island. Which island? Nobody thought to ask a Kor'kron.\n\nThe trail ran out at Sergeant Ulka, sitting by the water with a wound that would have dropped most people, insisting everything was under control. I offered a hand. The sergeant would not take it. That's the Kor'kron for you. You'd admire it if it weren't so tiring."] = "伊崔格從不浪費口舌。一隊柯爾克隆進了塵泥沼澤，沒有回來。去查清楚。整個任務簡報就這樣。\n\n在蕨牆村，納澤爾·血矛對他們記得可清楚了。又吵又驕傲，嘴裡一直講著那座島。哪座島？沒人想到要去問柯爾克隆。\n\n線索斷在士官烏爾卡那裡，就坐在水邊，帶著一道足以讓大多數人倒下的傷，堅持一切都在掌控之中。我伸手要幫忙。士官不肯接受。柯爾克隆就是這樣。要不是這麼累人，你還真會佩服。"
L["Alcaz Island. An old keep, rotten docks, and under it a prison nobody was ever supposed to know about. By the time I got down there it was already a brawl: guards in blood-red bandanas, naga coming up out of the water, and black dragons, because of course.\n\nI went looking for the king. Found a torturer they called the Questioner instead, and he had a key, and the key fit the chains on a fellow named Mason Connery. Nice man. Very grateful. Then a note on the floor told me the rest. The king had died trying to escape, just before the naga came in.\n\nI read it twice. Then I took it back to Sully, and Sully went very quiet."] = "奧卡茲島。一座老要塞，爛掉的碼頭，底下還有一座從來不該有人知道的監獄。等我下到那裡，早就打成一團了：綁著血紅色頭巾的守衛、從水裡冒出來的納迦，還有黑龍，當然少不了黑龍。\n\n我去找國王。結果找到一個他們叫審問者的拷問官，他身上有把鑰匙，剛好能打開一個叫梅森‧康納利的傢伙身上的鐐銬。人很好。非常感激。然後地上的一張紙條告訴了我剩下的事。國王在試圖逃跑時死了，就在納迦攻進來之前。\n\n我讀了兩遍。然後把它帶回去給蘇利，蘇利變得非常安靜。"
L["Ulka sent me in after Commander Folkar. Alcaz Prison was a mess: guards in blood-red bandanas, naga out of the sea, black dragons for good measure. Folkar was alive, barely, his axe arm broken and most of his elites dead around him, and still every inch a Kor'kron. He told me why they'd come. The Warchief wanted Varian Wrynn, King of Stormwind, brought to Orgrimmar alive.\n\nSo I went looking for a king. I found a torturer called the Questioner, took his key, and let a chained prisoner named Mason Connery out of his irons. Then a note on the ground told me the rest. Varian had died trying to escape, just before the naga hit.\n\nI had to go back and tell Folkar. Longest short walk of my life."] = "烏爾卡派我進去找指揮官弗卡爾。奧卡茲監獄一團亂：綁著血紅色頭巾的守衛、從海裡冒出來的納迦，再附贈幾頭黑龍。弗卡爾還活著，勉強而已，拿斧頭的那隻手斷了，手下的精英大多死在他身邊，但他從頭到腳依然是個柯爾克隆。他告訴我他們為什麼來。大酋長要把暴風城國王瓦里安·烏瑞恩活著帶回奧格瑪。\n\n所以我去找國王了。我找到一個叫審問者的拷問官，拿走他的鑰匙，把一個叫梅森‧康納利的囚犯從鐐銬裡放了出來。然後地上的一張紙條告訴了我剩下的事。瓦里安在試圖逃跑時死了，就在納迦攻進來之前。\n\n我得回去告訴弗卡爾。那是我這輩子走過最長的一段短路。"
L["Sully begged me to tell no one but Shaw, so I told Shaw, and Shaw took it the way he takes everything, which is to say you'd never know.\n\nConnery had pressed a note into my hand on the way out. A treasure, he said, worth more than gold, buried in Westfall. I dug it up. A box of papers. Worth more than gold to somebody, I'm sure. Renzik, Shaw's goblin, was dying to see them, and a goblin in Booty Bay named Rix Xizzix would have paid me for them instead. I'll let you guess.\n\nConnery only asked one thing in return. If anyone wonders, he's dead. Caught in dragonfire and blown out to sea. So, for the record: tragic. Never met the man."] = "蘇利求我除了肖爾以外誰都別說，所以我告訴了肖爾，而肖爾的反應就跟他面對任何事一樣，也就是說，你根本看不出來。\n\n康納利在我離開的時候，往我手裡塞了一張紙條。他說有個寶藏，比黃金還值錢，埋在西部荒野。我把它挖了出來。一箱文件。我相信對某些人來說，確實比黃金還值錢。肖爾手下的哥布林雷吉克想看想得要命，而藏寶海灣有個叫瑞克斯·希吉克斯的哥布林，則願意出錢跟我買。我讓你們猜猜看。\n\n康納利只求一件事當作回報。如果有人問起，他已經死了。被龍火燒到，然後被沖進海裡。所以，正式紀錄是：真是悲劇。我從沒見過這個人。"
L["Folkar couldn't make the trip himself, so I carried it to Thrall: the king was dead, and the Kor'kron had come home with nothing but bad news and a broken arm. Thrall listened. Thrall always listens. Somehow that's worse.\n\nConnery had pressed a note into my hand on the way out. A treasure in Westfall, worth more than gold. It was a box of papers. Nazgrel, who advises the Warchief, wanted a look, and a goblin in Booty Bay named Rix Xizzix would have paid me for them instead. I'll let you guess.\n\nConnery only asked one thing in return. If anyone wonders, he's dead. Caught in dragonfire and blown out to sea. So, for the record: tragic. Never met the man."] = "弗卡爾沒辦法親自跑這一趟，所以由我把消息帶給索爾：國王死了，而柯爾克隆除了壞消息和一隻斷手，什麼也沒帶回來。索爾聽完了。索爾一向都會聽完。不知道為什麼，這樣反而更難受。\n\n康納利在我離開的時候，往我手裡塞了一張紙條。西部荒野有個寶藏，比黃金還值錢。結果是一箱文件。替大酋長出主意的納茲格雷爾想看一看，而藏寶海灣有個叫瑞克斯·希吉克斯的哥布林，則願意出錢跟我買。我讓你們猜猜看。\n\n康納利只求一件事當作回報。如果有人問起，他已經死了。被龍火燒到，然後被沖進海裡。所以，正式紀錄是：真是悲劇。我從沒見過這個人。"
L["A young sentinel in Darnassus hadn't heard from her sister in too long, so I went to Azshara to look. I found Keldara Sunblade a prisoner of the satyr, and hurt. Except she wasn't. She'd been playing it up the whole time, waiting for her captors to get careless. Turns out I was the opening she'd been waiting for.\n\nAfter that the commander at Talrendis Point put me to work on the naga picking over the old kaldorei ruins, which kept me busy a good while. It ended with Warlord Krellian, hiding behind his guards in a temple. Guards only get you so far.\n\nThe commander held that head like a promise. Azshara might be kaldorei again yet."] = "達納蘇斯有個年輕的哨兵太久沒收到姊妹的消息了，所以我去艾薩拉找人。我發現凱爾達拉‧日刃被薩特抓了，還受了傷。只不過她其實沒受傷。她從頭到尾都在演，等著抓她的人鬆懈下來。結果我就是她一直在等的那個破綻。\n\n在那之後，塔倫迪斯營地的指揮官派我去對付那些在古老卡多雷遺跡裡翻來翻去的納迦，讓我忙了好一陣子。最後收尾的是軍閥克雷利安，躲在一座神殿裡，躲在他的守衛後面。守衛能擋的也就那麼多。\n\n指揮官捧著那顆頭，像捧著一個承諾。艾薩拉說不定還會再一次屬於卡多雷。"
L["One of the sentinels had spotted a kaldorei woman alone on the Shattered Strand, plainly no fighter. Saria Fairmoon. An archaeologist, more or less, digging for highborne relics while the naga looted everything around her, and very glad to find an assistant who could fight.\n\nSo I assisted. A staff from under a naga lady's nose, a crystal off a murloc, a mark of the old queen's favor. And three highborne tablets called Creation, Manipulation and Power, which in hindsight should have told me something.\n\nThen Saria wanted to show me what it had all been for, and I found out what she'd really been after.\n\nI went back to Talrendis Point with her knapsack full of artifacts and news nobody wanted. Saria didn't come with me."] = "有個哨兵在碎裂海灘發現一名卡多雷女子孤身一人，一看就不是打架的料。莎莉亞‧皎月。算是個考古學家吧，納迦把她周圍洗劫一空，她還在那裡挖上層精靈的遺物，能找到一個會打架的助手，她高興得不得了。\n\n所以我就當起了助手。從一位納迦女士的眼皮底下摸來一根法杖，從一隻魚人身上拿來一顆水晶，還有一枚古代女王恩寵的印記。另外還有三塊上層精靈石板，分別叫做「創造」、「操控」和「力量」，現在回想起來，這早該讓我察覺到什麼了。\n\n然後莎莉亞想讓我看看這一切到底是為了什麼，我這才明白她真正想要的是什麼。\n\n我背著她裝滿文物的背包回到塔倫迪斯營地，帶著一個沒人想聽的消息。莎莉亞沒有跟我一起回來。"
L["Belgrom Rockmaul had sent a dozen warriors to Azshara to guard a blood elf mage who'd promised him the riches of the highborne. When I got there the warriors were dead. The mage, Magus Rimtori, had killed them all.\n\nI found the camp: three sealed crystals feeding a summoning spell, and the seals in the pockets of Rimtori's officers. I took the seals and broke them, the crystals erupted, and while Rimtori was still reeling I finished it. The head went to Belgrom.\n\nThe mage's tome ended up with a warlock in Orgrimmar, who found a demon in its diagrams and wanted its heart. So I called the thing up at the Altar of Storms and brought the heart back. The warlock never said what it was for. I didn't ask."] = "貝爾戈洛姆·石槌派了一打戰士去艾薩拉，護衛一個答應給他上層精靈財寶的血精靈法師。等我到的時候，那些戰士都死了。那個法師，魔導師里姆托里，把他們全殺了。\n\n我找到了營地：三顆被封印的水晶在替一個召喚法術供能，封印就放在里姆托里手下軍官的口袋裡。我拿走封印、打破它們，水晶整個爆開，趁里姆托里還沒回過神，我就把事情了結了。頭送去給貝爾戈洛姆。\n\n那個法師的魔典最後落到奧格瑪一個術士手上，那術士在書裡的圖解中發現了一隻惡魔，想要牠的心臟。所以我在風暴祭壇把那東西召喚出來，把心臟帶了回去。那術士始終沒說心臟要拿來幹嘛。我也沒問。"
L["The Blackmaw are furbolgs without a home. The Legashi satyr drove them out of their den, and they've been living in makeshift camps ever since, getting sicker.\n\nTheir gatekeeper had sent scouts to spy on the satyr stronghold and hadn't heard back. I found one of them, Korsa, alone outside the walls. One scout dead, one taken, and Korsa too ashamed to go home and say so.\n\nSo we fixed it. We cut down Master Feardred, who served the satyr lord, thinned out the stronghold, and broke Graal out of a satyr cage.\n\nThe scouts walked back into Ursolan with their heads up. That was the whole point."] = "黑喉是一群無家可歸的熊怪。雷加希薩特把他們趕出了巢穴，從那之後他們就一直住在臨時搭的營地裡，病得越來越重。\n\n他們的守門人派了偵察兵去監視薩特的要塞，卻一直沒有回音。我找到了其中一個，科爾薩，孤零零地待在城牆外。一個偵察兵死了，一個被抓走，而科爾薩羞愧到不敢回去報告。\n\n所以我們把事情擺平了。我們幹掉了替薩特領主辦事的費德瑞德大師，把要塞裡的敵人清掉一大半，再把格拉爾從薩特的籠子裡救了出來。\n\n偵察兵們抬頭挺胸地走回烏索蘭。整件事的重點就在這裡。"
L["A Blackmaw named Furze was burning up with a fever that looked like it was unmaking him from the inside, and he wasn't the first. The tribe's elder had a theory about a cure, and it was the last place anybody wanted it to be: the Legashi's own firewater.\n\nSo I went into the satyr camp for a drink. They weren't sharing, so I took the recipe off one of them and brewed my own batch in their cauldron, satyrweed and a mote of fel power. I've smelled worse. Not much worse.\n\nThe elder turned it into a tincture, and I tested it on corrupted beasts out east: knock one down, dose it, watch. It worked well enough to give the elder hope.\n\nThe first real dose went to Furze. He'd waited long enough."] = "一個叫弗爾茲的黑喉熊怪發著高燒，那病看起來像是在從裡面把他一點一點拆掉，而他不是第一個。部族的長者對解藥有個想法，偏偏在大家最不希望的地方：雷加希自己的火酒。\n\n所以我進薩特營地去喝一杯。他們不肯分，我就從其中一個身上拿走配方，用他們的大鍋自己釀了一批，薩特草加上一個魔化微粒。我聞過更臭的。也沒臭多少就是了。\n\n長者把它做成了酊劑，我拿到東邊那些腐化的野獸身上試：打倒一隻，餵一劑，觀察。效果好到讓長者燃起了希望。\n\n第一劑真正的藥給了弗爾茲。他已經等夠久了。"
L["The Blackmaw needed warriors, so I went to Timbermaw Hold to ask their cousins. Funny thing: when the satyr overran the Blackmaw, the rest of the Timbermaw sealed their passage and never knew their own kin had made it out.\n\nGorn One Eye was glad to help, and couldn't. The Timbermaw had their own war on with the Deadwood. So I brought back the Deadwood chieftain's mace, with nobody holding it, and that freed up some warriors.\n\nI planted the Timbermaw War Banner in the satyr prince's summoning circle, the reinforcements came, and the prince fell. The demon who'd moved into Blackmaw Hold went the same way.\n\nFor the first time in a long while, the Blackmaw had something to plan besides the next retreat."] = "黑喉需要戰士，所以我去木喉要塞找他們的表親幫忙。說來好笑：當年薩特攻陷黑喉的時候，其他木喉熊怪封死了通道，從來不知道自己的族人有逃出來。\n\n獨眼高恩很樂意幫忙，但幫不上。木喉正在跟死木熊怪打他們自己的仗。所以我把死木酋長的錘子帶了回來，上面已經沒有人握著了，這才騰出了一些戰士。\n\n我把木喉戰旗插在薩特王子的召喚法陣上，援軍趕到，王子倒下了。那個搬進黑喉要塞的惡魔，也是一樣的下場。\n\n這是很久以來第一次，黑喉除了下一次撤退之外，有別的事可以計畫了。"
L["Some of the best things I've ever found, I found poking through ash. There's a burned-out wreck in Westfall, nothing left in it worth stealing, and in the middle of it a note. Charred half to nothing. But somebody had written it for whoever bothered to look, and I always bother to look.\n\nWhat was left of it pointed across the sea. To the Barrens, of all places. So I went, a very long way for a scrap of paper, and found a second burned-out ruin waiting for me. The twin of the first, an ocean apart, with the same sign left on it. And nailed up beside it, a plank with more writing.\n\nWhoever this was had gone to a lot of trouble. That's usually a good sign. Usually."] = "我這輩子找到過最棒的幾樣東西，都是在灰燼裡翻出來的。西部荒野有一處燒光的殘骸，裡面沒剩下任何值得偷的東西，正中間卻有一張紙條。燒到幾乎什麼都不剩。但有人寫下它，就是為了留給願意找的人，而我向來願意找。\n\n剩下的字指向海的另一邊。偏偏是貧瘠之地。所以我去了，為了一張紙片跑了好遠好遠，結果發現第二處燒光的廢墟在等著我。跟第一處一模一樣，隔著一整片海洋，上面留著同樣的記號。旁邊還釘著一塊木板，寫著更多的字。\n\n不管這人是誰，都花了好大一番工夫。這通常是個好兆頭。通常啦。"
L["There's a burned-out wreck out in the Barrens, the kind you ride past a hundred times. I didn't ride past it. In the ash was a note, charred so badly I could barely make it out, but somebody had plainly meant it to be found.\n\nWhat was left of it sent me across the sea to Westfall. Long trip for a scrap of paper. And there it was: a second burned-out ruin, twin of the first, a whole ocean away, with the same sign left on it. Nailed up beside it was a plank with the next set of instructions.\n\nI stood there a while thinking somebody out there had far too much time on their hands. Then I read the plank."] = "貧瘠之地有一處燒光的殘骸，就是那種你騎馬經過一百次都不會多看一眼的地方。我沒有直接騎過去。灰燼裡有一張紙條，燒得我幾乎看不清楚，但很顯然有人是故意要讓它被找到的。\n\n剩下的字把我送過海，到西部荒野去。為了一張紙片跑這麼遠。然後它就在那裡：第二處燒光的廢墟，跟第一處一模一樣，隔著一整片海洋，上面留著同樣的記號。旁邊釘著一塊木板，寫著下一步的指示。\n\n我在那裡站了一會兒，心想外頭某個人實在是太閒了。然後我讀了那塊木板。"
L["The plank sent me up into the Stonetalon Mountains, to a camp tucked away where nobody would ever stumble on it. Whoever lived there had left in a hurry. Crates still full of tools. Two good sturdy bags. And the sort of pocket litter you only leave behind when you're in a rush to be somewhere else.\n\nThe litter pointed me to the edge of the cliff, and then, as far as I could tell, over it. So I jumped.\n\nThey call that a leap of faith. I call it a very long moment. I came down on a ledge below in one piece, right beside a mound of fresh dirt. Somebody had been digging there, and not long ago.\n\nI'd come this far. I wasn't going to be stopped by a pile of dirt."] = "木板把我送上石爪山脈，到一個藏得很隱密、絕對不會有人誤打誤撞找到的營地。住在那裡的人走得很匆忙。箱子裡還裝滿工具。兩個堅固的好袋子。還有那種只有在你急著趕去別處的時候，才會隨手留下的口袋雜物。\n\n那些雜物把我指向懸崖邊，然後，就我看來，是指向懸崖外面。所以我跳了。\n\n他們管這叫信仰之躍。我管這叫非常漫長的一瞬間。我完好無缺地落在下面的一塊岩架上，旁邊就是一堆剛翻過的土。有人在那裡挖過，而且才剛挖不久。\n\n都走到這一步了，我可不會被一堆土擋下來。"
L["The dirt gave up a messenger bag with a parchment in it, and the parchment sent me clear across the sea to Stonewrought Dam, where a carved eagle on the stone heads pointed its fist at Thoradin's Wall. Lovely view, if you like heights.\n\nUp on the old wall was one more bag and one last note. Whoever had left it was gone. I'd just missed them, by the look of it. And under the note was what the whole trail had been guarding, across two continents, a cliff and a dam.\n\nA sleeping bag. A cozy one.\n\nI'd love to tell you I was disappointed. I wasn't. It's a very good sleeping bag."] = "土裡挖出一個信差包，裡面有張羊皮紙，羊皮紙又把我一路送過海，到巨石水壩去，那裡的石像上刻著一隻老鷹，石像的拳頭正指向索拉丁之牆。風景很美，如果你喜歡高的地方的話。\n\n在那道古老的城牆上，有最後一個袋子和最後一張紙條。留下它的人已經走了。看起來，我只差一點點就碰上了。而紙條底下，就是這整條線索一路守護的東西，跨越兩塊大陸、一座懸崖和一座水壩。\n\n一個睡袋。一個很舒適的睡袋。\n\n我很想跟你們說我很失望。我沒有。那真的是一個非常好的睡袋。"
L["Up on the lower slopes of Hyjal lives a hermit druid called Ketharas, in a cave, by choice. I liked him right away. Anyone who picks a cave over company has given it some thought.\n\nHe eased me in with seeds and owl eggs, then sent me west to the ancients and dryads still nursing their wounds from the war. That's where it got hard. One of their own, an ancient named Sunderbark, was too far gone in the corruption to come back, and somebody had to put him down.\n\nI did. Then I planted a seed in what was left of him.\n\nAfter that they sent me looking for a bird. A small one, I was told, with a great deal of power."] = "海加爾山的下坡住著一個叫凱薩拉斯的隱士德魯伊，住在洞穴裡，自願的。我馬上就喜歡上他了。會選洞穴而不選人群的人，一定是認真想過的。\n\n他先用種子和貓頭鷹蛋讓我暖暖身，然後把我往西派，去找那些還在舔舐戰爭傷口的古樹和林精。事情就是從那裡開始變難的。他們自己人之中，有一位叫裂皮的古樹，腐化得太深，已經回不來了，總得有人送他上路。\n\n我送了。然後在他剩下的殘骸裡種下了一顆種子。\n\n在那之後，他們派我去找一隻鳥。他們說，一隻小小的鳥，擁有很大的力量。"
L["The bird was a crow, and the crow was trouble, the good kind. A warlock outfit was cooking things up out of fel ash below the Felblood Scar, and she wanted it stopped. Her plan started with pinecones.\n\nPrickly ones. Turns out a prickly pinecone, delivered with feeling, ruins a warlock's workstation. I ruined four.\n\nThen she got bold. The warlocks kept a demon in a cage, Felflick, and she dangled an iron key where Felflick could see it. For a shot at freedom, Felflick told me whose bones to fetch and whose soulstone to take. The bones went onto the warlocks' own heap, and something big and foul crawled back out. I put it back down.\n\nAfter all that, Felflick wanted paying. What I did about that stays between me and the crow."] = "那隻鳥是一隻烏鴉，而那隻烏鴉是個麻煩，好的那種。有一群術士在魔血傷痕下方用魔化灰燼搞東搞西，她想讓他們停手。她的計畫從松果開始。\n\n多刺的那種。原來一顆多刺的松果，只要帶著感情丟出去，就能毀掉一個術士的工作台。我毀了四個。\n\n然後她膽子大了起來。術士們在籠子裡關了一隻叫菲爾弗利克的惡魔，她把一把鐵鑰匙晃到菲爾弗利克看得見的地方。為了換一個自由的機會，菲爾弗利克告訴我該去拿誰的骨頭、該拿走誰的靈魂石。那些骨頭被丟回術士們自己的骨堆上，然後有個又大又噁心的東西爬了出來。我又把它打回去了。\n\n忙完這一切，菲爾弗利克要我付帳。我是怎麼處理的，就只有我和那隻烏鴉知道了。"
L["In the ash west of the warlock camp I found a Wild God dying. Velician. You don't forget a thing like that. Velician pressed a branch of the World Tree into my hands, gone bad, with a sickly green crystal grown out of it, and begged that it reach the crow.\n\nNobody on the mountain could read it, so it went down to Moonglade, to an ancient called Orokai. Orokai sat with the branch a while and then showed me what it remembered. A druid named Ve'han Talongrasp had stolen part of a Wild God's power. And he'd talked about a Pact.\n\nNobody ever forms a Pact to plant flowers.\n\nI carried that back up the mountain."] = "在術士營地西邊的灰燼裡，我發現一位荒野之神快死了。維里希安。這種事你忘不掉的。維里希安把一根世界之樹的枝條塞到我手裡，枝條已經壞了，上面長出一顆病懨懨的綠色水晶，祂求我一定要把它交到那隻烏鴉手上。\n\n山上沒人看得懂它，所以它被送下山到月光林地，交給一位叫歐羅凱的古樹。歐羅凱陪著那根枝條坐了一會兒，然後讓我看它記得的東西。一個叫維漢‧爪握的德魯伊偷走了一位荒野之神的部分力量。而且他還提到了一個「教團」。\n\n從來沒有人是為了種花才組教團的。\n\n我把這件事帶回了山上。"
L["Ketharas had a plan to turn the stolen power back on the thief, and it needed gifts from the gods themselves. So I went shopping among the Wild Gods.\n\nThere's an effigy on a bridge above the Cradle of Tranquility. Touch it and Jereman comes, cleverest of the lot, they say, and Jereman knew exactly who to ask. A fox in the ruins of Dae'gun said the spell could feed on the ashes of Azgalor, one of the Legion's lieutenants, so I took a pinch of a demon lord. Another god wanted a drop of the life the Scourge had stolen, so I took that back off the Scourge. And a jewel from the harpies' nests. The harpies were not consulted.\n\nI came away with a much higher opinion of foxes."] = "凱薩拉斯有個計畫，要把被偷走的力量反過來對付小偷，而這需要眾神親手給的禮物。所以我就去荒野之神那裡採買了。\n\n祥和育所上方的一座橋上有一尊肖像。摸一下，傑勒曼就會來，據說是祂們之中最聰明的一位，而傑勒曼也很清楚該去問誰。戴根廢墟裡的一隻狐狸說，這個法術可以拿亞茲加洛的骨灰當養分，那是燃燒軍團的一個副官，所以我就去抓了一撮惡魔領主。另一位神想要一滴被天譴軍團偷走的生命，所以我又從天譴軍團手上拿了回來。還有鷹身人巢裡的一顆寶石。沒人問過鷹身人的意見。\n\n這趟下來，我對狐狸的評價高多了。"
L["Ketharas bound the gods' gifts into the branch, and out came the Staff of the Mountain. Up at the Summit of Eternity the druids put a name to the enemy: the Blackthorne Pact. Druids who'd lost their immortality, blamed Malfurion for it, and swore they'd take that power back.\n\nThe staff did what it was made for. Point it at one of them and the wards came off, and then it was a plain fight, which suited me. Ve'han's wards came off too, in the lodge under the great tree, and without his stolen power he went down like anybody else.\n\nThe Wild God he'd been trying to devour went home free. The druids thanked me, and offered the hermit a standing welcome, should Ketharas ever want company.\n\nI wouldn't hold my breath."] = "凱薩拉斯把眾神的禮物綁進枝條裡，做出了山脈法杖。在永恆山峰上，德魯伊們終於叫出了敵人的名字：黑荊教團。一群失去了永生的德魯伊，把這筆帳算在瑪法里恩頭上，發誓要把那份力量拿回來。\n\n法杖完全發揮了它的用途。拿它指著其中一個，結界就會被剝掉，接下來就只是單純打一架，這很合我胃口。維漢的結界也一樣被剝掉了，就在那棵巨樹下的小屋裡，沒有了偷來的力量，他倒下的樣子跟其他人沒兩樣。\n\n他一直想吞噬的那位荒野之神，自由地回家了。德魯伊們向我道謝，也對那位隱士發出長期有效的邀請，如果凱薩拉斯哪天想要有人作伴的話。\n\n我是不會屏息以待啦。"
L["I delivered a goblin's crate to Farholde Keep and walked straight into somebody else's war. Farholde and the orcs of Rog'mar had been fighting over the Riverglades for years, and now the Twilight's Hammer had burned the village of Sunnyglade and moved into the ruins.\n\nI spent a while clearing them out and carrying their pages and charms back to the keep. That's not the part I remember.\n\nThe part I remember is Farmer Elbrim. The raiders had taken keepsakes off the farmers they killed. I took them back and laid them on the graves. Then Elbrim asked me to go into the barn where the family had hidden and bring out whatever was left.\n\nA doll and a locket. That was what was left."] = "我替一個哥布林把一箱貨送到遠境堡要塞，結果直接走進了別人的戰爭。遠境堡和羅格瑪的獸人為了大河林地已經打了好多年，而現在暮光之錘又燒了陽光谷村，住進了廢墟裡。\n\n我花了一段時間把他們清掉，把他們的書頁和符咒搬回要塞。但我記得的不是這部分。\n\n我記得的是農夫艾爾布里姆。那些劫掠者從他們殺掉的農民身上拿走了紀念品。我把東西拿回來，放在墳上。然後艾爾布里姆請我進去那間穀倉，就是那一家人躲起來的地方，把剩下的東西帶出來。\n\n一個娃娃和一個墜子盒。剩下的就這些。"
L["I carried a goblin's crate up to Rog'mar, where the orcs had been fighting the humans of Farholde over the Riverglades for years. Krom'rosh wanted the humans reminded that Rog'mar was still there. So I raided their farm and their training camps, and their feed went into Rog'mar's stewpot.\n\nThen there was the new problem. The Twilight's Hammer had burned the human village of Sunnyglade and settled into the ashes. Nobody had invited them.\n\nTran'gul wanted to know why they'd come. I brought back the shadowmancers' letters, Tran'gul read every word, and then wanted a miner, alive and talking.\n\nThe miner wasn't talking, at first. I can be very persuasive.\n\nBy the end of it Tran'gul was sure of one thing. The cult hadn't come to the Riverglades for a village. It had come to dig."] = "我把一個哥布林的貨箱扛到羅格瑪。那裡的獸人為了大河林地跟遠境堡的人類打了好多年，克隆羅許想提醒那些人類，羅格瑪還在這裡。於是我洗劫了他們的農場和訓練營，他們的飼料進了羅格瑪的燉鍋。\n\n然後才是新麻煩。暮光之錘燒了人類的陽光谷村，就在灰燼裡住了下來。沒人邀請他們。\n\n特朗古爾想知道他們為什麼來。我把暗影術師的信件帶回去，特朗古爾一字一字讀完，接著就想要一個礦工，要活的，還要會說話的。\n\n那個礦工一開始不肯說話。我可以非常有說服力。\n\n到最後，特朗古爾確定了一件事。那個教派來大河林地不是為了一座村子。他們是來挖東西的。"
L["Under Sunnyglade the cult had caves, and in the caves it had ogres, and it was pouring void magic into them to see what happened. Mostly what happened was dead ogres. Now and then it was something a lot bigger and angrier.\n\nDown there I found Claire, an apprentice from Farholde Keep, trapped under the place Claire used to call home. Claire handed me a crystal catalyst to fill with the cult's magic, and I filled it, the hard way.\n\nThe one in charge down there was Chogg'Zac. Chogg'Zac had two heads. Claire wanted both. I brought back both.\n\nThen I carried the full catalyst up to Farholde and let the experts worry about what was in it."] = "陽光谷底下，教派有一些洞穴，洞穴裡有巨魔，他們把虛無魔法灌進巨魔體內，看看會發生什麼事。大部分時候，發生的事就是巨魔死掉。偶爾會變出某個大得多、也火大得多的東西。\n\n我在下面找到了克萊兒，一個遠境堡要塞的學徒，被困在自己曾經稱為家的地方底下。克萊兒交給我一個水晶催化器，要我裝滿教派的魔法，我裝滿了，用最辛苦的那種方法。\n\n下面管事的是喬札克。喬札克有兩顆頭。克萊兒兩顆都要。我兩顆都帶回來了。\n\n然後我把裝滿的催化器帶回遠境堡，讓專家們去煩惱裡面到底裝了什麼。"
L["There's a cave under Sunnyglade, and down there I met Clubtoe. An ogre miner, looking for friends who'd gone missing. I helped look. What we found was the cult pouring void magic into ogres, making a few of them huge and wrong and killing a great many more.\n\nClubtoe took that about as well as you'd expect. We smashed their glowing circles and went for the one in charge, Chogg'Zac. One ogre, two heads.\n\nThat was it for Clubtoe and the Twilight's Hammer. Before heading off to join the ogres who'd already walked out on the cult, Clubtoe handed me one of the heads to carry home to Rog'mar.\n\nNice gesture. Heavy gesture."] = "陽光谷底下有個洞穴，我在那裡遇見了棒趾。一個巨魔礦工，在找失蹤的朋友。我幫忙找了。結果我們發現教派正在把虛無魔法灌進巨魔體內，讓少數幾個變得又大又不對勁，然後害死更多更多。\n\n棒趾的反應就跟你想的差不多。我們砸爛了他們那些發光的法陣，然後去找管事的，喬札克。一個巨魔，兩顆頭。\n\n這下棒趾跟暮光之錘算是徹底一刀兩斷了。在動身去投靠那些已經離開教派的巨魔之前，棒趾把其中一顆頭交給我，要我帶回羅格瑪。\n\n很有心意。也很有重量。"
L["An ogre's head makes a fine introduction, so Tran'gul sent me north with one to Bolder'ok, where the ogres who quit the Twilight's Hammer live by one rule: whoever hits hardest is right.\n\nTheir leader, Clugfist, sized me up the only way an ogre knows. Smash the weaklings who crept back to the cult. Then get Clugfist's own weapon back off Klunk, the champion who ran off with it. I did both.\n\nClugfist allowed that the Horde might be stronger than expected. From an ogre, that's practically a love song.\n\nI carried the decree home: Bolder'ok and Rog'mar would be spilling blood together soon."] = "一顆巨魔的頭是很好的見面禮，所以特朗古爾派我帶著一顆往北去博德羅克，那些退出暮光之錘的巨魔住在那裡，只遵守一條規矩：誰打得最用力，誰就是對的。\n\n他們的首領鈍拳，用巨魔唯一懂的方式打量我。先去痛扁那些偷偷溜回教派的弱者。然後從冠軍克魯克手上，把鈍拳自己的武器拿回來，那傢伙帶著武器跑了。兩件我都辦到了。\n\n鈍拳承認，部落也許比預期的還要強。從巨魔嘴裡說出來，這幾乎等於是情歌了。\n\n我把那道命令帶回家：博德羅克和羅格瑪很快就要並肩見血了。"
L["West of Sunnyglade the cult had built itself a fortress, the Twilight's Shroud, and a sergeant from Farholde had been holding the border in front of it with no word from home. Somebody had to turn up eventually. It was me.\n\nFive of Farholde's scouts were sitting in the cult's cages. I took keys off the cultists until I had enough and let them all out.\n\nThen I went looking for whoever was running the cult's whole campaign. Overlord Kilgar, deep in the Shroud. The sergeant asked for his head, so that's what I brought back.\n\nGood news for Farholde, for once."] = "在陽光谷西邊，教派替自己蓋了一座堡壘，叫暮光之幕，而遠境堡有位中士一直在堡壘前面守著邊界，家裡音訊全無。總得有人出現。那個人是我。\n\n遠境堡的五個斥候被關在教派的籠子裡。我從教徒身上一把一把拿鑰匙，拿夠了，就把他們全放了出來。\n\n然後我去找主導教派整場行動的人。霸主基爾加，在暮光之幕的最深處。中士要他的頭，所以我就帶了頭回去。\n\n難得一次，是給遠境堡的好消息。"
L["Da'grosh is the sort who doesn't wait for anybody. Da'grosh had charged the cult's new fortress, the Twilight's Shroud, and watched his warriors dragged off into cages. So we went back in, and I let five of Rog'mar's scouts out.\n\nThe better part was a cave nearby where the cult kept ogres digging for it. A Bolder'ok ogre and I talked five of those miners into turning on their masters. Their executioner didn't get talked into anything, so I took the executioner's mace home to Bolder'ok.\n\nLast came Overlord Kilgar, who ran the whole show. Da'grosh wanted his head. Da'grosh got it."] = "達羅許是那種不等任何人的類型。達羅許衝向教派的新堡壘暮光之幕，結果眼睜睜看著他的戰士被拖進籠子裡。所以我們又殺了回去，我放出了羅格瑪的五個斥候。\n\n更精彩的是附近一個洞穴，教派讓巨魔在那裡替他們挖礦。我和一個博德羅克的巨魔說服了其中五個礦工，反過來對付他們的主子。他們的劊子手怎麼說都說不動，所以我把劊子手的錘子帶回了博德羅克。\n\n最後是霸主基爾加，整場戲的總導演。達羅許要他的頭。達羅許拿到了。"
L["Kilgar was dead and the cult kept coming anyway, which is the trouble with cults.\n\nAshe Amberhall at Farholde had an idea, and a soulstone. I called a thrall up out of one of the cult's conduits and caught it in the stone, and Ashe asked it questions until it gave up where they were coming from: a stronghold hidden in the mountains, Krol'dok.\n\nSo I went and had a look. I made sure the stronghold had no leader anymore, and came home with the Eye of Mugg to prove it. It's the sort of proof nobody argues with."] = "基爾加死了，教派還是一直來，這就是教派麻煩的地方。\n\n遠境堡的艾希‧安珀荷有個主意，還有一顆靈魂石。我從教派的一個導管裡召喚出一個奴僕，把它關進石頭裡，艾希一直問它問題，問到它供出他們是從哪裡來的：一座藏在山裡的要塞，克羅多克。\n\n所以我就去看了看。我確保那座要塞再也沒有首領，然後帶著穆格之眼回家當證據。這是那種沒人會爭辯的證據。"
L["With Kilgar dead you'd think the cult would take the hint. It didn't. Their trail led to a stronghold hidden in the mountains, Krol'dok, and Da'grosh was waiting outside it with a job for whoever went in.\n\nInside, I collected a token of vengeance. Fifteen cultists' ears. I counted twice.\n\nI came out with their tome as well, and the Eye of Mugg, so Rog'mar could see for itself that the stronghold's leader wouldn't be leading anything anymore."] = "基爾加都死了，你會以為教派該懂了吧。並沒有。他們的蹤跡通往一座藏在山裡的要塞，克羅多克，而達羅許就等在要塞外面，手上有件差事要交給進去的人。\n\n進去之後，我收集了一份復仇的信物。十五個教徒的耳朵。我數了兩遍。\n\n我出來的時候還帶著他們的魔典，以及穆格之眼，讓羅格瑪親眼看看，那座要塞的首領再也領導不了任何東西了。"
L["Somewhere in Krol'dok, a blacksmith called Tunk had been carrying the mould for a key. Tunk didn't need it anymore. I took it back to Farholde Keep, where Alphonse Dumas called it rather crude, kept the embers hot, and sent me off for four pieces of thick leather and twelve iron bars. What came out of the forge was a key to Krol'dok's compound. Word is it opens a locked door deep inside, the short way to whoever waits at the back. I'm keeping it for next time."] = "在克羅多克的某個角落，有個叫吞克的鐵匠，身上一直帶著一副鑰匙模具。吞克已經用不到它了。我把它帶回遠境堡要塞，阿爾馮斯‧仲馬說它相當粗糙，讓爐火一直燒著，然後打發我去弄四塊厚皮和十二塊鐵錠。出爐的是一把克羅多克營地鑰匙。聽說它能打開要塞深處一扇上鎖的門，是通往最裡面那位的捷徑。我先留著，下回用。"
L["Somewhere in Krol'dok, a blacksmith called Tunk had been carrying the mould for a key. Tunk didn't need it anymore. I took it to Kreza Darkthorn at Rog'mar, who called it crude and worn, kept the embers hot, and sent me off for four pieces of thick leather and twelve iron bars. What came out of the forge was a key to Krol'dok's compound. Word is it opens a locked door deep inside, the short way to whoever waits at the back. I'm keeping it for next time."] = "在克羅多克的某個角落，有個叫吞克的鐵匠，身上一直帶著一副鑰匙模具。吞克已經用不到它了。我把它帶到羅格瑪交給克瑞莎‧黑棘，克瑞莎說它又粗糙又磨損，讓爐火一直燒著，然後打發我去弄四塊厚皮和十二塊鐵錠。出爐的是一把克羅多克營地鑰匙。聽說它能打開要塞深處一扇上鎖的門，是通往最裡面那位的捷徑。我先留著，下回用。"
L["Farholde had been writing to Stormwind for years, and Stormwind had been not writing back. So the knight commander tried a different sort of letter, and I carried the overlord's head to Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep. Hard to ignore a head.\n\nThen a field marshal's log came my way, and the man who wrote it was still out in the Twilight's Shroud. I found Marshal Ryan dying. He gave me his crest, a warning he never got to finish, and a name. Abigail.\n\nThe knight commander asked me to carry the crest to her in Cathedral Square, and not to expect company. Some faces aren't welcome at some doors, apparently.\n\nI didn't ask why. Some errands you just do."] = "遠境堡寫信給暴風城寫了好幾年，而暴風城一直都沒回。所以騎士指揮官換了一種寫信的方式，由我把霸主的頭送去暴風要塞給伯瓦爾‧弗塔根。一顆頭，可就很難假裝沒看到了。\n\n然後一本元帥的日誌落到我手上，寫日誌的人還在暮光之幕裡。我找到元帥雷恩的時候，他快死了。他給了我他的徽記、一句來不及說完的警告，還有一個名字。艾比蓋兒。\n\n騎士指揮官請我把徽記送去教堂廣場給她，還說別指望有人陪。看來有些臉孔，在有些門前並不受歡迎。\n\n我沒問為什麼。有些差事，做就對了。"
L["The Magram and the Gelkis have been feuding longer than anyone can remember, and each wanted me on their side. I'm not saying which one got me. Either way I ended up in the Valley of Bones, where skeletons were clawing up out of the ground. Not centaur skeletons, either.\n\nThe Magram looked at that and saw an army. Orgrul wanted bones to build it with, gently cursed, and wanted exactly four hundred and twenty-six of them. Somebody there can count. The Gelkis looked at the necromancers' robes, saw their own exiles, and wanted the curse broken.\n\nEither way, I ended up holding somebody else's staff and pointing it at the dead. What it did depended on who'd made it."] = "瑪格拉姆和吉爾吉斯結仇的時間，久到沒人記得，兩邊都想要我站在他們那一邊。最後是哪一邊得到了我，我不說。不管怎樣，我最後都到了白骨之谷，那裡有骷髏正從地底爬出來。而且還不是半人馬的骷髏。\n\n瑪格拉姆看到這一幕，看到的是一支軍隊。歐格魯爾要骨頭來組建這支軍隊，要稍微被詛咒過的，而且剛好要四百二十六根。那邊顯然有人很會算數。吉爾吉斯看到的是死靈法師的長袍，認出那是他們自己的流亡者，所以想要破除詛咒。\n\n不管怎樣，我最後都握著別人的法杖，指著那些死人。它會起什麼作用，要看是誰做的。"
L["Ride with the Gelkis, and the khan of the Magram is the problem. With so many Magram tied up in the valley their village was nearly empty, and Khan Jehn died in his own home at the hands of outsiders working for the Gelkis.\n\nRide with the Magram, and the khan's death is the news waiting for you when you come back from the front. Orgrul didn't rage about it. Orgrul just handed the necromancy staff back to the Magram, and in a tent by the village lake, Khan Jehn got up again.\n\nWhich ride was mine, I'm keeping to myself. Either way, the khan had a worse week than I did."] = "跟著吉爾吉斯走，問題就是瑪格拉姆的可汗。大批瑪格拉姆被困在山谷裡，他們的村子幾乎空了，可汗傑恩就死在自己家裡，下手的是替吉爾吉斯做事的外人。\n\n跟著瑪格拉姆走，可汗的死就是你從前線回來時等著你的消息。歐格魯爾沒有暴怒。歐格魯爾只是把那根死靈法杖交還給瑪格拉姆，然後在村子湖邊的一座帳篷裡，可汗傑恩又站了起來。\n\n我走的是哪一條路，我就自己留著了。不管怎樣，可汗那陣子都過得比我慘。"
L["In the woods past the centaur lines I found a crystal pylon, cracked and humming, and Mordent Evenshade, who wanted it fixed. Its missing pieces had been carried off as trophies to both centaur villages. I took them back. From both.\n\nThen I wandered the woods with a borrowed relic, scooping up loose mana and pouring it into the pylons, and right about the time they hummed properly, the sky changed. Mordent only got round to explaining afterward.\n\nThe temple's historian was still rattled that I'd carried that relic through haunted woods, but not too rattled to send me after a dying protector's crystal heart and point me at an unstable rift. Was there still enough mana here to make new guardians?\n\nI threw it. We found out."] = "在半人馬戰線另一頭的林子裡，我發現一座水晶晶塔，裂了，還在嗡嗡作響，旁邊是莫登特‧暮影，想把它修好。它缺的零件被當成戰利品，搬到了兩個半人馬村子去。我把它們拿回來了。兩邊都拿。\n\n然後我帶著一件借來的聖物在林子裡晃，把散落的魔力舀起來，倒進晶塔裡，就在它們開始正常嗡嗡響的時候，天空變了。莫登特是事後才想到要解釋的。\n\n神殿的史學家到現在還在為我帶著那件聖物穿過鬧鬼的樹林而驚魂未定，不過還沒嚇到不能派我去拿一個垂死守護者的水晶心臟，再把我指向一道不穩定的裂隙。這裡剩下的魔力，還夠不夠造出新的守護者？\n\n我把它丟了進去。答案揭曉了。"
L["Mithera's garden had gone wild and mean, and the necklace that woke its treants was missing from its shrine. Her old friend Woodwyrd was still there, dead and still feeling the flames. I put Woodwyrd out with a vial of water from the depths of Maraudon, which is not a sentence I ever expected to say.\n\nThe thieves were quilboar. Kog'thug the Brave owned up to it, which was brave, I suppose, but the necklace was with Kog'thug's mate now, and the two of them weren't speaking. Peace took a bouquet from the very garden they'd robbed and the blood of Agamaggan from Razorfen Downs. Not Razorfen Kraul. Kog'thug made very sure I knew the difference.\n\nThe necklace went home with its magic spent. Still from her daughter, though."] = "米瑟拉的花園變得又野又兇，而那條能喚醒樹人的項鍊從聖壇上不見了。她的老朋友伍德維德還在那裡，已經死了，卻還感覺得到火焰。我用一瓶從瑪拉頓深處取來的水，把伍德維德的火熄了，這句話我從沒想過自己會說出口。\n\n小偷是野豬人。勇者科格薩格認了，我想這確實挺勇敢的，但項鍊現在在科格薩格的伴侶手上，而他們兩個正在冷戰。要和好，得用一束從他們偷東西的那座花園裡摘的花，外加剃刀高地的阿迦瑪甘之血。不是剃刀沼澤。科格薩格非常確定我搞清楚了這兩個的差別。\n\n項鍊回家了，魔力已經用盡。不過，那依然是她女兒送的。"
L["Coming of age in Thendal Grove mostly means the village finally hands you the chores it's been saving up. I did a lot of chores.\n\nThe good part came after. Somebody lent me better eyes for a look at the anchor pylon, the thing holding our whole island up in the sky, and Falorne Fallwind showed me how to read the leylines, the gift my line carries. Hard to explain. Like putting your ear to the ground and hearing the island hum.\n\nIt wasn't all humming. Al'Aketh converts were out by the standing stones, goading the wind sprites into a fury. First time I met the cult. Wouldn't be the last.\n\nFor my last trial, Aetheen of the Gales sent me into the ursera caves after the den mother. I came back with her head, and the grove let me go."] = "在坦德爾林地成年，大部分的意思就是，村子終於把一直留給你的雜事統統丟給你了。我做了好多雜事。\n\n精彩的部分在後面。有人借了我一雙更好的眼睛，讓我看看錨定晶塔，就是那個把我們整座島撐在天上的東西，而法羅恩‧秋風教我怎麼解讀地脈，那是我這一脈血統傳下來的天賦。很難解釋。就像把耳朵貼在地上，聽見整座島在嗡嗡低鳴。\n\n不全都是嗡嗡聲。奧拉凱斯的皈依者跑到立石那邊，把風靈們激得暴跳如雷。那是我第一次碰到這個教派。不會是最後一次。\n\n至於最後的試煉，狂風艾希安把我派進熊獸的洞穴去找巢母。我帶著她的頭回來，林地就放我走了。"
L["Coming of age in Thendal Grove, you learn fast that the grown-ups have been saving chores for you. I'll skip the chores.\n\nWhat I remember is the sky. Ventaari Brightwish took me to the Elemental Convergence to use the skysight, the gift my line carries. You look up, and the sky looks back. That's the best I can do. Somebody lent me better eyes, too, for a look at the anchor pylon that keeps the whole island aloft. You don't think about that much, growing up. You do after.\n\nThen the winds by the standing stones went wild, and it turned out Al'Aketh converts were stirring the sprites up on purpose. My first brush with the cult.\n\nLast came my trial, in the ursera caves, after the den mother. I came back. She didn't."] = "在坦德爾林地成年，你很快就會發現，大人們一直在替你存雜事。雜事我就跳過了。\n\n我記得的是天空。凡塔莉‧亮願帶我去元素匯聚使用天之視覺，那是我這一脈血統傳下來的天賦。你抬頭看天空，天空也回頭看你。我只能形容到這樣了。也有人借了我一雙更好的眼睛，讓我看看那座讓整座島浮在空中的錨定晶塔。從小到大，你不太會去想這種事。看過之後就會了。\n\n然後立石旁的風突然狂暴起來，原來是奧拉凱斯的皈依者故意在挑撥風靈。那是我第一次和這個教派交手。\n\n最後是我的試煉，在熊獸的洞穴裡，對付巢母。我回來了。她沒有。"
L["On the road to Shen'dar Village I broke up a band of thugs that High Priestess Lorthuna had sent down from the Shrine of Akir. Good warm-up.\n\nIn Shen'dar the constable needed one look at me to know which order I belonged to, and sent me to my elder. Rathiril Sunlance of the High Order sat me down, told me how bad things were for the island, and then asked me to go and run the Windshapers off a place the High Order holds sacred. Which meant beating six of their novice seers.\n\nThat's the orders for you. Both love the island. They just can't stand each other.\n\nThe constable's own errand was refreshingly simple. A bandit called Badwind Bennic had a gang in the cave behind the waterfall. Had."] = "在往申德村的路上，我收拾了一群高階女祭司洛蘇娜從奧基爾聖殿派下來的打手。很好的暖身。\n\n到了申德，治安官只看了我一眼，就知道我屬於哪個教團，把我送去見我的長老。高天盟的拉斯里爾‧日槍讓我坐下，告訴我島上的情況有多糟，接著就請我去把塑風者趕出一個高天盟視為神聖的地方。意思就是打敗他們六個見習先知。\n\n這就是兩大教團。兩邊都愛這座島。只是彼此看不順眼。\n\n治安官自己的差事就單純得讓人鬆一口氣。一個叫『惡風』班尼克的強盜，在瀑布後面的洞穴裡有一幫手下。曾經有。"
L["On the road to Shen'dar Village I broke up a band of thugs that High Priestess Lorthuna had sent down from the Shrine of Akir. Good warm-up.\n\nIn Shen'dar the constable read my lineage at a glance and sent me to my elder, Illaya Amberwind of the Windshapers. Illaya talked a long while about the island's plight. Then about the High Order, whose apprentices were all over a place the Windshapers hold sacred. That part was shorter, and it ended with me beating six of them.\n\nThat's the two orders for you. Both would give anything for the island. Neither would share a bench.\n\nAfter that, clearing bandits out of a cave behind the waterfall felt almost restful."] = "在往申德村的路上，我收拾了一群高階女祭司洛蘇娜從奧基爾聖殿派下來的打手。很好的暖身。\n\n到了申德，治安官一眼就看出我的血統，把我送去見我的長老，塑風者的伊菈雅‧琥珀風。伊菈雅講了好久島上的困境。然後講到高天盟，說他們的學徒在一個塑風者視為神聖的地方到處亂跑。這部分講得比較短，結尾是我打敗了他們六個。\n\n這就是兩大教團。兩邊都願意為這座島付出一切。但誰也不肯跟對方坐同一張板凳。\n\n在那之後，去瀑布後面的洞穴清掉一窩強盜，感覺幾乎算是休息了。"
L["The cult had a missionary preaching in Shen'dar, and the constable was tired of it. So I joined up. Somebody put the Mark of Akir on me, and off I went to Falaath Village, one of the faithful.\n\nMissionary Jasaan preached contrition at me while living lightning strolled up and down the streets like it paid rent there. I nodded in all the right places. What I carried home was enough for the constable to strike first, and my second visit to Falaath went a lot worse for them.\n\nThen the cult hit the western watchtower, and I got there too late. Peacekeeper Vaaniel was dead. There was a bloody note, and among the things it sent me after was a family signet. A Shadowsong signet, for the High Elder in Valanaar.\n\nThe report was the easy part to deliver."] = "教派有個傳教士在申德傳教，治安官已經受夠了。所以我入教了。有人在我身上烙下奧基爾印記，我就以虔誠信徒的身分去了法拉斯村。\n\n傳教士賈桑對著我宣講懺悔，而活生生的閃電就在街上走來走去，好像在那裡付了房租一樣。所有該點頭的地方我都點了頭。我帶回去的情報，足以讓治安官先發制人，而我第二次去法拉斯村的時候，他們的下場就慘多了。\n\n然後教派襲擊了西邊的瞭望塔，我趕到的時候已經太遲了。保安官梵尼爾死了。現場有一張沾血的紙條，它要我去找的東西裡，有一枚家族印戒。影歌家族的印戒，要交給瓦拉納爾的高階長者。\n\n報告反而是最好送的部分。"
L["The head of my order, the Supreme Magister, had a grand plan and a missing scholar. The scholar was Fillion Flamebreeze, and I found Fillion in a shriekling den, hurt. So I carried that scholar out past everything in there that wanted us both dead. Harder than it sounds. Later I went back in for the Shriekling Matriarch and brought Fillion her head.\n\nFillion's readings were the plan: a way to steer skycutter ships between Skywall and Azeroth. I gathered them again at the standing stones, right under the Windshapers' noses.\n\nThen the cult sent the High Order a box. Inside was Belathaan Brightwish's silvered tongue. I went out and evened the account, and after that the High Order pledged itself to the fight."] = "我們教團的首領，至高博學者，有一個宏大的計畫，和一個失蹤的學者。學者叫菲利安‧焰風，我在一個始祖鳥巢穴裡找到了菲利安，受了傷。所以我扛著那位學者出來，一路閃過裡面所有想讓我們兩個死的東西。比聽起來難多了。後來我又回去對付始祖鳥族母，把她的頭帶給了菲利安。\n\n菲利安的讀數就是計畫的核心：一種能在天空之牆和艾澤拉斯之間駕駛割天者飛船的方法。我在立石那邊又重新收集了一次讀數，就在塑風者的眼皮底下。\n\n然後教派寄了一個盒子給高天盟。裡面是貝拉桑‧亮願那條能言善道的舌頭。我出門去把這筆帳算平了，在那之後，高天盟宣誓投入這場戰鬥。"
L["The head of my order, the Grand Skyseer, had a grand plan and a broken construct. Riaani Nightwind told me what it was missing: crystallized lightning, an enchanted gyrozephyr and an air construct core. Lovely words. I found the parts. I also found where they pointed, which was straight at the High Order. At Belathaan Brightwish, to be exact.\n\nI caught up with Belathaan on the road to the Shrine of Akir, and we had words. Firm ones.\n\nThen the cult answered in blood. Windshaper novices dead in the highlands. I went out to the lowlands and took ten charms off cultist corpses in return. Not even, but a start, and the Windshapers pledged themselves to the fight, High Order or no High Order."] = "我們教團的首領，大觀天者，有一個宏大的計畫，和一具壞掉的構造體。里安尼‧夜風告訴我它缺了什麼：結晶閃電、一個附魔過的陀風儀，還有一顆空氣構造體核心。好美的詞。零件我找到了。我也找到了它們指向的地方，直直指向高天盟。精確地說，是指向貝拉桑‧亮願。\n\n我在前往奧基爾聖殿的路上追上了貝拉桑，我們聊了一下。聊得很堅定。\n\n然後教派用血來回應。塑風者的見習生死在高地上。我跑到低地，從教徒的屍體上拿了十個護符作為回禮。還沒扯平，但算是個開始，於是塑風者宣誓投入這場戰鬥，管他高天盟怎麼想。"
L["The druids in Shadowgale Forest had gone quiet, and in a haunted forest, quiet is never good news.\n\nThe cult had ambushed their den. Elegael Thornpaw had come through it, barely, and knew who'd done it: Commander Haalien, one of their own circle, gone over to the Al'Aketh. I brought back Haalien's head. Tucked behind the bracer was a torn missive saying somebody in Valanaar was feeding the cult everything it knew.\n\nAfter that I took poultices into the den and went from druid to druid, patching up the ones who could still be patched.\n\nI took the missive home to Valanaar, and the names of the dead."] = "影風森林的德魯伊們沒了聲音，而在一座鬧鬼的森林裡，安靜從來不是好消息。\n\n教派伏擊了他們的巢穴。伊蕾嘉兒‧荊爪勉強撐了過來，也知道是誰幹的：指揮官哈利安，他們自己圈子裡的人，投靠了奧拉凱斯。我把哈利安的頭帶了回來。護腕後面塞著一張撕破的密函，上面說瓦拉納爾有人一直把所有情報餵給教派。\n\n在那之後，我帶著藥膏進到巢穴裡，一個德魯伊接一個德魯伊地看，替那些還補得起來的人包紮。\n\n我把密函帶回瓦拉納爾，還有死者的名字。"
L["The cult went for the watchtowers next. At the eastern one the relief force was hanging on by its fingernails, so I went for the cult's healers first. Take away the healers and the brawlers get a lot less brave. Commander Belguilos, a peacekeeper who'd turned Breaker for the cult, went down after that, and so did the assault.\n\nBack in Valanaar the High Elder had a lead: a cultist who wanted out. I found the turncoat's hiding place, and the turncoat in it, already dead, with the assassins still hanging about. Ten fewer by the time I left. Under the body was a damaged blue crystal, still glowing.\n\nWhatever the High Elder got out of that crystal ended all talk of caution. We were going to the Shrine of Akir."] = "教派接著把目標轉向瞭望塔。東邊那座的支援部隊已經快撐不住了，所以我先去收拾教派的治療者。把治療者拿掉，那些打手就沒那麼勇敢了。指揮官貝吉蘿絲，一個替教派當起破壞者的保安官，接著倒下，攻勢也跟著瓦解。\n\n回到瓦拉納爾，高階長者有了一條線索：一個想脫身的教徒。我找到了那個叛徒的藏身處，叛徒也在裡面，已經死了，刺客們還在附近晃。等我離開的時候，刺客少了十個。屍體底下有一顆受損的藍色水晶，還在發光。\n\n不管高階長者從那顆水晶裡得到了什麼，從此再也沒人提「謹慎」兩個字。我們要殺上奧基爾聖殿了。"
L["The peacekeepers and both orders marched on the Shrine of Akir together and cut a path to the inner sanctum. Empty. Lorthuna had gone up through a portal into the sky.\n\nSo up we went after her, and the help the orders had sent for arrived from Azeroth, the Kirin Tor and the Earthen Ring both. The high priestess was stopped. But the wards that hid Zephras from Al'Akir were down, and no island holds out against the Windlord in his own realm.\n\nSo the orders went down to Azeroth to look for a way to save it. The High Order took a skycutter to Dalaran, a portal took me on to Stormwind, and before long I was being introduced to the Alliance's leaders, one city at a time.\n\nNot bad for somebody who'd never stood on ground that didn't float."] = "保安官和兩大教團一起向奧基爾聖殿進軍，殺出一條路進到內殿。空的。洛蘇娜已經穿過傳送門，跑到天上去了。\n\n所以我們追了上去，兩大教團求來的援軍也從艾澤拉斯趕到，祈倫托和陶土議會都來了。高階女祭司被阻止了。但讓微風島躲過奧拉基爾耳目的結界已經倒了，而在馭風者自己的國度裡，沒有一座島撐得住。\n\n所以兩大教團下到艾澤拉斯，尋找拯救它的方法。高天盟搭割天者號去了達拉然，一道傳送門再把我送到暴風城，沒多久我就被人帶著，一座城一座城地去拜見聯盟的領袖。\n\n對一個從沒踩過不會飄的地面的人來說，還不賴。"
L["Both orders and the peacekeepers, side by side for once, fought their way into the Shrine of Akir and found the inner sanctum empty. Lorthuna had slipped through a portal to the spires overhead.\n\nUp we went. Help came from Azeroth, the Earthen Ring and the Kirin Tor, and the high priestess was stopped. But the wards that hid Zephras from Al'Akir were down, and the island couldn't stand against the Windlord in his own realm.\n\nSo the Windshapers took a skycutter down to Mulgore to look for a way to save it, and I went on to Orgrimmar, where Thrall sent me round to meet the rest of the Horde.\n\nFirst time I'd stood on ground that wasn't floating. I kept checking."] = "兩大教團和保安官難得並肩作戰，一路殺進奧基爾聖殿，結果發現內殿是空的。洛蘇娜已經從一道傳送門溜到上方的尖塔去了。\n\n我們追了上去。援軍從艾澤拉斯趕來，陶土議會和祈倫托都到了，高階女祭司被阻止了。但讓微風島躲過奧拉基爾耳目的結界已經倒了，而在馭風者自己的國度裡，這座島撐不住。\n\n所以塑風者搭著割天者號下到莫高雷，尋找拯救它的方法，而我繼續前往奧格瑪，索爾派我四處去認識部落的其他人。\n\n那是我第一次站在不會飄的地面上。我一直忍不住低頭確認。"
L["So there's this apothecary in Brill. Johaan. Hums while he works. First day, he sends me out to kill dogs for their blood. Then murlocs for their scales, then spiders for their venom, and I'm thinking this had better be a soup.\n\nIt was not a soup. It was a drink, and the lucky guest was a dwarf they were keeping in the tavern cellar. I'll spare you that part. Johaan was thrilled. He wrote it all down, handed me his findings for Silverpine and told me to walk carefully.\n\nI walked very carefully."] = "所以布瑞爾有個藥劑師。喬漢。工作的時候會哼歌。第一天，他派我去殺狗取血。然後是殺魚人取鱗片，再來殺蜘蛛取毒液，我心想，這最好是在煮湯。\n\n那不是湯。那是一杯飲料，幸運的客人是他們關在旅店地窖裡的一個矮人。那部分我就不多說了。喬漢興奮得不得了。他把一切都寫了下來，把研究成果交給我，要我送去銀松森林，還叫我走路小心點。\n\n我走得非常小心。"
L["Silverpine is where Johaan's work goes to grow up. Renferrel at the Sepulcher wanted bear hearts and spider blood, which by then felt like ordinary shopping, and I hauled the lot down to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity. He looked at it the way most people look at cake.\n\nTurns out somebody had tried this recipe before. A fellow called Berard, whose journal was still lying around in Pyrewood Village. Lovely place. Do not stay the night. I got the journal out, and then Faranell wanted moss off the things in Lake Lordamere and a hardened tumor, and I stopped asking what any of it was for.\n\nThat's the trick with apothecaries. The less you ask, the better you sleep."] = "銀松森林是喬漢的研究去長大的地方。瑟伯切爾的倫弗利爾要熊心和蜘蛛血，到那時候這已經感覺像普通買菜了，我把一大堆東西扛到幽暗城給大藥劑師法拉尼爾。他看那些東西的眼神，就像大多數人看蛋糕一樣。\n\n原來之前有人試過這個配方。一個叫貝拉德的傢伙，他的日記還丟在焚木村裡。很漂亮的地方。千萬別在那裡過夜。我把日記拿了出來，然後法拉尼爾又要洛丹米爾湖裡那些東西身上的苔蘚，還要一顆硬化的腫瘤，從那之後我就不再問任何東西是拿來幹嘛的了。\n\n這就是跟藥劑師打交道的訣竅。問得越少，睡得越好。"
L["Apothecary Lydon runs things in Tarren Mill, and Lydon likes to test his work on whoever's handy. I brought him bear tongues and creeper ichor, he cooked up the Elixir of Suffering, and then he handed it back to me. Not to drink. For Umpi, the poor beast he keeps in his room. Umpi did not enjoy it.\n\nNext came mountain lion blood for the Elixir of Pain, and that one was for Stanley. Stanley lived on a farm down in Hillsbrad Fields and was, until I came along, a very good dog. One sip and he was something else entirely, and we had words, and I won.\n\nLydon was delighted. Lydon is always delighted."] = "藥劑師林度恩負責塔倫米爾的大小事，而林度恩喜歡拿手邊任何人來測試他的作品。我帶給他熊舌頭和食苔蛛的毒液，他熬出了受難藥劑，然後又把它遞回給我。不是要我喝。是給烏比的，那隻他養在房間裡的可憐野獸。烏比一點都不喜歡。\n\n接下來是山獅的血，做痛苦藥劑，那瓶是給斯坦利的。斯坦利住在希爾斯布萊德農場的一座農莊裡，在我出現之前，是一隻非常乖的狗。一口下去，牠就變成了完全不一樣的東西，我們吵了一架，我贏了。\n\n林度恩高興得不得了。林度恩永遠都很高興。"
L["The Elixir of Agony was Lydon's masterpiece, and it took half of Hillsbrad to make. Mudsnout blossoms. A trip down to Faranell so he could add his own little touch. Troll's blood, scales off the naga on the coast, eyes off the murlocs. And then the secret ingredient: beer. A keg of Shindigger Stout from Dun Garok.\n\nLydon had some farmers locked upstairs at the inn, and the farmers, he figured, would drink anything. He tainted the keg and I carried it up and set it on their rug, friendly as you like.\n\nThen I went downstairs and had a drink of my own. Not from that keg."] = "苦楚藥劑是林度恩的傑作，要用掉半個希爾斯布萊德才做得出來。泥鼻花朵。跑一趟去找法拉尼爾，讓他加點自己的小巧思。食人妖的血、海岸邊納迦的鱗片、魚人的眼睛。然後是祕密原料：啤酒。一桶來自丹加洛克的狂歡黑啤酒。\n\n林度恩把幾個農夫關在旅店樓上，他認為這些農夫什麼都肯喝。他在酒桶裡動了手腳，我把它扛上樓，放在他們的地毯上，要多友善有多友善。\n\n然後我下樓，自己也喝了一杯。不是那一桶。"
L["Next job for the Society was back home in the Apothecarium, for a fellow named Theodore Griffs. He'd heard about a spider up in the ruins over the city, Witherfang, whose venom eats right through dead flesh. In the Undercity that's not a rumor. That's a job offer.\n\nSo into the Ruins of Lordaeron we went, a few of us, because nobody sane goes in there alone. Witherfang was big and quick and not at all happy to see us. We brought Griffs his Highly Toxic Strain anyway, and he held the vial up to the light like a jeweler.\n\nEverything else I'd fetched them was for killing the living. That one was for the dead. I went up for some air after that, which in the Undercity takes a while."] = "替協會辦的下一件事，是回到老家的煉金區，替一個叫薩多雷·格雷夫的傢伙做事。他聽說城市上方的廢墟裡有一隻蜘蛛，叫枯萎之牙，牠的毒液能直接蝕穿死肉。在幽暗城，這不是傳聞。這是工作機會。\n\n所以我們幾個人進了羅德隆廢墟，因為腦袋正常的人不會一個人進去。枯萎之牙又大又快，見到我們一點都不高興。但我們還是把劇毒菌株帶給了格雷夫，他把小瓶子舉到光下看，像個珠寶商一樣。\n\n我之前替他們拿的每樣東西，都是用來殺活人的。這一樣是對付死人的。之後我上去透了透氣，而在幽暗城，這要走好一段路。"
L["The Agamands owned the mills north of Brill, back when they were alive. They're still there. They just don't run the place anymore.\n\nThe deathguard wanted the grounds cleared, and Coleman Farthing wanted something more personal: the family. Devlin Agamand haunts those mills, and Coleman wanted Devlin's remains, and then the remains of the rest of them, one after another. The whole family, one sack at a time.\n\nColeman had wanted proof of what became of the Agamands. I brought back most of the Agamands. That seemed to settle the question."] = "阿加曼德家族在他們還活著的時候，擁有布瑞爾北邊的那些磨坊。他們現在還在那裡。只是不再管事了。\n\n亡靈衛兵想把那片地清乾淨，而庫勒曼·法席恩想要的比較私人一點：那一家人。代弗林·阿加曼德在那些磨坊裡作祟，庫勒曼要代弗林的遺骸，接著是其他人的遺骸，一個接一個。整個家族，一袋一袋地裝。\n\n庫勒曼想要阿加曼德家族下場如何的證據。我帶回了阿加曼德家族的大部分。這似乎就回答了那個問題。"
L["Somewhere in the middle of it I came across a letter one of the Agamands had written and never got round to delivering. So I delivered it. Late, admittedly. The post in Tirisfal has never been quick."] = "在這中間某個時候，我發現了一封阿加曼德家的人寫好、卻一直沒送出去的信。所以我替他送了。好啦，是晚了點。提里斯法的郵差本來就沒快過。"
L["Coleman sent me on to Magistrate Sevren, and Sevren had heard things about the crypt under the mills. Turns out the Agamands I'd already met weren't the only Agamands. There were older ones down in the dark, generations of them, and not one of them was resting.\n\nSo down I went. Wailing ancestors and rotting ancestors, and the wailing ones are worse. Take my word for it. A rotting ancestor goes down easily enough, but a wailing one stays in your ears for days.\n\nAt the back of it all was Captain Dargol. I brought the captain's skull back to Sevren, and that was the end of the Agamand family's trouble, as far as Brill was concerned. One grave at a time, every one of them left quieter than I found it."] = "庫勒曼把我轉介給執政官塞弗倫，而塞弗倫聽說了磨坊底下那座墓穴的事。原來我之前見過的阿加曼德，並不是全部的阿加曼德。黑暗裡還有更老的，好幾代人，而且沒有一個在安息。\n\n所以我下去了。哀嚎的鬼魂和腐爛的古屍，哀嚎的那種比較糟。相信我。腐爛的古屍很容易打倒，但哀嚎的那種，會在你耳朵裡迴盪好幾天。\n\n這一切的最深處是達高爾隊長。我把隊長的顱骨帶回去給塞弗倫，就布瑞爾而言，阿加曼德家族的麻煩到此為止。一座墳接一座墳，每一座在我離開時都比我來時安靜。"
L["Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze in Auberdine had a scout who'd gone quiet up the coast, near an old tower called Althalaxx. Would I go and look? I went and looked.\n\nThe scout, Balthule Shadowstrike, was fine. Keeping an eye on the tower from a safe distance, which was wise, because the tower was full of warlocks. The Cult of the Dark Strand, they call themselves. Anyone who picks a name like that is hoping you'll ask about it, so I didn't. I took their papers instead. Four worn parchments, which their owners had no more use for.\n\nBalthule didn't like what was written on them. Not one bit. A letter went off to Delgren the Purifier in Ashenvale, and I went with it. Whatever the cult was up to, the tower was only the part you could see from the beach."] = "奧伯丁的哨兵艾麗莎·星風有個斥候在海岸北邊沒了消息，就在一座叫奧薩拉克斯的老塔附近。我能不能去看看？我就去看了。\n\n那個斥候，巴蘇爾·影擊，好好的。在安全的距離外盯著那座塔，這很明智，因為塔裡滿滿都是術士。他們自稱「黑暗之絲」。會取這種名字的人，就是希望你去問，所以我偏不問。我改拿走他們的文件。四張破舊的羊皮紙，反正它們的主人也用不到了。\n\n巴蘇爾不喜歡上面寫的東西。一點都不喜歡。一封信送去給梣谷的淨化者德爾葛蘭，我也跟著信一起去了。不管那個教派在搞什麼，那座塔都只是你從海灘上看得到的那一角而已。"
L["Delgren the Purifier keeps watch at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale, and Delgren read the letter and handed me a list. Soul gems, a tome somebody didn't want to part with, the usual cult leftovers.\n\nThe odd one out was the Highborne. There were souls trapped in Night Run and in Satyrnaar, bound up and waiting for somebody to come along and cut them loose. So I cut them loose. I can't tell you what a Highborne soul does with its freedom, but they didn't hang about to discuss it.\n\nEvery piece I brought back, Delgren said, weakened whatever was holding court at the top of Althalaxx. When there was nothing left to bring, it was back up to Darkshore to tell the scout the time had come."] = "淨化者德爾葛蘭在梣谷的邁斯特拉崗哨站崗，德爾葛蘭讀完信，就塞給我一張清單。靈魂寶石、一本主人不想放手的魔典，都是教派常見的那些殘渣。\n\n比較特別的是上層精靈。夜道谷和薩提納爾裡困著一些靈魂，被綁在那裡，等著有人來替他們鬆綁。所以我替他們鬆綁了。我沒辦法告訴你上層精靈的靈魂重獲自由之後會做什麼，但他們沒留下來跟我討論。\n\n德爾葛蘭說，我帶回來的每一樣東西，都會削弱那個在奧薩拉克斯塔頂坐鎮的東西。等到沒東西可帶了，我就回黑海岸去告訴那個斥候，時候到了。"
L["The Tower of Althalaxx has a great many stairs and a warlock on most of them. Balthule's orders were short: Athrikus Narassin, top of the tower, bring back the head.\n\nSo I took the stairs one at a time and the warlocks the same way. At the top was Narassin, the one who'd gathered the whole Dark Strand there in the first place. All my running about in Ashenvale had taken the edge off whatever power was behind him. There was enough edge left to keep things lively.\n\nI came down with the head and gave it to Balthule, and Balthule sent me straight back to Ashenvale to tell Delgren. That's how it works in those woods, I've learned. Nothing is really finished until somebody in another forest has heard about it."] = "奧薩拉克斯之塔有很多很多階樓梯，大部分的樓梯上都站著一個術士。巴蘇爾的命令很簡短：埃瑟里克斯·納拉辛，塔頂，把頭帶回來。\n\n所以我一階一階地爬，術士也一個一個地收拾。塔頂是納拉辛，當初就是他把整個黑暗之絲召集到那裡的。我在梣谷到處奔波，已經把他背後那股力量磨鈍了不少。不過剩下的鋒利，還足夠讓場面熱鬧一下。\n\n我帶著頭下樓，交給巴蘇爾，巴蘇爾又直接把我送回梣谷去告訴德爾葛蘭。我學到了，那片樹林就是這樣運作的。除非另一座森林裡有人聽說了，否則沒有一件事算真正結束。"
L["Arugal is the reason Silverpine has worgen. Dalar Dawnweaver, down at the Sepulcher, wanted proof the curse was still at work. I could have saved us both some time. Stand in that forest after dark for a minute. That's your proof.\n\nDalar wanted it done properly, though, and properly mostly meant shackles. Shackles off the gluttons, shackles off the darksouls, shackles out of Pyrewood, until I could have opened a smithy. Somewhere along the way there was a thing called the Remedy of Arugal. Judging by the forest, it remedied nothing. And there was Grimson the Pale, whose head I brought back. Paler, by then.\n\nDalar took all of it and looked pleased, in a grim sort of way. Grim is about as pleased as anyone gets in Silverpine."] = "銀松森林會有狼人，就是因為阿魯高。瑟伯切爾的達拉爾·道恩維沃爾想要證明詛咒還在作用。我本來可以替我們兩個省點時間的。天黑之後去那片森林裡站一分鐘。證據就有了。\n\n不過達拉爾想要按部就班，而按部就班大部分的意思就是鐐銬。暴食者身上的鐐銬、魔魂身上的鐐銬、焚木村裡的鐐銬，多到我都可以開一間鐵匠鋪了。途中還有一個叫「阿魯高的解藥」的東西。從這片森林的樣子來看，它什麼都沒解。還有蒼白的格里森，我把他的頭帶了回來。那時候，又更蒼白了一點。\n\n達拉爾全部收下，看起來很滿意，是那種陰沉的滿意。在銀松森林，陰沉大概就是一個人最滿意的樣子了。"
L["Shadow Priest Allister had a different worry: Dalaran. A band of their wizards had settled in at Ambermill, and they had crates moving along the road north of Pyrewood. I helped myself to one. Inside was a pendant scratched all over with runes.\n\nDalar Dawnweaver had a look and decided the wizards were digging into old magic under Silverpine. The kind Dalaran gets very excited about and everybody else comes to regret. Allister wanted more of those pendants, which meant a good few wizards who no longer needed them.\n\nAt the top of it all was the Weaver, Archmage Ataeric. I took his staff off him the direct way and handed it to Allister. Very nice staff. It seemed a shame to hand it over."] = "暗影牧師奧利斯特擔心的是另一件事：達拉然。他們有一群法師在安伯米爾住了下來，還有一些箱子在焚木村北邊的路上運來運去。我自己拿了一箱。裡面是一個刻滿符文的墜飾。\n\n達拉爾·道恩維沃爾看了一眼，判斷那些法師在挖銀松森林底下的古老魔法。就是那種達拉然會非常興奮、而其他所有人最後都會後悔的魔法。奧利斯特想要更多那種墜飾，這代表有好幾個法師從此不再需要它們了。\n\n這一切的頭頭，是大法師阿塔瑞克。我用最直接的方式把他的法杖拿了下來，交給奧利斯特。非常漂亮的法杖。交出去還真有點可惜。"
L["Everything in Silverpine ends up pointing at Shadowfang Keep sooner or later, so I stopped arguing and went in.\n\nEverybody wanted something out of there. The High Executor wanted to know what had become of two missing deathstalkers. A keeper in the Apothecarium wanted a book called the Book of Ur. And Dalar Dawnweaver wanted Arugal's head. Just the head. Dalar was very clear on that.\n\nI found the deathstalkers. Only one of them was in any shape to talk. I found the book. And I found Arugal at the top of his keep, with worgen at every turn on the way up, and he made me work for every step.\n\nThe book went to the Undercity and the head went to the Sepulcher. That's about as tidy as Silverpine ever gets."] = "銀松森林裡的每件事，遲早都會指向影牙城堡，所以我不再爭了，直接走了進去。\n\n每個人都想從裡面拿點什麼。高階執行官想知道兩個失蹤的亡靈哨兵怎麼了。煉金區的一位看守者想要一本叫烏爾之書的書。而達拉爾·道恩維沃爾想要阿魯高的頭。只要頭。達拉爾說得非常清楚。\n\n我找到了亡靈哨兵。其中只有一個還說得出話。我找到了那本書。我也在城堡頂端找到了阿魯高，一路上每個轉角都有狼人，而他讓我每一步都走得很辛苦。\n\n書送去了幽暗城，頭送去了瑟伯切爾。在銀松森林，這大概已經是最整齊俐落的收場了。"
L["High Executor Darthalia runs Tarren Mill like a war room, because it is one. Down in Hillsbrad the humans were still farming and trading as if the Forsaken weren't sitting up the hill, and Darthalia meant to correct that.\n\nFirst orders were the northern farms, with a couple of farmers named outright. Darthalia likes names on a list. After that, the peasants. Grim work. It got done.\n\nThat was the opening move. Darthalia already had the next one picked out."] = "高階執行官達薩利亞把塔倫米爾當成作戰室在經營，因為它本來就是。山下的希爾斯布萊德，人類還在照常種田、做買賣，好像被遺忘者沒坐在山坡上一樣，而達薩利亞打算糾正這一點。\n\n第一道命令是北邊的農場，還直接點名了幾個農夫。達薩利亞喜歡清單上有名字。之後是農民。很陰鬱的工作。工作完成了。\n\n這只是開局。達薩利亞早就挑好了下一步。"
L["Deathguard Samsa had a sideline going too: thirty human skulls. Thirty. Samsa didn't explain, and in Tarren Mill you learn quickly which questions aren't worth the answer."] = "亡靈衛兵沙穆薩也有自己的副業：三十顆人類的頭骨。三十顆。沙穆薩沒解釋，而在塔倫米爾，你很快就會學到哪些問題不值得知道答案。"
L["After the farms, the town. Darthalia took Hillsbrad apart like a clock: the smithy, the town hall, the mine. I walked out of the town hall with the registry under my arm and the proclamation destroyed behind me. Hard to run a town without a smith, a council or its paperwork."] = "農場之後是城鎮。達薩利亞像拆時鐘一樣把希爾斯布萊德拆開：鐵匠鋪、市政廳、礦坑。我夾著戶籍名冊走出市政廳，身後的公告已經被毀了。沒有鐵匠、沒有議會、也沒有文書，一個鎮可很難運作下去。"
L["The best bit, though, was the wanted poster outside the inn in Tarren Mill. Four names on it: a clerk, a citizen, a miner and a farmer, every one of them marked dangerous. A farmer, I can see. A miner, sure. But I'd have paid good money to see the clerk be dangerous."] = "不過最精彩的，是塔倫米爾旅店外面的那張通緝令。上面有四個名字：一個書記員、一個平民、一個礦工和一個農夫，每一個都被標註為危險人物。農夫，我可以理解。礦工，好吧。但書記員能有多危險，我還真願意花大錢去看看。"
L["Dun Garok is a dwarven fort down in the south of the foothills, and it was the last thing standing between Darthalia and a finished campaign. Ten mountaineers, eight riflemen, four priests and Captain Ironhill. The riflemen were the worst of it. Dwarves can shoot, and they've had a lot of practice.\n\nOnce Ironhill fell, Darthalia sealed up a commendation and sent me down to the Undercity to hand it to Varimathras. My own praise, sealed, and not for my eyes. I carried it the whole way without peeking and handed it over with a perfectly straight face.\n\nI like to think it was flattering. I'll never know. That's the trouble with sealed letters. They're all about you, and none of them are for you."] = "丹加洛克是丘陵南邊的一座矮人堡壘，也是達薩利亞完成整場戰役前的最後一道障礙。十個巡山人、八個火槍手、四個牧師，加上鐵山上尉。火槍手最難搞。矮人很會開槍，而且練習的機會多得很。\n\n鐵山一倒，達薩利亞就封好一份嘉獎令，派我下去幽暗城交給瓦里瑪薩斯。誇獎我的話，封起來，還不是給我看的。我一路帶著它，一眼都沒偷看，交出去的時候臉上完全面不改色。\n\n我喜歡想像那是在誇我。我永遠不會知道了。這就是密封信件的麻煩。內容全都在講你，卻沒有一封是給你的。"
L["You'd be amazed what pirates leave lying around. Aboard one of the Bloodsail ships off Stranglethorn's Wild Shore, I came across a little scroll with a riddle on it. Cortello's, it said. No idea who Cortello was. Still haven't.\n\nNow, I know better than to trust verse I find on a pirate ship. But nobody writes a riddle about nothing. There's always something at the bottom of it worth hiding, and I had time on my hands.\n\nI worked it out, more or less, and it sent me all the way to the Swamp of Sorrows, to the first wooden bridge west of Stonard. Under the bridge, in the muck, another scroll. Soggy, of course. It had been living under a bridge in a swamp. I'd be soggy too."] = "你會很驚訝海盜都把什麼東西亂丟。在荊棘谷蠻荒海岸外的一艘血帆海盜船上，我發現一張小卷軸，上面寫著一道謎題。署名科泰羅。完全不知道科泰羅是誰。到現在還是不知道。\n\n說真的，我很清楚不該相信在海盜船上撿到的詩。但沒有人會為了什麼都沒有去寫一道謎題。謎底下面一定藏著什麼值得藏的東西，而我剛好很閒。\n\n我大概解出來了，它把我一路送到悲傷沼澤，斯通納德西邊的第一座木橋。橋下的爛泥裡，又是一張卷軸。濕答答的，當然了。它在沼澤的橋底下住了那麼久。換作是我也會濕答答的。"
L["The soggy scroll had another riddle on it, which by then I'd come to expect, and this one wanted me in Dustwallow Marsh. Over the sea. For a bit of paper. I did wonder on the boat what I was doing with myself.\n\nBloodfen Burrow is raptor country, and the Bloodfen raptors are not shy. They treat anybody poking around their home as dinner that's had the decency to walk in. I'll give Cortello this much: nobody was going to stumble on that hiding place by accident.\n\nDown among the raptors, sure enough, there was another scrap. Musty, this one, like it had been waiting a long time for somebody stubborn enough to turn up. I'm very stubborn about treasure."] = "那張濕答答的卷軸上又是一道謎題，到那時候我已經見怪不怪了，而這道謎題要我去塵泥沼澤。要渡海。就為了一張紙。在船上，我真的有在反省自己到底在幹嘛。\n\n鮮血沼澤墓穴是迅猛龍的地盤，而那裡的迅猛龍一點都不害羞。任何在牠們家附近東翻西找的人，在牠們眼裡都是一頓很有禮貌、自己走進門來的晚餐。這點我得替科泰羅說句話：沒有人會不小心撞見那個藏寶處。\n\n果然，在迅猛龍堆裡還有另一張紙片。這張有霉味，像是已經等了很久，在等一個夠固執的人出現。說到寶藏，我是非常固執的。"
L["The musty scroll was the last of them, and it pointed at the Hinterlands, at the great waterfall on the eastern coast. By then I'd boarded a pirate ship, crawled under a bridge and walked into a raptor den on the strength of a stranger's handwriting. You'd think I'd have learned something. I had not.\n\nUnder the falls, there it was: Cortello's treasure. An actual chest, the kind you hope for as a child and stop believing in once you're grown.\n\nI won't tell you what was in it. Not because it was disappointing. Because I've told this story enough times to know that once you say what's in the chest, everyone stops listening. Cortello paid well for the trouble. Leave it at that."] = "那張發霉的卷軸是最後一張，它指向辛特蘭，東海岸的那座大瀑布。到那時候，我已經憑著一個陌生人的筆跡上過海盜船、爬過橋底、走進迅猛龍的巢穴。你會以為我應該學到點什麼了。並沒有。\n\n瀑布底下，它就在那裡：科泰羅的寶藏。一個貨真價實的寶箱，就是那種你小時候夢想過、長大之後就不再相信的東西。\n\n我不會告訴你們裡面裝了什麼。不是因為令人失望。而是因為這故事我講過夠多次了，我知道一旦說出箱子裡是什麼，大家就不聽了。科泰羅為這番折騰付了很好的報酬。就說到這裡吧。"
L["Marlene Redpath asked me to look in on her niece, Pamela, in Darrowshire. Darrowshire's over in the Eastern Plaguelands, and nobody has lived there in a long time. I went anyway.\n\nPamela was there. A little girl at her old home in the ruins, waiting for her family to come back and very worried about her doll. She was also a ghost. She didn't bring it up, so neither did I.\n\nThe doll had come apart, and the pieces were scattered about the town. I picked through Darrowshire until I had the lot, and for a minute there, with Pamela hugging that doll, I almost forgot where we were standing.\n\nThen she asked me to go and see her Auntie Marlene, and I started to understand how long she'd been waiting."] = "瑪萊恩·雷德帕斯請我去達隆郡看看她的姪女帕米拉。達隆郡在東瘟疫之地，已經很久沒有人住了。我還是去了。\n\n帕米拉在那裡。一個小女孩，待在廢墟裡她的老家，等著家人回來，而且非常擔心她的洋娃娃。她也是一個鬼魂。她沒提，所以我也沒提。\n\n洋娃娃散掉了，碎片散落在鎮上各處。我把達隆郡翻了一遍，直到把所有碎片都找齊，有那麼一會兒，看著帕米拉緊緊抱著那個娃娃，我差點忘了我們站在什麼地方。\n\n然後她請我去看看她的瑪萊恩姑媽，我這才開始明白她到底等了多久。"
L["Pamela's aunt had a job waiting for me: a wedding ring, for a historian who'd been asking around about Darrowshire.\n\nThe historian was Chromie. A gnome, cheerful, and a little too well informed about things that hadn't happened yet. Chromie wanted the Annals of Darrowshire, an old history of the town that took some finding, and once she had it she added to it. Extended, she called it. I didn't ask where the extra pages came from. I'm not sure I'd have liked the answer.\n\nThe extended version went to Pamela's uncle, Carlin Redpath, at Light's Hope Chapel."] = "帕米拉的姑媽已經替我準備好一份差事：一枚結婚戒指，要交給一位一直在打聽達隆郡的史學家。\n\n那位史學家是克羅米。一個地精，很開朗，而且對還沒發生的事知道得有點太清楚了。克羅米想要《達隆郡的歷史》，一本記載這座小鎮的古老史書，費了一番工夫才找到，而她一拿到手，就往裡面加料。她說這叫「全史」。我沒問多出來的那幾頁是從哪裡來的。我不確定我會喜歡那個答案。\n\n增訂版送去了聖光之願禮拜堂，交給帕米拉的叔叔卡林·雷德帕斯。"
L["Carlin wanted Darrowshire's old defenders freed from that town, and I freed fifteen of them. The dead of Darrowshire have waited long enough for everything."] = "卡林想讓達隆郡當年的守衛者從那座小鎮裡解脫，我解脫了其中十五個。達隆郡的死者，等每件事都已經等得夠久了。"
L["Carlin Redpath had the annals now, and Carlin wanted the last battle of Darrowshire put right. Putting it right, it turned out, takes a great many relics off the dead.\n\nA villain's skull and another villain's broken sword. A hero's libram, and the shield of Pamela's father. And five skulls that resonated, which meant sorting through a great many skulls that didn't. Most skulls, it turns out, have nothing to say.\n\nWhen it was all gathered, Carlin wrapped the lot in one bundle and sent me back to Chromie with it. Every hero and villain of that night, packed into one sack on my back. It was heavier than it looked."] = "卡林·雷德帕斯現在有了史書，而卡林想把達隆郡的最後一戰導回正軌。結果所謂導回正軌，需要從死人身上拿走一大堆遺物。\n\n一個惡棍的頭骨，另一個惡棍的斷劍。一位英雄的聖契，還有帕米拉父親的盾牌。另外還要五個會共鳴的顱骨，這代表得在一大堆不會共鳴的顱骨裡翻找。原來大部分的頭骨，都沒什麼話好說。\n\n全部收集齊了之後，卡林把它們包成一大包，要我帶回去給克羅米。那一夜所有的英雄和惡棍，全塞在我背上的一個袋子裡。比看起來重多了。"
L["Chromie sent me back to Darrowshire with the bundle. I set it down in the town square, and the night Darrowshire fell started again all around me. The dead got up. Both sides.\n\nMy job was to keep the right people standing long enough, and mostly that meant Captain Redpath, Pamela's father, who had to hold on until his own corrupted self came to meet him. Then it did. I put it down, and the captain's spirit came walking into the square, himself again.\n\nAfter that I went to see Pamela at her home. For once, somebody had good news for her: her father had come home.\n\nShe gave me the key to his old chest by way of thanks. There was treasure in it. Some stories end well, and I'm not about to argue."] = "克羅米要我把那包東西帶回達隆郡。我把它放在鎮上的廣場，達隆郡淪陷的那一夜，就在我四周重新上演。死者們站了起來。兩邊都是。\n\n我的任務是讓對的人撐得夠久，主要就是雷德帕斯隊長，帕米拉的父親，他得撐到墮落的自己來找他為止。然後它來了。我把它打倒，隊長的靈魂走進了廣場，恢復成原本的他。\n\n在那之後，我去帕米拉家看她。難得一次，有人帶著好消息來找她：她的父親回家了。\n\n她給了我她父親那只舊箱子的鑰匙當作謝禮。裡面有寶物。有些故事有好結局，我可不打算爭辯。"
L["Northshire was supposed to be the quiet part. I'd barely found the abbey before the deputy had me pulling red bandanas off thieves, and every thief had a friend. In the vineyards, across the river, out at the logging camp: same masks, same red. Apparently they have a dress code.\n\nThe best of it was the Collector. A schedule turned up with that name on it, and Marshal Dughan read it and sent me hunting. A thief who goes by the Collector is asking for a certain kind of visitor. The Collector had a ring, and the Collector had my full attention, and only one of those two made it through the day.\n\nThat's a lot of matching masks for a few bandits. Bandits don't coordinate."] = "北郡本來應該是比較平靜的那一段。我才剛找到修道院，副隊長就要我去從盜賊身上扯下紅色頭巾，而每個盜賊都有朋友。葡萄園裡、河對岸、伐木營地那邊：一樣的面罩，一樣的紅色。看來他們有服裝規定。\n\n最精彩的是收貨人。一張時刻表冒了出來，上面寫著這個名字，治安官杜漢讀完就派我去追。一個自稱收貨人的盜賊，根本就是在等某種訪客上門。收貨人有一枚戒指，收貨人也得到了我全部的注意力，而這兩者之中，只有一個撐過了那一天。\n\n幾個土匪戴這麼多一模一樣的面罩，也太多了。土匪是不會互相配合的。"
L["Gryan Stoutmantle counts in fifteens. Fifteen trappers, fifteen smugglers, fifteen pillagers, fifteen looters, fifteen highwaymen, and a few extra so I wouldn't get bored. For a while there, the People's Militia was mostly me.\n\nBest errand of the lot was a note. Gryan sent me to Lakeshire to see someone called Wiley the Black, and Wiley gave me a note. I carried it back to Westfall. Gryan had me carry it on to Mathias Shaw in Stormwind. Shaw had me carry his report back to Westfall. Three zones and four trips for some paper, and nobody once thought to hire a courier. I was the courier.\n\nStill, Shaw's report gave Gryan a name to put to all those masks. That changes a fight."] = "格里安·斯托曼數東西是以十五為單位的。十五個捕獸者、十五個走私者、十五個搶劫者、十五個強奪者、十五個路霸，再加上一些額外的，免得我無聊。有一陣子，西部荒野民兵大部分就是我。\n\n最好玩的差事是一張字條。格里安派我去湖畔鎮找一個叫黑衣威利的人，威利給了我一張字條。我把它帶回西部荒野。格里安又要我把它送去暴風城給馬迪亞斯·肖爾。肖爾又要我把他的報告帶回西部荒野。三個地區、四趟路，就為了幾張紙，而且從來沒有人想到要雇個信差。我就是那個信差。\n\n不過，肖爾的報告讓格里安終於能替那些面罩叫出名字了。這會改變一場仗的打法。"
L["A name's a fine thing, but Gryan wanted an address. So I watched the roads south of Moonbrook until a Defias messenger came strolling along with a letter, and we settled the question of who'd be delivering it. Me. To Gryan.\n\nWhat really helped was the Defias Traitor, who turned up at Sentinel Hill ready to show us where the rest of them were hiding. All it took was walking a turncoat down to Moonbrook alive, and the road to Moonbrook is not a friendly road. I kept the Traitor breathing right up to the hole in the ground they'd been using for a front door.\n\nThe old mine. Of course it was the mine."] = "有名字很好，但格里安想要地址。所以我在月溪鎮南邊的路上守著，直到一個迪菲亞信差拿著一封信晃了過來，然後我們解決了這封信該由誰送的問題。由我送。送給格里安。\n\n真正幫上大忙的是迪菲亞叛徒，他跑到哨兵嶺，準備帶我們去看其他人藏在哪裡。只需要把一個叛徒活著帶到月溪鎮就好，而去月溪鎮的那條路可不友善。我讓那個叛徒一路保持呼吸，直到他們拿來當大門用的那個地洞前面。\n\n那座老礦坑。當然是礦坑。"
L["The Deadmines. You go in expecting a mine, and you get one, and then a goblin foundry, and then a cave so big there's a whole ship sitting in it. A proper ship, cannons and all, under Westfall. Whoever dug that place out knew their trade.\n\nEdwin VanCleef was up on the deck, and he did not go quietly. Gryan wanted his head, and I carried it out into the daylight and all the way up to Sentinel Hill.\n\nThere was a letter on VanCleef, too. Addressed to the City Architect in Stormwind, and never sent. That's another story."] = "死亡礦坑。你走進去，以為會看到一座礦坑，你也確實看到了，然後是一座哥布林鑄造廠，再然後是一個大到整艘船都停在裡面的洞穴。真正的船，大砲什麼的一應俱全，就在西部荒野的地底下。不管是誰挖出那個地方的，都很懂行。\n\n艾德溫·范克里夫站在甲板上，而他沒有乖乖就範。格里安要他的頭，我把它帶出來見了天日，一路帶上哨兵嶺。\n\n范克里夫身上還有一封信。收件人是暴風城的城市建築師，一直沒寄出去。那是另一個故事了。"
L["Shoni the Shilent in Stormwind had asked me to fetch a Gnoam Sprecklesprocket while I was down there. I couldn't tell you what one is. Shoni knew, and Shoni was paying, and that was enough for me."] = "暴風城的沉默的舒尼拜託過我，既然要下去，就順便帶一個「小型高能發動機」回來。那到底是什麼東西，我說不上來。舒尼知道，舒尼付錢，這對我來說就夠了。"
L["VanCleef's letter was for Baros Alexston, the City Architect. Baros had known the Stonemasons back when they were still just masons, and I got the feeling that letter landed somewhere sore. Next thing I knew, I was on my way to the Stockade.\n\nOne of the Brotherhood's leaders, Bazil Thredd, was locked up in there, and the prisoners had picked that moment to riot. The warden wanted it put down and Thredd's head brought out. So in I went: a whole building full of people with nothing to lose and a grudge against anyone holding a key. Thredd was waiting deep in the back. I came out with the head.\n\nThe warden thanked me, and then mentioned, as if it were nothing, that Thredd had had a visitor."] = "范克里夫的信是給城市建築師巴洛斯·艾力克斯頓的。巴洛斯在石匠們還只是石匠的時候就認識他們了，我感覺那封信戳中了某個痛處。下一刻，我就已經在前往監獄的路上了。\n\n兄弟會的首領之一巴基爾·斯瑞德被關在裡面，而囚犯們偏偏挑這個時候暴動。典獄官要我鎮壓暴動，把斯瑞德的頭帶出來。所以我進去了：一整棟樓的人，什麼都沒得輸，對任何拿著鑰匙的人都懷恨在心。斯瑞德在最裡面等著。我帶著頭出來了。\n\n典獄官向我道謝，然後像是在講件小事一樣提到，斯瑞德之前有過一個訪客。"
L["The warden had written down what that visitor looked like and sealed it, and I carried the envelope across Stormwind like it might go off. It went from hand to hand until it reached Shaw, and Shaw told me to look up an old friend.\n\nThe old friend sold cheese. Elling Trias, in the Trade District, behind a counter stacked with wheels of the stuff, and SI:7 the whole time. Half the city has bought cheddar off that man and never known.\n\nTrias sent me up to the castle to meet Tyrion, who had a plan and a little mechanical spy to carry it out. The plan needed silk cloth and two fresh apples. I've been handed some strange shopping lists in my time. That one was for catching a traitor, and it had apples on it."] = "典獄官把那個訪客的長相寫了下來，封好，我捧著那個信封穿過暴風城，好像它隨時會爆炸一樣。它一路轉手，直到交到肖爾手上，而肖爾要我去找一位老朋友。\n\n那位老朋友是賣起司的。伊林·提亞斯，在貿易區，站在一個堆滿整輪起司的櫃台後面，而他從頭到尾都是軍情七處的人。半個城市的人都跟他買過切達起司，卻從來沒發現。\n\n提亞斯要我上城堡去見泰里恩，泰里恩有一個計畫，還有一個小小的機械間諜來執行它。這個計畫需要絲綢和兩顆新鮮的蘋果。我這輩子拿過不少奇怪的購物清單。那一張是用來抓叛徒的，上面卻寫著蘋果。"
L["The spybot did its work, and I ended up crouched in the castle garden, waiting on a meeting. Lord Gregor Lescovar, an actual lord of Stormwind, came out to talk business with Marzon the Silent Blade. For somebody called the Silent Blade, Marzon talked plenty. I let them get it all said.\n\nThen I stood up. Neither of them enjoyed that part.\n\nAfter that the story went up the ladder, one important person at a time, until I was carrying a report into the keep for the king. It started with thieves in a Northshire vineyard. It ended in the royal garden with a lord.\n\nI don't know what the king made of it. I do know there was one fewer lord at dinner."] = "間諜機器人完成了它的工作，最後我蹲在城堡的花園裡，等著一場密會。葛瑞格·萊斯科瓦公爵，貨真價實的暴風城貴族，走出來和沉默之刃馬爾松談生意。以一個叫「沉默之刃」的人來說，馬爾松的話還真多。我讓他們把話全說完。\n\n然後我站了起來。他們兩個都不喜歡這個部分。\n\n在那之後，事情一路往上報，一次一個大人物，直到我拿著一份報告走進要塞去見國王。一切從北郡葡萄園裡的盜賊開始。最後在皇家花園裡，以一位公爵收場。\n\n我不知道國王對這件事怎麼想。我只知道那天晚餐桌上少了一位公爵。"
L["Everybody has a bit of old dungeon armor that's seen better days. I took my bracers to Deliana on the High Seat in Ironforge, and Deliana said they could be a great deal better. All it would cost was the bracers, twenty gold, and fifteen blood samples out of Winterspring.\n\nI paid, and they came back better. Fair's fair. But Deliana wasn't done with me. There was a sealed container of blood that needed to go to a goblin called Mux Manascrambler, all the way down in Gadgetzan, and somehow I was already the one carrying it.\n\nAn earnest proposition, they call this sort of thing. In my experience, earnest means long."] = "每個人都有一件見過更好日子的地城舊護甲。我把我的護腕拿去鐵爐堡至高王座找德莉娜，德莉娜說它們可以變得好很多。代價只有那副護腕、二十金幣，以及冬泉谷的十五份血液樣本。\n\n我付了，護腕回來時確實變好了。公平交易。但德莉娜還沒放過我。有一個封好的血液容器，要送去給一個叫莫克斯·施法者的哥布林，遠在加基森，而不知道為什麼，拿著它的人已經是我了。\n\n他們管這種事叫「誠摯的建議」。依我的經驗，誠摯的意思就是很長。"
L["Everybody has a bit of old dungeon armor that's seen better days. I took my bracers to Mokvar in Orgrimmar, and Mokvar said they could be a great deal better. All it would cost was the bracers, twenty gold, and fifteen venom samples out of Silithus, which are about as much fun to collect as they sound.\n\nI paid, and they came back better. Fair's fair. But Mokvar wasn't done with me. There was a sealed container of venom that needed to go to a goblin called Mux Manascrambler, down in Gadgetzan, and somehow I was already the one carrying it.\n\nAn earnest proposition, they call this sort of thing. In my experience, earnest means long."] = "每個人都有一件見過更好日子的地城舊護甲。我把我的護腕拿去奧格瑪找莫克瓦，莫克瓦說它們可以變得好很多。代價只有那副護腕、二十金幣，以及希利蘇斯的十五份毒液樣本，收集起來就跟聽起來一樣好玩。\n\n我付了，護腕回來時確實變好了。公平交易。但莫克瓦還沒放過我。有一個封好的毒液容器，要送去給一個叫莫克斯·施法者的哥布林，在加基森，而不知道為什麼，拿著它的人已經是我了。\n\n他們管這種事叫「誠摯的建議」。依我的經驗，誠摯的意思就是很長。"
L["Mux Manascrambler is a goblin with a plan, and a goblin's plan always starts with your money. Forty gold and a cartload of reagents bought me the Ectoplasmic Distiller, and then I had to go out and use it on ghosts in three different corners of the world. Ghosts do not enjoy being distilled.\n\nThe best part was the shifty merchant: an imp in a cave in Winterspring, selling Fel Elemental Rods. Doing business with an imp is exactly as much fun as it sounds. I counted my fingers afterward.\n\nOut of all of it came the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer. I carried it home, and my belt and gloves got the same treatment the bracers had. Just compensation, they called it. I'd call it a start."] = "莫克斯·施法者是個有計畫的哥布林，而哥布林的計畫永遠從你的錢開始。四十金幣加上一整車的施法材料，換來了外膜蒸餾器，然後我得帶著它，到世界上三個不同的角落去對鬼魂使用。鬼魂一點都不喜歡被蒸餾。\n\n最精彩的是那個狡猾的商人：冬泉谷一個洞穴裡的小鬼，在賣惡魔元素魔棒。跟小鬼做生意，就跟聽起來一樣好玩。事後我數了數手指。\n\n這一切最後換來了超空間靈體顯像機。我把它帶回家，我的腰帶和手套也得到了跟護腕一樣的待遇。他們管這叫「公平的補償」。我會說這只是個開始。"
L["The Ghost Revealer, it turns out, works. I switched it on at the gates of Stratholme, and there stood Anthion Harmon, dead and waiting, with a plea. Baron Rivendare had Ysida Harmon somewhere inside, and time was short.\n\nSo we ran Stratholme. Not walked. Ran, through the whole rotten city to the Baron himself, and we got there in time. Ysida gave me a locket to carry out, so Anthion would know it was true.\n\nThe dead don't stay sentimental for long when there's work left. Next thing I knew, Anthion had me fetching iron, leather and cloth for a banner, and the unfinished banner was going to an old friend of his in Dire Maul. These jobs never get shorter."] = "結果靈體顯像機真的有用。我在斯坦索姆的大門口打開它，安希恩·哈莫就站在那裡，已經死了，在等人，還帶著一個請求。瑞文戴爾男爵把亞希達·哈莫關在裡面某個地方，時間不多了。\n\n所以我們衝進了斯坦索姆。不是用走的。是用跑的，穿過整座腐爛的城市，直衝男爵本人，而且我們及時趕到了。亞希達交給我一個墜子盒帶出去，好讓安希恩知道這是真的。\n\n只要還有工作沒做完，死人就不會感傷太久。下一刻，安希恩就要我去拿鐵、皮革和布料做一面旗幟，而那面還沒完成的旗幟，要送去給他在厄運之槌的一位老朋友。這種工作永遠不會變短。"
L["Anthion's old friend was Falrin Treeshaper, in the library at Dire Maul. Falrin looked at the unfinished banner and agreed to help, right after a small matter of ogres. Falrin has a vendetta. I never got the whole story. I got a number, twenty-five, and that's how many warbeads I took off ogres before Falrin was satisfied.\n\nAn enchantment and some more shopping later, I was holding the Banner of Provocation, which is exactly what it sounds like. Plant it in the right place and somebody comes looking for a fight.\n\nFalrin even had the place picked out: the Ring of Law, in Blackrock Depths. Some people send flowers."] = "安希恩的老朋友是法琳·樹形者，在厄運之槌的圖書館裡。法琳看了看那面未完成的旗幟，答應幫忙，不過要先處理一點跟巨魔有關的小事。法琳跟巨魔有仇。整個故事我始終沒聽全。我只拿到一個數字，二十五，那就是我得從巨魔身上拿走多少戰爭串珠，法琳才會滿意。\n\n一個附魔外加又一輪採買之後，我手上拿著挑釁旗幟，作用就跟名字一模一樣。把它插在對的地方，就會有人來找你打架。\n\n法琳連地點都挑好了：黑石深淵的秩序競技場。有些人送的是花。"
L["Here's how you pick a fight in the Ring of Law on purpose. You walk into Blackrock Depths, let the Dark Irons sentence you, and while they're at it you plant the Banner of Provocation in the middle of the ring.\n\nTheldren took the hint. Theldren and his whole team of gladiators, all at once, while the crowd cheered for anybody but me. We beat them anyway. Theldren had been carrying the top piece of an amulet that once belonged to a Lord Valthalak. That name would come up again. Often.\n\nAnthion had a few parting words for me after that, and then it was home, where my boots, trousers and mantle got their turn."] = "在秩序競技場裡故意挑起一場架，方法是這樣的。你走進黑石深淵，讓黑鐵矮人判你的罪，趁他們在宣判的時候，把挑釁旗幟插在競技場正中央。\n\n瑟爾倫懂了這個暗示。瑟爾倫和他整支角鬥士隊伍，一次全上，觀眾則是替我以外的任何人歡呼。我們還是打贏了。瑟爾倫身上帶著一塊護符的上半部，那護符曾經屬於一位叫瓦薩拉克的領主。這個名字之後還會再出現。很常出現。\n\n在那之後，安希恩跟我說了幾句道別的話，然後我就回家了，這次輪到我的靴子、褲子和肩甲。"
L["Back home they pointed me at Blackrock Mountain, Ghost Revealer in hand. Somewhere near the Spire, they said, I'd find somebody. I switched it on, and there was Bodley. Dead, like most of my acquaintances that season, and with a great deal to say about Lord Valthalak.\n\nWhat it came down to was fire. Three kings of flame, Bodley called them. I fetched a piece of each, and a hallowed brazier to hold them, and brought the lot back to a ghost inside a mountain.\n\nWhat came out of that was a brazier for calling up the dead. Bodley seemed to think that was good news. Bodley's standards have changed."] = "回到家，他們把我指向黑石山，手上拿著靈體顯像機。他們說，在黑石塔附近某個地方，我會找到某個人。我打開它，布德利就在那裡。死了，就跟那陣子我認識的大部分人一樣，而且對瓦薩拉克有一大堆話要說。\n\n說到底，關鍵是火。布德利管他們叫烈焰三巨頭。我從每一位身上各拿了一樣東西，再加上一個用來裝它們的神聖火盆，全部帶回去給山裡的一個鬼魂。\n\n結果做出來的是一個用來召喚死者的火盆。布德利似乎覺得這是好消息。布德利的標準已經變了。"
L["Theldren had given me the top of Lord Valthalak's amulet. Bodley wanted the left and the right, and there's only one way to get them. Bodley names some old relic, you fetch it, and you light the brazier in the right dungeon. Somebody long dead comes out of it, angry, carrying a piece of the amulet. You kill them again. Then you do the whole thing over for the other side.\n\nSomewhere in the middle, Bodley gave me a long look and announced, I see Alcaz Island in your future. Bodley was right. Twenty bloodkelp, off the naga out there.\n\nI never did find out what a ghost wants with twenty bloodkelp."] = "瑟爾倫給了我瓦薩拉克護符的上半部。布德利要左邊和右邊，而要拿到它們只有一個辦法。布德利說出某件古老的遺物，你去拿來，然後在對的地城裡點燃火盆。某個死了很久的人會從裡面出來，很生氣，身上帶著一塊護符。你再殺他一次。然後為了另一邊，整個重來一遍。\n\n在這中間某個時候，布德利盯著我看了好久，然後宣布：「我看見你的未來有奧卡茲島。」布德利說對了。二十份血巨藻，從那邊的納迦身上拿。\n\n我始終沒搞懂一個鬼魂要二十份血巨藻幹嘛。"
L["With the amulet whole again, Bodley wanted it used. A Flask of Supreme Power and a sack of Blackrock bracers later, I was in Upper Blackrock Spire, in the Beast's old room, lighting the brazier one last time.\n\nLord Valthalak answered. Lord Valthalak was not happy to be called. We put him down, and then came the strangest part of the whole business: I held his own amulet over his corpse, then handed it to his ghost, who sent me back to Bodley.\n\nBodley called this part Mea Culpa. I took it for an apology. Bodley's, not mine."] = "護符拼回完整之後，布德利想要用它。一瓶超級能量精煉藥水加上一袋黑石護腕之後，我來到了黑石塔上層，在比斯巨獸的舊房間裡，最後一次點燃火盆。\n\n瓦薩拉克回應了。瓦薩拉克一點都不高興被召喚。我們把他打倒，然後是整件事裡最奇怪的部分：我拿著他自己的護符，舉在他的屍體上方，再把它交給他的鬼魂，他的鬼魂又把我送回去找布德利。\n\n布德利把這一段叫做「認錯」。我理解成是一種道歉。是布德利的，不是我的。"
L["The last stop was the first one. I went back to where all of this started, with the cap and tunic of my old set, and handed them over. Saving the best for last, apparently.\n\nWhat came back finished the set. To anyone else it's just good armor. But I know what's in it: a goblin's ghost machine, a race through Stratholme, a brawl in the Ring of Law, and one dead lord who got his amulet back from my own hand.\n\nPeople ask where I got it. I tell them it's a long story. Then, if they're buying, I tell them this one."] = "最後一站，就是第一站。我回到這一切開始的地方，帶著舊套裝的頭盔和外衣，把它們交了出去。看來是把最好的留到最後。\n\n拿回來的東西，讓整套裝備湊齊了。在別人眼裡，這只是一套好護甲。但我知道裡面有什麼：一個哥布林的抓鬼機器、一場斯坦索姆的賽跑、秩序競技場裡的一場混戰，還有一位死掉的領主，從我手上拿回了他自己的護符。\n\n有人問我這套是從哪裡來的。我告訴他們，說來話長。然後，如果他們請客，我就講這個故事。"
L["Darkshire keeps its lamps lit all night, every night, and after a while there you stop thinking that's odd. Commander Althea Ebonlocke runs the Night Watch, and the Night Watch was short on everything except work.\n\nThe work was Raven Hill Cemetery, where the dead had stopped staying put. Skeletons of every kind: warriors, mages, fiends, horrors, and the names don't get any friendlier. The worst of it was the eastern mausoleum. Twenty plague spreaders, in the dark, in a crypt, and every one of them living up to the name.\n\nI came out filthy, and the commander nodded at me like I'd done a decent day's work. In Darkshire that's practically a parade."] = "夜色鎮的燈每晚都亮一整夜，待久了，你就不會覺得這有什麼奇怪的。指揮官阿勒泰婭·埃伯洛克負責守夜人，而守夜人什麼都缺，就是不缺工作。\n\n工作是烏鴉嶺墓園，那裡的死人已經不肯乖乖待著了。各式各樣的骷髏：戰士、法師、惡魔、恐怖之物，名字一個比一個不友善。最糟的是東邊的陵墓。二十隻瘟疫食屍鬼，在黑暗裡，在墓穴裡，每一隻都名副其實。\n\n我出來的時候渾身髒兮兮的，指揮官對我點了點頭，好像我做了一天還算像樣的工作。在夜色鎮，這幾乎等於是遊行慶祝了。"
L["Sven Yorgen's family was murdered, and what Sven wanted was a name. Somebody had buried a book behind an old stump on his farm, and I spent a good while showing it around Darkshire. The clues, once I had them all: not from around here, nervous, jittery, gone west. I found him out past town. Folks call him Jitters. Some people just make it easy.\n\nOnce Jitters had finished that journal, we had our name. Morbent Fel, a necromancer out at Raven Hill. Getting at Morbent took a special weapon, and the weapon took a tour of its own: a bishop in Stormwind, a shipwreck in the Wetlands, a forge back in Stormwind. Morbent's Bane, they called it.\n\nMorbent took one look at it and stopped being difficult."] = "斯溫·猶根的家人被殺了，而斯溫想要的是一個名字。有人在他農場的一個老樹樁後面埋了一本書，我花了好一段時間拿著它在夜色鎮到處問。等線索全部到手：不是本地人、很緊張、神經兮兮、往西走了。我在鎮外找到了他。大家都叫他基特斯。有些人就是讓事情變得很簡單。\n\n等基特斯把那本日記的事交代完，我們就有了名字。摩本特·費爾，一個在烏鴉嶺的死靈法師。要對付摩本特，需要一把特別的武器，而那把武器自己也跑了一大圈：暴風城的一位主教、濕地的一艘沉船、再回到暴風城的一座熔爐。他們管它叫摩本特的剋星。\n\n摩本特看了它一眼，就不再難搞了。"
L["Sirra Von'Indi keeps a library in Darkshire, and Sirra had noticed what nobody else had bothered to: Raven Hill's history had died along with its people. I went poking through the ruins and came back with a tome about a family called Valor. Heroes, the whole lot of them. Dead heroes, which in Duskwood means they're still around.\n\nThere were four of them, each one had left a weapon behind, and every weapon came with a chore. One wanted a mace back from a skeleton that had walked off with it. The others wanted Defias, worgs and ogres seen to. Heroes to the last, and still handing out work."] = "希拉·沃寧迪在夜色鎮管一間圖書館，而希拉注意到了一件沒人費心去注意的事：烏鴉嶺的歷史，跟它的居民一起死了。我跑去廢墟裡翻找，帶回一本關於一個叫維洛的家族的書。全都是英雄。死掉的英雄，而在暮色森林，這代表他們還在附近。\n\n他們一共四個，每個人都留下了一把武器，而每把武器都附帶一件差事。一個要我從一具骷髏身上把他的錘子拿回來，那骷髏帶著錘子跑了。其他幾個要我處理迪菲亞、座狼和巨魔。英雄到最後一刻，還在發派工作。"
L["None of it put them to rest. So I carried the family's weapons back to Raven Hill, to find out what single night had pinned them all there."] = "這些都沒能讓他們安息。所以我把這家人的武器帶回烏鴉嶺，想弄清楚到底是哪一個夜晚，把他們全都釘在了那裡。"
L["North of Raven Hill there's a grave so weathered you can hardly read it. I asked around Darkshire whose it was, and the librarian knew. Morgan Ladimore. It's a sad story, and I'll leave the telling of it to the people who live there. The short of it: something called Mor'Ladim walks the woods near that grave, and the commander of the Night Watch wanted him gone for good.\n\nI brought back his skull. Then the commander told me the rest. One of Ladimore's children had lived, and she was right there in Darkshire, standing watch. Sarah Ladimore.\n\nSarah heard me out, then gave me a ring and asked me to leave it on her father's grave. So I walked back up the hill and did.\n\nSome errands you don't make jokes about. That's one."] = "烏鴉嶺北邊有一座墳，風化得幾乎看不清上面的字。我在夜色鎮到處問那是誰的，圖書館員知道。摩根·拉迪莫爾。那是個悲傷的故事，就留給住在那裡的人去講吧。簡單來說：有個叫摩拉迪姆的東西在那座墳附近的樹林裡遊蕩，而守夜人的指揮官想讓他永遠消失。\n\n我帶回了他的頭骨。然後指揮官告訴我剩下的事。拉迪莫爾有一個孩子活了下來，她就在夜色鎮，正在站崗。莎拉·拉迪莫爾。\n\n莎拉聽我說完，然後給了我一枚戒指，請我把它放在她父親的墳上。所以我又走回山上，照做了。\n\n有些差事，你不會拿來開玩笑。這就是其中之一。"
L["Madame Eva had a vision, and the vision had a name in it. Stalvan. That one word cost me a walk across half the kingdom.\n\nStalvan himself was hard to find. His paperwork was everywhere. A town registry, a footlocker in a Westfall schoolhouse, a letter that never got delivered, a crate of somebody's old things down in the Stormwind canals, a chest upstairs in a marshal's house in Elwynn. Every one of them held a page, and every page was worse than the last. A faded one. A muddy one. A bloody one.\n\nIt ended at Mistmantle Manor with Stalvan Mistmantle, who didn't want visitors. I brought his family ring back to Madame Eva. Eva didn't look surprised. I doubt anything surprises her."] = "伊瓦夫人看見了一個幻象，幻象裡有一個名字。斯塔文。就這麼兩個字，害我走遍了半個王國。\n\n斯塔文本人很難找。他的文件倒是到處都是。一本鎮上的名冊、西部荒野一間學校裡的一個小箱子、一封從沒送出去的信、暴風城運河區裡一箱不知道誰的舊東西、艾爾文森林一位元帥家樓上的一個箱子。每一處都藏著一頁，而每一頁都比上一頁更糟。一頁褪色的。一頁沾泥的。一頁沾血的。\n\n最後在密斯特曼托莊園，見到了不想要訪客的斯塔文·密斯特曼托。我把他的家傳戒指帶回去給伊瓦夫人。伊瓦看起來一點都不意外。我懷疑有什麼事能讓她意外。"
L["Duskwood has worgen. Of course it does. The Nightbane prowl Brightwood Grove and the Rotting Orchard, and someone in Darkshire called Calor keeps count of them.\n\nCalor started me on the shadow weavers, which are worgen who cast spells, which is a thing I'd been happier not knowing about. After that it was runners and fangs and whatever else the pack could spare, and every trip out, the woods got a little quieter and I got a little choosier about where I put my back.\n\nWhen it was done, Calor wrote me a note for Master Carevin. I'd been on trial the whole time without being told. Seems I passed. The reward for passing was being trusted with more worgen."] = "暮色森林有狼人。當然有。夜行狼人在亮木樹林和腐爛果園裡出沒，而夜色鎮有個叫卡洛爾的人一直在算牠們的數量。\n\n卡洛爾讓我先從織影狼人開始，那是會施法的狼人，這種事我寧可不要知道。之後是跑得快的、牙尖的，還有狼群捨得派出來的其他各種，每出去一趟，林子就安靜一點，而我對自己背對著哪裡也挑剔了一點。\n\n全部結束之後，卡洛爾寫了一張字條要我交給卡爾文大師。原來我一直在接受考驗，只是沒人告訴我。看來我通過了。通過的獎勵，是被託付更多的狼人。"
L["Up past the Raven Hill cemetery, in a shack, lives an old hermit called Abercrombie. Lonely sort, you'd think. Wanted a few things from town, and I was glad to help.\n\nHere's what he wanted. Thread spun from ghost hair. Zombie juice. A pile of ghoul ribs. Looking back, the ghoul ribs were a hint.\n\nThen he gave me a letter for the mayor, and the mayor couldn't read it. It had to be translated, and not long after the mayor read it properly, something called Stitches came lurching down the road toward Darkshire. Abercrombie had been building company.\n\nThere was a bride, too. Eliza, out in the cemetery. Eliza had the Embalmer's heart, so I took it off her and brought it to the mayor. Courting in Duskwood is a grim business."] = "在烏鴉嶺墓園再過去一點，有間破屋，住著一個叫亞伯克隆比的老隱士。你會以為是個寂寞的人。他想要鎮上的幾樣東西，我很樂意幫忙。\n\n他要的是這些。用鬼魂頭髮紡成的線。殭屍汁。一堆食屍鬼的肋骨。現在回頭看，食屍鬼肋骨就是個暗示。\n\n然後他給了我一封要交給鎮長的信，鎮長看不懂。得找人翻譯，而在鎮長真正讀懂之後沒多久，一個叫縫合怪的東西就搖搖晃晃地沿著大路朝夜色鎮走來。亞伯克隆比一直在替自己打造伴兒。\n\n還有一位新娘。伊莉莎，在墓園裡。伊莉莎身上有藏屍者的心臟，所以我從她那裡拿走，交給了鎮長。在暮色森林談戀愛，是件陰森的事。"
L["There's a ghost on the road where the Swamp of Sorrows gives way to the Blasted Lands. The Fallen Hero of the Horde, they call him, and his is a sorry tale. He took his soldiers toward the Blasted Lands and waited for orders. The orders never came.\n\nStonard knew the story. A few questions there, and I knew where the orders had actually gone: out to the murloc camps, into the keeping of something called the Swamp Talker. I went and took them back. The Warchief's own orders, long overdue and a bit damp.\n\nI carried them to the ghost. A dead man, finally reading the orders he'd waited for. I let him have a minute."] = "在悲傷沼澤過渡到詛咒之地的那條路上，有一個鬼魂。他們叫他部落英雄的靈魂，他的故事很悲慘。他帶著他的士兵往詛咒之地去，然後等待命令。命令始終沒來。\n\n斯通納德的人知道這個故事。在那裡問了幾個問題，我就知道命令實際上跑到哪裡去了：送到了魚人的營地，落進一個叫沼澤空談者的東西手裡。我去把它拿了回來。大酋長親自下的命令，遲到了很久，而且有點濕。\n\n我把命令帶給那個鬼魂。一個死人，終於讀到了他一直在等的命令。我讓他靜靜待了一會兒。"
L["An ambassador at Nethergarde Keep had an errand for me I didn't see coming: go and talk to a Horde ghost. With demons camped on the doorstep, I suppose the old squabbles can wait.\n\nThe Fallen Hero of the Horde stands where the swamp gives way to the Blasted Lands, and he told me all of it. Soldiers who crossed over, and what Razelikh the Defiler's people did with them after. Out there the dead don't get to rest. They get bound to stones and put to work.\n\nSo he gave me a job: set them loose, eighteen of them, at the Stones of Binding. You have to stay right by the stone while you work or it all comes apart, and fighting well while rooted to one spot is harder than it sounds.\n\nOdd work for the Alliance. The dead don't seem to mind whose colors you wear."] = "守望堡的一位大使交給我一件我完全沒料到的差事：去跟一個部落的鬼魂談談。惡魔都在家門口紮營了，我想那些陳年舊怨可以先放一邊。\n\n部落英雄的靈魂站在沼澤過渡到詛咒之地的地方，他把一切都告訴了我。那些越過邊界的士兵，以及污染者拉瑟萊克的手下後來怎麼處置他們。在那裡，死者沒辦法安息。他們被綁在石頭上，被迫做工。\n\n所以他給了我一份工作：在束縛之石那裡把他們放出來，十八個。工作的時候你得一直待在石頭旁邊，不然整個儀式就會散掉，而被釘在同一個地方還要打得好，比聽起來難多了。\n\n替聯盟做這種事挺奇怪的。不過死人似乎不在乎你穿的是誰的顏色。"
L["With the orders read, the Fallen Hero told me the rest of it. What happened to the soldiers who crossed into the Blasted Lands, and what Razelikh the Defiler's people did with them after. Out there the dead don't get to rest. They get bound to stones and put to work.\n\nSo he gave me a job: set them loose, eighteen of them, at the Stones of Binding. The catch is that you have to stay close to the stone while you work, or the whole thing comes apart. Nobody tells you how hard it is to fight well while rooted to one spot.\n\nWhen it was done, he didn't thank me, exactly. He started remembering names."] = "命令讀完之後，部落英雄的靈魂把剩下的事告訴了我。那些越過邊界進入詛咒之地的士兵發生了什麼事，以及污染者拉瑟萊克的手下後來怎麼處置他們。在那裡，死者沒辦法安息。他們被綁在石頭上，被迫做工。\n\n所以他給了我一份工作：在束縛之石那裡把他們放出來，十八個。麻煩的是，工作的時候你得一直待在石頭附近，不然整個儀式就會散掉。沒人會告訴你，被釘在同一個地方還要打得好有多難。\n\n結束之後，他也沒有真的道謝。他開始想起一些名字。"
L["Once the stones were quiet, the Fallen Hero gave me a name: Corporal Thund Splithoof, one of his own. Thund was waiting near the road into the Blasted Lands, with a spectral lockbox and something inside it for me. The dead, it turns out, pay their debts.\n\nThe second name was Lieutenant Kirith. Find out what became of Kirith, the Fallen Hero said. So I went looking, and out at the Serpent's Coil I found what was left: a spirit, with news.\n\nI carried the news back to the road. The Fallen Hero took it in, and then said two words I didn't expect from an old soldier of the Horde. Demon hunter."] = "石頭安靜下來之後，部落英雄的靈魂給了我一個名字：桑德·裂蹄下士，他自己的人。桑德在通往詛咒之地的路旁等著，帶著一個幽靈保險箱，裡面有東西要給我。原來死人也會還債。\n\n第二個名字是基利斯中尉。去查查基利斯怎麼了，部落英雄的靈魂說。所以我去找了，在盤蛇谷找到了剩下的部分：一個靈魂，帶著消息。\n\n我把消息帶回那條路上。部落英雄的靈魂聽完，然後說出了兩個我沒想到會從一個部落老兵嘴裡聽到的詞。惡魔獵人。"
L["The demon hunter was Loramus Thalipedes, who lives on the coast of Azshara by the Bay of Storms. Loramus told me his story, then worked a spell of enlightenment while I stood there waiting, and when it was done I understood the problem. Razelikh is warded, and getting through that ward takes the beast's name.\n\nThe name came by way of a temple down by the water, whose lord wanted Hetaera dead first and the heads brought as proof. All three of them. Bloodied, beaten and bruised, which tells you how that fight went.\n\nLast came twenty chunks of Azsharite, hidden all over southern Azshara, and a felhound to sniff them out. Best partner I had that year. Never said a word."] = "那個惡魔獵人是洛拉姆斯·薩里比迪斯，住在艾薩拉的海岸邊，風暴海灣旁。洛拉姆斯跟我講了他的故事，然後在我站著等的時候施了一個啟迪法術，等法術結束，我就明白問題在哪了。拉瑟萊克有結界保護，而要穿過那道結界，得知道那頭野獸的名字。\n\n名字是透過水邊的一座神殿得來的，神殿的領主要我先殺掉赫泰拉，再把頭帶回去當證據。三顆頭全部都要。沾血的、挨揍的、瘀青的，你應該猜得出那場仗是怎麼打的。\n\n最後是二十塊艾薩拉水晶，藏在艾薩拉南部各處，還有一隻地獄犬幫我把它們嗅出來。那是我那一年最棒的搭檔。一句話都沒說過。"
L["The demon hunter packed the Azsharite into a shipment and sent me off with it to Galvan the Ancient, in northern Stranglethorn. That's one end of the world to the other, near enough, hauling a crate of crystal somebody had very particular plans for.\n\nGalvan is called the Ancient for a reason, and nobody hurries Galvan. I stood by while the forge did its work, and what came out of the fire was Felbane, made for the one job ordinary steel can't do. Razelikh's lieutenants can't be killed by anything else.\n\nThen I carried it all the way back to the Blasted Lands, to the Fallen Hero on his road. I'd like to think it was the first good news he'd had since he died."] = "惡魔獵人把艾薩拉水晶打包成一批貨，要我送去荊棘谷北部給加爾文。這差不多是從世界的一頭到另一頭，扛著一箱有人對它有非常特定計畫的水晶。\n\n加爾文被稱為「古老者」，不是沒有原因的，而沒有人能催加爾文。我在一旁等著熔爐做它的工作，從火裡出來的是邪能剋星，專為一件普通鋼鐵做不到的事而打造。拉瑟萊克的副官們，除了它之外什麼都殺不死。\n\n然後我一路把它帶回詛咒之地，交給路上的部落英雄的靈魂。我很願意相信，那是他死後聽到的第一個好消息。"
L["Razelikh kept three lieutenants, and each of them wore a piece of a shattered amulet. None of them could die until Felbane had weakened them, and the weapons only had so much in them. Use them wisely, the Fallen Hero said. I did. Mostly.\n\nThree pieces made one, and with that I went up the Rise of the Defiler to see the demon himself. The Fallen Hero had a name for him by then. Rakh'likh.\n\nI came back with the demon's severed horn, and the Ward of the Defiler with it, so the Fallen Hero could destroy that ward before it fell into the wrong hands. He didn't get his soldiers back. He got the horn."] = "拉瑟萊克手下有三個副官，每一個都戴著一塊碎裂護符的碎片。在邪能剋星削弱他們之前，他們沒有一個死得了，而那些武器的力量是有限的。部落英雄的靈魂說，要省著用。我省著用了。大致上啦。\n\n三塊碎片合而為一，我帶著它走上褻瀆者高地，去見那個惡魔本尊。那時候部落英雄的靈魂已經知道他的名字了。拉克利克。\n\n我帶著惡魔被砍下的角回來，還有污染者防護結界，好讓部落英雄的靈魂能在結界落入壞人手中之前把它摧毀。他沒能找回他的士兵。他得到了那支角。"
L["It started as the oddest little job. A troll in Steamwheedle Port named Yeh'kinya handed me a bramble and sent me to Feralas to catch ghosts. Not big ghosts. Screecher ghosts. Find a dead screecher, use the bramble, and its spirit comes along with you.\n\nThree of them, that's all he wanted. I brought them back, and whatever those spirits told him, he liked it. It had to do with an old troll prophecy.\n\nI remember thinking, what does a dead screecher know about prophecy? More than I did, as it turned out. That was the first thread. I had no idea how much was tied to the other end of it."] = "一開始是一件很奇怪的小差事。熱砂港一個叫葉基亞的食人妖遞給我一根荊棘，派我去菲拉斯抓鬼。不是什麼大鬼。是尖嘯者的鬼。找到一隻死掉的尖嘯者，用那根荊棘，牠的靈魂就會跟著你走。\n\n三隻，他就只要這樣。我把牠們帶回去，不管那些靈魂跟他說了什麼，他都很喜歡。這跟一個古老的食人妖預言有關。\n\n我記得當時心想，一隻死掉的尖嘯者對預言能知道些什麼？結果比我知道的還多。那是第一條線頭。我完全不知道線的另一端綁著多少東西。"
L["The prophecy, it turned out, was written on tablets, and the tablets were in Zul'Farrak. Where else. Sand, heat, sand trolls, more sand. I brought two of them back and Yeh'kinya read them like a letter from home.\n\nThe tablets spoke of an ancient egg from the days of the old troll empires, and that egg sat in a cave at the top of Jintha'Alor, with every Vilebranch in the Hinterlands between me and it. I went up. I came down with the egg. The Vilebranch had a lot to say about that, most of it at the tops of their voices.\n\nYeh'kinya held it like a newborn. I've seen parents with less care."] = "原來預言寫在石板上，而石板在祖爾法拉克。不然還能在哪。沙子、高溫、沙地食人妖，還有更多沙子。我帶回了兩塊，葉基亞讀它們的樣子，就像在讀家書一樣。\n\n石板提到一顆來自古代食人妖帝國時期的古老之卵，而那顆卵就放在辛薩羅山頂的一個洞穴裡，我和它之間隔著辛特蘭所有的邪枝食人妖。我上去了。我帶著卵下來了。邪枝食人妖對此有很多話要說，大部分是用吼的。\n\n葉基亞抱著它，像抱著一個新生兒。我見過一些父母都沒那麼小心。"
L["Then Yeh'kinya told me what the egg was for. It was a vessel, and he wanted it filled. With Hakkar.\n\nSo down into the Temple of Atal'Hakkar I went, the sunken one in the Swamp of Sorrows, and not alone, because that place doesn't take visitors one at a time. At the very bottom, in the Sanctum of the Fallen God, the Avatar of Hakkar rose up to meet us. Big. Winged. Furious. We put it down, I used the egg, and the egg drank in the essence of a god like dry ground takes rain.\n\nI carried it back to Tanaris in my pack, between my bedroll and my supper, and felt it the whole way.\n\nLooking back, that was the moment to start asking questions. I didn't. It was a very nice egg."] = "然後葉基亞告訴我那顆卵是用來幹嘛的。它是一個容器，而他想把它裝滿。用哈卡。\n\n所以我下到了阿塔哈卡神廟，就是悲傷沼澤裡那座沉沒的神廟，而且不是一個人，因為那地方不接待一次只來一位的訪客。在最底層的墮落之神的聖所裡，哈卡的化身升起來迎接我們。很大。有翅膀。暴怒。我們把它打倒，我用了那顆卵，而那顆卵吸進了一位神的精華，就像乾涸的土地吸進雨水。\n\n我把它裝在背包裡帶回塔納利斯，夾在我的鋪蓋和晚餐中間，一路上都感覺得到它。\n\n現在回頭看，那一刻就該開始問問題了。我沒有。那真的是一顆很漂亮的卵。"
L["Back in Steamwheedle Port, Prospector Ironboot stopped me with a question. Did I know there were six Mosh'aru tablets? Not two. Six. Yeh'kinya had somehow forgotten to mention the other four.\n\nTwo of them were in Zul'Mashar, out in the Eastern Plaguelands, which is a fine place to visit if you enjoy being chewed on. The last two were in Lower Blackrock Spire, which is worse. I fetched all four, and Ironboot read the whole set.\n\nRead whole, the prophecy said something else entirely. Two tablets sounded like a way to keep Hakkar out of the world. Six sounded like a way to let him back in.\n\nI thought about that egg, and every mile I'd carried it. I'd been a great help to somebody. I just hadn't asked who."] = "回到熱砂港，勘查員詹斯·鐵靴攔住我，問了一個問題。我知不知道摩沙魯石板一共有六塊？不是兩塊。六塊。葉基亞不知怎麼的，忘了提另外四塊。\n\n其中兩塊在東瘟疫之地的祖瑪沙爾，如果你喜歡被啃，那是個很棒的觀光景點。最後兩塊在黑石塔下層，那裡更糟。四塊我都拿回來了，鐵靴把整套讀了一遍。\n\n整套讀下來，預言說的是完全不同的事。兩塊石板聽起來像是把哈卡擋在世界之外的方法。六塊聽起來像是讓他回來的方法。\n\n我想起那顆卵，還有我帶著它走過的每一哩路。我幫了某個人一個大忙。我只是沒問是誰。"
L["The prospector reckoned I ought to go and have a word with Yeh'kinya. The prospector was right.\n\nI won't give you the whole conversation. The short of it was that Hakkar the Soulflayer was coming back into the world through Zul'Gurub, and the trolls who meant to meet him there were the Zandalar. Somebody had to carry word to their man Molthor, out on Yojamba Isle off the coast of Stranglethorn. That was me.\n\nSo a job that started with a bramble and three dead screechers ended with me on a beach full of Zandalar, with Zul'Gurub the obvious next stop.\n\nThat one's a story for another night. Buy the next round and I might tell it."] = "勘查員認為我應該去找葉基亞談談。勘查員說得對。\n\n整段對話我就不轉述了。簡單說，奪魂者哈卡正透過祖爾格拉布重返這個世界，而打算在那裡迎接他的食人妖是贊達拉。總得有人把消息帶給他們的人莫托爾，在荊棘谷外海的尤亞姆巴島上。那個人就是我。\n\n所以一份從一根荊棘和三隻死掉的尖嘯者開始的工作，結束在一片站滿贊達拉食人妖的海灘上，而祖爾格拉布顯然就是下一站。\n\n那就是另一個晚上的故事了。下一輪你請，我說不定就講。"
L["There's a poster outside Westbrook Garrison. WANTED, it says, and then Hogger, in quotes, as if even the marshal wasn't sure that was his real name. A Riverpaw brute, out at Forest's Edge. Bring back his claw.\n\nOne gnoll, I thought. How bad can one gnoll be?\n\nHere's what nobody tells you about Hogger. He's big, he's quick, he hits like a runaway cart, and he doesn't live alone. The Riverpaw are thick in those woods, and every one of them takes his side. Say his name in Goldshire and watch the room go quiet.\n\nI brought back the claw, and it's a big one. You could rake a garden with it. Marshal Dughan looked at it for a good while, and then paid me.\n\nThe road to Westfall is a little safer now. A little."] = "西泉要塞外面有一張告示。上面寫著「通緝」，然後是「霍格」，還加了引號，好像連治安官都不確定那是不是他的真名。一個河爪豺狼人暴徒，在林邊空地那邊。把他的爪子帶回來。\n\n一隻豺狼人，我心想。一隻豺狼人能有多糟？\n\n關於霍格，有件事沒人會告訴你。他很大隻、很快，打起人來像一輛失控的馬車，而且他不是一個人住。那片林子裡滿滿都是河爪豺狼人，每一隻都站在他那邊。在閃金鎮說出他的名字，看看整間屋子怎麼安靜下來。\n\n我把爪子帶回來了，很大一隻。拿來耙花園都行。治安官杜漢盯著它看了好一陣子，然後付了錢。\n\n去西部荒野的路現在安全一點了。一點點。"
L["Under the Thandol Span, where the bridge is broken, there's a stretch of riverbed nobody bothers to look at. I looked. There was what was left of a dwarf down there, and a waterlogged envelope.\n\nIt was a letter from Sully Balloo to Sara Balloo in Ironforge. Not orders. Not a map to anything. A man writing home to his wife, saying goodbye in case he didn't get another chance. He didn't.\n\nSo I carried it to Ironforge and found Sara. You don't want to be the one handing over a letter like that, but somebody has to. Sara read it, wrote a note of her own and asked me to take it to King Magni. She wanted her king to know what Sully had given. So up to the High Seat I went."] = "在薩多爾大橋底下，橋斷掉的地方，有一段沒人會費心去看的河床。我看了。下面有一具矮人的遺骸，還有一個泡了水的信封。\n\n那是蘇利·巴魯寫給鐵爐堡的薩拉·巴魯的信。不是命令。不是什麼藏寶圖。是一個男人寫信回家給他的妻子，跟她道別，以防再也沒有機會。他確實沒有。\n\n所以我把信帶到鐵爐堡，找到了薩拉。你不會想當那個遞出這種信的人，但總得有人做。薩拉讀完，寫了一張自己的字條，請我交給國王麥格尼。她希望她的國王知道蘇利付出了什麼。所以我上了至高王座。"
L["Kings get a lot of letters. Magni read Sara's and decided Sully Balloo would have a memorial, and that the Grand Mason would build it.\n\nThe Grand Mason took one look at the commission and decided only the best stone would do: Alterac Granite, five pieces of it. Long way to go for rocks. Very good rocks, I'm told. I carried every one of them back to Ironforge and felt each of them in my shoulders the next morning.\n\nThen I reported back to the king, and Sully got his memorial. Kings hand out a lot of things, titles and medals and land. A stone for one soldier nobody else was out looking for isn't the grandest of them. I liked it best."] = "國王收到的信很多。麥格尼讀了薩拉的信，決定為蘇利·巴魯建一座紀念碑，由大石匠負責建造。\n\n大石匠看了一眼這份委託，就決定非最好的石頭不用：奧特蘭克花崗岩，五塊。為了幾塊石頭跑這麼遠。據說是非常好的石頭。我把每一塊都扛回了鐵爐堡，隔天早上，肩膀把每一塊都記得清清楚楚。\n\n然後我回去向國王回報，蘇利有了他的紀念碑。國王會發很多東西，頭銜、勳章、土地。為一個沒有其他人在找的士兵立一塊石頭，算不上最隆重的一種。但那是我最喜歡的。"
L["There's a wrecked raft in a pond in Un'Goro, and if you poke around it you'll find a small pack. Inside: a large compass, a curled map, a key with a lion's head on it, and a photograph of a gnome dressed in green.\n\nWell. Marshal's Refuge isn't far, and there's a gnome there called Linken. You can see where this is going.\n\nLinken knew the things were his. Linken did not know much else. Where he'd been, what the key opened, why he'd been rafting through a crater full of dinosaurs: all gone. What he did have was a sword, and a name to take it to. Donova Snowden, in Winterspring.\n\nThe far end of Kalimdor, naturally. I've noticed that about lost things. They're never lost anywhere close."] = "安戈洛的一個池塘裡有一艘破木筏，如果你在附近翻一翻，會找到一個小背包。裡面有：一個大羅盤、一張捲起來的地圖、一把有獅頭的鑰匙，還有一張穿綠衣服的地精的照片。\n\n好吧。馬紹爾營地不遠，那裡有個叫林克的地精。你們應該猜得到接下來的發展。\n\n林克知道那些東西是他的。其他事林克就不太知道了。他去過哪裡、那把鑰匙開什麼、他為什麼要划著木筏穿過一個滿是恐龍的環形山：全忘了。他手上有的是一把劍，還有一個可以拿劍去找的名字。多諾瓦·雪山，在冬泉谷。\n\n卡林多的另一頭，當然了。我發現失物都有這個特性。它們從來不會丟在近的地方。"
L["Donova Snowden took one look at Linken's sword and decided the answer was in a graveyard. Getting there was the strange part.\n\nIt took a trip to Feralas for something called the Videre Elixir, and then the graveyard outside Gadgetzan, where Donova's instructions were very clear. Drink the elixir by the gravestone. I drank it. I died.\n\nThat was the plan, mind you. As a ghost I could meet Gaeriyan, who told me which grave to look at once I had a body again. So I walked back to my body, got up, found the gravestone, and came away with a better sword than the one I'd brought.\n\nFirst time I ever died on instructions. Strangely restful."] = "多諾瓦·雪山看了林克的劍一眼，就斷定答案在一座墓地裡。怎麼到那裡，才是奇怪的部分。\n\n得先跑一趟菲拉斯拿一種叫視靈藥劑的東西，然後去加基森外面的墓地，多諾瓦的指示寫得非常清楚。在墓碑旁邊喝下藥劑。我喝了。我死了。\n\n先說好，這是計畫的一部分。變成鬼魂之後，我才能見到加里楊，加里楊告訴我等我有了身體之後該去看哪一座墳。所以我走回我的身體，站起來，找到那塊墓碑，離開時拿著一把比我帶去的那把更好的劍。\n\n這是我第一次照著指示去死。出奇地放鬆。"
L["Eridan Bluewind, up in Felwood, knew what Linken had been trying to make: a silver heart.\n\nThat took a fistful of silvery claws and an irontree heart, which meant arguing with a good deal of local wildlife, and then a book. The Book of Aquor. Carry the lot down to Tanaris, open the book, and out comes Aquementas, a water elemental, standing in the middle of the desert.\n\nAquementas did not care to be summoned. Once we'd settled that, the claws and the heart had become the Silver Totem of Aquementas, and I carried it back to Linken.\n\nA water elemental, called up in the driest place I know, to make a totem for a gnome who couldn't remember where he'd been. You couldn't make that up. I didn't."] = "費伍德森林的艾瑞丹·藍風知道林克一直想做的是什麼：一顆銀色的心。\n\n這需要一把銀爪和一顆鐵樹心，意思就是得跟一大堆當地野生動物爭論一番，然後還要一本書。阿奎爾之書。把這些東西全部帶到塔納利斯，翻開書，就會冒出亞奎門塔斯，一隻水元素，站在沙漠正中央。\n\n亞奎門塔斯一點都不想被召喚。等我們把這件事談妥了，銀爪和鐵樹心已經變成了亞奎門塔斯的銀圖騰，我把它帶回去給林克。\n\n在我知道最乾燥的地方召喚出一隻水元素，替一個不記得自己去過哪裡的地精做一根圖騰。這種事你編都編不出來。我也沒編。"
L["Linken had one more job, and it was the reason for the totem. Fire Plume Ridge, just south of the Refuge. That's where Blazerunner lives, wrapped in a protective aura nothing gets through. Nothing except a silver totem made out of a water elemental.\n\nSomebody once said it's dangerous to go alone. I went anyway. I held up the totem, the aura went out like a candle in the rain, and Blazerunner turned out to be a lot less impressive without it. In the cave beyond sat the Golden Flame, and I carried it back to Linken.\n\nHe still doesn't remember everything. But he has his sword, his flame and an adventure to show for it. I have a story nobody believes. Tell it in any tavern and watch them smile at you like you've had one too many."] = "林克還有最後一件事要做，而那就是圖騰存在的理由。火羽山，就在營地南邊。火焰使者住在那裡，裹著一層什麼都穿不透的防護光環。什麼都穿不透，除了一根用水元素做成的銀圖騰。\n\n以前有人說過，一個人去很危險。我還是去了。我舉起圖騰，光環就像雨中的蠟燭一樣熄了，而沒了光環的火焰使者，原來一點也不怎麼樣。後面的洞穴裡放著金色火焰，我把它帶回去給林克。\n\n他到現在還是沒想起所有的事。但他有了他的劍、他的火焰，還有一段冒險可以證明。我則有一個沒人相信的故事。在任何一間酒館講出來，看看大家怎麼對你微笑，好像你多喝了一杯。"
L["Mankrik waits at the Crossroads. A big orc, built for a fight, and he'd lost one: quillboar hit him on the Gold Road, and his wife didn't come back from it. He asked me to find her. That was the whole of it. Find her.\n\nThe Barrens is a great deal of nothing in every direction, and I walked a lot of it. South of the Crossroads, I found her. Too late, by a long way.\n\nI went back and told him. You don't dress that kind of thing up.\n\nThen he asked for tusks. Bristleback tusks, sixty of them. I didn't argue the number. Grief keeps its own count, and Mankrik's came to sixty.\n\nHer name was Olgra. Somebody ought to say it."] = "曼寇里克在十字路口等著。一個高大的獸人，天生就是打架的料，而他輸了一場：野豬人在黃金之路上襲擊了他，他的妻子沒能回來。他請我去找她。就這樣。找到她。\n\n貧瘠之地往每個方向都是一大片的什麼都沒有，我走了很大一片。在十字路口南邊，我找到了她。太遲了，遲了很久。\n\n我回去告訴他。這種事，你不會加油添醋。\n\n然後他要獠牙。刺背野豬人的獠牙，六十根。我沒有對這個數字有意見。悲傷有自己的算法，而曼寇里克算出來是六十。\n\n她的名字叫奧格菈。總該有人說出來。"
L["Desolace has two kinds of people who'll give you advice about Maraudon, and neither kind tells you why.\n\nThe first was the Centaur Pariah, out in southern Desolace. The Pariah's instructions came written down, and they read like the guest list for a funeral: the Nameless Prophet, the dead khans, and at the end of it all, the Amulet of Union. I went down and collected. Long-dead centaur are no friendlier than the living ones, I can tell you that.\n\nThe second was somebody called Willow, who just wanted carvings. Twenty-five Theradric crystal carvings out of Maraudon. The caves were not short of them, and neither were the things guarding them.\n\nI never did find out what either of them wanted it all for. In Desolace, that counts as a warm welcome."] = "在淒涼之地，會給你瑪拉頓建議的人有兩種，而兩種都不會告訴你為什麼。\n\n第一個是半人馬賤民，在淒涼之地南部。賤民的指示是寫下來的，讀起來像一份葬禮的賓客名單：無名預言者、死去的可汗們，然後在最後面，是聯合墜飾。我下去把東西收齊了。我可以告訴你，死了很久的半人馬，一點也不比活的友善。\n\n第二個是一個叫維洛的人，只想要雕像。從瑪拉頓拿二十五個瑟萊德絲水晶雕像。洞穴裡多得是，守著它們的東西也多得是。\n\n這兩個人要這些東西幹嘛，我始終沒搞清楚。在淒涼之地，這就算是熱烈歡迎了。"
L["Talendria at Nijel's Point had a cure for what was eating Maraudon, or the start of one. A coated cerulean vial, filled at the orange crystal pool down in the caverns, then splashed on the Vylestem vines. The vines don't care for it. Out comes a Noxxious Scion, all rot and temper, and once you've killed it the plant is clean again. Eight plants.\n\nGardening, but with more killing than usual.\n\nMaraudon was sick, and the rot had Lord Vyletongue's name on it. He was somewhere further down."] = "尼耶爾前哨站的塔琳德莉亞手上有一帖能治瑪拉頓病根的藥，或者說，是藥方的開頭。一個天藍水瓶，到洞穴深處的橙色水晶池裝滿，然後潑在維利斯塔姆藤蔓上。藤蔓不喜歡這樣。接著會冒出一隻諾克賽恩幼體，渾身腐爛又滿肚子火，等你把牠殺了，植物就恢復乾淨了。八株。\n\n就是園藝，只是殺的東西比平常多一點。\n\n瑪拉頓病了，而那股腐爛上面寫著維利塔恩領主的名字。他就在更深的地方。"
L["On the side, Archmage Tervosh in Theramore wanted ten shadowshard fragments from the purple end of the caves. Pretty things, if you like your crystals a little sickly. I didn't ask what an archmage wants with them. Archmages get touchy."] = "另外，塞拉摩的大法師特沃許想要洞穴紫色那一頭的十塊暗影殘片。很漂亮的東西，如果你喜歡看起來有點病懨懨的水晶的話。我沒問大法師要它們幹嘛。大法師很容易不高興。"
L["Vark Battlescar at Shadowprey Village had a remedy for the rot in Maraudon, or the start of one. Take a coated cerulean vial down into the caverns, fill it at the orange crystal pool, and splash it on the Vylestem vines. The vines cough up something called a Noxxious Scion. Put the Scion down and the plant comes back clean. Eight of those and you've healed a garden.\n\nWeeding, the hard way.\n\nMaraudon was sick, and the rot had Lord Vyletongue's name on it. He was somewhere further down, waiting."] = "葬影村的瓦克·戰痕手上有一帖能治瑪拉頓腐爛的藥，或者說，是藥方的開頭。帶一個天藍水瓶下到洞穴裡，在橙色水晶池裝滿，然後潑在維利斯塔姆藤蔓上。藤蔓會吐出一個叫諾克賽恩幼體的東西。把幼體解決掉，植物就恢復乾淨了。八株下來，你就治好了一座花園。\n\n拔草，只是拔得特別辛苦。\n\n瑪拉頓病了，而那股腐爛上面寫著維利塔恩領主的名字。他就在更深的地方，等著。"
L["Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar wanted ten shadowshard fragments from the purple side of the caves, so I hauled those all the way up to the Valley of Spirits. Heavy, sharp, and apparently worth it."] = "奧格瑪的尤塞爾奈想要洞穴紫色那一側的十塊暗影殘片，所以我一路把它們扛到精神谷。又重又利，而且看來很值錢。"
L["Cavindra had a story about Maraudon, and the story was about Celebras, a keeper the caverns had twisted. Fixing him meant the Scepter of Celebras, which had come apart into a rod and a diamond, and two of the nastiest things in Maraudon were holding a piece each. Neither was in a sharing mood, so I didn't ask nicely.\n\nThen there was Celebras himself, cursed and wild, who had to be beaten before he could be talked to. Not a sentence I expected to say about a keeper.\n\nAfterward he was Celebras the Redeemed, calm and himself again, and I helped him put the scepter back together. Handy thing. Opens a shortcut into the deeper caves.\n\nI've had worse rewards than a door I don't have to fight my way through."] = "凱雯德拉有一個關於瑪拉頓的故事，故事的主角是塞雷布拉斯，一位被洞穴扭曲了的守護者。要治好他，需要塞雷布拉斯節杖，而那根節杖已經散成了一根魔棒和一顆鑽石，瑪拉頓裡最難搞的兩個東西各拿著一塊。兩個都沒有要分享的意思，所以我也沒有好好拜託。\n\n然後是塞雷布拉斯本人，被詛咒、發了狂，得先打贏他才能跟他講話。這不是我以為自己會拿來形容一位守護者的句子。\n\n之後他成了贖罪的塞雷布拉斯，平靜下來，恢復成原本的自己，我幫他把節杖重新組好。很方便的東西。可以打開一條通往更深處洞穴的捷徑。\n\n比起一扇不用殺出一條血路就能通過的門，我拿過更糟的報酬。"
L["At the very bottom of Maraudon lives Princess Theradras. She is a great deal of angry rock, more or less, and she did not want company. I'd been sent down to kill her, so that worked out for everyone but her.\n\nWhen she fell, a spirit came to talk. Zaetar. Brother of Remulos, and, with Theradras, father of the centaur, which explains a lot about Desolace. He'd been down there a long time. He didn't ask for revenge. He asked me to take something to his brother, and gave me the Seed of Life for Remulos in Moonglade.\n\nSo I carried a seed out of the deepest hole in Desolace, all the way to Moonglade.\n\nEverything in Maraudon had tried to kill me on the way down. The last thing it did was hand me a gift. Odd place."] = "在瑪拉頓的最底層，住著瑟萊德絲公主。她大概就是一大塊很生氣的石頭，而且不想要有人作伴。我被派下去殺她，所以這件事對大家來說都很順利，除了她以外。\n\n她倒下的時候，有一個靈魂過來說話。札爾塔。雷姆洛斯的兄弟，而且和瑟萊德絲一起，是半人馬的父親，這解釋了淒涼之地的很多事。他在下面待了很久。他沒有要求復仇。他請我帶一樣東西給他的兄弟，然後把生命之種交給我，要給月光林地的雷姆洛斯。\n\n所以我把一顆種子從淒涼之地最深的洞裡帶了出來，一路送到月光林地。\n\n在我往下走的路上，瑪拉頓裡的每樣東西都想殺我。它做的最後一件事，卻是送我一份禮物。奇怪的地方。"
L["Feathermoon was missing a courier. Raschal, coming from Thalanaar. Latronicus Moonspear had already written him down as missing in action, and once Feathermoon writes you down, you tend to stay written.\n\nGinro Hearthkindle hadn't given up. Ginro had spent a week combing Feralas and come back with nothing but gnoll teeth. So I took a turn along the Forgotten Coast and found the boat. A row boat with the Feathermoon crest on it, torn almost in two.\n\nNo Raschal. No body, either, which was something. Just a knife, lying in the mud by the wreck.\n\nI brought it back to Ginro. A knife can't tell you much, I thought. I was wrong about that, but that's the next part."] = "羽月要塞有個信差失蹤了。拉斯卡爾，從薩蘭納爾過來的。拉托尼庫斯·月矛已經把他登記為作戰失蹤，而一旦羽月要塞把你登記上去，你通常就會一直待在名冊上。\n\n基恩諾·火花還沒放棄。基恩諾花了整整七天把菲拉斯翻遍了，除了豺狼人的牙齒什麼都沒帶回來。所以我沿著被遺忘的海岸找了一趟，找到了那艘船。一艘划艇，上面有羽月要塞的徽記，幾乎被撕成兩半。\n\n沒有拉斯卡爾。也沒有屍體，這倒算是好事。只有一把刀，躺在殘骸旁邊的泥巴裡。\n\n我把它帶回去給基恩諾。我心想，一把刀能說明什麼。這點我錯了，但那是下一段的事。"
L["Ginro's next idea was a new one on me. Take the knife to Quintis Jonespyre, who can hold a thing and read where it's been.\n\nSo Quintis held the knife and told me what it remembered. Raschal, hauling two big leather backpacks inland. Raschal, fretting about Woodpaw gnolls the whole way. And Raschal, not noticing the water elementals forming up behind him.\n\nThat last part was not encouraging.\n\nHandy trick, psychometry. I'd hate to have it at a dinner party, though. Imagine picking up somebody's fork. Still, it beat a week of turning over rocks, and now we knew where to look: inland, toward the gnolls, after a courier who'd had a worse day than anyone had guessed."] = "基恩諾的下一個主意，我還是第一次聽說。把刀拿去給奎恩提斯，他可以拿著一樣東西，讀出它去過哪裡。\n\n所以奎恩提斯拿起刀子，告訴我它記得的事。拉斯卡爾，扛著兩個大皮背包往內陸走。拉斯卡爾，一路上都在擔心木爪豺狼人。還有拉斯卡爾，沒注意到身後正在成形的水元素。\n\n最後那段可不怎麼令人振奮。\n\n物品讀心術，很好用的把戲。不過我可不想在晚宴上有這種能力。想像一下拿起別人的叉子。總之，這比翻了七天石頭強多了，而現在我們知道該往哪裡找了：往內陸，往豺狼人那邊，去找一個那天過得比大家猜的都還慘的信差。"
L["The Woodpaw camps are about what you'd expect. Gnolls, bones, a smell you take home with you. I went through them looking for anything of Raschal's and found both his packs, pinned to a tree like a trophy, Feathermoon insignia and all.\n\nThe other thing in the packs was a note, and the note changed the whole picture. Raschal had seen strange insect creatures south of the gnoll camps, and gone to have a look.\n\nNot lost, then. Not dragged off by gnolls, either. Our courier had gone looking for trouble on purpose. I liked him already."] = "木爪豺狼人的營地就跟你想的差不多。豺狼人、骨頭，還有一股你會帶回家的味道。我把營地翻了一遍，找任何屬於拉斯卡爾的東西，結果找到了他的兩個背包，像戰利品一樣釘在一棵樹上，羽月要塞的徽記什麼的都還在。\n\n背包裡另一樣東西是一張紙條，而這張紙條改變了整個局面。拉斯卡爾在豺狼人營地南邊看到了奇怪的昆蟲生物，就跑去看了。\n\n所以不是迷路了。也不是被豺狼人拖走的。我們的信差是故意去找麻煩的。我已經開始喜歡他了。"
L["Inside was a parcel he'd never delivered, meant for Falfindel Waywarder in Thalanaar. I took it there myself. A courier's job ought to get finished, even if the courier can't finish it."] = "裡面有一個他沒送出去的包裹，是要給薩蘭納爾的法芬德爾的。我親自送了過去。信差的工作就該完成，就算信差本人沒辦法完成。"
L["South of the gnolls there's a hole in the ground called the Writhing Deep, and it's full of Zukk'ash. Insects, big ones, all legs and mandibles. Somewhere in there was Raschal, or what was left of him.\n\nWhat was left of him turned out to be all of him, sealed up in a pod. I got him out, and he had a report to make.\n\nBack at Feathermoon, Shandris Feathermoon read that report and sent me straight to Darnassus with it, where somebody finally put a name to what was under Feralas.\n\nSilithid.\n\nI went out looking for one lost courier and came back with a warning for all of Kalimdor. Not bad for a knife in the mud."] = "豺狼人營地南邊，有一個叫痛苦深淵的地洞，裡面滿滿都是祖卡什。昆蟲，大隻的，全是腳和顎。拉斯卡爾就在裡面某個地方，或者說，他剩下的部分。\n\n結果他剩下的部分就是他的全部，被封在一個蟲繭裡。我把他弄了出來，而他有一份報告要交。\n\n回到羽月要塞，珊蒂斯‧羽月讀了那份報告，直接要我把它送去達納蘇斯，在那裡，終於有人替菲拉斯底下的東西叫出了名字。\n\n異種蠍。\n\n我出門去找一個失蹤的信差，回來時帶著一個給整個卡林多的警告。對一把泥巴裡的刀來說，還不賴。"
L["It began with a quiet word outside the cathedral: Bishop DeLavey wanted to see me up in Stormwind Keep. From the way it was said, I gathered it wasn't about my soul.\n\nThe bishop told me exactly as much as I needed and not a word more. A diplomat had gone missing, and it was not to be talked about. A contact in the Valley of Heroes handed me a sealed note for Elling Trias, a man with a cheese shop and, it turns out, a good deal more than that. Trias read it, sealed up a note of his own, and sent me off to a watchman in Duskwood.\n\nThat's how you know it's serious. Nobody says anything out loud. They write it down, seal it, and make you carry it."] = "一切從大教堂外的一句悄悄話開始：德拉維主教想在暴風要塞見我。從那句話的口氣，我猜這跟我的靈魂無關。\n\n主教告訴我的，剛好是我需要知道的，一個字都沒多。一位外交官失蹤了，而且這件事不能說出去。英雄谷的一個聯絡人交給我一封封好的信，要給伊林·提亞斯，一個開起司店的人，而原來他不只是開起司店而已。提亞斯讀完，封好他自己的一封信，把我送去找暮色森林的一個守衛。\n\n這就是你知道事情很嚴重的方式。沒有人把話說出口。他們寫下來，封好，然後叫你帶著。"
L["Watcher Backus walks the road north of Darkshire. Backus read the note and sent me out to Addle's Stead, an old farm in western Duskwood, where a little house had some paperwork in it that the Defias wouldn't want found. The Defias Docket.\n\nHere's a thing about the Defias nobody warns you about. They keep records. Whether that's very organized or very stupid, I've never decided. It does make my job easier.\n\nBackus took one look at it and sent me straight back to Stormwind. Trias read it the way a man reads a bill he already knew was coming, and had my next stop picked out before he'd put it down."] = "守夜人巴庫斯在夜色鎮北邊的路上巡邏。巴庫斯讀了信，把我派去暮色森林西邊的一座老農場，腐草農場，那裡有間小屋，屋裡有一些迪菲亞不會想被人找到的文件。迪菲亞文件。\n\n關於迪菲亞，有件事沒人提醒過你。他們會做紀錄。這到底是非常有組織，還是非常蠢，我一直拿不定主意。不過確實讓我的工作輕鬆多了。\n\n巴庫斯看了一眼，就直接把我送回暴風城。提亞斯讀它的樣子，像一個人在讀一張早就知道會來的帳單，而他還沒把文件放下，就已經挑好了我的下一站。"
L["The next lead was Dashel Stonefist, in Old Town. With a name like that, the conversation was always going to start with fists. Dashel didn't want to talk. Dashel wanted to settle things the old way, so we did, and when it was over Dashel was a good deal more reasonable.\n\nWhat Dashel told me sent me back to Trias, and Trias sent me out of the city altogether: north to the Wetlands, to Menethil Harbor and a contact there named Mikhail.\n\nI've always liked that part of a job. One minute you're trading punches in Old Town, the next you're on the road with a name in your pocket and a long way to go."] = "下一條線索是舊城區的達舍爾·石拳。有這種名字，談話一定是從拳頭開始的。達舍爾不想說話。達舍爾想用老方法解決，所以我們就用老方法，等打完，達舍爾講道理多了。\n\n達舍爾告訴我的事，讓我回去找提亞斯，而提亞斯乾脆把我送出了城：往北去濕地，到米奈希爾港，找一個叫米克哈爾的聯絡人。\n\n我一直很喜歡工作的這個部分。前一分鐘你還在舊城區跟人互毆，下一分鐘你就上路了，口袋裡揣著一個名字，前面還有好長一段路。"
L["Mikhail works out of the Deepwater Tavern in Menethil Harbor and notices things. Lately Mikhail had noticed a fellow who listened to other people's business a little too hard.\n\nThat was Tapoke Jahn. Slim, to his friends, if he has any. The moment Slim saw me coming, he did what guilty men always do. He ran. He didn't get far. I subdued him, and after that Slim was very keen to be helpful.\n\nSlim's confession pointed south, across the sea, to Theramore. So Mikhail sent me to find a commander in Dustwallow Marsh, and I took the next boat out."] = "米克哈爾在米奈希爾港的深水旅店工作，很會注意事情。最近米克哈爾注意到一個傢伙，對別人的事聽得有點太認真了。\n\n那個人是塔伯克·賈恩。朋友都叫他「乾柴」，如果他有朋友的話。乾柴一看到我走過來，就做了所有心虛的人都會做的事。他跑了。他沒跑多遠。我制服了他，之後乾柴就變得非常熱心幫忙。\n\n乾柴的供詞指向南方，越過大海，到塞拉摩。所以米克哈爾要我去塵泥沼澤找一位指揮官，我就搭上了下一班船。"
L["Theramore is Jaina Proudmoore's city. The commander there had me search Sentry Point for any sign of a Private Hendel. No Hendel. When a soldier isn't at his post, that tells you plenty.\n\nAn archmage in Jaina's tower knew where to look instead: some tents out northwest of the city. Hendel was there, and Hendel was not in a talking mood, so we had it out. When he finally yielded, Lady Jaina Proudmoore herself was there to take him off my hands, with a quiet word of thanks for me.\n\nQuiet. That was the whole job, start to finish. I never did learn the diplomat's name. But considering who sent me looking and who turned up to say thank you, I have a fair idea."] = "塞拉摩是珍娜‧普勞德摩爾的城市。那裡的指揮官要我去警戒崗哨搜一搜，找一個叫亨德爾的下士的蹤跡。沒有亨德爾。一個士兵不在他的崗位上，這本身就說明了很多。\n\n珍娜高塔裡的一位大法師知道該去哪裡找：城市西北邊的一些帳篷。亨德爾在那裡，而亨德爾沒有要談的心情，所以我們就打了一場。等他終於投降，珍娜‧普勞德摩爾女士親自到場把他從我手上接走，還低聲向我道了謝。\n\n低調。整份工作從頭到尾都是如此。我始終不知道那位外交官的名字。但想想是誰派我去找的、又是誰出面來道謝，我心裡大概有數了。"
L["The orcs at Stonard had caught themselves a spy. A human, Infiltrator Marksen, who'd seen more than he should. Out at Beggar's Haunt, two of the Forsaken offered to help get the truth out of him: Deathstalker Zraedus and Apothecary Faustin. A truth serum. Very neighborly.\n\nThe recipe called for panther hearts, a rare fungus and a tumor out of a giant. I'll leave the tumor there. Faustin brewed it all up and I carried it to Zraedus, and what came back to me was called Zraedus's Brew.\n\nI took it down to Stonard and gave it to Marksen. Marksen drank it. Marksen didn't have a great deal to say after that.\n\nZraedus was very pleased with how helpful we'd all been."] = "斯通納德的獸人抓到了一個間諜。一個人類，間諜瑪克森，看到了不該看的東西。在乞丐鬼屋那邊，有兩個被遺忘者表示願意幫忙從他嘴裡問出實話：亡靈哨兵萊度斯和藥劑師法奧斯丁。一種吐真劑。真是熱心的鄰居。\n\n配方需要豹心、一種稀有的真菌，還有一顆從巨人身上取下來的腫瘤。腫瘤的部分我就不多說了。法奧斯丁把它們全熬在一起，我把它帶給萊度斯，交回我手上的東西叫做萊度斯的酒。\n\n我把它帶去斯通納德，交給瑪克森。瑪克森喝了。瑪克森在那之後就沒什麼話好說了。\n\n萊度斯對我們大家這麼熱心幫忙，非常滿意。"
L["Morgan's Vigil had a dragonkin problem, and for about an afternoon I was the solution. Then the letters started. The Vigil wrote to the magistrate in Lakeshire, the magistrate wrote to Stormwind, and I carried every one of them up and down the kingdom like a well-armed pigeon.\n\nIn the keep, Lady Katrana Prestor had a little advice for me before the Highlord gave his answer. The answer was no. A very polite no, on very good paper. The magistrate read it twice and stopped being polite himself.\n\nWhich is how I ended up in a cave up north of the Ruins of Thaurissan, listening to a fellow called Ragged John tell me what had become of a marshal named Windsor. The ragged part, I'll say, was earned."] = "摩根的崗哨有龍類的問題，大概有一個下午的時間，我就是那個解決方案。然後信件就開始了。崗哨寫信給湖畔鎮的鎮長，鎮長寫信給暴風城，而我像一隻全副武裝的信鴿，帶著每一封信在王國裡上上下下跑。\n\n在要塞裡，女伯爵卡特拉娜·普瑞斯托在大領主給出答覆之前，先給了我一點建議。答覆是不行。一個非常有禮貌的不行，寫在非常好的紙上。鎮長讀了兩遍，然後他自己也不再客氣了。\n\n這就是為什麼我最後跑到索瑞森廢墟北邊的一個洞穴裡，聽一個叫狼狽不堪的約翰的傢伙告訴我，一位叫溫德索爾的元帥後來怎麼了。我得說，「狼狽不堪」這幾個字，他是實至名歸。"
L["Ragged John's tale ended in a Dark Iron prison, so down into Blackrock Depths I went, and there was Marshal Windsor in a cell, finished. They'd taken his proof, and with it whatever had been holding him up. He sent me back to give Maxwell the bad news.\n\nHe'd have stayed finished, too, if a crumpled note hadn't turned up in the Depths. One look at it and the marshal was back. His papers were with a golem lord and a general down there, and neither of them wanted to give anything back. I didn't take it personally.\n\nOnce Windsor had his papers, he wanted his gear and his friends out of their cells, in that order. Blackrock Depths had opinions about that. We got both anyway."] = "狼狽不堪的約翰的故事，結局是一座黑鐵監獄，所以我下到了黑石深淵，溫德索爾元帥就在一間牢房裡，整個人垮了。他們拿走了他的證據，也連帶拿走了一直撐著他的那股勁。他要我回去把壞消息告訴麥克斯韋爾。\n\n要不是深淵裡冒出了一張皺巴巴的紙條，他大概就一直垮下去了。元帥看了一眼，整個人就回來了。他的文件在下面的一個傀儡元帥和一個將軍手上，兩個都不想交出任何東西。我沒把這當成是針對我。\n\n溫德索爾一拿回文件，就想要他的裝備，再把他的朋友們從牢房裡救出來，按照這個順序。黑石深淵對此很有意見。我們還是兩樣都辦到了。"
L["A squire at the gates of Stormwind had one job that day: let Marshal Windsor know I'd come. Then Windsor arrived, and we walked into the city together, and I kept him alive all the way up to the keep. That took some doing.\n\nIn the throne room he faced Lady Katrana Prestor, the most trusted voice at court, and called her by her real name. Onyxia. The whole court got a good look at what had been whispering in the Highlord's ear all this time.\n\nShe killed him for it, right there. But the secret was out, and there's no spell in the world that puts that back.\n\nI never got to buy him a drink. So this one's his."] = "暴風城大門口的一個侍從，那天只有一件事要做：通知溫德索爾元帥我到了。然後溫德索爾來了，我們一起走進城裡，我一路讓他活著走到要塞。那可費了一番工夫。\n\n在王座廳裡，他面對女伯爵卡特拉娜·普瑞斯托，宮廷裡最受信任的聲音，然後叫出了她的真名。奧妮克希亞。整個宮廷終於看清楚，一直在大領主耳邊低語的到底是什麼東西。\n\n她為此殺了他，就在那裡。但秘密已經揭穿了，這世上沒有任何法術能把它塞回去。\n\n我始終沒機會請他喝一杯。所以這一杯，敬他。"
L["Afterward the Highlord handed me a fragment of something called the Dragon's Eye and told me to find someone who could restore its power. Who? Nobody knew. Where? Nobody knew that either. All anyone could say for certain was that such a someone existed. I've had better directions from drunks.\n\nThe someone turned out to be Haleh, up at Mazthoril in Winterspring, and Haleh's price for the Drakefire Amulet was the blood of the black dragonflight's champion. General Drakkisath, on his throne at the top of Blackrock Spire.\n\nI went up with friends. Drakkisath had a great many guards and a bad temper, and by the end a lot less blood. Haleh made the amulet. Onyxia keeps a lair down in Dustwallow Marsh, and now I can let myself in."] = "事後，大領主交給我一塊叫巨龍之眼的東西的碎片，要我去找一個能恢復它力量的人。是誰？沒人知道。在哪裡？也沒人知道。大家唯一能確定的，就是有這麼一個人存在。我從醉漢那裡都問到過更好的路。\n\n結果那個人是哈爾琳，在冬泉谷的麥索瑞爾，而哈爾琳替我做龍火護符的代價，是黑龍軍團勇士的血。達基薩斯將軍，坐在黑石塔頂端的王座上。\n\n我找了朋友一起上去。達基薩斯有一大堆守衛和很差的脾氣，到最後，血少了很多。哈爾琳做出了護符。奧妮克希亞在塵泥沼澤有一座巢穴，現在我可以自己開門進去了。"
L["Warlord Goretooth in Kargath doesn't give orders so much as read out a list. Three names in Lower Blackrock Spire, all to be dead, and whatever papers they were sitting on brought back. What was in those papers got me sent straight to Orgrimmar.\n\nThe Warchief's answer was short. Go to Blackrock Spire. Kill Rend Blackhand. Bring back his head. Rend called himself a warchief, and Orgrimmar only has room for one.\n\nSo I went, and Rend's head came home with me. Then Thrall sat me down and told me what the wind had been carrying, and none of it was good. Dragons, mostly. Black ones."] = "卡加斯的軍官高圖斯與其說是在下命令，不如說是在唸清單。黑石塔下層的三個名字，全都得死，他們手上的文件要帶回來。那些文件裡寫的東西，讓我直接被送去了奧格瑪。\n\n大酋長的答覆很簡短。去黑石塔。殺掉雷德·黑手。把他的頭帶回來。雷德自稱大酋長，而奧格瑪只容得下一位。\n\n所以我去了，雷德的頭跟著我回了家。然後索爾讓我坐下，告訴我風一直在傳些什麼，沒有一件是好事。大部分是龍。黑色的。"
L["Finding Rexxar is a job in itself. He walks the roads of Desolace somewhere between Stonetalon and Feralas, which is a great deal of road. I walked most of it before I caught him walking the rest.\n\nHe sent me with his testament to Myranda the Hag in the Western Plaguelands. Myranda deals in deception, and deception has ingredients. This batch needed twenty eyes off the black dragonspawn in Blackrock Spire. I didn't ask why eyes. Myranda didn't say.\n\nWhat came back was an amulet. Wear it into Emberstrife's den in Dustwallow Marsh, and a black dragon looks at you and sees family. I stood there in somebody else's scales making polite conversation with a dragon. Still one of my better performances."] = "找到雷克薩本身就是一份工作。他在淒涼之地的路上走來走去，介於石爪山脈和菲拉斯之間，那可是很長一段路。我走了大半段，才終於在他走剩下那段的時候逮到他。\n\n他要我帶著他的證明去找西瘟疫之地的巫女米蘭達。米蘭達專做欺瞞的生意，而欺瞞也是需要材料的。這一批需要黑石塔裡黑色龍人的二十顆眼睛。我沒問為什麼是眼睛。米蘭達也沒說。\n\n拿回來的是一個護符。戴著它走進塵泥沼澤裡艾博斯塔夫的巢穴，黑龍看著你，就會以為你是自家人。我就站在那裡，披著別人的鱗片，跟一頭龍客客氣氣地聊天。到現在還是我最精彩的演出之一。"
L["Emberstrife wanted proof, and dragons keep their proof in skulls. Four of them, one from the champion of each of the other flights: blue up in Winterspring, green in the Swamp of Sorrows, red on the road to Grim Batol, and bronze guarding the Caverns of Time. That's a lot of map for one shopping list, and not one of them went down easy.\n\nI hauled the lot back to the Wyrmbog, still wearing my borrowed face, and came away with a dull old amulet and one large problem. The next step was inside Blackrock Spire, and the disguise wouldn't hold up in there.\n\nThe charade was over. So I went to find Rexxar again, which, as you'll remember, takes a while."] = "艾博斯塔夫要證據，而龍把證據放在頭骨裡。四顆，每一顆都來自其他龍族的勇士：冬泉谷的藍龍、悲傷沼澤的綠龍、格瑞姆巴托路上的紅龍，還有守在時光之穴的青銅龍。一張購物清單跨了這麼大一張地圖，而且沒有一頭是好對付的。\n\n我把它們全扛回巨龍沼澤，臉上還戴著借來的那張臉，換到一個黯淡的舊護符，外加一個大問題。下一步是在黑石塔裡面，而那套偽裝在裡面是撐不住的。\n\n這齣戲演完了。所以我又去找雷克薩了，你們應該還記得，那可得花上一段時間。"
L["Rexxar took one look at the dull amulet and knew what it needed: blood. General Drakkisath's, to be exact, champion of the black dragonflight, who keeps his throne at the very top of Blackrock Spire.\n\nNo disguise this time. We went up the hard way, through everything the Spire had, and into the throne room behind the Halls of Ascension. Drakkisath did not want to part with any of his blood. By the end he'd parted with all of it.\n\nRexxar did the rest and handed me the Drakefire Amulet. Four skulls, twenty eyes, one borrowed face and a dead general went into that thing. If Onyxia ever wonders who's knocking, it's me."] = "雷克薩看了那個黯淡的護符一眼，就知道它需要什麼：血。精確地說，是達基薩斯將軍的血，黑龍軍團的勇士，王座就在黑石塔的最頂端。\n\n這次不偽裝了。我們用最難的方式往上打，穿過黑石塔所有的東西，一路殺進最深處的王座廳。達基薩斯一滴血都不想給。到最後，他全給了。\n\n剩下的雷克薩搞定了，然後把龍火護符交給我。四顆頭骨、二十顆眼睛、一張借來的臉，再加上一個死掉的將軍，全都做進了那東西裡。哪天奧妮克希亞想知道是誰在敲門，就是我。"
L["On the road into Westfall there's a broken-down wagon, and beside it the Furlbrows, who left their farm in a hurry and couldn't bring much with them.\n\nFarmer Furlbrow wanted one thing. Not the farm, not the furniture. His pocket watch, still sitting in the wardrobe back at the farmhouse. So I walked out to the pumpkin farm and fetched it. Of everything a man could leave behind, that was the one he couldn't stop thinking about.\n\nVerna's worry was Blanchy, their old horse, who was hungry and getting no younger. I went through the fields picking up oats until I had eight handfuls. Blanchy ate every one and looked at me like I'd hung the moon."] = "在通往西部荒野的路上，有一輛壞掉的馬車，旁邊是法布隆夫婦，他們匆匆離開了自己的農場，沒能帶走多少東西。\n\n農夫法布隆只想要一樣東西。不是農場，不是家具。是他的懷錶，還放在農舍的衣櫃裡。所以我走到那座南瓜農場，把它拿了回來。一個人能留下的所有東西裡，那就是他一直忘不掉的那一樣。\n\n弗娜擔心的是布蘭契，他們的老馬，肚子餓了，年紀也不小了。我在田裡到處撿燕麥，撿到八捧。布蘭契每一捧都吃光了，看著我的樣子，好像我替牠摘下了月亮。"
L["Later on I turned up Furlbrow's deed in a Defias camp in Elwynn. Thieves will take anything that isn't nailed down, and a few things that are."] = "後來我在艾爾文森林的一個迪菲亞營地裡，翻出了法布隆的地契。小偷什麼都拿，沒釘死的拿，有些釘死的也照拿。"
L["If you want to understand Princess Moira, the Royal Historian in Ironforge will explain, and it takes a while. The Dark Irons, the War of the Three Hammers, and how the Burning Steppes came to be burning. Then, so I'd really understand, I was sent out to the Ruins of Thaurissan to read the old relics myself. History lessons, in the hottest classroom in the Eastern Kingdoms.\n\nThat was the warm-up. King Magni wanted me to find Kharan Mighthammer, a prisoner deep in Blackrock Depths. Kharan had a tale about Moira. I listened. It was not the tale Magni wanted.\n\nThen I had to go back to Ironforge and tell him. Here's some free advice. If you're ever handed bad news for a king about his daughter, see if anyone else is going that way."] = "如果你想了解茉艾拉公主，鐵爐堡的皇家歷史學家會解釋給你聽，而且要講好一陣子。黑鐵矮人、三錘之戰，還有燃燒平原是怎麼燒起來的。然後，為了讓我真正搞懂，我被派去索瑞森廢墟，親自去讀那些古老的遺物。歷史課，在東部王國最熱的教室裡上。\n\n那只是暖身。國王麥格尼要我去找卡蘭·巨錘，一個關在黑石深淵深處的囚犯。卡蘭有一段關於茉艾拉的故事。我聽了。那不是麥格尼想聽的故事。\n\n然後我得回鐵爐堡告訴他。給你們一個免費的建議。如果哪天有人要你替一位國王帶來關於他女兒的壞消息，先看看有沒有別人剛好要往那邊走。"
L["Magni's orders were plain. Back into Blackrock Depths, kill Emperor Dagran Thaurissan, and bring Moira home.\n\nBlackrock Depths is a city, not a cellar, and the emperor sits at the far end of it. We got there. We did the first part. The emperor went down, and I turned around to rescue the princess.\n\nThe princess did not want rescuing. She'd married him, and she was mourning her husband. She also had news. She was carrying his child, and that child would be heir to Ironforge.\n\nThat news went back to her father by way of me. Of every report I've ever made, that's the one where I most wished I'd taken the long road. Magni wanted his daughter back. What he got was a grandchild, and a problem nobody could kill."] = "麥格尼的命令很直白。回黑石深淵，殺掉達格蘭·索瑞森大帝，把茉艾拉帶回家。\n\n黑石深淵是一座城，不是一間地窖，而大帝就坐在城的最深處。我們到了。第一部分我們做到了。大帝倒下，我轉身去救公主。\n\n公主不想被救。她嫁給了他，正在為她的丈夫哀悼。她還有消息要說。她懷了他的孩子，而那個孩子將會是鐵爐堡的繼承人。\n\n那個消息是由我帶回去給她父親的。我做過的所有報告裡，就屬那一次我最希望自己繞遠路。麥格尼想要回他的女兒。結果他要當外公了，外加一個沒人殺得掉的問題。"
L["I was shown a drawing of an orc. Crude, with bars scribbled over the face. That was the whole clue. So I went looking for a prison, and Blackrock Depths has a big one, and in it was Commander Gor'shak.\n\nThe Dark Irons didn't care for us talking, and halfway through they came at us in waves. I made sure the commander lived to finish the story. Another prisoner nearby had the real news: Princess Moira Bronzebeard, kidnapped by the Dark Irons.\n\nThrall heard me out and sent me back in to kill the emperor and free the princess from his spell.\n\nI did the killing. The princess did not look like anyone under a spell. She looked like a widow, carrying the emperor's child, an heir with a claim on Ironforge. I took that back to Orgrimmar and watched the Warchief do some very careful thinking."] = "有人給我看了一張獸人的畫像。畫得很粗糙，臉上還塗了幾條鐵欄杆。線索就只有這樣。所以我去找監獄，而黑石深淵有一座很大的監獄，裡面關著指揮官哥沙克。\n\n黑鐵矮人不喜歡我們聊天，講到一半，他們就一波一波地衝過來。我確保指揮官活到把故事講完。附近另一個囚犯帶來了真正的消息：茉艾拉·銅鬚公主被黑鐵矮人綁架了。\n\n索爾聽我說完，又把我派回去殺掉大帝，把公主從他的法術裡解救出來。\n\n殺的部分我做了。可是公主看起來一點都不像中了法術的人。她看起來像個寡婦，懷著大帝的孩子，一個有權繼承鐵爐堡的子嗣。我把這消息帶回奧格瑪，看著大酋長非常、非常謹慎地思考。"
L["Raene Wolfrunner in Astranaar was worried about Teronis, who'd gone west looking for some way to stop the furbolg attacks and hadn't come back. Raene asked me to find Teronis. I did, out by Lake Falathim. The murlocs had found Teronis first.\n\nThere was a journal on the body, though, and a glowing gem still to be found. I found it, and brought both back to Astranaar.\n\nRaene read the journal and the job changed. Teronis had been onto something, a way to slow the attacks, and it wasn't finished. The next step was a moonwell to the northeast and someone there called Shael'dryn. So off I went. Errands from the dead are still errands."] = "阿斯特蘭納的萊恩·狼行者很擔心泰羅尼斯，泰羅尼斯往西走，想找個辦法阻止熊怪的攻擊，結果一直沒回來。萊恩請我去找泰羅尼斯。我找到了，在法拉希姆湖邊。魚人比我先找到泰羅尼斯。\n\n不過屍體上有一本日記，還有一顆發光的寶石等著人去找。我找到了，把兩樣東西一起帶回阿斯特蘭納。\n\n萊恩讀了日記，工作就變了。泰羅尼斯當時已經摸到了某個門路，一個能減緩攻擊的方法，只是還沒完成。下一步是東北邊的一座月井，那裡有個叫莎爾蒂恩的人。所以我又出發了。死人交代的差事，也還是差事。"
L["Shael'dryn, at the moonwell, knew exactly what Teronis had been after: Dartol's Rod, broken into pieces and hidden around the worst corners of Ashenvale. So it was a scavenger hunt, with twisted treants up toward Felwood holding one of the pieces and not in a sharing mood.\n\nThe pommel was the low point. It was down in the Dor'danil barrow den, and I'll spare you exactly where I found it. I washed my hands for a week.\n\nOnce the rod was whole I took it to a hidden shrine to wake it up again, and still nobody had told me what the thing actually did. That came later. It involved fur."] = "月井旁的莎爾蒂恩很清楚泰羅尼斯在找的是什麼：達托爾之杖，碎成了好幾塊，藏在梣谷最糟糕的幾個角落。所以這是一場尋寶遊戲，往費伍德森林那邊的扭曲樹人手上就拿著其中一塊，而且沒有要分享的意思。\n\n杖柄是最低潮的部分。它在朵丹尼爾獸穴裡，我到底是在哪裡找到它的，就容我略過不提了。我的手洗了整整七天。\n\n杖子拼完整之後，我把它帶到一座隱密的聖壇去重新喚醒，而到那時候，還是沒有人告訴我這東西到底是幹嘛用的。那是後來的事。牽涉到毛。"
L["Here's what Dartol's Rod does: you use it, and you're a furbolg. Raene wanted me to find one of the few furbolg left uncorrupted, and apparently walking up in my own skin was not the way to start that conversation.\n\nKrolg was the one, southeast of Mystral Lake. Krolg had no love for the night elves and blamed them for what had happened to the furbolg. Didn't hide it, either. But Ran Bloodtooth's lot had gone bad, and Krolg wanted Ran dead.\n\nSo I obliged. Four of the Bloodtooth guards, then Ran, and Ran's skull came home with me.\n\nRaene got the skull and the rod back. I kept the memory of having fur. Not my look, honestly. And itchy."] = "達托爾之杖的用途是這樣的：你一用它，就變成一隻熊怪。萊恩要我去找少數幾個還沒被腐化的熊怪之一，而顯然，頂著我自己的皮走過去，不是展開那場對話的好方法。\n\n那位就是克羅格，在密斯特拉湖東南邊。克羅格對夜精靈沒什麼好感，把熊怪的遭遇都怪在他們頭上。也沒打算掩飾。但蘭恩·血牙那一夥人已經墮落了，克羅格想要蘭恩死。\n\n所以我就照辦了。四個血牙保鏢，然後是蘭恩，蘭恩的頭骨跟著我回家了。\n\n萊恩拿回了頭骨和杖子。我則留下了長過一身毛的回憶。老實說，不適合我。而且很癢。"
L["Nimboya had the kind of problem nobody at Grom'gol wanted to say out loud. The Darkspear chief's youngest son, Yenniku, was gone, and the Bloodscalps were the only trail anyone had.\n\nThe Bloodscalps don't take questions, so I started by collecting. Shrunken heads, twenty of them, so Nimboya could go through every one and make sure none of them was Yenniku. That's a job you remember. None of them was.\n\nOnly the Bloodscalp leaders knew more, and they weren't sharing. Nimboya had an answer for that as well. I brought back both their heads and dropped them in the cauldron at camp.\n\nTurns out a Bloodscalp gets a lot chattier once you've parted the talking end from the rest."] = "尼姆布亞碰上的，是格羅姆高沒有人想大聲說出來的那種問題。暗矛酋長的幼子耶尼庫不見了，而唯一的線索就是血頂食人妖。\n\n血頂食人妖不接受提問，所以我從收集開始。皺縮的頭顱，二十個，好讓尼姆布亞一個一個檢查，確定裡面沒有耶尼庫。這種工作你會記一輩子。裡面沒有他。\n\n只有血頂的首領們知道更多，而他們不肯說。尼姆布亞對此也有辦法。我把他們兩個的頭都帶了回來，丟進營地的大鍋裡。\n\n結果一個血頂食人妖，只要你把會說話的那一端跟其他部分分開，就會變得健談許多。"
L["Here's something nobody tells you about talking heads. They haggle.\n\nNezzliok's head spoke up from the cauldron first and wanted trophies out of the Skullsplitter ruins, one from each. Gan'zulah's wanted Skullsplitters, dead, by the dozen, and somebody's broken armor on top. Being dead hadn't made either of them any less Bloodscalp. If anything, it had given them time to think about what they wanted.\n\nI paid both bills. Only then did they tell me what they knew. The chief's son hadn't died with the Bloodscalps at all. Zanzil the Outcast had him.\n\nI've bargained with goblins in my time. The goblins were easier."] = "關於會說話的頭，有件事沒人會告訴你。它們會討價還價。\n\n奈茲里奧克的頭先從大鍋裡開口，要碎顱遺跡裡的戰利品，每一處各一件。甘祖拉恩的頭要碎顱食人妖，死的，一打一打地要，最上面還要加一件某人的破盔甲。死了並沒有讓他們少一點血頂的作風。真要說的話，反而讓他們有更多時間想清楚自己要什麼。\n\n兩筆帳我都付了。他們這才告訴我他們知道的事。酋長的兒子根本沒有跟血頂一起死。他在流亡者贊吉爾手上。\n\n我這輩子跟哥布林討價還價過。哥布林還比較好搞。"
L["Nezzliok had one more thing to say, and it wasn't cheerful. Zanzil didn't just have the chief's son. Zanzil had him body and soul, and you can't cut a soul loose with a blade. Believe me, that was my first idea.\n\nKin'weelay, who'd stood beside that cauldron the whole time as if talking heads were nothing new, knew an old Stranglethorn legend about something called the Mind's Eye. The Eye was in the Mosh'Ogg Ogre Mound, with an ogre sitting on it who didn't want to share. I made my case. Kin'weelay took the Eye and a few singing crystals I'd dug out of Crystalvein Mine and worked the lot into a Soul Gem.\n\nPretty thing. Not the sort you'd wear."] = "奈茲里奧克還有一件事要說，而且不是什麼開心的事。贊吉爾不只是抓了酋長的兒子。贊吉爾控制了他的身體和靈魂，而靈魂是用刀子割不開的。相信我，那是我的第一個念頭。\n\n肯維雷一直站在那口大鍋旁邊，好像會說話的頭沒什麼稀奇的，而肯維雷知道一個荊棘谷的古老傳說，講的是一個叫心靈之眼的東西。心靈之眼在莫什奧格巨魔山裡，上面坐著一個不想分享的巨魔。我說服了他。肯維雷拿著心靈之眼，加上我從水晶礦坑挖出來的幾顆會唱歌的水晶，做成了一顆靈魂寶石。\n\n很漂亮的東西。不是你會戴在身上的那種。"
L["I had the Soul Gem and a very short plan. Find Yenniku. Use the gem. Bring it back full.\n\nHe was down at the Ruins of Aboraz, by the Crystal Shore, with Zanzil's people all around him. The chief's son, standing in the jungle with somebody else's will where his own should be. Not easy to look at. I got close enough, I used the gem, and whatever Zanzil had wrapped around his soul let go. The soul went into the stone.\n\nI carried that gem back to Grom'gol the way you'd carry a full cup through a crowded tavern. Nimboya took it, and for once there was no next errand. Just a promise: the Darkspear would remember who brought their chief's son home.\n\nI've been paid in gold plenty of times. That was better."] = "我有了靈魂寶石，還有一個非常簡短的計畫。找到耶尼庫。用寶石。把它裝滿帶回來。\n\n他在水晶海岸邊的阿博拉茲廢墟，四周都是贊吉爾的人。酋長的兒子，站在叢林裡，原本該是他自己意志的地方，換成了別人的意志。看了不好受。我靠得夠近，用了寶石，不管贊吉爾在他的靈魂上纏了什麼，都鬆開了。靈魂進了石頭裡。\n\n我把那顆寶石帶回格羅姆高，就像端著一杯滿滿的酒穿過擠滿人的酒館。尼姆布亞接了過去，而難得一次，沒有下一件差事。只有一個承諾：暗矛會記得是誰把他們酋長的兒子帶回家的。\n\n我收過很多次金子當報酬。這次更好。"
L["Deathknell is a graveyard with a town attached, and the Scarlet Crusade had camped right next door. Executor Arren had me thin them out first and wanted their armbands as proof. Executors like a tally.\n\nThe real prize was their messenger, Meven Korgal, sitting in the Crusader camp with papers meant for somebody important. They reached somebody important, all right. Ours.\n\nArren read the documents and didn't care for a word of them. Next thing I'm carrying them up the road to Executor Zygand in Brill at a brisk walk. When an executor wants something delivered, you don't stop to admire the pumpkins."] = "喪鐘鎮是一座附帶一個小鎮的墓地，而血色十字軍就在隔壁紮營。執行官阿倫先要我去把他們的人數削減一些，還要他們的臂章當證據。執行官喜歡計數。\n\n真正的大獎是他們的信差，邁文‧考加爾，坐在十字軍營地裡，帶著要給某個大人物的文件。那些文件確實送到了某個大人物手上。我們這邊的。\n\n阿倫讀了文件，一個字都不喜歡。下一刻，我就帶著它們沿著大路往布瑞爾走，去找執行官塞加德，腳步很快。執行官要你送東西的時候，你可不會停下來欣賞南瓜。"
L["Brill's war on the Crusade started with pumpkins. I stole ten off a farm up by Deathknell and hauled them to Apothecary Johaan, who did something to one of them that I didn't watch too closely. A laced pumpkin, for the Scarlet Zealot they kept in the tavern cellar. I carried it down myself. The zealot got a pumpkin. That's as far as I'm taking that story.\n\nExecutor Zygand preferred the direct approach, and kept sending me out to the Scarlet camps west of town until there weren't many captains left in them.\n\nOne of the deathguards wanted their rings as proof. My word, apparently, wasn't enough. Ten rings later, it was."] = "布瑞爾對十字軍的戰爭，是從南瓜開始的。我從喪鐘鎮附近的一座農場偷了十顆，扛去給藥劑師喬漢，他對其中一顆做了些什麼，我沒有看得太仔細。一顆加了料的南瓜，要給他們關在旅店地窖裡的血色狂熱者。我親自送下去的。那個狂熱者得到了一顆南瓜。這個故事我就講到這裡。\n\n執行官塞加德偏好直接一點的方法，一直派我去鎮西邊的血色十字軍營地，直到那裡剩下沒幾個隊長。\n\n其中一個亡靈衛兵要他們的戒指當證據。看來光憑我一句話不夠。十枚戒指之後，夠了。"
L["Brother Crowley in the Stormwind Cathedral wanted me to go and see a Brother Anton. In Desolace. You don't just wander over to Desolace, but I went, and at Nijel's Point Anton had a job ready and waiting.\n\nThirty undead ravagers. Not twenty, not a handful. Thirty. I counted, because I knew Anton would.\n\nThat earned me a letter of commendation to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore. That's how it goes with the devout. You do them one favor, they write you a reference, and the reference gets you a bigger favor. Raleigh read it and started talking about a monastery up in Tirisfal Glades, and how badly it needed a visit."] = "暴風城大教堂的克羅雷修士要我去見一位安東修士。在淒涼之地。淒涼之地可不是隨便晃過去就到的，但我還是去了，在尼耶爾前哨站，安東已經準備好一份工作等著我。\n\n三十個不死族劫掠者。不是二十個，也不是一小撮。三十個。我數了，因為我知道安東會數。\n\n這讓我拿到一封推薦信，要交給南海鎮的虔誠的萊雷恩。虔誠的人就是這樣。你幫他們一個忙，他們就幫你寫一封推薦信，而這封推薦信會幫你換來一個更大的忙。萊雷恩讀完，就開始談起提里斯法林地的一座修道院，以及那裡有多需要有人去拜訪一下。"
L["Librarian Mae Paledust works in the Hall of Explorers in Ironforge and wanted one book in particular, the Mythology of the Titans. The copy Mae had in mind was sitting in the library of the Scarlet Monastery, where, as far as I could tell, nobody was reading it.\n\nSo a few of us went in to borrow a book. That's how I put it to myself, anyway. The Library wing is long halls, tall shelves and a great many serious people in red who don't care for visitors. Borrowing took some doing.\n\nWe came out with the book. Mae took it the way most people take a newborn, very carefully and without looking at anyone else in the room. I've had warmer thanks. I've rarely seen anybody happier, though, and I've watched people find gold."] = "圖書館員麥伊·蒼塵在鐵爐堡的探險者大廳工作，特別想要一本書：《泰坦神話》。麥伊心裡想的那一本，就放在血色修道院的圖書館裡，據我所知，在那裡根本沒人在讀。\n\n所以我們幾個人進去借一本書。至少我是這樣跟自己說的。圖書館區是長長的走廊、高高的書架，還有一大堆穿紅衣服、表情嚴肅、不歡迎訪客的人。借書可費了一番工夫。\n\n我們帶著書出來了。麥伊接過去的樣子，就像大多數人抱新生兒一樣，非常小心，眼裡也看不見房間裡的其他人。我收過更熱情的道謝。不過我很少見過有人那麼開心，而我可是看過人挖到黃金的。"
L["There's a prisoner in the Monastery graveyard, Vorrel Sengutz, and Interrogator Vishas had been working on Vorrel for a long while. Vorrel didn't have much left to ask for. Two things: Vishas dead, and Vorrel's wedding ring, which Vishas had kept, taken to Monika Sengutz in Tarren Mill. Same last name. You can work out the rest.\n\nVishas didn't enjoy being interrupted. I took the ring back and walked it all the way to Tarren Mill. Light thing, a ring. Long walk, though.\n\nThe Library had its own customers. Half the scholars in the Horde seem to want a book off those shelves, and the Crusade guards its reading like it's gold. Can't think why. Most of it's about how to kill the rest of us."] = "修道院的墓地裡有一個囚犯，沃瑞爾·森加斯，而審訊員韋沙斯已經在沃瑞爾身上下了很長一段時間的工夫。沃瑞爾已經沒剩多少東西可以要求了。兩件事：韋沙斯死，還有把被韋沙斯扣著的沃瑞爾的結婚戒指，送去給塔倫米爾的莫尼卡，她也姓森加斯。剩下的你們自己想得到。\n\n韋沙斯不喜歡被打擾。我拿回了戒指，一路走到塔倫米爾。戒指很輕。路倒是很長。\n\n圖書館區有它自己的顧客。部落裡有一半的學者，似乎都想從那些書架上拿一本書，而十字軍守著他們的讀物，像守著黃金一樣。想不通為什麼。大部分內容都是在講怎麼殺光我們其他人。"
L["Raleigh the Devout wanted the Scarlet Monastery's leaders dead, in the name of the Light. Funny thing to ask, since they'd tell you they did everything in the name of the Light too. I didn't argue theology. I packed.\n\nThe Armory belonged to Herod, a big man with a bigger axe, who spun like a top and announced he'd been waiting for a real challenge. Happy to oblige. In the Cathedral we put down the Scarlet Commander, and High Inquisitor Whitemane swept in and raised him right back up, which hardly seems fair. So we did it again, both of them this time, and nobody got up.\n\nRaleigh thanked me in the name of the Light as well. The Light, I'm told, was very grateful."] = "虔誠的萊雷恩想要血色修道院的首領們死，以聖光之名。這要求挺好笑的，因為他們也會告訴你，他們做的每件事都是以聖光之名。我沒有跟他辯論神學。我打包行李。\n\n軍械庫是赫洛德的地盤，一個大個子拿著一把更大的斧頭，轉得像陀螺一樣，還宣布他一直在等一場真正的挑戰。樂意奉陪。在大教堂裡，我們打倒了血色十字軍指揮官，結果高階審判官懷特邁恩衝進來，把他又復活了，這實在不太公平。所以我們又打了一次，這次兩個一起，沒有人再站起來。\n\n萊雷恩也以聖光之名向我道謝。據說，聖光非常感激。"
L["When Varimathras asks you for something, you say yes, and you say it quickly. What the dreadlord wanted was the Scarlet Monastery's leadership dead, all four of them, kennel to altar.\n\nThe one I remember is the Cathedral. We put down the Scarlet Commander, and High Inquisitor Whitemane came in behind him and stood him right back up, which I thought was poor sportsmanship. So we knocked them both down together, and this time nobody got up. Herod, back in the Armory, had told us he'd been waiting for a real challenge. I hope we lived up to it.\n\nBack in the Royal Quarter I made my report. Varimathras looked pleased, which is the most worrying thing a dreadlord can do."] = "瓦里瑪薩斯要你做事的時候，你就說好，而且要說得很快。那位驚懼領主要的是血色修道院的領導層全部死光，四個都要，從犬舍一路到祭壇。\n\n我記得的是大教堂那一段。我們打倒了血色十字軍指揮官，高階審判官懷特邁恩就跟在後面進來，把他扶了起來，我覺得這實在很沒運動精神。所以我們把他們兩個一起打倒，這次沒有人再站起來。在軍械庫那邊的赫洛德說過，他一直在等一場真正的挑戰。希望我們沒讓他失望。\n\n回到皇家區，我做了報告。瓦里瑪薩斯看起來很滿意，這是一個驚懼領主能做出最令人擔心的事。"
L["Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff of the Argent Dawn wanted the Scarlet Archive in Stratholme burned and its archivist dead. Fine. Archives burn nicely.\n\nThe part worth telling came after. The Scarlet Bastion answers to the Grand Crusader, holiest man in the city. We hit him hard enough and he came apart into Balnazzar, a dreadlord, who'd been wearing the Grand Crusader the whole time like a borrowed tabard. Explains a few things about the Crusade, that. I brought the duke the head.\n\nThe duke would take Baron Rivendare's head too, from the dead side of town, if anyone was offering. Some folk collect spoons."] = "銀色黎明的尼古拉斯·瑟倫霍夫公爵想要燒掉斯坦索姆的血色十字軍文獻，順便解決文件管理員。沒問題。文獻燒起來很漂亮。\n\n值得講的是後面那部分。血色十字軍堡壘聽命於大十字軍，城裡最神聖的人。我們把他打得夠重，他就散開變成了巴納札爾，一個驚懼領主，一直把大十字軍當成借來的外袍穿在身上。這倒是解釋了十字軍的一些事。我把頭帶給了公爵。\n\n如果有人願意，公爵也很樂意收下瑞文戴爾男爵的頭，就在城裡亡者的那一半。有些人收集湯匙。"
L["Kirsta Deepshadow keeps to the north end of the Western Plaguelands and has a professional interest in the Scarlet Crusade. Unfinished business, Kirsta calls it, which is the kind of phrase that means somebody owes somebody blood. The first few jobs were a sampler of their outer lines, two of everything, like ordering off a menu.\n\nThe one worth telling is Hearthglen. Kirsta wanted the town itself measured, so I walked into a fortress full of Crusaders and went looking for somewhere high to stand and have a good long look. You'd think somebody would wonder what a stranger was doing up there. Nobody did.\n\nI came back with a count of everything they had. It wasn't a garrison. It was an army."] = "科爾斯塔·迪普沙東待在西瘟疫之地的北端，對血色十字軍有一種職業上的興趣。科爾斯塔管這叫「未了之事」，這種說法通常代表有人欠了某人血債。頭幾份工作是他們外圍防線的試吃拼盤，每樣兩個，像在照菜單點菜。\n\n值得講的是壁爐谷。科爾斯塔想要摸清整座城鎮的底細，所以我走進一座滿是十字軍的堡壘，找了個高處站著，好好看了很久。你會以為有人會好奇一個陌生人跑到那上面幹嘛。沒有人。\n\n我帶回了他們所有東西的數目。那不是一支駐軍。那是一支軍隊。"
L["Nathanos Blightcaller doesn't do small talk. I'd taken the Grand Crusader's orders off a dead Scarlet courier, and Nathanos had a better idea than reading them.\n\nHe handed me a rotten apple. One bite and I looked every inch a Scarlet Crusader, and off I went to Tyr's Hand to deliver those orders to the Crusader Lord in person. A whole town of zealots, and me strolling through it with the taste of bad fruit in my mouth. Nobody looked twice. The Crusader Lord took the orders and gave me plenty to carry back.\n\nWhat I brought Nathanos put the Scarlet Oracle, Demetria, on the road to Stratholme with an escort. She never got there."] = "納薩諾斯‧凋零者不閒聊。我從一個死掉的血色信差身上拿到了大十字軍的命令，而納薩諾斯有一個比讀它更好的主意。\n\n他遞給我一顆爛蘋果。咬一口，我看起來就完完全全是個血色十字軍，然後我就出發去提爾之手，親自把那些命令交給十字軍領主。一整座城鎮的狂熱分子，而我嘴裡帶著爛水果的味道，在裡面閒晃。沒有人多看一眼。十字軍領主收下命令，又給了我一大堆東西帶回去。\n\n我帶回去給納薩諾斯的東西，讓血色十字軍聖者德米提雅在護送下踏上了前往斯坦索姆的路。她始終沒到。"
L["Tirion Fordring lives alone in a cottage in the Eastern Plaguelands, and once he starts talking, you sit down. He lost his title and his home for standing up for the wrong orc, and his son Taelan grew up to be a Highlord of the Scarlet Crusade. Tirion wanted him back.\n\nSo I went collecting memories, the best of them a family painting hidden in Stratholme behind a picture of the twin moons. A hag at Uther's Tomb gave me a Scarlet face, and I walked into Hearthglen and handed Taelan his father's gift.\n\nIt worked. Taelan remembered, and we fought our way out together. On the road, Grand Inquisitor Isillien caught us. Taelan died there. Tirion arrived a moment too late, and Isillien didn't last long after."] = "提里奧·弗丁獨自住在東瘟疫之地的一間小屋裡，他一開口，你就會坐下來。他因為替錯的獸人挺身而出，失去了頭銜和家園，而他的兒子泰蘭長大後成了血色十字軍的大領主。提里奧想要把他找回來。\n\n所以我去收集回憶，其中最好的一件，是藏在斯坦索姆一幅雙月畫後面的一幅家族畫像。烏瑟之墓的一位巫女給了我一張血色十字軍的臉，我走進壁爐谷，把他父親的禮物交給了泰蘭。\n\n成功了。泰蘭想起來了，我們一起殺了出來。在路上，大審判官伊瑟利恩追上了我們。泰蘭死在那裡。提里奧晚了一步趕到，而伊瑟利恩在那之後也沒撐多久。"
L["Scholomance has one front door and nobody hands out keys, so you make your own. Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Camp had the recipe, and it was mostly a tour of the worst corners of the world: bones from the Plaguelands, a lava lake at the top of Fire Plume Ridge, a scarab off a summoner in Andorhal.\n\nThe best stop was Gadgetzan. A goblin called Krinkle Goodsteel would turn my bones into a key mold for fifteen gold. Mold rhymes with gold. I noticed. I paid.\n\nWhen it was all done, Arbington fitted the pieces together, handed me the Skeleton Key, and called it as certain to work as anything could be. Then suggested I go and find out.\n\nThat's an alchemist for you. Confident right up to the door."] = "通靈學院只有一扇前門，而且沒人會發鑰匙，所以你得自己做一把。冰風營地的化學家阿爾比頓有配方，而那基本上是一趟世界最糟角落之旅：瘟疫之地的骨頭、火羽山頂的熔岩湖、安多哈爾一個召喚師身上的聖甲蟲。\n\n最好的一站是加基森。一個叫克林科·古德斯迪爾的哥布林，願意用十五金幣把我的骨頭做成鑰匙模具。十五金幣一個模子，我看那模子大概是金子打的。這我注意到了。我付了。\n\n一切完成後，阿爾比頓把零件組在一起，把骷髏鑰匙交給我，說它絕對有效，就跟世上任何事一樣確定。然後建議我自己去試試看。\n\n化學家就是這樣。一路自信滿滿，直到門口為止。"
L["High Executor Derrington wanted me inside Scholomance, and Apothecary Dithers explained the catch. The door is locked, and the only key is one you build yourself, out of bones from the Plaguelands, a lava lake at the top of Fire Plume Ridge and a scarab from a summoner in Andorhal.\n\nThe bit I remember is Gadgetzan. A goblin called Krinkle Goodsteel would make the key mold, for fifteen gold. Mold, gold. I noticed. I paid anyway. You don't haggle with a goblin over something you can't make yourself.\n\nDithers put the pieces together and handed over the Skeleton Key, with a send-off about fame and power and laying waste to Scholomance.\n\nNow that's how you see somebody out the door."] = "高階執行官德靈頓要我進通靈學院，而藥劑師迪瑟斯解釋了其中的難處。門是鎖著的，唯一的鑰匙得你自己做，材料是瘟疫之地的骨頭、火羽山頂的熔岩湖，還有安多哈爾一個召喚師身上的聖甲蟲。\n\n我記得的是加基森那一段。一個叫克林科·古德斯迪爾的哥布林願意做鑰匙模具，收十五金幣。一個模子十五金幣，我看是金子打的吧。這我注意到了。我還是付了。自己做不出來的東西，你不會跟哥布林討價還價。\n\n迪瑟斯把零件組在一起，交出了骷髏鑰匙，還附上一段關於名聲、力量以及把通靈學院夷為平地的送別詞。\n\n這才叫送人出門。"
L["Caer Darrow is a town of ghosts, and one of the sadder ones is Eva Sarkhoff. Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher, had killed her family, and he was still at work in Scholomance.\n\nEva wanted him dead. Then she wanted her own remains burned, and her family's beside them. That's a strange thing to be asked by the person whose bones you'll be burning. I did it. It seemed to matter to her.\n\nHer last request came with a vial, the Blood of Innocents, and instructions: find the porch, put the blood in the brazier, and Kirtonos the Herald would come to feast upon my soul.\n\nKirtonos came. My soul is still with me. Kirtonos isn't."] = "凱爾達隆是一座鬼魂的小鎮，而其中比較令人難過的一個是艾瓦·薩克霍夫。屠夫瑟爾林·卡斯迪諾夫教授殺了她的家人，而他還在通靈學院裡工作。\n\n艾瓦要他死。然後她要我燒掉她自己的遺骸，還有她家人的遺骸，放在一起燒。被你要燒的那副骨頭的主人親口拜託，這種事感覺很奇怪。我照做了。這對她來說似乎很重要。\n\n她最後的請求附帶一個小瓶子，無辜者之血，還有指示：找到門廊，把血放進火盆裡，傳令官基爾圖諾斯就會前來吞噬我的靈魂。\n\n基爾圖諾斯來了。我的靈魂還在我身上。基爾圖諾斯不在了。"
L["Ras Frostwhisper haunts Scholomance, and Ras is a lich. Magistrate Marduke, another of Caer Darrow's ghosts, had a theory about liches. You don't kill one. You remind it that it used to be a man, and then you kill the man.\n\nSo I went looking for the man. In the ruins of Stromgarde I found his Keepsake of Remembrance. Leonid Barthalomew at Light's Hope knew what to do with it, and what to do was carry it into Stratholme and set it on the unholy ground called Menethil's Gift. I won't describe that place. You've either been or you're lucky.\n\nBack in Scholomance, I held the Soulbound Keepsake up to the lich, and for one moment Ras Frostwhisper was a mortal again.\n\nIt was a short moment. Marduke got the head."] = "萊斯·霜語在通靈學院裡作祟，而萊斯是一個巫妖。凱爾達隆的另一個鬼魂，馬杜克鎮長，對巫妖有一套理論。你不是去殺巫妖。你是去提醒它，它曾經是一個人，然後你殺掉那個人。\n\n所以我去找那個人。在激流堡的廢墟裡，我找到了巫妖生前的遺物。聖光之願禮拜堂的萊尼德·巴薩羅梅知道該怎麼處理它，而處理的方法，就是把它帶進斯坦索姆，放在一塊叫米奈希爾的禮物的邪惡土地上。那個地方我就不描述了。你要嘛去過，要嘛很幸運。\n\n回到通靈學院，我把禁錮靈魂的遺物舉到巫妖面前，有那麼一刻，萊斯·霜語又成了一個凡人。\n\n那一刻很短。馬杜克拿到了頭。"
L["Weldon Barov waits at Chillwind Camp for his family's fortune to come back to him. The fortune was in Scholomance, as four deeds: Caer Darrow, Brill, Tarren Mill and Southshore. Imagine owning Brill. Imagine wanting to.\n\nI brought him the deeds, and then he had one small family matter left over. His brother Alexi wanted the same fortune and was living at the Bulwark, in Horde territory. Weldon wanted Alexi's head. Alexi, he warned me, would be well protected by Horde filth.\n\nAlexi was, a bit. Not enough.\n\nI carried the head back to Chillwind, and that made Weldon the last Barov. Sounds grand. Mostly it means a smaller table at family dinners."] = "維爾頓·巴羅夫在冰風營地等著他家族的財產回到他手上。那份財產在通靈學院裡，是四張地契：凱爾達隆、布瑞爾、塔倫米爾和南海鎮。想像一下擁有布瑞爾。再想像一下居然會想要擁有它。\n\n我把地契帶給他，然後他還剩一件家族的小事。他的兄弟阿萊克斯想要同一份財產，住在部落領地的亡靈壁壘。維爾頓要阿萊克斯的頭。他警告我，阿萊克斯一定有部落的人渣嚴密保護著。\n\n阿萊克斯是有一點保護。不夠就是了。\n\n我把頭帶回冰風營地，這讓維爾頓成了最後一個巴羅夫。聽起來很氣派。其實大部分的意思是，家族聚餐的桌子變小了。"
L["Alexi Barov keeps to the Bulwark these days, and Alexi had a business proposal. The Barov fortune was lying about in Scholomance as four deeds: Caer Darrow, Brill, Tarren Mill and Southshore. Bring them home and the fortune was Alexi's again. Southshore included, for what that's worth.\n\nI brought them home. Then came the other half of the job. There was a brother, Weldon, down at Chillwind Camp with a claim to the very same papers, and Alexi wanted his head. Weldon, I was told, would be well protected by Alliance scum.\n\nLovely family. You could tell they were related.\n\nI walked into Chillwind and came out with the head, and Chillwind had some loud opinions about that. The last Barov. Alexi liked the sound of it."] = "阿萊克斯·巴羅夫最近都待在亡靈壁壘，而阿萊克斯有一個生意提案。巴羅夫家族的財產，以四張地契的形式散落在通靈學院裡：凱爾達隆、布瑞爾、塔倫米爾和南海鎮。把它們帶回來，財產就又是阿萊克斯的了。南海鎮也包括在內，雖然也不知道值多少。\n\n我把它們帶回來了。然後是工作的另一半。有個兄弟，維爾頓，在冰風營地，宣稱自己擁有同樣的文件，而阿萊克斯要他的頭。有人告訴我，維爾頓一定有聯盟的敗類嚴密保護著。\n\n好一個家族。一看就知道是親兄弟。\n\n我走進冰風營地，帶著頭走出來，冰風營地對此有一些很大聲的意見。最後一個巴羅夫。阿萊克斯很喜歡這個稱號的聲音。"
L["Sentinel Melyria Frostshadow had a problem with wolves. Wolves on two legs, up in the Howling Vale, where they had no business being. Worgen, in Ashenvale. The Sentinel thought an old book might explain it, the Tome of Mel'Thandris, and the book was right there in the Vale with the worgen.\n\nSo I went and read it. Not the most relaxing reading I've ever done.\n\nIt told a story, and not a happy one. A priestess named Velinde Starsong prayed for help against the demons, and the help she was given was the Scythe of Elune. Whatever she did with it, the worgen came after. Melyria liked that story about as much as I did, which is to say not at all."] = "哨兵梅麗瑞亞·霜影有一個狼的問題。兩條腿走路的狼，在狼嚎谷，牠們根本不該出現在那裡。狼人，在梣谷。哨兵認為一本古書也許能解釋這件事，《麥爾莎迪絲之書》，而那本書就在谷裡，跟狼人在一起。\n\n所以我去讀了。不是我讀過最輕鬆的讀物。\n\n它講了一個故事，而且不是快樂的故事。一位叫維琳德·星歌的女祭司祈求幫助對抗惡魔，而她得到的幫助是伊露恩之鐮。不管她用它做了什麼，接著就來了狼人。梅麗瑞亞對這個故事的喜歡程度跟我差不多，也就是一點也不喜歡。"
L["Darnassus remembered Velinde fondly. Melyria sent me to Thyn'tel Bladeweaver on the Warrior's Terrace, and Thyn'tel handed me the key to Velinde's chest, which had sat in storage since she left.\n\nGoing through somebody else's chest feels like burglary, even with the key. I found what I was after, Velinde's journal, and brought it back with the key.\n\nIt wasn't a confession, exactly. Velinde had used the scythe and the worgen had come, and then she couldn't hold them. So she'd gone looking for help, somewhere a long way from Ashenvale. The journal knew where she'd meant to go. It didn't know whether she'd got there. Neither did anybody in Darnassus."] = "達納蘇斯對維琳德的記憶很美好。梅麗瑞亞要我去戰士區找塞恩提爾·刃紋，塞恩提爾交給我維琳德那只箱子的鑰匙，那箱子從她離開之後就一直收在倉庫裡。\n\n翻別人的箱子，就算有鑰匙，感覺還是像在闖空門。我找到了要找的東西，維琳德的日記，連同鑰匙一起帶了回去。\n\n那不算是一份自白。維琳德用了那把鐮刀，狼人就來了，然後她控制不住牠們。所以她出發去尋求幫助，去一個離梣谷很遠很遠的地方。日記知道她打算去哪裡。日記不知道她到底有沒有到。達納蘇斯也沒有人知道。"
L["Velinde's trail started at the docks. Thyn'tel sent me to Ratchet, and the wharfmaster there remembered Velinde taking passage to Booty Bay. So I took passage to Booty Bay. Following a priestess's travel plans across the world is a strange way to spend your days.\n\nIn Booty Bay the caravan records had her on the road north. Up through Stranglethorn. Toward Duskwood.\n\nNobody goes to Duskwood on purpose. Velinde apparently did, so I did too, and the road north was as friendly as it always is, which is not at all. At the end of it was Darkshire, where the sun doesn't bother."] = "維琳德的蹤跡從碼頭開始。塞恩提爾把我送去棘齒城，那裡的碼頭管理員記得維琳德搭船去了藏寶海灣。所以我也搭船去了藏寶海灣。跨越整個世界去追一位女祭司的行程，真是一種奇怪的過日子方式。\n\n在藏寶海灣，商隊紀錄顯示她往北走了。穿過荊棘谷。往暮色森林去。\n\n沒有人會故意去暮色森林。顯然維琳德去了，所以我也去了，而往北的那條路就跟往常一樣友善，也就是一點都不友善。路的盡頭是夜色鎮，一個連太陽都懶得露臉的地方。"
L["Clerk Daltry had no Velinde in any of the Darkshire records. What Daltry did have was a name: Jonathan Carevin. The Carevins hunt the things in Duskwood's woods and have done for a long while, and if anybody in town knew about worgen, it'd be them.\n\nCarevin wasn't thrilled to have a stranger asking about the Scythe of Elune. Fair enough. But we came to an arrangement: whatever I found out there, Darkshire would hear about it too.\n\nWhat I found was in Roland's Doom, an old mine I'd rather not go back to, under a mound of dirt. Not the scythe. Evidence of it. Proof it had been there, in Duskwood, a very long way from home. I took it back to Carevin as promised."] = "書記員達爾塔在夜色鎮的任何紀錄裡都找不到維琳德。但達爾塔手上有一個名字：喬納森·卡爾文。卡爾文家族在暮色森林裡獵殺那些東西，已經很久很久了，如果鎮上有誰懂狼人，就是他們。\n\n卡爾文對一個陌生人跑來打聽伊露恩之鐮，並不怎麼高興。這很合理。但我們達成了協議：不管我在外面找到什麼，夜色鎮也會知道。\n\n我找到的東西在羅蘭之墓，一座我寧可不要再回去的老礦坑，埋在一堆土底下。不是鐮刀。是它的證據。證明它曾經在那裡，在暮色森林，離家非常非常遠。我照約定把它帶回去給卡爾文。"
L["Darnassus again. Carevin sent me back to Thyn'tel Bladeweaver with what I'd found, and that's a long way to carry an answer nobody's going to like.\n\nThyn'tel heard me out. The scythe had been in Duskwood. Velinde's trail had come apart somewhere around Roland's Doom. And whatever she'd called up with it was still loose in the world, in more forests than one.\n\nThyn'tel thanked me and meant it, and looked as uneasy as I've ever seen anyone look while saying thank you. I understood. We had answers now. That was the trouble. None of them came with the scythe attached, and the scythe was still out there somewhere.\n\nI've followed a lot of trails. That's the only one that crossed the whole world and finished on a question."] = "又是達納蘇斯。卡爾文要我帶著找到的東西回去找塞恩提爾·刃紋，帶著一個沒人會喜歡的答案走那麼遠，真的很遠。\n\n塞恩提爾聽我說完。鐮刀曾經在暮色森林。維琳德的蹤跡在羅蘭之墓附近某處斷了。而不管她用它召喚出了什麼，那東西仍然在這個世界上到處遊蕩，而且不只在一座森林裡。\n\n塞恩提爾向我道謝，是真心的，但說謝謝的時候，看起來是我見過最不安的人。我能理解。我們現在有答案了。麻煩就在這裡。沒有一個答案附帶著那把鐮刀，而那把鐮刀還在外面某個地方。\n\n我追過很多條線索。只有這一條橫跨了整個世界，最後停在一個問號上。"
L["The Shady Rest was an inn on the road between the Barrens and Dustwallow Marsh, and by the time I saw it, it was a black heap. Captain Garran Vimes in Theramore wanted to know who'd done it. So did everyone else, and everyone else already had a theory.\n\nIn the mud outside were hoofprints. Not a horse's. Bring that back to Theramore and you can hear the room decide what happened before you've finished the sentence.\n\nVimes listened, though, and didn't decide anything. Good instinct, as it turned out. There was a lot more in that ash than hoofprints, and none of it agreed with the rest."] = "樹蔭旅店曾經是一間旅店，在貧瘠之地和塵泥沼澤之間的路上，等我見到它的時候，已經是一堆焦黑的廢墟。塞拉摩的蓋蘭·維米斯隊長想知道是誰幹的。其他所有人也想知道，而且其他所有人都已經有了自己的理論。\n\n外面的泥巴裡有蹄印。不是馬的。把這個帶回塞拉摩，你一句話還沒講完，就能聽見整個房間已經替這件事下了結論。\n\n不過維米斯聽完了，什麼結論也沒下。事後證明，這是很好的直覺。那堆灰燼裡還有很多東西，不只蹄印，而且彼此對不上。"
L["In what was left of the fireplace sat a shield. Black iron, scorched through, and far too big for a human arm. You can imagine how that went down in Theramore.\n\nVimes didn't jump at it. Instead I was sent across town to Caz Twosprocket at the smithy, to see what the metal had to say for itself. Caz turned it over and over, gave it the long look smiths save for other people's work, and the verdict was: not made here. Not in Theramore. Past that, nobody would swear to anything.\n\nI carried the verdict back to Vimes. It looked bad for the Horde, and that was what bothered me. A shield that big, left lying right where the first person to poke the ashes would find it. It felt like somebody wanted it found."] = "壁爐剩下的部分裡放著一面盾牌。燒黑的鐵盾，整個燒穿了，對人類的手臂來說太大了。你可以想像這在塞拉摩引起了什麼反應。\n\n維米斯沒有馬上跳起來。他反而把我派到鎮子另一頭的鐵匠鋪去找卡茲·雙鏈，看看這塊金屬自己怎麼說。卡茲把它翻來翻去，用鐵匠專門留給別人作品的那種眼神盯了好久，結論是：不是這裡做的。不是塞拉摩做的。除此之外，沒有人敢發誓任何事。\n\n我把結論帶回去給維米斯。這看起來對部落很不利，而這正是讓我不舒服的地方。一面那麼大的盾牌，就丟在第一個去翻灰燼的人一定會找到的地方。感覺就像有人希望它被找到。"
L["The badge in the ashes belonged to Lieutenant Paval Reethe of the Theramore Guard. The records said Reethe had been one of Daelin's men. Admiral Proudmoore's, that is, from before his daughter made peace with the orcs. Plenty of those fellows never forgave her for it, and Reethe had walked off the job.\n\nWhere do deserters go in Dustwallow? Lost Point, it turns out, to a crew of former Theramore soldiers with no love left for their old command. Their leader gave me Reethe's story in the end.\n\nI brought it back to Vimes. Reethe had reasons to hate the Horde, and Reethe's badge had been at the inn. On paper, that's a case. In person it was too neat. Nobody makes lieutenant by dropping a badge at the scene."] = "灰燼裡的那枚徽章，屬於塞拉摩衛兵的帕瓦爾·雷瑟上尉。紀錄上說，雷瑟曾經是戴林的人。也就是普勞德摩爾上將的人，在他女兒跟獸人講和之前。那些傢伙裡有很多人始終沒原諒她，而雷瑟就這樣丟下差事走人了。\n\n在塵泥沼澤，逃兵都去哪裡？原來是廢棄哨塔，投靠一群前塞拉摩士兵，他們對自己的老長官早就沒有任何感情了。最後，他們的頭頭把雷瑟的故事告訴了我。\n\n我把它帶回去給維米斯。雷瑟有理由恨部落，而雷瑟的徽章出現在旅店。寫在紙上，這就是一樁案子。當面看，就太整齊了。沒有人是靠在現場掉徽章當上上尉的。"
L["Vimes had one more lead, and it went north to the captain at North Point Tower, who had a nasty suspicion about the Grimtotem. That's the tauren clan that hates everybody. A battle plan, a note and an armful of armaments out of Blackhoof Village later, the suspicion had teeth. The Grimtotem had burned the Shady Rest and dressed it up to look like the Horde, then sat back to watch Theramore and the Horde go for each other.\n\nTabetha, out at her farm, knew where to hit back: Direhorn Post. I burned three tents there and slept fine that night.\n\nAfterwards Vimes gave me a wreath, and I laid it at the Hyal family monument. Quiet spot. I stayed a minute."] = "維米斯還有最後一條線索，往北通到北點哨塔的隊長那裡，那位隊長對恐怖圖騰有個很不妙的懷疑。恐怖圖騰就是那個看誰都不順眼的牛頭人氏族。從黑蹄村拿到一份作戰計畫、一張字條和一大把武器之後，那個懷疑就長出了牙齒。恐怖圖騰燒了樹蔭旅店，把現場布置成部落幹的樣子，然後坐在一旁看塞拉摩和部落互相廝殺。\n\n在自家農場的塔貝薩知道該往哪裡反擊：恐角崗哨。我在那裡燒了三頂帳篷，那天晚上睡得很好。\n\n事後維米斯給了我一個花圈，我把它放在海亞爾一家的紀念碑前。很安靜的地方。我在那裡待了一會兒。"
L["Word travels fast when an inn burns down and somebody says the Horde did it. The Shady Rest sat on the road between the Barrens and Dustwallow, and when I got there it was ash and a few black beams.\n\nIn the mud outside were hoofprints. Tauren-sized. Exactly what you'd want to find, if you wanted Theramore to blame the Horde. I took that to Krog in Brackenwall Village, who had orders to look into the fire and no intention of letting Theramore tell the story first.\n\nThere was more in those ashes, too. A blackened shield. A Theramore guard's badge. Every clue pointed somewhere different, and every one of them pointed somewhere awfully convenient."] = "一間旅店燒掉了，又有人說是部落幹的，這種消息傳得很快。樹蔭旅店就在貧瘠之地和塵泥沼澤之間的路上，等我到的時候，只剩灰燼和幾根焦黑的樑柱。\n\n外面的泥巴裡有蹄印。牛頭人大小的。如果你想讓塞拉摩怪罪部落，這正是你會希望被找到的東西。我把這件事帶去蕨牆村給克羅格，他奉命調查這場火，而且完全不打算讓塞拉摩搶先把故事說完。\n\n那堆灰燼裡還有更多東西。一面燒黑的盾牌。一枚塞拉摩衛兵的徽章。每一條線索都指向不同的地方，而每一條都指向一個方便得過頭的地方。"
L["Black iron, scorched, heavy enough to stop a charging kodo: that was the shield in the fireplace. Krog sent me to Do'gol with it, and Do'gol wanted six acidic venom sacs before anything else happened. I fetched them. Do'gol did whatever you do to a shield with acid, and I carried the thing back to Krog.\n\nKrog wanted another opinion and sent me all the way to Thunder Bluff to show it to Mosarn. That's a long way to carry a shield. You get attached.\n\nMosarn knew the craft, and that should have settled it. It didn't, for me. A shield can be carried into an inn by anybody. It can be left behind by anybody, too, right where somebody's bound to find it."] = "燒黑的鐵，烤得焦焦的，重到足以擋住一頭衝鋒的科多獸：這就是壁爐裡的那面盾牌。克羅格要我帶著它去找杜高爾，而杜高爾在做任何事之前，先要六個酸性毒囊。我拿回來了。杜高爾對盾牌做了某種用酸處理的事，我再把那東西扛回去給克羅格。\n\n克羅格想聽聽別人的意見，又把我一路送到雷霆崖給莫薩恩看。扛著一面盾牌走那麼遠。扛久了，還真會有感情。\n\n莫薩恩認得那手工藝，照理說這就該定案了。但對我來說沒有。一面盾牌，誰都能把它帶進旅店。也誰都能把它留下，就留在某人一定會找到的地方。"
L["There was a badge in the ashes as well, Theramore Guard, belonging to a Lieutenant Paval Reethe. I brought it to Krog, and the next thing I knew I was out in the marsh with Ogron, going to ask Reethe a few questions.\n\nOgron did the asking, after a fashion. Reethe was cornered and jumpy and in no mood to chat, and it went the way these things go when everybody in the conversation is armed. Reethe didn't walk away from it.\n\nSo that was our suspect: dead, and quickly. Very tidy. A bit too tidy for my liking. If you wanted a case closed before anyone asked the next question, you couldn't have arranged it better."] = "灰燼裡還有一枚徽章，塞拉摩衛兵的，屬於一位帕瓦爾·雷瑟上尉。我把它帶給克羅格，下一刻，我就跟著奧格隆到了沼澤裡，要去問雷瑟幾個問題。\n\n問話的是奧格隆，某種意義上的問話。雷瑟被逼到牆角，神經緊繃，完全沒有聊天的心情，而事情就照著所有在場的人都帶著武器時會有的方式發展。雷瑟沒能活著離開。\n\n所以這就是我們的嫌犯：死了，而且死得很快。非常乾淨俐落。對我來說有點太乾淨俐落了。如果你想在任何人問出下一個問題之前就結案，再也安排不出比這更好的了。"
L["Mosarn remembered something about that shield and sent me back to Krog with it. Krog had me fetch Blackhoof armaments and a Grimtotem battle plan, and laid side by side, it all came together. The Grimtotem had burned the Shady Rest and left the Horde holding the torch, so that Theramore and Brackenwall would go for each other while the Grimtotem sat back and watched.\n\nTabetha, of all people, knew where the attack had come from: Direhorn Post. A human mage pointing me at a tauren camp. Strange times. I burned the north tent, the east tent and the northeast tent, and walked off with the smoke at my back.\n\nKrog called it justice. I called it a long week."] = "莫薩恩想起了關於那面盾牌的某件事，就把我送回去找克羅格。克羅格要我去拿黑蹄村的武器和一份恐怖圖騰的作戰計畫，把它們並排放在一起，一切就拼湊起來了。恐怖圖騰燒了樹蔭旅店，讓部落背黑鍋，好讓塞拉摩和蕨牆村互相廝殺，而恐怖圖騰坐在一旁看戲。\n\n偏偏是塔貝薩知道攻擊是從哪裡來的：恐角崗哨。一個人類法師把我指向一座牛頭人營地。世道真奇怪。我燒了北邊的帳篷、東邊的帳篷和東北邊的帳篷，然後背著濃煙走人。\n\n克羅格管這叫正義。我管這叫漫長的七天。"
L["It started with a crumpled map in the Badlands and a note on it saying Hammertoe Grez was alive. Hammertoe was, too, down in Uldaman, and missing an amulet. I got it back.\n\nThen the amulet went on tour: to a prospector in the Badlands, to a historian in Ironforge, to an advisor by way of a note, and back to the historian again. Every leg of it, I should say, walked by me.\n\nAt the end of all that walking, somebody finally handed me a proper job. Kill Ambassador Infernus in Angor Fortress, bring back proof, then go down into Uldaman again for the Tablet of Will before the Shadowforge got to it.\n\nCourier, soldier, treasure hunter. I'd never been all three on one errand before."] = "一切從荒蕪之地的一張皺巴巴的地圖開始，上面有一張紙條，說鐵趾格雷茲還活著。鐵趾確實還活著，在奧達曼裡面，還少了一個護符。我把它拿了回來。\n\n然後那個護符就開始巡迴：送到荒蕪之地的一個勘查員那裡，送到鐵爐堡的一位歷史學家那裡，靠一張紙條轉到一位顧問那裡，再送回那位歷史學家那裡。我得說，每一段路都是我走的。\n\n走完這一大圈之後，終於有人交給我一份像樣的工作。去苦痛堡壘殺掉因弗努斯大使，帶回證據，然後再下一次奧達曼，搶在暗影矮人之前拿到意志石板。\n\n信差、士兵、尋寶人。我從來沒有在同一件差事裡同時當過這三種人。"
L["Somewhere in Uldaman I picked up a shattered necklace. Fine work, badly broken. A thing like that has a maker, so I went looking and found him in Ironforge: Talvash del Kissel. He'd tell me all about it, for five silver bars.\n\nI paid a man to tell me about his own necklace. Moving on.\n\nHis story sent me back into Uldaman, to what was left of a paladin and a journal saying where the gems had gone. Three gems, three corners of the dig, one of them in the fist of the trogg leader, who didn't let go easily. Talvash had given me a Phial of Scrying, so I could report from down there without the walk.\n\nLast, he wanted a power source off the strongest construct in the place. That was Archaedas. Talvash got his necklace back together. I got a story."] = "我在奧達曼某處撿到一條碎掉的項鍊。做工精細，壞得很徹底。這種東西一定有個製作者，所以我去找，在鐵爐堡找到了他：塔瓦斯德·基瑟爾。他願意把一切都告訴我，只要五根銀錠。\n\n我付錢請一個人告訴我他自己的項鍊的事。好，下一個話題。\n\n他的故事把我送回奧達曼，找到一位聖騎士的遺骸，還有一本日記，寫著寶石都去了哪裡。三顆寶石，挖掘場的三個角落，其中一顆握在石齶怪首領的拳頭裡，他可不肯輕易鬆手。塔瓦斯德給了我一個占卜之瓶，讓我可以從下面直接回報，不用走回去。\n\n最後，他要從那裡最強大的構造體身上拿一個能量源。那就是阿扎達斯。塔瓦斯德把他的項鍊拼回去了。我得到了一個故事。"
L["Dran Droffers runs a salvage business in Orgrimmar, Droffers and Son, and had heard about a valuable necklace somewhere in the Uldaman dig site. Probably damaged. Droffers didn't mind damaged.\n\nI found it, and it was. No gems. Down in the depths I found what was left of a paladin, and a journal that said where the gems had gone, and I couldn't read a word of it. The nearest translator was Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath, who'd do it in exchange for borrowing the necklace. Everybody wants a little something.\n\nThree gems and a power source later, the last of them pried off the strongest construct in Uldaman, I'd worn a groove in the road between Kargath and Orgrimmar, and Droffers had the necklace and the gem salvage.\n\nIn that trade, everything's salvage eventually."] = "德蘭·杜佛斯在奧格瑪做回收生意，店叫德洛佛父子回收站，他聽說奧達曼挖掘場的某處有一條值錢的項鍊。大概壞了。杜佛斯不介意壞的。\n\n我找到了，而且確實壞了。寶石都沒了。在深處，我找到一位聖騎士的遺骸，還有一本日記，寫著寶石去了哪裡，而我一個字都看不懂。最近的翻譯是卡加斯的加卡爾，條件是要借項鍊去用一用。每個人都想要分一點好處。\n\n三顆寶石加上一個能量源之後，最後那個是從奧達曼最強大的構造體身上撬下來的，我已經在卡加斯和奧格瑪之間的路上踩出了一條溝，而杜佛斯拿到了項鍊和寶石的回收品。\n\n在那一行，所有東西最後都會變成回收品。"
L["Past Archaedas, at the very bottom of Uldaman, sits a stone watcher that has been waiting a very long time for someone to ask it a question. I asked. It answered at length. Then I woke the Discs of Norgannon, and they answered at greater length.\n\nThe short of it: the titans shaped the world, and they made the earthen out of stone to look after it. Over the ages the earthen went soft and became something else. You've met the result. They run Ironforge.\n\nI came away with a miniature copy of the discs and took it to the Explorers' League in Ironforge. Proof of where the dwarves came from, small enough to carry under one arm.\n\nMy reward was a voucher for Dinita Stonemantle in the Vault. I found out where a whole people came from and got paid by the bank."] = "在阿扎達斯後面，奧達曼的最底層，坐著一個石頭守護者，它已經等了很久很久，等有人來問它一個問題。我問了。它回答得很長。然後我喚醒了諾甘農圓盤，圓盤回答得更長。\n\n簡單說：泰坦塑造了這個世界，然後用石頭做出了土靈來照顧它。經過漫長的歲月，土靈變得柔軟，成了別的東西。結果你們都見過了。他們在經營鐵爐堡。\n\n我帶著一份迷你版的圓盤離開，把它交給鐵爐堡的探險者協會。矮人從哪裡來的證據，小到可以夾在一隻手臂底下。\n\n我的報酬是一張憑證，要去銀行找丁尼塔·石衣領。我查出了一整個民族的起源，結果是銀行付我錢。"
L["Behind Archaedas, at the bottom of Uldaman, a stone watcher sits waiting for someone with questions. I had a few. It had very old answers, and when it ran out, I woke the Discs of Norgannon for the rest.\n\nHere's the gist. The titans shaped the world and made the earthen out of stone to tend it, and over the ages the earthen softened into flesh. Into dwarves, as it happens. All those dwarves digging up the Badlands were digging up their own family history and didn't know it.\n\nI came away with a miniature copy of the discs and took it to Thunder Bluff, to Sage Truthseeker, who understood exactly what it was.\n\nThen I was handed a voucher for Bena Winterhoof. Secrets of creation, paid out in a slip of paper. I took it. Paper spends."] = "在阿扎達斯後面，奧達曼的底層，坐著一個石頭守護者，在等一個帶著問題的人。我剛好有幾個。它有非常古老的答案，等它答完了，我就喚醒諾甘農圓盤來回答剩下的。\n\n重點是這樣的。泰坦塑造了這個世界，用石頭做出土靈來照料它，而經過漫長的歲月，土靈軟化成了血肉。剛好就是矮人。那些在荒蕪之地挖東挖西的矮人，挖的其實是自己的家族史，只是他們自己不知道。\n\n我帶著一份迷你版的圓盤離開，把它帶到雷霆崖，交給聖者圖希克，他完全明白那是什麼。\n\n然後我拿到一張憑證，要去找貝娜·冰蹄領。創世的秘密，用一張紙條支付。我收下了。紙條也是能花的。"
L["Your trainer says the call has come: the spirit of the bear will see you. Spirits are never in a hurry, and a bear's spirit least of all. Go where you're sent, and take your time. It will."] = "你的訓練師說，時候到了：巨熊之靈願意見你。先靈從不趕時間，熊的靈魂更是如此。照指示去吧，不用急。反正牠也不急。"
L["Your trainer sends you to Moonglade, where Dendrite Starblaze has a new lesson waiting. This one is about healing, and the Circle doesn't teach healing from a book. Bring patience, and good boots."] = "你的訓練師派你前往月光林地，德迪利特·星焰在那裡準備了新的一課。這次講的是治療，而塞納里奧議會可不是照著書本教治療的。帶上耐心，還有一雙好靴子。"
L["Your trainer has another lesson for you, and Dendrite Starblaze in Moonglade will give it. This one is about water, so you will get wet. Druids teach the way water moves: slowly, and never in a straight line."] = "你的訓練師又有一課要教你，由月光林地的德迪利特·星焰來上。這次是關於水的，所以你一定會弄濕。德魯伊教東西的方式就跟水流一樣：慢慢來，而且從不走直線。"
L["Dendrite Starblaze wants you in Moonglade. There's someone to meet: the spirit of a great cat, out in the southern hills. Cats are particular about whom they teach, and they take their time deciding."] = "德迪利特·星焰要你到月光林地一趟。有人要見你：巨豹之靈，就在南邊的山丘上。貓挑學生是很挑剔的，而且決定之前會考慮很久。"
L["Your trainer says a hunter shouldn't hunt alone, and knows who has a taming rod for you. There are beasts to try it on, and none of them asked to be tamed. Whether any of them follows you home is up to you."] = "你的訓練師說，獵人不該獨自狩獵，而且知道誰那裡有一根馴獸棒可以給你。有幾頭野獸等著你去試，而牠們沒有一頭說過想被馴服。最後有沒有哪一頭會跟你回家，就看你了。"
L["If you ever bring the Ancient Petrified Leaf out of Molten Core, know that it belongs to someone. It looks like nothing much, and it's a big world. Start your search in Felwood."] = "如果你哪天從熔火之心帶出了古代石化葉片，要知道它是有主人的。它看起來沒什麼特別，而世界很大。從費伍德森林開始找吧。"
L["Belann Windwood in Valanaar has made staves and wands for the High Order's mages for more than a century, and now it's your turn to visit. Belann keeps one of the order's oldest traditions. It asks for a fallen bough, and Belann is particular."] = "瓦拉納爾的貝藍‧風木替高天盟的法師打造法杖和魔杖已經超過一百年，現在輪到你登門拜訪了。貝藍守著教團最古老的傳統之一。這個傳統需要一根落下的樹枝，而貝藍很挑剔。"
L["Your trainer says it's time you met Tabetha. She lives out in Dustwallow Marsh, far from any library, and she's where trainers send a mage once book learning stops being enough."] = "你的訓練師說，是時候讓你見見塔貝薩了。她住在塵泥沼澤，離任何圖書館都很遠，當書本上的學問已經不夠用時，訓練師就會把法師送到她那裡。"
L["Archmage Xylem lives in a tower atop the cliffs of Azshara, about as far from anyone as a tower can get. Xylem wants a Prismatic Shell, and a warlord named Krellian has one. Archmages call this research."] = "大法師克希雷姆住在艾薩拉懸崖頂上的一座塔裡，大概是一座塔能離人群最遠的距離了。克希雷姆想要一個稜彩貝殼，而一個叫克雷利安的軍閥手上就有一個。大法師管這叫做研究。"
L["Deep in Dire Maul, Lorekeeper Lydros still keeps the Athenaeum, and still knows a spell or two worth learning. The price is the essence of Hydrospawn, a water elemental loose in the Warpwood Quarter. Lydros calls that a fair trade."] = "在厄運之槌深處，博學者萊德羅斯依然守著圖書館，也依然懂得一兩個值得學的法術。代價是海多斯博恩的精華，一隻在扭木廣場亂跑的水元素。萊德羅斯覺得這筆交易很公平。"
L["In Deathknell, Aramis Hammerhand teaches what the Light still asks of a paladin, and Aramis isn't one for long lectures. The Deathguard nearby are hurt, the Light heals, and you know the words. Start there."] = "在喪鐘鎮，阿拉米斯‧錘手教導聖光依然對聖騎士有什麼要求，而阿拉米斯不愛長篇大論。附近的亡靈衛兵受了傷，聖光能治癒，而你知道該怎麼唸。就從那裡開始吧。"
L["Shari Stilwell in Brill has directions for you: head west until Tirisfal runs out, and look for Bandarion Keep. Paladins are making a home there. Report to Breton Samuels when you arrive."] = "布瑞爾的夏莉‧斯迪威爾有路線要告訴你：一直往西走，走到提里斯法的盡頭，找到班達利昂要塞。聖騎士們正在那裡建立家園。到了之後，向布瑞頓‧山繆斯報到。"
L["Danitha Morr has a lesson for you about doing good for its own sake, with nobody watching and nothing to gain. It begins in the Undercity, where Tanis Alderwood could use a hand."] = "丹妮莎‧莫爾要給你上一課，關於為善而行善，沒有人在看，也沒有任何好處可拿。這一課從幽暗城開始，塔尼斯·奧德伍德那裡正需要人幫忙。"
L["Danitha Morr sees a chance for Bandarion Keep to prove its worth to the Horde: two Earthen Ring travelers have gone missing in Silverpine Forest. Go to the Sepulcher and ask Trevan Rol what's known."] = "丹妮莎‧莫爾看到一個讓班達利昂要塞向部落證明自身價值的機會：兩名陶土議會的旅人在銀松森林失蹤了。前往瑟伯切爾，問問崔凡‧羅爾目前知道些什麼。"
L["Duthorian Rall at Stormwind's Cathedral of Light has a tome for you, and a question to go with it: when evil walks into your lands, will you be strong enough? Rall means to find out."] = "暴風城光明大教堂的達索瑞恩·拉爾有一本書要給你，還附帶一個問題：當邪惡走進你的土地，你夠不夠堅強？拉爾打算親自查個清楚。"
L["Your trainer has another test for you, and it waits at Jordan Stilwell's forge, just outside the gates of Ironforge. Jordan needs a paladin who doesn't mind a long road and a heavy pack."] = "你的訓練師還有一項考驗要給你，地點在喬丹·斯迪威爾的熔爐，就在鐵爐堡的大門外。喬丹需要一位不介意長途跋涉、背著重擔的聖騎士。"
L["A summons from Danitha Morr: come home to Bandarion Keep. You've covered a lot of ground in the Light's service by now, and Danitha has noticed. So, it seems, have your boots."] = "丹妮莎‧莫爾的召喚：回班達利昂要塞來。你為了聖光已經走過很多路，丹妮莎注意到了。看來你的靴子也注意到了。"
L["Your trainer sends you to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District. Grayson keeps an old rite for paladins who have carried the Light a long way. It asks a great deal, and Grayson will want to see you're ready."] = "你的訓練師派你去暴風城教堂區找格雷森·沙東布瑞克公爵。格雷森保存著一項古老的儀式，留給那些背負聖光走過漫長道路的聖騎士。這項儀式要求很多，而格雷森會想確認你已經準備好了。"
L["Danitha Morr has sent for you again. Your warhorse has carried you a long way, but the order keeps an older rite for paladins who have proven themselves, and Danitha thinks it's your turn. Bandarion Keep, then."] = "丹妮莎‧莫爾又派人來找你了。你的戰馬已經載你走了很遠，但騎士團還保留著一項更古老的儀式，留給證明過自己的聖騎士，而丹妮莎認為輪到你了。那就去班達利昂要塞吧。"
L["If you ever bring the Eye of Divinity out of Molten Core, carry it to the Eastern Plaguelands. Eris Havenfire waits there for a priest who has it, with a trial that asks for more than bright prayers."] = "如果你哪天從熔火之心帶出了神性之眼，就把它帶到東瘟疫之地。艾瑞斯·哈文法在那裡等著擁有它的牧師，帶著一場光靠虔誠祈禱可過不了的試煉。"
L["Master Mathias Shaw at SI:7 has a job for you in Westfall. Find Agent Kearnen out there for a briefing. Kearnen has been watching the Defias, and Shaw wants to see how you handle yourself."] = "軍情七處的馬迪亞斯‧肖爾大師在西部荒野有份工作給你。去那裡找密探吉爾妮聽取簡報。吉爾妮一直在監視迪菲亞，而肖爾想看看你的身手如何。"
L["Shenthul, down in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar, has Shattered Hand work for a rogue. Before anything else, you learn the salute. The Shattered Hand likes its business quiet and its greetings complicated."] = "奧格瑪暗影裂口的申蘇爾，有碎手氏族的工作要交給盜賊。在做任何事之前，你得先學會軍禮。碎手氏族喜歡低調做事，打招呼卻搞得很複雜。"
L["A letter turns up in your mailbox. No name. Just a cabin outside Pyrewood Village and one letter at the bottom: C. Somebody wants a rogue who works alone."] = "你的信箱裡出現了一封信。沒有署名。只有焚木村外的一間小屋，還有底下一個字母：C。有人想找一個單獨行動的盜賊。"
L["Your trainer slips you a seal with a raven on it. Take it to Fahrad at Ravenholdt Manor, hidden in the hills of Hillsbrad. Be ready: your cunning gets tested on the way."] = "你的訓練師偷偷塞給你一枚印著烏鴉的印記。把它帶給拉文霍德莊園的法拉德，莊園藏在希爾斯布萊德的山丘裡。做好準備：路上會考驗你的狡詐。"
L["Your trainer slips you a seal with a raven on it, for Fahrad at Ravenholdt Manor in the hills of Hillsbrad. Mind the test on the way in. Inside, Myrokos Silentform has a quarrel with the Syndicate, and work."] = "你的訓練師偷偷塞給你一枚印著烏鴉的印記，要交給希爾斯布萊德山丘裡拉文霍德莊園的法拉德。進門時小心那場考驗。進去之後，麥洛克斯跟辛迪加有過節，也有工作。"
L["A letter from Ravenholdt this time. Fahrad wants a word about the jobs you've been taking. He doesn't say why."] = "這次是拉文霍德寄來的信。法拉德想跟你談談你最近接的那些工作。他沒說為什麼。"
L["Your trainer thinks you're ready to meet the earth. The earth is patient and expects the same of you, so there will be an errand or two before it has anything to say."] = "你的訓練師認為你已經準備好去見大地了。大地很有耐心，也期望你一樣有耐心，所以在它開口之前，得先跑一兩件差事。"
L["Your trainer says it's time to call fire. Fire is the least patient of the elements and the quickest to test you, so keep your wits about you. Your trainer will tell you who to find first."] = "你的訓練師說，是時候召喚火焰了。火是最沒耐心的元素，也最快來考驗你，所以保持清醒。你的訓練師會告訴你先去找誰。"
L["Water is next, and the way to it starts with Norric Lochthane in Loch Modan. Of the four elements, water is the patient one, and it likes its students patient too. Pack for a long trip."] = "接下來是水，而通往水的路從洛克莫丹的諾里克‧洛克賽恩開始。四種元素裡，水是最有耐心的一個，它也喜歡有耐心的學生。準備好長途旅行吧。"
L["Your trainer says water is next and sends you to Islen Waterseer in the Barrens. Of the four elements, water is the patient one, and it likes its students patient too. Pack for a long trip."] = "你的訓練師說接下來是水，派你去貧瘠之地找水之先知伊斯倫。四種元素裡，水是最有耐心的一個，它也喜歡有耐心的學生。準備好長途旅行吧。"
L["Air is the last of the four elements, and the hardest to pin down. Your road to it starts with Veyric Thunderhame in the Arathi Highlands, who has work for a shaman."] = "空氣是四元素中的最後一個，也是最難捉摸的一個。你通往它的路，從阿拉希高地的維里克‧雷鎚開始，他有工作要交給薩滿。"
L["Air is the last of the four elements, and your trainer sends you to Thousand Needles to find Prate Cloudseer. Air goes where it likes and listens when it feels like it. Go and see if it feels like it."] = "空氣是四元素中的最後一個，你的訓練師派你去千針石林找普拉特·雲眼。空氣想去哪就去哪，想聽的時候才聽。去看看它這次想不想聽。"
L["Kardris Dreamseeker in Orgrimmar thinks you're ready for the hardest lesson yet: all four elements at once. That lesson belongs to Bath'rah the Windwatcher in the Alterac Mountains, who will want a sample of each."] = "奧格瑪的卡德里斯‧尋夢者認為你已經準備好上最難的一課了：同時掌握四種元素。這一課歸奧特蘭克山脈的捕風者巴斯拉管，而巴斯拉會要每種元素各一份樣本。"
L["Eldrun Stormbreaker in Ironforge is building a scryer meant to see into the Great Ossuary beneath Scholomance. First it needs two fine diamonds. After that, it needs someone willing to take it down there."] = "鐵爐堡的伊德倫‧破颶者正在打造一顆預言水晶球，要用來看進通靈學院底下的大骨窖。首先它需要兩顆上好的鑽石。之後，它需要一個願意把它帶下去的人。"
L["Your trainer passes along a summons from a warlock in the city. It's time you called something out of the void and put it to work. It won't want to. They never do."] = "你的訓練師轉達了城裡一位術士的召喚。是時候從虛空中召喚出某個東西，讓它替你做事了。它不會想做的。它們從來都不想。"
L["Your trainer thinks you're ready for a subtler demon than the voidwalker. A succubus takes more than a strong will to bind, and your trainer knows who can tell you what else it takes. Subtle things rarely come cheap."] = "你的訓練師認為你已經準備好面對比虛無行者更微妙的惡魔了。要束縛一隻魅魔，光有堅強的意志還不夠，而你的訓練師知道誰能告訴你還需要什麼。微妙的東西，向來不便宜。"
L["Your trainer sends you down to Ratchet to find Strahad Farsan, who knows how to bind a felhunter. A felhunter eats magic. You'll want to be very sure of the binding before you try it."] = "你的訓練師派你南下棘齒城，去找斯坦哈德·法爾杉，他知道怎麼束縛惡魔獵犬。惡魔獵犬吃魔法。在動手之前，你最好對自己的束縛非常有把握。"
L["Your trainer sends you down to Ratchet, to Strahad Farsan, who knows how a warlock's mount is called. No stable sells one. It comes from somewhere a good deal warmer than Ratchet."] = "你的訓練師派你南下棘齒城，去找斯坦哈德·法爾杉，他知道術士的坐騎要怎麼召喚。沒有哪個馬廄賣這種坐騎。牠來自一個比棘齒城熱得多的地方。"
L["The demon trainer in the city has a name for you: Mor'zul Bloodbringer, out in the Burning Steppes. Mor'zul knows how to call a dreadsteed of Xoroth, and doesn't share that with just anyone."] = "城裡的惡魔訓練師給了你一個名字：燃燒平原的莫蘇爾·召血者。莫蘇爾知道怎麼召喚克索諾斯恐懼戰馬，而且可不是隨便誰都肯教。"
L["Your trainer says you swing well enough. Time for your first real trial. Your trainer will tell you who to see, and like most warrior business, it ends with somebody on the ground. Make sure it isn't you."] = "你的訓練師說，你揮得還算可以。是時候迎接你的第一場真正的試煉了。訓練師會告訴你該去找誰，而就跟大部分戰士的事一樣，結局會有人倒在地上。確保那個人不是你。"
L["Your trainer sends you to Klannoc Macleod, the Islander, who runs a fighting pit on Fray Island in the Barrens. Warriors go there to find out what they're made of. Bring a good weapon and a thick skull."] = "你的訓練師派你去找島民克蘭諾克·馬克雷德，他在貧瘠之地的勇士島上經營一個格鬥場。戰士們去那裡，看看自己到底有幾兩重。帶上一把好武器和一顆硬腦袋。"
L["Master Mathias Shaw at SI:7 in Stormwind is curious. Jaina's marines found a man washed up on the shore near Theramore, and whatever he's telling them, Shaw wants to hear it too."] = "暴風城軍情七處的馬迪亞斯‧肖爾大師很好奇。珍娜的陸戰隊在塞拉摩附近的海岸發現一個被沖上岸的男人，不管他在跟他們說什麼，肖爾也想聽聽。"
L["Eitrigg in Grommash Hold is worried. A band of Kor'kron went into Dustwallow Marsh and never came back."] = "葛羅瑪許堡的伊崔格很擔心。一隊柯爾克隆進了塵泥沼澤，再也沒有回來。"
L["All the talk in Jaina's tower kept coming back to one place: Alcaz Island, an old ruin off the marsh's coast. Sully McCleary, behind the graveyard outside Theramore, wants you to go and see what's hidden under its keep."] = "珍娜高塔裡的談話，一直繞回同一個地方：奧卡茲島，沼澤外海的一座古老廢墟。塞拉摩外墓地後面的蘇利‧麥拉利，要你去看看那座要塞底下藏著什麼。"
L["Sergeant Ulka, wounded and waiting by the water near Alcaz Island, has a job for you after all. Commander Folkar took the rest of the Kor'kron into the prison under the island's old keep. Somebody has to go in after them."] = "受了傷、在奧卡茲島附近水邊等著的士官烏爾卡，終究還是有份工作要給你。指揮官弗卡爾帶著其他柯爾克隆，進了島上舊要塞底下的監獄。總得有人跟進去。"
L["Sully McCleary has one request: tell no one what you found under Alcaz but Master Shaw in Stormwind. And the prisoner you freed pressed a note into your hand on the way out, promising a treasure worth more than gold."] = "蘇利‧麥拉利只有一個請求：你在奧卡茲底下發現的事，除了暴風城的肖爾大師以外，誰都別說。還有，你救出來的那個囚犯，在離開時往你手裡塞了一張紙條，說有一個比黃金還值錢的寶藏。"
L["Commander Folkar is in no shape to travel, so it falls to you to tell Thrall in Orgrimmar what you found under Alcaz. And the prisoner you freed pressed a note into your hand, promising a treasure worth more than gold."] = "指揮官弗卡爾的狀況沒辦法遠行，所以得由你去告訴奧格瑪的索爾，你在奧卡茲底下發現了什麼。還有，你救出來的那個囚犯，往你手裡塞了一張紙條，說有一個比黃金還值錢的寶藏。"
L["Sentinel Dalia Sunblade in Darnassus hasn't heard from her sister Keldara in far too long. Keldara is posted to Talrendis Point in Azshara, where the sentinels fight the naga for the old ruins. Commander Truesong there should know where she is."] = "達納蘇斯的哨兵達莉亞·日刃已經太久沒收到她的姊妹凱爾達拉的消息了。凱爾達拉駐守在艾薩拉的塔倫迪斯營地，哨兵們在那裡和納迦爭奪古老的遺跡。那裡的指揮官真歌應該知道她在哪裡。"
L["One of Commander Truesong's sentinels has spotted a kaldorei woman alone on the Shattered Strand, plainly no fighter, with naga on every side. Truesong at Talrendis Point wants to know who she is and what she's doing out there."] = "指揮官真歌手下的一名哨兵，發現有個卡多雷女子孤身待在碎裂海灘上，一看就不是打架的料，四周全是納迦。塔倫迪斯營地的真歌想知道她是誰，在那裡做什麼。"
L["Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar sent a dozen warriors to Azshara to guard Magus Rimtori, a blood elf mage who had promised him the riches of the highborne. That bargain has gone badly. Take Belgrom's sealed letter to Ag'tor Bloodfist at Valormok."] = "奧格瑪的貝爾戈洛姆·石槌派了一打戰士到艾薩拉，護衛魔導師里姆托里，一名曾向他許諾上層精靈財寶的血精靈法師。這筆交易出了大問題。把貝爾戈洛姆的密封信件帶給瓦羅莫克的阿格圖·血拳。"
L["In the Ruins of Eldarath, a Blackmaw furbolg named Ekkal has a score to settle with the Legashi satyr, who drove the tribe from its home. The Blackmaw are short of friends. Their gatekeeper, Rageroar, is camped to the north at Ursolan."] = "在艾達拉斯廢墟，一個叫艾卡爾的黑喉熊怪跟雷加希薩特有一筆帳要算，正是那些薩特把部族趕出了家園。黑喉缺朋友。他們的守門人拉格羅爾，就在北邊的烏索蘭紮營。"
L["Furze, a Blackmaw at Ursolan, is burning up with a fever that seems to unmake its victims from the inside, and Furze isn't the first to catch it. Tell Elder Bramblesnap. If anyone knows a cure, it's the elder."] = "烏索蘭的黑喉熊怪弗爾茲正發著高燒，那種病似乎會從裡面把患者一點一點拆掉，而弗爾茲不是第一個染上的。去告訴長者棘咬。如果有誰知道解藥，就是長者了。"
L["Gatekeeper Rageroar is ready to take the fight to the Legashi, but the Blackmaw don't have the warriors for it. The Timbermaw might. Go to Timbermaw Hold in Felwood and ask Gorn One Eye for help."] = "守門人拉格羅爾已經準備好向雷加希開戰，但黑喉沒有足夠的戰士。木喉熊怪也許有。前往費伍德森林的木喉要塞，向獨眼高恩求援。"
L["In Westfall there's a burned-out wreck nobody looks at twice, and in the ash there's a note. Charred, mostly gone, but someone plainly meant it to be found. Read what's left and see where it points."] = "西部荒野有一處燒光的殘骸，沒人會多看一眼，而灰燼裡有一張紙條。燒焦了，大半都沒了，但很顯然有人是故意要讓它被找到的。讀讀剩下的部分，看看它指向哪裡。"
L["Out in the Barrens there's a burned-out wreck nobody looks at twice, and in the ash there's a note. Charred, mostly gone, but someone plainly meant it to be found. Read what's left and see where it points."] = "貧瘠之地有一處燒光的殘骸，沒人會多看一眼，而灰燼裡有一張紙條。燒焦了，大半都沒了，但很顯然有人是故意要讓它被找到的。讀讀剩下的部分，看看它指向哪裡。"
L["Beside the burned-out remains in the Barrens, someone has nailed up a plank with a note on it. More directions, and this time they point up into the Stonetalon Mountains. Whoever left this trail went to a lot of trouble."] = "在貧瘠之地那處燒光的殘骸旁，有人釘了一塊木板，上面有張紙條。更多的指示，這次指向石爪山脈的山上。不管留下這條線索的是誰，都花了好大一番工夫。"
L["Beside the burned-out remains in Westfall, someone has nailed up a plank with a note on it. More directions, and this time they point up into the Stonetalon Mountains. Whoever left this trail went to a lot of trouble."] = "在西部荒野那處燒光的殘骸旁，有人釘了一塊木板，上面有張紙條。更多的指示，這次指向石爪山脈的山上。不管留下這條線索的是誰，都花了好大一番工夫。"
L["On the ledge below the abandoned camp in the Stonetalon Mountains sits a mound of fresh dirt. Somebody was digging here not long ago. You've followed this trail across an ocean. A pile of dirt isn't going to stop you."] = "在石爪山脈那座廢棄營地下方的岩架上，有一堆新翻的土。不久前有人在這裡挖過。你都追著這條線索橫渡大洋了。一堆土可擋不住你。"
L["Fel taint keeps washing down off Mount Hyjal into Felwood, and Greta Mosshoof at the Emerald Sanctuary wants to know where it starts. Up on the mountain's lower slopes lives a hermit druid called Ketharas. Start with him."] = "魔化的污染不斷從海加爾山沖刷進費伍德森林，翡翠聖地的格雷塔·苔蹄想知道源頭在哪裡。山腳的坡地上住著一個叫凱薩拉斯的隱士德魯伊。從他開始找吧。"
L["The bird the ancients sent you after is a crow, perched by the road below the Felblood Scar. It has strong opinions about the Ashen Reign, the warlocks working fel ash nearby. It also has a plan, and the plan starts with pinecones."] = "古樹們要你去找的那隻鳥是一隻烏鴉，就棲息在魔血傷痕下方的路邊。牠對灰燼支配，也就是附近那群操弄魔化灰燼的術士，有很強烈的意見。牠也有一個計畫，而計畫從松果開始。"
L["West of the Felblood Scar, out in the ash, a Wild God named Velician lies dying, with a faintly glowing branch close at hand. Velician has one last errand, and you're the only one near enough to hear it."] = "在魔血傷痕西邊的灰燼裡，一位叫維里希安的荒野之神奄奄一息，身旁放著一根微微發光的枝條。維里希安還有最後一件差事，而附近聽得見的人只有你。"
L["Ketharas has an idea for turning Ve'han Talongrasp's stolen power back on him, but a hermit's magic won't stretch that far. It will take gifts from the Wild Gods themselves. Ketharas sends you back to the crow, who knows how to ask."] = "凱薩拉斯有個主意，要把維漢‧爪握偷來的力量反過來對付他，但隱士的魔法撐不了那麼遠。這需要荒野之神親手給的禮物。凱薩拉斯把你送回那隻烏鴉身邊，牠知道該怎麼開口。"
L["Ketharas has bound the Wild Gods' gifts into the branch and made something new of it: the Staff of the Mountain. Carry it up to Tiala Whitemane at the Summit of Eternity. Ve'han Talongrasp has had his stolen power long enough."] = "凱薩拉斯把荒野之神的禮物綁進枝條，做出了新的東西：山脈法杖。把它帶上永恆山峰，交給提亞拉‧白鬃。維漢‧爪握拿著偷來的力量已經夠久了。"
L["Friz Frazzlespark at Powderfuse Port needs a crate carried inland to Knight Commander Demar Brant at Farholde Keep. The keep has bigger worries than goblin deliveries: the Twilight's Hammer has burned the village of Sunnyglade, and nobody knows why."] = "火線港的佛利茲‧焦炫需要有人把一箱貨扛到內陸，交給遠境堡要塞的騎士指揮官戴瑪‧布蘭特。要塞有比哥布林送貨更大的煩惱：暮光之錘燒了陽光谷村，而沒人知道為什麼。"
L["Friz Frazzlespark at Powderfuse Port needs a crate carried up to Krom'rosh at Rog'mar. The orcs there have fought Farholde's humans over the Riverglades for years, and now there's a third party: the Twilight's Hammer has burned the human village of Sunnyglade."] = "火線港的佛利茲‧焦炫需要有人把一箱貨扛到羅格瑪，交給克隆羅許。那裡的獸人為了大河林地跟遠境堡的人類打了好幾年，而現在多了第三方：暮光之錘燒了人類的陽光谷村。"
L["The Twilight's Hammer didn't burn Sunnyglade for the view. There are caves under the village, and the cult is busy in them. Apprentice Claire of Farholde Keep is already down there, and could use a hand."] = "暮光之錘燒掉陽光谷可不是為了看風景。村子底下有洞穴，而教派正在裡面忙著。遠境堡要塞的學徒克萊兒已經下去了，正需要人幫忙。"
L["Tran'gul is sure the Twilight's Hammer came to the Riverglades to dig, and the digging is under Sunnyglade. Down in the caves there, an ogre miner named Clubtoe has lost some friends and wants them found."] = "特朗古爾確信暮光之錘來大河林地是為了挖東西，而挖的地方就在陽光谷底下。在那裡的洞穴深處，一個叫棒趾的巨魔礦工弄丟了幾個朋友，想把他們找回來。"
L["Tran'gul has an ogre's head and a use for it. Carry it north to Bolder'ok, where the ogres who walked out on the Twilight's Hammer live by one rule: whoever hits hardest is right. Their leader, Clugfist, will take some convincing."] = "特朗古爾手上有一顆巨魔的頭，也想好了用途。把它帶往北方的博德羅克，那些離開暮光之錘的巨魔住在那裡，只遵守一條規矩：誰打得最用力，誰就是對的。他們的首領鈍拳，可得花點工夫說服。"
L["West of Sunnyglade the cult has raised a fortress, the Twilight's Shroud, and Sergeant Riftan of Farholde has been holding the line in front of it with no word from home. Knight Commander Demar Brant at Farholde Keep sends you to find the sergeant."] = "教派在陽光谷西邊蓋了一座堡壘，叫暮光之幕，而遠境堡的瑞夫坦中士一直在堡壘前面守著防線，家裡音訊全無。遠境堡要塞的騎士指揮官戴瑪‧布蘭特派你去找那位中士。"
L["Da'grosh, one of Rog'mar's warriors, has gone west to take a swing at the cult's new fortress, the Twilight's Shroud. Krom'rosh would like to know how that's going. Find Da'grosh in the hills west of Rog'mar."] = "羅格瑪的戰士達羅許往西去了，打算對教派的新堡壘暮光之幕揮上一拳。克隆羅許想知道進展如何。去羅格瑪西邊的山丘找達羅許。"
L["Overlord Kilgar is dead, and the Twilight's Hammer keeps coming anyway. Ashe Amberhall at Farholde Keep wants to know where from, and has a soulstone and an idea. All it needs is a small favor from you."] = "霸主基爾加死了，暮光之錘還是一直來。遠境堡要塞的艾希‧安珀荷想知道他們是從哪裡來的，手上有一顆靈魂石和一個主意。只需要你幫個小忙。"
L["Overlord Kilgar is dead, and the Twilight's Hammer keeps coming anyway, out of Krol'dok, a stronghold hidden in the mountains. Da'grosh is waiting outside it with a job for whoever goes in."] = "霸主基爾加死了，暮光之錘還是一直來，從克羅多克湧出，那是一座藏在山裡的要塞。達羅許就在要塞外面等著，手上有件差事要交給進去的人。"
L["Farholde Keep has been writing to Stormwind for years and hearing nothing back. Time for a different sort of letter: Overlord Kilgar's head, for Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep. A letter is easy to ignore. A head, less so."] = "遠境堡要塞寫信給暴風城寫了好幾年，一直沒有回音。是時候換一種信了：霸主基爾加的頭，送去暴風要塞給伯瓦爾‧弗塔根。信很容易被忽略。頭就沒那麼容易了。"
L["Two centaur clans, the Magram and the Gelkis, have feuded for generations. Captain Pentigast at Nijel's Point wants the Alliance to have a friend in one of them. Which one is up to you. Either way, the road leads to the Valley of Bones."] = "瑪格拉姆和吉爾吉斯兩個半人馬部族，已經世代為仇。尼耶爾前哨站的潘迪加斯船長希望聯盟能在其中一方交到朋友。選哪一方由你決定。不管怎樣，路都通往白骨之谷。"
L["Two centaur clans, the Magram and the Gelkis, have feuded for generations. Gurda Wildmane at Ghost Walker Post wants the Horde to have a friend in one of them. Which one is up to you. Either way, the road leads to the Valley of Bones."] = "瑪格拉姆和吉爾吉斯兩個半人馬部族，已經世代為仇。鬼旅崗哨的古爾達·蠻鬃希望部落能在其中一方交到朋友。選哪一方由你決定。不管怎樣，路都通往白骨之谷。"
L["Neither clan is finished with the Valley of Bones. Ride with the Magram, and Orgrul has work for you at the valley's northern entrance. Ride with the Gelkis, and Nerlokh waits at the southern one. The feud is far from settled."] = "兩個部族都還沒跟白骨之谷做個了斷。跟著瑪格拉姆走，歐格魯爾在山谷北入口有工作給你。跟著吉爾吉斯走，納洛克在南入口等著。這場世仇還遠遠沒有結束。"
L["A cracked crystal pylon stands among the elven ruins of Shen'dralas, past the centaur battle lines, and it's still humming. Ruins don't usually hum. Look for others like it, and for whoever still looks after them."] = "在申德拉斯的精靈廢墟之間，越過半人馬的戰線，立著一座裂開的水晶晶塔，而且還在嗡嗡作響。廢墟通常是不會嗡嗡響的。找找其他類似的晶塔，還有那個仍在照顧它們的人。"
L["Mithera, at the temple in Shen'dralas, once kept a garden nearby and left treants to guard the flowers. Now Mithera wonders what became of them. Go and look in on the Forlorn Gardens. The name isn't encouraging."] = "申德拉斯神殿的米瑟拉，曾經在附近照料一座花園，還留下樹人守護那些花。如今米瑟拉想知道它們怎麼樣了。去孤寂花園看一看。這名字聽起來可不太妙。"
L["Today you come of age in Thendal Grove, on an island that floats in the sky. Ailee Farheart in Thendal Village sends you to Rorian the Dayseeker. The grove has work saved up for you, and wants to see what you're made of."] = "今天你在坦德爾林地迎來成年，在一座浮在天空中的島上。坦德爾村的艾莉‧遠心派你去找『尋日者』羅里安。林地替你存了一堆工作，想看看你有幾兩重。"
L["Your trial is behind you, and the grove has taught you what it can. Aetheen of the Gales sends you south to report to Constable Aonda in Shen'dar Village. The Al'Aketh have been busy on the road between."] = "你的試煉已經結束，林地能教你的也都教了。狂風艾希安派你南下，去申德村向治安官安妲報到。奧拉凱斯在這兩地之間的路上一直很活躍。"
L["The Al'Aketh have a missionary preaching in Shen'dar Village, and Constable Aonda is tired of it. Aonda wants someone inside the cult. Sania Silverstream, also in Shen'dar, can make you look like one of the faithful."] = "奧拉凱斯有個傳教士在申德村傳教，治安官安妲已經受夠了。安妲想安插一個人進教派。同樣在申德村的莎妮雅‧銀澗，可以把你打扮得像個虔誠信徒。"
L["In Valanaar, the island's port, Valennia Stormfist sends you to the head of your order: Elaadrin Evengale, Supreme Magister of the High Order. The Magister has a grand plan for saving Zephras, and a part in it for you."] = "在島上的港城瓦拉納爾，維菈妮雅‧颶拳派你去見你所屬教團的領袖：高天盟的至高博學者伊拉德林‧和風。博學者有一個拯救微風島的宏大計畫，裡面也有你的位置。"
L["In Valanaar, the island's port, Valennia Stormfist sends you to the head of your order: Ayessa Dawnsinger, Grand Skyseer of the Windshapers. The Skyseer has a grand plan for saving Zephras, and a part in it for you."] = "在島上的港城瓦拉納爾，維菈妮雅‧颶拳派你去見你所屬教團的領袖：塑風者的大觀天者阿雅莎‧曦詠。觀天者有一個拯救微風島的宏大計畫，裡面也有你的位置。"
L["Lotheluum Starbreeze in Valanaar hasn't heard from the druids of Shadowgale Forest in too long, and in a forest that haunted, quiet is a bad sign. Go north and find Elegael Thornpaw, in the northeast of the woods."] = "瓦拉納爾的洛瑟倫‧星風已經太久沒收到影風森林德魯伊們的消息了，而在那麼鬧鬼的森林裡，安靜是個壞兆頭。往北走，到樹林東北邊找伊蕾嘉兒‧荊爪。"
L["You saw what the cult left of the western watchtower. Now it has turned on the eastern one. Valennia Stormfist sends you to Yorana Windyreed there, in the Gustberry Lowlands, while the tower is still standing."] = "你已經看過教派把西邊的瞭望塔變成什麼樣子。現在它轉向了東邊那座。趁那座塔還立著，維菈妮雅‧颶拳派你去風莓低地找那裡的優菈娜‧風葦。"
L["No more caution. The peacekeepers and both orders are marching on the Shrine of Akir, High Priestess Lorthuna's seat, together for once, and they want you with them. Join Valennia Stormfist in the Gustberry Lowlands before the march begins."] = "不再謹慎了。保安官和兩大教團難得聯手，正向高階女祭司洛蘇娜的據點奧基爾聖殿進軍，而他們希望你同行。在進軍開始前，到風莓低地與維菈妮雅‧颶拳會合。"
L["Apothecary Johaan, at the Gallows' End Tavern in Brill, needs darkhound blood. Then other things. He's working on something new for the Royal Apothecary Society, and he hums while he works, which is never a good sign."] = "布瑞爾恐懼之末旅店的藥劑師喬漢需要暗獵犬之血。然後還要別的東西。他正在替皇家藥劑師協會研究某種新東西，而且工作時會哼歌，這從來都不是好兆頭。"
L["Johaan's findings are with Apothecary Renferrel now, at the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest. Renferrel has a shopping list of bear hearts and spider blood, all bound for Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity. Don't ask what for."] = "喬漢的研究成果現在在銀松森林瑟伯切爾的藥劑師倫弗利爾手上。倫弗利爾有一張購物清單，上面是熊心和蜘蛛血，全都要送去幽暗城給大藥劑師法拉尼爾。別問要拿來幹嘛。"
L["Apothecary Lydon, in Tarren Mill, wants gray bear tongues and creeper ichor for a new elixir. Lydon likes to see his work tested, on somebody other than Lydon. That's where you come in."] = "塔倫米爾的藥劑師林度恩要灰熊的舌頭和食苔蛛的毒液來做一種新藥劑。林度恩喜歡看自己的作品接受測試，測試對象是林度恩以外的人。這就是你派上用場的地方。"
L["Apothecary Lydon, in Tarren Mill, has his eye on a greater work: the Elixir of Agony. It starts with mudsnout blossoms. It does not end there. Lydon's recipes never do."] = "塔倫米爾的藥劑師林度恩盯上了一件更偉大的作品：苦楚藥劑。它從泥鼻花朵開始。不會在那裡結束。林度恩的配方從來不會。"
L["Theodore Griffs, in the Undercity's Apothecarium, has heard of a spider in the ruins above the city, Witherfang, whose venom eats through undead flesh. He wants a sample. In the Undercity, that isn't a rumor. It's a job offer."] = "幽暗城煉金區的薩多雷·格雷夫，聽說城市上方的廢墟裡有一隻叫枯萎之牙的蜘蛛，牠的毒液能蝕穿不死族的肉體。他想要一份樣本。在幽暗城，這不是傳聞。這是工作機會。"
L["The Scourge are trying to dig in at the Agamand Mills, northwest of Brill, and Deathguard Dillinger wants them beaten back. Coleman Farthing, at the Gallows' End Tavern, once worked those mills and has his own business with the family that owned them."] = "天譴軍團想在布瑞爾西北邊的阿加曼德磨坊紮根，亡靈衛兵迪林格爾要把他們打回去。恐懼之末旅店的庫勒曼·法席恩曾經在那些磨坊工作，跟擁有磨坊的那一家人也有自己的事要處理。"
L["Coleman Farthing has had his revenge on the Agamands, but says the mills still threaten every Forsaken in Tirisfal. Magistrate Sevren in Brill has heard about your work out there and wants a word."] = "庫勒曼·法席恩已經向阿加曼德家族報了仇，但他說那些磨坊依然威脅著提里斯法的每一個被遺忘者。布瑞爾的執政官塞弗倫聽說了你在那裡的事蹟，想找你談談。"
L["Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze in Auberdine sent a scout, Balthule Shadowstrike, to watch some strange goings-on at the Tower of Althalaxx to the northeast. Balthule should have been back by now. Elissa would like someone to go and look."] = "奧伯丁的哨兵艾麗莎·星風派了一名斥候巴蘇爾·影擊，去監視東北方奧薩拉克斯之塔的一些怪事。巴蘇爾早該回來了。艾麗莎希望有人去看看。"
L["Delgren the Purifier, at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale, has read Balthule's letter and calls it dire. The Dark Strand has cultists at Ordil'Aran, and one of them carries a soul gem Delgren would very much like to study."] = "梣谷邁斯特拉崗哨的淨化者德爾葛蘭讀了巴蘇爾的信，說情況很嚴重。黑暗之絲在奧迪拉蘭有教徒，其中一個身上帶著一顆靈魂寶石，德爾葛蘭非常想研究一下。"
L["Balthule Shadowstrike, back at the Tower of Althalaxx, says the time to strike is now. Athrikus Narassin is at the top of the tower, and the warlocks around him are deadlier than any you've met so far."] = "回到奧薩拉克斯之塔的巴蘇爾·影擊說，現在就是出手的時候。埃瑟里克斯·納拉辛就在塔頂，而他周圍的術士，比你目前遇過的都還要致命。"
L["Silverpine Forest is crawling with worgen, and Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher calls it Arugal's mess. Dalar means to clean it up for the Dark Lady and needs a capable aide. First, you'll have to prove you are one."] = "銀松森林到處都是狼人，瑟伯切爾的達拉爾·道恩維沃爾說這是阿魯高闖的禍。達拉爾打算替黑暗女王收拾這個爛攤子，需要一個能幹的助手。首先，你得證明你就是那個人。"
L["Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher has a new worry: Dalaran. Its wizards have taken an interest in Ambermill, and their crates keep turning up at a camp north of Pyrewood Village. Allister wants to know what's inside."] = "瑟伯切爾的暗影牧師奧利斯特有了新的煩惱：達拉然。他們的法師對安伯米爾產生了興趣，而他們的箱子一直出現在焚木村北邊的一座營地。奧利斯特想知道裡面裝了什麼。"
L["Everyone at the Sepulcher has business in Shadowfang Keep. High Executor Hadrec sent two deathstalkers in, and they haven't come back. Dalar Dawnweaver wants Arugal's head. In the Undercity's Apothecarium, Keeper Bel'dugur wants a book."] = "瑟伯切爾的每個人在影牙城堡都有事要辦。高級執行官哈德瑞克派了兩名亡靈哨兵進去，到現在還沒回來。達拉爾·道恩維沃爾要阿魯高的頭。幽暗城煉金區的看守者貝爾杜加則想要一本書。"
L["High Executor Darthalia runs Tarren Mill like a war room. Down the hill, the humans of Hillsbrad still farm and trade as if the Forsaken weren't there. Darthalia means to change that, and the farms come first."] = "高階執行官達薩利亞把塔倫米爾當成作戰室在經營。山下，希爾斯布萊德的人類照樣種田、做買賣，好像被遺忘者不存在一樣。達薩利亞打算改變這一點，而農場是第一站。"
L["Darthalia's list moves on to Hillsbrad itself: the blacksmith, the town hall, and the mine that keeps the town supplied. Report to the High Executor in Tarren Mill for the next set of orders."] = "達薩利亞的清單輪到希爾斯布萊德鎮本身了：鐵匠、市政廳，還有供應全鎮的礦坑。到塔倫米爾向高階執行官報到，接下一批命令。"
L["Next on Darthalia's map is Dun Garok, the dwarven fort in the south of the foothills. Dwarves dig in deep and shoot straight, and these have had years of practice. The High Executor in Tarren Mill has your orders."] = "達薩利亞地圖上的下一站是丹加洛克，丘陵南邊的矮人堡壘。矮人挖得深、槍法準，而這些矮人已經練了好多年。塔倫米爾的高階執行官有你的命令。"
L["Aboard one of the Bloodsail ships off Stranglethorn's Wild Shore lies a small scroll with a riddle on it, signed Cortello. Nobody seems to know who Cortello was. Nobody writes a riddle about nothing, either."] = "在荊棘谷蠻荒海岸外的一艘血帆海盜船上，有一張小卷軸，上面寫著一道謎題，署名科泰羅。似乎沒人知道科泰羅是誰。不過，也沒有人會為了什麼都沒有去寫一道謎題。"
L["Under a bridge west of Stonard, in the Swamp of Sorrows, Cortello left another scroll. The swamp has not been kind to it. The verse is still readable, just about, and it has somewhere new in mind."] = "在悲傷沼澤斯通納德西邊的一座橋底下，科泰羅留下了另一張卷軸。沼澤對它可不太客氣。上面的詩勉強還讀得出來，而它指向了一個新地方。"
L["The musty scroll from Bloodfen Burrow has another verse on it. By now you've boarded a pirate ship, crawled under a bridge and walked into a raptor den on Cortello's say-so. Why stop now?"] = "從鮮血沼澤墓穴拿到的那張發霉卷軸上，還有另一段詩。到現在，你已經憑著科泰羅的一句話上過海盜船、爬過橋底、走進迅猛龍的巢穴。何必現在停下來？"
L["When the battle of Darrowshire began, Marlene Redpath hid her niece Pamela, and never learned what became of her. Marlene, at Sorrow Hill in the Western Plaguelands, wants someone to go and look. So does Pamela's sister Jessica, in Everlook."] = "達隆郡之戰開打時，瑪萊恩·雷德帕斯把她的姪女帕米拉藏了起來，從此再也不知道她的下落。在西瘟疫之地悔恨嶺的瑪萊恩，希望有人去看看。在永望鎮的帕米拉的姊姊潔西卡也是。"
L["In Darrowshire, Pamela Redpath is lonely. Auntie Marlene told her to stay put and never came back, and her father hasn't come home either. Maybe Marlene knows where he is. She lives on a hill south of Andorhal."] = "在達隆郡，帕米拉·雷德帕斯很寂寞。瑪萊恩姑媽叫她待在原地，卻再也沒回來，她的爸爸也一直沒回家。也許瑪萊恩知道他在哪裡。她住在安多哈爾南邊的一座山丘上。"
L["Carlin Redpath, at Light's Hope Chapel, has read the strange new pages at the end of the Annals of Darrowshire and wants the truth of them. The annals also say where the heroes and villains of that last battle left their relics."] = "聖光之願禮拜堂的卡林·雷德帕斯讀了《達隆郡的歷史》最後那幾頁奇怪的新內容，想知道其中的真相。這本史書也記載了，最後那一戰的英雄與惡棍把他們的遺物留在了哪裡。"
L["Chromie, at the ruined inn in Andorhal, has bound the relics you gathered into one powerful spell and believes Joseph Redpath can still be saved. The bundle has to go to Darrowshire's town square, and you're the one carrying it."] = "安多哈爾旅店廢墟裡的克羅米，已經把你收集來的遺物綁進一道強大的法術裡，並相信約瑟夫·雷德帕斯還有救。這包東西得送到達隆郡的廣場，而負責扛的人就是你。"
L["Deputy Willem, outside Northshire Abbey, has a new gang of thieves on his hands. They call themselves the Defias Brotherhood, they've been seen across the river to the east, and nobody knows what they're up to."] = "北郡修道院外的維里副隊長手上有一幫新的盜賊。他們自稱迪菲亞兄弟會，有人在東邊的河對岸看過他們，而沒人知道他們在打什麼主意。"
L["Westfall's farmers have been driven off their land, and Gryan Stoutmantle means to win it back. He's raising a People's Militia in the stone tower on Sentinel Hill, and he'll take every recruit who turns up."] = "西部荒野的農民被趕出了自己的土地，而格里安·斯托曼打算把它奪回來。他正在哨兵嶺的石塔裡組建西部荒野民兵，任何上門的新兵他都收。"
L["Gryan Stoutmantle knows a good deal more about the Defias now, but not where they hide. One of his scouts has spotted a Defias messenger on the roads around Moonbrook, and messengers carry things."] = "格里安·斯托曼現在對迪菲亞了解得多了，但還不知道他們藏在哪裡。他的一名斥候在月溪鎮附近的路上看到一個迪菲亞信差，而信差總是帶著東西。"
L["Thanks to a turncoat, Gryan Stoutmantle knows where the Defias hide: the old mine under Moonbrook. Back on Sentinel Hill, Gryan has one task left for you, and it has a name on it. Edwin VanCleef."] = "多虧一個叛徒，格里安·斯托曼知道迪菲亞藏在哪裡了：月溪鎮底下的老礦坑。回到哨兵嶺，格里安還有最後一項任務給你，上面寫著一個名字。艾德溫·范克里夫。"
L["Edwin VanCleef was carrying a letter, sealed and never sent. It's addressed to Baros Alexston, the City Architect, at City Hall in Stormwind's Cathedral Square. Somebody ought to deliver it."] = "艾德溫·范克里夫身上帶著一封信，封好了卻從沒寄出。收件人是城市建築師巴洛斯·艾力克斯頓，在暴風城教堂廣場的市政廳。總得有人把它送過去。"
L["Bazil Thredd had a regular visitor in the Stockade lately: a quiet man whose papers said Maelik. Warden Thelwater had suspicions, wrote down what he looked like, and sealed it for Baros Alexston."] = "巴基爾·斯瑞德最近在監獄裡常有一位訪客：一個安靜的男人，文件上寫著馬利克。典獄官塞爾沃特起了疑心，把他的長相寫下來，封好交給巴洛斯·艾力克斯頓。"
L["Up at Stormwind Keep, Tyrion's spybot has its disguise and Tyrion has arranged a meeting. Lord Gregor Lescovar will be waiting in the castle garden for Marzon the Silent Blade. Tyrion wants you close enough to hear every word."] = "在暴風要塞，泰里恩的間諜機器人已經偽裝好了，泰里恩也安排好了一場會面。葛瑞格·萊斯科瓦公爵會在城堡花園裡等候沉默之刃馬爾松。泰里恩要你靠得夠近，聽清楚每一個字。"
L["Deliana, in Ironforge, has an earnest proposition for anyone whose old dungeon bracers have seen better days. Bring them along, with twenty gold and fifteen blood samples from Winterspring, and hear the rest."] = "鐵爐堡的德莉娜，有一個誠摯的建議要給那些地城舊護腕已經風光不再的人。把護腕帶來，再加上二十金幣和十五份冬泉谷的血液樣本，然後聽聽剩下的部分。"
L["Mokvar, in Orgrimmar, has an earnest proposition for anyone whose old dungeon bracers have seen better days. Bring them along, with twenty gold and fifteen venom samples from Silithus, and hear the rest."] = "奧格瑪的莫克瓦，有一個誠摯的建議要給那些地城舊護腕已經風光不再的人。把護腕帶來，再加上二十金幣和十五份希利蘇斯的毒液樣本，然後聽聽剩下的部分。"
L["Mux Manascrambler, a goblin in Gadgetzan, has a supernatural device in mind. Like every goblin plan, it starts with your money: forty gold, and a pile of reagents to go with it."] = "加基森的哥布林莫克斯·施法者，心裡有一個超自然裝置的構想。就跟每個哥布林的計畫一樣，它從你的錢開始：四十金幣，外加一大堆施法材料。"
L["Deliana in Ironforge wants Mux's new Ghost Revealer put to work. Take it to the gates of Stratholme, switch it on, and see whether the ghost of Anthion Harmon has anything to say."] = "鐵爐堡的德莉娜想讓莫克斯的新靈體顯像機派上用場。把它帶到斯坦索姆的大門口，打開它，看看安希恩·哈莫的鬼魂有沒有話要說。"
L["Mokvar in Orgrimmar wants Mux's new Ghost Revealer put to work. Take it to the gates of Stratholme, switch it on, and see whether the ghost of Anthion Harmon has anything to say."] = "奧格瑪的莫克瓦想讓莫克斯的新靈體顯像機派上用場。把它帶到斯坦索姆的大門口，打開它，看看安希恩·哈莫的鬼魂有沒有話要說。"
L["Anthion's unfinished banner is in the hands of Falrin Treeshaper, in the Athenaeum at Dire Maul. Before anything else, Falrin has a vendetta against the ogres to settle, and it runs to twenty-five warbeads."] = "安希恩那面未完成的旗幟，在厄運之槌圖書館的法琳·樹形者手上。在做任何事之前，法琳要先了結跟巨魔的一筆仇，而那筆仇的價碼是二十五個戰爭串珠。"
L["The Banner of Provocation is ready, and Falrin Treeshaper knows where it belongs: the middle of the Ring of Law in Blackrock Depths, planted while the Dark Irons sentence you. Somebody is bound to take offense."] = "挑釁旗幟已經準備好了，而法琳·樹形者知道它該插在哪裡：黑石深淵秩序競技場的正中央，就在黑鐵矮人宣判你的時候插下去。一定會有人被惹毛的。"
L["Deliana in Ironforge has one more name for you: Bodley. Look near Blackrock Spire, in Blackrock Mountain, with the Ghost Revealer switched on. Without it, you won't see Bodley at all."] = "鐵爐堡的德莉娜還有一個名字要給你：布德利。到黑石山的黑石塔附近找找，記得打開靈體顯像機。沒有它，你根本看不見布德利。"
L["Mokvar in Orgrimmar has one more name for you: Bodley. Look near Blackrock Spire, in Blackrock Mountain, with the Ghost Revealer switched on. Without it, you won't see Bodley at all."] = "奧格瑪的莫克瓦還有一個名字要給你：布德利。到黑石山的黑石塔附近找找，記得打開靈體顯像機。沒有它，你根本看不見布德利。"
L["Bodley, in Blackrock Mountain, wants Lord Valthalak's amulet whole again. You have the top piece; the left and right are still missing. Bodley's plan for finding them begins, as these things do, with fetching something old."] = "黑石山的布德利想讓瓦薩拉克的護符重新完整。你手上有上半部，左邊和右邊都還沒找到。布德利找它們的計畫，就跟這類事情一樣，從去拿某件古老的東西開始。"
L["Lord Valthalak's amulet is whole again, and Bodley isn't finished with it. First come the final preparations: forty Blackrock bracers and a Flask of Supreme Power, carried back to Blackrock Mountain."] = "瓦薩拉克的護符已經重新完整，而布德利還沒打算放手。首先是最後的準備：四十個黑石護腕和一瓶超級能量精煉藥水，帶回黑石山。"
L["Back where it all began. Deliana in Ironforge is waiting for the last pieces of your old dungeon set, the cap and the tunic. After everything since the bracers, it seems a small thing to ask."] = "回到一切開始的地方。鐵爐堡的德莉娜在等你舊地城套裝的最後兩件：頭盔和外衣。從護腕到現在經歷了這麼多，這點要求似乎不算什麼。"
L["Back where it all began. Mokvar in Orgrimmar is waiting for the last pieces of your old dungeon set, the cap and the tunic. After everything since the bracers, it seems a small thing to ask."] = "回到一切開始的地方。奧格瑪的莫克瓦在等你舊地城套裝的最後兩件：頭盔和外衣。從護腕到現在經歷了這麼多，這點要求似乎不算什麼。"
L["Stormwind has pulled its guards out of Darkshire, and Commander Althea Ebonlocke's Night Watch is all the town has left. The commander needs volunteers. Duskwood's dead have stopped staying in their graves."] = "暴風城撤走了夜色鎮的衛兵，指揮官阿勒泰婭·埃伯洛克的守夜人是鎮上僅剩的力量。指揮官需要志願者。暮色森林的死者已經不肯乖乖待在墳墓裡了。"
L["Sven Yorgen lost his family to the Dark Riders of Deadwind Pass. Coming home, he saw a shadowy figure burying something behind the stump by his barn, and never found out what. Sven is camped at the far western edge of Duskwood."] = "斯溫·猶根的家人死在逆風小徑的黑暗騎士手上。回家時，他看見一個黑影在他穀倉旁的樹樁後面埋東西，卻始終不知道埋的是什麼。斯溫在暮色森林最西邊紮營。"
L["Sirra Von'Indi keeps the library in Darkshire Town Hall, and it has next to nothing on Raven Hill. The village's history died with its people. If you turn up anything in the ruins, Sirra would like to see it."] = "希拉·沃寧迪管理夜色鎮市政廳的圖書館，而那裡幾乎沒有任何關於烏鴉嶺的資料。那座村子的歷史跟著它的居民一起死了。如果你在廢墟裡翻到了什麼，希拉很想看看。"
L["On the hill north of Raven Hill Cemetery stands a weathered grave marked Morgan Ladimore, and someone has disturbed the dirt on it. Sirra Von'Indi in Darkshire might remember the name."] = "在烏鴉嶺墓園北邊的山丘上，有一座風化的墳墓，上面寫著摩根·拉迪莫爾，而墳上的土被人動過。夜色鎮的希拉·沃寧迪也許記得這個名字。"
L["Madame Eva read the cards in Darkshire last night, and Death stared back. Eva fears for her granddaughter, and the trance gave up only one clue: a name, Stalvan. Clerk Daltry at the Town Hall might know it."] = "伊瓦夫人昨晚在夜色鎮占卜，結果死神回瞪著她。伊瓦擔心她的孫女，而恍惚中只得到一條線索：一個名字，斯塔文。市政廳的書記員達爾塔也許知道。"
L["Calor, in Darkshire, gave up on the Night Watch and joined Master Carevin, who goes after Duskwood's evil instead of waiting for it. If you want in, Calor says, prove it on the worgen in Brightwood Grove."] = "夜色鎮的卡洛爾放棄了守夜人，加入了卡爾文大師，他會主動去追殺暮色森林的邪惡，而不是坐著等它上門。卡洛爾說，如果你想加入，就去亮木樹林的狼人身上證明自己。"
L["An old man who lives in a shack above Raven Hill Cemetery used to come into Darkshire for supplies. Elaine Carevin hasn't seen him in a long while and thinks somebody should make sure nothing's wrong."] = "一個住在烏鴉嶺墓園上方破屋裡的老人，以前常到夜色鎮採買補給。艾萊尼·卡爾文已經很久沒見到他了，覺得應該有人去確認一下有沒有出什麼事。"
L["A ghost waits on the road where the Swamp of Sorrows gives way to the Blasted Lands. The Fallen Hero of the Horde, they call him, and he has a story for anyone willing to stop and listen."] = "在悲傷沼澤過渡到詛咒之地的那條路上，有一個鬼魂在等著。他們叫他部落英雄的靈魂，任何願意停下來聽的人，他都有一個故事要說。"
L["Ambassador Ardalan at Nethergarde Keep has an odd errand for you: go and hear out a Horde ghost. The Fallen Hero of the Horde waits on the road where the Blasted Lands meet the swamp, with a story to tell."] = "守望堡的奧達蘭大使有一件奇怪的差事要給你：去聽一個部落的鬼魂說話。部落英雄的靈魂在詛咒之地與沼澤交界的路上等著，有一個故事要說。"
L["The Fallen Hero of the Horde isn't done talking. On his road at the edge of the Blasted Lands, he has the rest of his story to tell: what became of the soldiers who crossed over."] = "部落英雄的靈魂還沒說完。在詛咒之地邊緣的那條路上，他還有故事的後半段要說：那些越過邊界的士兵後來怎麼了。"
L["The Fallen Hero of the Horde has two names for you. Corporal Thund Splithoof is waiting near the road into the Blasted Lands. Lieutenant Kirith is another matter: nobody knows what became of the lieutenant."] = "部落英雄的靈魂有兩個名字要給你。桑德·裂蹄下士在通往詛咒之地的路旁等著。基利斯中尉就是另一回事了：沒有人知道那位中尉後來怎麼了。"
L["The Fallen Hero of the Horde has a name for you, and it's a long way off: Loramus Thalipedes, a demon hunter who lives by the Bay of Storms in Azshara. Loramus has a story of his own."] = "部落英雄的靈魂有一個名字要給你，而且遠得很：洛拉姆斯·薩里比迪斯，一位住在艾薩拉風暴海灣邊的惡魔獵人。洛拉姆斯也有他自己的故事。"
L["Loramus Thalipedes has packed your Azsharite into a shipment for Galvan the Ancient, in northern Stranglethorn Vale. It's most of the world away from Azshara, and Loramus has very particular plans for what's inside."] = "洛拉姆斯·薩里比迪斯已經把你的艾薩拉水晶打包成一批貨，要送去荊棘谷北部給加爾文。那裡跟艾薩拉幾乎隔了大半個世界，而洛拉姆斯對裡面的東西有非常明確的打算。"
L["The Fallen Hero of the Horde has a use for Felbane. Razelikh the Defiler keeps three lieutenants in the Blasted Lands, each wearing a piece of a shattered amulet, and ordinary steel won't finish any of them."] = "部落英雄的靈魂替邪能剋星想好了用途。污染者拉瑟萊克在詛咒之地有三個副官，每一個都戴著一塊碎裂護符的碎片，而普通的鋼鐵殺不死他們任何一個。"
L["Yeh'kinya, a troll at Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris, has the oddest little job on the coast: go to Feralas and catch the spirits of three dead screechers. Yeh'kinya supplies the bramble. You supply the legs."] = "塔納利斯熱砂港的食人妖葉基亞，有一件整條海岸上最奇怪的小差事：去菲拉斯抓三隻死掉的尖嘯者的靈魂。葉基亞提供荊棘。你提供腳力。"
L["Whatever the screecher spirits told Yeh'kinya, it had to do with an old troll prophecy written on tablets. The first two Mosh'aru tablets are in Zul'Farrak, among the sand trolls, and Yeh'kinya would very much like to read them."] = "不管尖嘯者的靈魂跟葉基亞說了什麼，都跟一個寫在石板上的古老食人妖預言有關。前兩塊摩沙魯石板在祖爾法拉克，在沙地食人妖之間，而葉基亞非常想讀它們。"
L["Yeh'kinya has the ancient egg from Jintha'Alor and now wants it filled with the essence of Hakkar. That means the very bottom of the sunken Temple of Atal'Hakkar, in the Swamp of Sorrows. Don't go alone."] = "葉基亞拿到了辛薩羅的古老之卵，現在想把哈卡的精華裝進去。這代表要去悲傷沼澤那座沉沒的阿塔哈卡神廟的最底層。別一個人去。"
L["Prospector Ironboot at Steamwheedle Port has a question about the Mosh'aru tablets: how many do you think there are? Two more lie in Zul'Mashar, in the Eastern Plaguelands, and the prospector would like them brought back."] = "熱砂港的勘查員詹斯·鐵靴對摩沙魯石板有個問題：你覺得總共有幾塊？還有兩塊在東瘟疫之地的祖瑪沙爾，勘查員希望有人把它們帶回來。"
L["Prospector Ironboot has read all six Mosh'aru tablets and thinks it's time you and Yeh'kinya had a talk. Yeh'kinya is still at Steamwheedle Port, just down the way. The walk is the easy part."] = "勘查員詹斯·鐵靴已經讀完了全部六塊摩沙魯石板，認為你該跟葉基亞好好談一談了。葉基亞還在熱砂港，就在不遠處。走過去是簡單的部分。"
L["There's a wanted poster outside Westbrook Garrison. A huge gnoll called Hogger is prowling the woods of southwestern Elwynn, and he has beaten every attempt to catch him. Marshal Dughan in Goldshire pays the bounty."] = "西泉要塞外面有一張通緝令。一隻叫霍格的巨大豺狼人在艾爾文森林西南部的樹林裡遊蕩，每一次抓他的行動都被他打退了。閃金鎮的治安官杜漢負責發賞金。"
L["Under the broken Thandol Span, where few travelers think to look, lie a dwarf's remains and a waterlogged envelope. It's addressed to Sara Balloo in Ironforge. It never got there."] = "在殘破的薩多爾大橋底下，一個少有旅人會留意的地方，躺著一具矮人的遺骸和一個泡了水的信封。收件人是鐵爐堡的薩拉·巴魯。它始終沒送到。"
L["Sara Balloo's plea is in King Magni's hands now, up on the High Seat in Ironforge. The king has read it and made up his mind. It involves the Grand Mason, and it involves you."] = "薩拉·巴魯的請求現在在國王麥格尼手上，在鐵爐堡的至高王座。國王已經讀過，也下定了決心。這件事牽涉到大石匠，也牽涉到你。"
L["There's a wrecked raft in a pond in Un'Goro Crater, out in the southeastern marshes. Nobody aboard, nobody waiting nearby. Poke around in the water and you might learn whose it was."] = "安戈洛環形山東南邊的沼澤地裡，有一個池塘，池塘裡有一艘破木筏。船上沒人，附近也沒人在等。在水裡翻一翻，也許你會知道它是誰的。"
L["Donova Snowden at Frostfire Hot Springs in Winterspring has an idea about Linken's sword, and it needs a rare brew, the Videre Elixir. Gregan Brewspewer, in northern Feralas, knows how to come by one."] = "冬泉谷冰火溫泉的多諾瓦·雪山對林克的劍有個想法，而這需要一種稀有的藥劑：視靈藥劑。菲拉斯北部的格雷甘·山酒知道怎麼弄到一瓶。"
L["Eridan Bluewind, at the Emerald Sanctuary in southern Felwood, has the next piece of Linken's story. It starts with a silver heart, made from silvery claws and an irontree heart. Felwood's wildlife is still using both."] = "費伍德森林南部翡翠聖地的艾瑞丹·藍風，掌握著林克故事的下一塊拼圖。它從一顆銀色的心開始，用銀爪和鐵樹心做成。這兩樣東西，費伍德森林的野生動物都還在用。"
L["Linken, back at Marshal's Refuge, has one last job, and it's what the Silver Totem is for. On Fire Plume Ridge, Blazerunner guards a cave behind an aura nothing gets through. Nearly nothing. It's dangerous to go alone."] = "回到馬紹爾營地的林克還有最後一件事要做，而那正是銀圖騰的用途。在火羽山上，火焰使者守著一個洞穴，身上的光環什麼都穿不透。幾乎什麼都穿不透。一個人去很危險。"
L["Quillboar fell on Mankrik and his wife at a small tauren camp, and the fighting split them up. Mankrik woke on the Gold Road with a tauren druid tending his wounds. Now he waits at the Crossroads, asking for any sign of her."] = "野豬人在一座小小的牛頭人營地襲擊了曼寇里克和他的妻子，混戰中兩人失散了。曼寇里克在黃金之路上醒來，一位牛頭人德魯伊正在替他療傷。現在他在十字路口等著，打聽任何關於她的消息。"
L["The Centaur Pariah, an outcast camped in southern Desolace, has a job for you in Maraudon, written out in full. Up near Kormek's Hut, Willow wants something from the same caves: crystal carvings, and plenty of them."] = "半人馬賤民，一個在淒涼之地南部紮營的流亡者，有一份瑪拉頓的工作要給你，全都寫得清清楚楚。北邊考米克小屋附近的維洛，也想要同一片洞穴裡的東西：水晶雕像，而且要很多。"
L["Something is corrupting the plants of Maraudon. Talendria at Nijel's Point has a remedy to try, a coated vial to fill at the caverns' orange crystal pool. Archmage Tervosh in Theramore wants shadowshards from the purple side, too."] = "有東西在腐化瑪拉頓的植物。尼耶爾前哨站的塔琳德莉亞有一帖藥想試試，一個要到洞穴橙色水晶池裝滿的天藍水瓶。塞拉摩的大法師特沃許也想要紫色那一側的暗影殘片。"
L["Something is corrupting the plants of Maraudon. Vark Battlescar at Shadowprey Village has a remedy to try, a coated vial to fill at the caverns' orange crystal pool. Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar wants shadowshards from the purple side, too."] = "有東西在腐化瑪拉頓的植物。葬影村的瓦克·戰痕有一帖藥想試試，一個要到洞穴橙色水晶池裝滿的天藍水瓶。奧格瑪的尤塞爾奈也想要紫色那一側的暗影殘片。"
L["Just inside Maraudon's orange passage, Cavindra tells a legend of the caves: Celebras, and his scepter, now in two pieces. Find the rod and the diamond, then find a way to speak with Celebras himself."] = "就在瑪拉頓橙色通道的入口內，凱雯德拉講述了一個關於洞穴的傳說：塞雷布拉斯，以及他那根如今斷成兩截的節杖。找到魔棒和鑽石，再想辦法跟塞雷布拉斯本人說上話。"
L["Keeper Marandis at Nijel's Point wants Princess Theradras dead. The princess waits at the very bottom of Maraudon, and everything between here and there would rather you stayed home."] = "尼耶爾前哨站的守護者瑪蘭迪斯要瑟萊德絲公主死。公主就在瑪拉頓的最底層，而從這裡到那裡之間的每樣東西，都寧可你待在家裡。"
L["Selendra, camped near Shadowprey Village, wants Princess Theradras dead. The princess waits at the very bottom of Maraudon, and everything between here and there would rather you stayed home."] = "在葬影村附近紮營的瑟琳德拉要瑟萊德絲公主死。公主就在瑪拉頓的最底層，而從這裡到那裡之間的每樣東西，都寧可你待在家裡。"
L["Feathermoon Stronghold is missing a courier. Raschal set out from Thalanaar and never arrived. Latronicus Moonspear has already marked him missing in action, but upstairs in the stronghold, Ginro Hearthkindle hasn't given up."] = "羽月要塞有個信差失蹤了。拉斯卡爾從薩蘭納爾出發，卻一直沒抵達。拉托尼庫斯·月矛已經把他登記為作戰失蹤，但在要塞樓上，基恩諾·火花還沒放棄。"
L["All the wreck gave up was a knife, and Ginro Hearthkindle thinks it can still tell you something. Take it to Quintis Jonespyre, up in Feathermoon's treehouse, who can read where a thing has been."] = "殘骸裡只找到一把刀，而基恩諾·火花認為它還能告訴你一些事。把它帶到羽月要塞的樹屋上給奎恩提斯，奎恩提斯能讀出一樣東西去過哪裡。"
L["The knife points inland, to the Woodpaw gnolls of southern Feralas. Ginro Hearthkindle wants their camps searched for Raschal's belongings, or for Raschal. Gnolls are not known for returning lost property."] = "刀子指向內陸，指向菲拉斯南部的木爪豺狼人。基恩諾·火花要你去搜他們的營地，找拉斯卡爾的東西，或是找拉斯卡爾本人。豺狼人可不是出了名會歸還失物的。"
L["Raschal's note points south of the Woodpaw camps, to a place called the Writhing Deep. Whatever he went to look at down there, he hasn't come back from it. Go and find him, or what's left of him."] = "拉斯卡爾的紙條指向木爪營地的南邊，一個叫痛苦深淵的地方。不管他去那裡看什麼，都還沒回來。去找到他，或是他剩下的部分。"
L["Thomas, in Cathedral Square in Stormwind, has a message for someone who can keep quiet: Bishop DeLavey would like to see you in Stormwind Keep. The bishop isn't saying why. Not out loud, anyway."] = "暴風城教堂廣場的湯瑪斯，有一則口信要給懂得保密的人：德拉維主教想在暴風要塞見你。主教沒說為什麼。至少沒說出口。"
L["Elling Trias's sealed note has brought you to Watcher Backus, on the road north of Darkshire. Now the watcher wants you out at Addle's Stead in western Duskwood, where the Defias may have left some paperwork lying around."] = "伊林·提亞斯那封封好的信，把你帶到了夜色鎮北邊路上的守夜人巴庫斯面前。現在守夜人要你去暮色森林西邊的腐草農場，迪菲亞可能在那裡留下了一些文件。"
L["Elling Trias, back at the cheese shop in Stormwind's Trade District, has read the Defias docket and picked your next stop before putting it down: Dashel Stonefist, in Old Town."] = "回到暴風城貿易區起司店的伊林·提亞斯，讀了迪菲亞文件，還沒放下就已經挑好了你的下一站：舊城區的達舍爾·石拳。"
L["Mikhail, at the Deepwater Tavern in Menethil Harbor, has had an eye on a patron called Tapoke Jahn. Slim, to his friends. Slim takes a great interest in other people's business, and Mikhail thinks it's time someone returned the favor."] = "米奈希爾港深水旅店的米克哈爾，一直在留意一個叫塔伯克·賈恩的客人。朋友都叫他「乾柴」。乾柴對別人的事非常感興趣，而米克哈爾認為，是時候有人禮尚往來了。"
L["Commander Samaul, at Foothold Citadel in Theramore, has heard what brought you all this way. The commander sends you to Sentry Point, in Dustwallow Marsh, to look for any sign of a Private Hendel."] = "塞拉摩堡壘的指揮官薩莫爾，已經聽說你一路跑來的原因。指揮官派你去塵泥沼澤的警戒崗哨，尋找一個叫亨德爾的下士的任何蹤跡。"
L["Deathstalker Zraedus keeps a quiet Forsaken camp at Beggar's Haunt in Duskwood. A human spy was watching it, but the orcs got to him first and hauled him off to Stonard. Zraedus would like to help them get the truth out of him."] = "亡靈哨兵萊度斯在暮色森林的乞丐鬼屋守著一座安靜的被遺忘者營地。有個人類間諜一直在監視營地，但獸人搶先一步抓住了他，把他拖去了斯通納德。萊度斯很樂意幫獸人從他嘴裡問出實話。"
L["Black dragonkin are gathering in the Burning Steppes, uncomfortably close to Morgan's Vigil. Helendis Riverhorn at the Vigil wants their numbers thinned, from the smallest broodling right up to a drake."] = "黑色龍類正在燃燒平原集結，離摩根的崗哨近得令人不安。崗哨的赫林迪斯·河角要削減牠們的數量，從最小的雛龍一路到幼龍。"
L["Ragged John's tale ended with Marshal Windsor dragged off to a prison. Marshal Maxwell at Morgan's Vigil wants to know what became of him, and the trail leads into Blackrock Depths, under Blackrock Mountain."] = "狼狽不堪的約翰的故事，結局是溫德索爾元帥被拖進了一座監獄。摩根的崗哨的麥克斯韋爾元帥想知道他後來怎麼了，而線索通往黑石山底下的黑石深淵。"
L["Marshal Maxwell at Morgan's Vigil has word from Marshal Windsor: he's bound for Stormwind and wants you there when he arrives. Go to the city gates and find Squire Rowe, who will let Windsor know you've come."] = "摩根的崗哨的麥克斯韋爾元帥收到了溫德索爾元帥的消息：他正前往暴風城，希望他抵達時你也在場。到城門口找侍衛洛義，他會通知溫德索爾你已經到了。"
L["Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep hands you a fragment of the Dragon's Eye. Someone out there can restore its power. That is the whole of what anyone knows about them, so the search may take a while."] = "暴風要塞的大領主伯瓦爾‧弗塔根交給你一塊巨龍之眼的碎片。世上某處有人能恢復它的力量。這就是大家對那個人的全部了解，所以這趟尋找可能要花上一段時間。"
L["Warlord Goretooth in Kargath, out in the Badlands, has three names in Lower Blackrock Spire and wants every one of them dead. Whatever papers they're keeping, the warlord wants those brought back too."] = "荒蕪之地卡加斯的軍官高圖斯，在黑石塔下層有三個名字，每一個他都要死。不管他們手上保管著什麼文件，軍官也要你一併帶回來。"
L["Thrall, in Grommash Hold, wants you to find Rexxar, the Champion of the Horde. Rexxar walks the paths of Desolace somewhere between Stonetalon and Feralas and doesn't wait for visitors. Expect to walk."] = "葛羅瑪許堡的索爾要你去找部落的勇士雷克薩。雷克薩在淒涼之地的路上走動，介於石爪山脈和菲拉斯之間，而且不會停下來等訪客。準備好多走點路吧。"
L["Emberstrife, in a den deep in the Wyrmbog of Dustwallow Marsh, won't take you on faith. The test is skulls: one from a champion of each of the blue, green, bronze and red dragonflights."] = "在塵泥沼澤巨龍沼澤深處巢穴裡的艾博斯塔夫，不會單憑信任就接納你。考驗是頭骨：藍龍、綠龍、青銅龍和紅龍軍團，各要一位勇士的頭骨。"
L["Rexxar, back on the roads of Desolace, knows what the amulet still lacks: the blood of General Drakkisath, champion of the black dragonflight. The general keeps his throne at the top of Blackrock Spire, and a great many guards around it."] = "回到淒涼之地路上的雷克薩，知道那個護符還缺什麼：黑龍軍團的勇士達基薩斯將軍的血。將軍的王座就在黑石塔的頂端，周圍還有一大堆守衛。"
L["Hooligans overran the Furlbrows' fields one night, and the couple fled in a rush. Now their wagon has broken down by the road near Jansen Stead in Westfall. Farmer Furlbrow left something precious behind, and Verna is fretting over their tired old horse."] = "某天晚上，一群流氓占據了法布隆夫婦的田地，夫妻倆匆忙逃走。現在他們的馬車在西部荒野詹森農場附近的路邊壞了。農夫法布隆把一樣珍貴的東西留在了家裡，而弗娜正為他們那匹疲憊的老馬操心。"
L["Royal Historian Archesonus, by the High Seat in Ironforge, has a long history of the Dark Iron dwarves to tell. Hear it out. King Magni has questions about his daughter, Moira, and the answers lie in Blackrock Depths."] = "鐵爐堡至高王座旁的皇家歷史學家阿克瑟努斯，有一段關於黑鐵矮人的漫長歷史要講。耐心聽完吧。國王麥格尼對他的女兒茉艾拉有些疑問，而答案就在黑石深淵裡。"
L["King Magni has heard enough. His orders from the High Seat are plain: back into Blackrock Depths, through the Dark Iron city to Emperor Dagran Thaurissan, and bring Princess Moira home."] = "國王麥格尼已經聽夠了。他從至高王座下達的命令很直白：回到黑石深淵，穿過黑鐵矮人的城市，找到達格蘭·索瑞森大帝，然後把茉艾拉公主帶回家。"
L["Galamav the Marksman in Kargath shows you a crude drawing of an orc, bars scrawled across the face. The orc is Commander Gor'shak, and the bars suggest a prison. Blackrock Depths has a big one."] = "卡加斯的神射手賈拉瑪弗給你看一張粗糙的獸人畫像，臉上塗著幾條鐵欄杆。那個獸人是指揮官哥沙克，而那些欄杆暗示著一座監獄。黑石深淵就有一座很大的。"
L["Raene Wolfrunner, in Astranaar, is worried about Teronis, who went west looking for a way to stop the furbolg attacks and hasn't come back. Raene would like Teronis found. Ashenvale is a big forest."] = "阿斯特蘭納的萊恩·狼行者很擔心泰羅尼斯，泰羅尼斯往西走，想找辦法阻止熊怪的攻擊，結果一直沒回來。萊恩希望有人找到泰羅尼斯。梣谷可是一座很大的森林。"
L["Raene has read Teronis' journal, and it points to Shael'dryn, who keeps a moonwell east of Iris Lake. Shael'dryn knows what Teronis was after. Getting it will take you into some of Ashenvale's less pleasant corners."] = "萊恩讀了泰羅尼斯的日記，日記指向莎爾蒂恩，莎爾蒂恩在伊瑞斯湖東邊照看一座月井。莎爾蒂恩知道泰羅尼斯在找什麼。要拿到它，你得深入梣谷一些不怎麼宜人的角落。"
L["Raene Wolfrunner, back in Astranaar, has a use for Dartol's Rod. A few of Ashenvale's furbolg still aren't corrupted, and Raene wants you to talk to one. The rod, apparently, will help with the introductions."] = "回到阿斯特蘭納的萊恩·狼行者，替達托爾之杖想好了用途。梣谷還有少數幾個熊怪沒有被腐化，萊恩要你去跟其中一個談談。據說，這根杖子能幫忙引見。"
L["Yenniku, youngest son of the Darkspear chief, has been taken somewhere in Stranglethorn. Nimboya at Grom'gol Base Camp is searching for him, and the Bloodscalp trolls in the ruins north of camp are the only trail there is."] = "暗矛酋長的幼子耶尼庫，在荊棘谷的某處被人帶走了。格羅姆高營地的尼姆布亞正在找他，而營地北邊遺跡裡的血頂食人妖，是唯一的線索。"
L["The heads of the two Bloodscalp leaders sit in the cauldron at Grom'gol, and death hasn't stopped them talking. It hasn't made them generous either. Before they say a word about Yenniku, they want paying."] = "兩個血頂首領的頭放在格羅姆高的大鍋裡，而死亡並沒有讓他們閉嘴。也沒有讓他們變得大方。在說出任何關於耶尼庫的事之前，他們要先拿到報酬。"
L["Nezzliok's head has one last thing to say about the fate of Yenniku. After that it's over to Kin'weelay, who stands beside the cauldron at Grom'gol and doesn't seem the least bit bothered by talking heads."] = "奈茲里奧克的頭還有最後一件關於耶尼庫下落的事要說。在那之後就輪到肯維雷了，肯維雷就站在格羅姆高的大鍋旁，對會說話的頭似乎一點也不在意。"
L["Kin'weelay's Soul Gem is ready, and it's no good to anyone sitting in your pack. Yenniku is somewhere out in the jungle, in Zanzil's hold. Nimboya waits at Grom'gol for whatever you bring back."] = "肯維雷的靈魂寶石已經準備好了，而它躺在你的背包裡對誰都沒用。耶尼庫就在叢林裡的某處，落在贊吉爾的掌控之中。尼姆布亞在格羅姆高等著你帶回來的任何東西。"
L["Executor Arren, in Deathknell, has work for the newly risen. Spiders first. But the Scarlet Crusade has made camp at the edge of the valley, and Arren hasn't forgotten them for a moment."] = "喪鐘鎮的執行官阿倫，有工作要給剛甦醒的人。先是蜘蛛。不過血色十字軍已經在山谷邊緣紮營了，而阿倫一刻也沒忘記他們。"
L["Brill is at war with the Scarlet Crusade camps west of town, and everyone in Brill has a part for you. Deathguard Simmer starts small: steal some pumpkins off a farm north of Deathknell. Executor Zygand thinks bigger."] = "布瑞爾正在跟鎮西邊的血色十字軍營地開戰，而布瑞爾的每個人都有一份差事要給你。亡靈守衛希米爾從小事開始：去喪鐘鎮北邊的一座農場偷些南瓜。執行官塞加德的想法就大多了。"
L["Brother Crowley, in Stormwind's Cathedral Square, wants you to call on Brother Anton. Anton is at Nijel's Point in Desolace, which is a long way to go for a conversation. Crowley doesn't say what it's about. Anton will."] = "暴風城教堂廣場的克羅雷修士，要你去拜訪安東修士。安東在淒涼之地的尼耶爾前哨站，為了一場談話跑這麼遠，真的很遠。克羅雷沒說是什麼事。安東會說。"
L["Librarian Mae Paledust, in Ironforge's Hall of Explorers, wants one book: the Mythology of the Titans. The copy Mae has in mind sits in the library of the Scarlet Monastery in Tirisfal Glades, and the Crusade doesn't lend."] = "鐵爐堡探險者大廳的圖書館員麥伊·蒼塵只想要一本書：《泰坦神話》。麥伊心裡想的那一本，就放在提里斯法林地血色修道院的圖書館裡，而十字軍是不外借的。"
L["Deep in the Scarlet Monastery's graveyard, in Tirisfal Glades, a prisoner named Vorrel Sengutz is waiting for someone to get that far. The library has customers too: Sage Truthseeker, in Thunder Bluff, wants a book off its shelves."] = "在提里斯法林地血色修道院的墓地深處，一個叫沃瑞爾·森加斯的囚犯，正在等有人走到那麼裡面。圖書館也有客人：雷霆崖的聖者圖希克想要書架上的一本書。"
L["Raleigh the Devout, in Southshore, wants the leaders of the Scarlet Monastery dead, in the name of the Light. They would say they do everything in its name too. There are four of them, from the kennels to the Cathedral."] = "南海鎮的虔誠的萊雷恩，要血色修道院的首領們死，以聖光之名。他們也會說自己做的每件事都是以聖光之名。一共四個，從犬舍一路到大教堂。"
L["Varimathras wants a word in the Undercity's Royal Quarter. The dreadlord has four names for you, the leaders of the Scarlet Monastery from the kennels to the Cathedral, and wants every one of them dead. Say yes quickly."] = "瓦里瑪薩斯要在幽暗城的皇家區見你。那位驚懼領主有四個名字要給你，血色修道院從犬舍到大教堂的四位首領，他要他們每一個都死。答應的時候要快。"
L["Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff of the Argent Dawn, at Light's Hope Chapel, wants a fire started. The Scarlet Crusade keeps an archive in Stratholme, and the duke wants it burned, along with the archivist who keeps it."] = "銀色黎明的尼古拉斯·瑟倫霍夫公爵，在聖光之願禮拜堂，想要放一把火。血色十字軍在斯坦索姆有一座文獻庫，公爵要把它燒了，連同管理它的文件管理員一起。"
L["Kirsta Deepshadow, in the north of the Western Plaguelands, has unfinished business with the Scarlet Crusade and could use a hand with it. Their outer lines are close by. Behind them sits Hearthglen."] = "西瘟疫之地北部的科爾斯塔·迪普沙東，跟血色十字軍有一些未了之事，想找人幫忙。他們的外圍防線就在附近。防線後面就是壁爐谷。"
L["Nathanos Blightcaller keeps to Marris Stead in the Eastern Plaguelands and doesn't do small talk. He has orders for you, and they start with a trip home: Varimathras, in the Undercity, is expecting you."] = "納薩諾斯‧凋零者待在東瘟疫之地的瑪瑞斯農場，從不閒聊。他有命令要給你，而第一步是回家一趟：幽暗城的瓦里瑪薩斯正在等你。"
L["At the western edge of the Eastern Plaguelands, an old man named Tirion Fordring lives alone in a cottage, a long way from anybody. He has a story to tell and a favor to ask. Sit down for the story."] = "在東瘟疫之地的西緣，一個叫提里奧·弗丁的老人獨自住在一間小屋裡，離所有人都很遠。他有一個故事要說，還有一個忙要請你幫。聽故事的時候，先坐下來。"
L["High Executor Derrington, at the Bulwark, wants the Scarlet Crusade busy fighting somebody other than the Forsaken, starting with their camp near Felstone Field. Over in the Eastern Plaguelands, Tirion Fordring lives alone in a cottage and has a favor to ask."] = "亡靈壁壘的高階執行官德靈頓，想讓血色十字軍忙著跟被遺忘者以外的人打仗，先從費爾斯通農場附近的營地開始。在東瘟疫之地那邊，提里奧·弗丁獨自住在一間小屋裡，有一個忙要請你幫。"
L["Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp wants someone inside Scholomance, the Scourge's school on Caer Darrow. The door is locked, and nobody hands out keys. Alchemist Arbington, in the same camp, thinks you can make one."] = "冰風營地的指揮官阿胥拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特，想派人進入通靈學院，那是天譴軍團在凱爾達隆上的學校。門是鎖著的，沒人會發鑰匙。同一座營地的化學家阿爾比頓，認為你可以自己做一把。"
L["High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark wants someone inside Scholomance, the Scourge's school on Caer Darrow. The door is locked, and nobody hands out keys. Apothecary Dithers, at the Bulwark too, thinks you can make one."] = "亡靈壁壘的高階執行官德靈頓，想派人進入通靈學院，那是天譴軍團在凱爾達隆上的學校。門是鎖著的，沒人會發鑰匙。同樣在亡靈壁壘的藥劑師迪瑟斯，認為你可以自己做一把。"
L["Caer Darrow is full of ghosts, and Eva Sarkhoff is one of the saddest. She has unfinished business with Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher, who is still at work somewhere inside Scholomance."] = "凱爾達隆到處都是鬼魂，而艾瓦·薩克霍夫是其中最令人難過的一個。她跟屠夫瑟爾林·卡斯迪諾夫教授之間還有未了之事，而那個人還在通靈學院裡的某處工作。"
L["Magistrate Marduke, another of Caer Darrow's ghosts, wants the lich Ras Frostwhisper destroyed, and has some advice: before you fight a lich, find out who it used to be. That trail starts in the ruins of Stromgarde."] = "凱爾達隆的另一個鬼魂馬杜克鎮長，想要摧毀巫妖萊斯·霜語，還給了你一個建議：在跟巫妖打之前，先查清楚它以前是誰。這條線索從激流堡的廢墟開始。"
L["Weldon Barov at Chillwind Camp wants the family fortune back. It's somewhere in Scholomance, as four deeds: Caer Darrow, Brill, Tarren Mill and Southshore. Somebody has to go in after them. Weldon has someone in mind."] = "冰風營地的維爾頓·巴羅夫想拿回家族的財產。它就在通靈學院的某處，是四張地契：凱爾達隆、布瑞爾、塔倫米爾和南海鎮。總得有人進去拿。維爾頓心裡已經有人選了。"
L["Alexi Barov, near the Bulwark, has a business proposal. The Barov fortune is lying in Scholomance as four deeds: Caer Darrow, Brill, Tarren Mill and Southshore. Alexi wants them home, and would rather not fetch them personally."] = "亡靈壁壘附近的阿萊克斯·巴羅夫有一個生意提案。巴羅夫家族的財產就躺在通靈學院裡，是四張地契：凱爾達隆、布瑞爾、塔倫米爾和南海鎮。阿萊克斯想把它們拿回家，而且寧可不要親自去拿。"
L["Sentinel Melyria Frostshadow, at the Shrine of Aessina in Ashenvale, has a wolf problem. These wolves walk on two legs and roam the Howling Vale, where they have no business being. An old book there, the Tome of Mel'Thandris, may explain them."] = "梣谷艾森娜神殿的哨兵梅麗瑞亞·霜影，有一個狼的問題。這些狼用兩條腿走路，在狼嚎谷遊蕩，而牠們根本不該出現在那裡。那裡有一本古書，《麥爾莎迪絲之書》，也許能解釋牠們的來歷。"
L["The Tome of Mel'Thandris gave Sentinel Melyria a name: Velinde Starsong. Melyria wants to know what became of Velinde, and sends you to Darnassus to ask Thyn'tel Bladeweaver on the Warrior's Terrace."] = "《麥爾莎迪絲之書》給了哨兵梅麗瑞亞一個名字：維琳德·星歌。梅麗瑞亞想知道維琳德後來怎麼了，派你去達納蘇斯的戰士區問塞恩提爾·刃紋。"
L["Velinde Starsong left Ashenvale to find help a long way off, and Darnassus hasn't heard from Velinde since. Thyn'tel Bladeweaver thinks the trail starts at the docks. Wharfmaster Dizzywig, in Ratchet, might remember a passenger."] = "維琳德·星歌離開梣谷，去很遠的地方尋求幫助，從此達納蘇斯再也沒收到維琳德的消息。塞恩提爾·刃紋認為線索從碼頭開始。棘齒城的碼頭管理員迪茲維格也許記得一位乘客。"
L["Velinde's trail has come all the way to Darkshire, in Duskwood, where the sun doesn't bother. Clerk Daltry, at the town hall, keeps the records. Somebody here must remember a night elf priestess passing through."] = "維琳德的蹤跡一路來到了暮色森林的夜色鎮，一個連太陽都懶得露臉的地方。市政廳的書記員達爾塔掌管紀錄。這裡一定有人記得有位夜精靈女祭司經過。"
L["What you dug out of Roland's Doom belongs in Darnassus. Jonathan Carevin, in Darkshire, wants Thyn'tel Bladeweaver to see it, and that means crossing the sea again. Mind it on the boat."] = "你從羅蘭之墓挖出來的東西，該送到達納蘇斯。夜色鎮的喬納森·卡爾文想讓塞恩提爾·刃紋看看它，這代表又要渡海了。在船上看好它。"
L["The Shady Rest Inn, on the road between the Barrens and Dustwallow Marsh, has burned to the ground. Everyone has a theory about who did it. Captain Garran Vimes in Theramore would rather have evidence. Start at the ruins."] = "樹蔭旅店，在貧瘠之地和塵泥沼澤之間的路上，已經燒成了平地。每個人都對兇手有自己的理論。塞拉摩的蓋蘭·維米斯隊長寧可要證據。從廢墟開始查吧。"
L["In what's left of the Shady Rest's fireplace lies a shield: black iron, scorched, and far too big for a human arm. Theramore will jump to conclusions. Captain Vimes would rather know where it was made."] = "在樹蔭旅店壁爐剩下的部分裡，放著一面盾牌：燒黑的鐵盾，焦痕累累，對人類的手臂來說太大了。塞拉摩一定會急著下結論。維米斯隊長寧可先知道它是在哪裡做的。"
L["There's a badge in the ashes as well, Theramore Guard, with a name on it: Lieutenant Paval Reethe. A Theramore officer's badge has no business at a burned inn. Captain Vimes will want to check the records."] = "灰燼裡還有一枚徽章，塞拉摩衛兵的，上面有個名字：帕瓦爾·雷瑟上尉。塞拉摩軍官的徽章，根本不該出現在一間燒毀的旅店裡。維米斯隊長會想查一查紀錄。"
L["Captain Vimes isn't satisfied yet. One more lead goes north, to Captain Darill at North Point Tower, who has a suspicion about the fire at the Shady Rest and needs someone to go and test it."] = "維米斯隊長還不滿意。還有最後一條線索往北，通到北點哨塔的達利爾上尉那裡，他對樹蔭旅店的火災有個懷疑，需要有人去驗證。"
L["The Shady Rest Inn, on the road between the Barrens and Dustwallow Marsh, has burned down, and the talk is that the Horde did it. Krog in Brackenwall Village would like the truth first. Start at the ruins."] = "樹蔭旅店，在貧瘠之地和塵泥沼澤之間的路上，已經燒毀了，大家都在傳是部落幹的。蕨牆村的克羅格想先知道真相。從廢墟開始查吧。"
L["Word of a burned inn has reached Camp Taurajo, and with it Alliance soldiers who blame the Horde. Grunt Logmar wants them seen off. The inn, the Shady Rest, is just over the border in Dustwallow Marsh."] = "旅店燒毀的消息傳到了陶拉祖營地，跟著來的還有怪罪部落的聯盟士兵。步兵勞格瑪要你把他們打發走。那間旅店，樹蔭旅店，就在邊界另一頭的塵泥沼澤。"
L["A blackened iron shield sits in the Shady Rest's fireplace, heavy enough to stop a charging kodo. Krog in Brackenwall Village will want to see it before anyone starts drawing conclusions."] = "樹蔭旅店的壁爐裡有一面燒黑的鐵盾，重到足以擋住一頭衝鋒的科多獸。在任何人開始下結論之前，蕨牆村的克羅格會想先看看它。"
L["A Theramore Guard badge turns up in the ashes, with a name on it: Lieutenant Paval Reethe. Krog in Brackenwall Village will want to know what a Theramore badge was doing at the Shady Rest."] = "灰燼裡出現了一枚塞拉摩衛兵的徽章，上面有個名字：帕瓦爾·雷瑟上尉。蕨牆村的克羅格會想知道，一枚塞拉摩的徽章跑到樹蔭旅店做什麼。"
L["Mosarn, in Thunder Bluff, has remembered something about that black shield, and Krog ought to hear it. Back to Brackenwall Village, then. It's a long way to carry a thought."] = "雷霆崖的莫薩恩想起了關於那面黑盾的某件事，克羅格應該聽一聽。那就回蕨牆村吧。為了一個念頭跑這麼遠，可真遠。"
L["There's a crumpled map lying at Hammertoe's Digsite in the Badlands, and the note on it says Hammertoe Grez is alive. Prospector Ryedol, camped just down the road, will want to hear that."] = "荒蕪之地的鐵趾挖掘場有一張皺巴巴的地圖，上面的紙條說鐵趾格雷茲還活著。就在路的另一頭紮營的勘察員雷杜爾，一定會想聽這個消息。"
L["Somewhere in Uldaman, a shattered necklace is waiting to be found. Broken, but fine work. Track down whoever made it and you might learn what it's worth."] = "在奧達曼的某處，一條碎掉的項鍊正等著被找到。壞了，但做工精細。找到做它的人，你也許就會知道它值多少。"
L["Dran Droffers, of Droffers and Son Salvage in Orgrimmar, has heard about a valuable necklace somewhere in the Uldaman dig site. Possibly damaged. Droffers doesn't mind damaged, as long as somebody brings it back."] = "奧格瑪德洛佛父子回收站的德蘭·杜佛斯，聽說奧達曼挖掘場的某處有一條值錢的項鍊。可能有損壞。杜佛斯不介意壞的，只要有人把它帶回來。"
L["At the very bottom of Uldaman, behind the last of its guardians, a stone watcher keeps the Discs of Norgannon. It has been waiting a very long time for someone to come and ask it questions."] = "在奧達曼的最底層，在最後一道守衛的後面，一位石頭守護者看守著諾甘農圓盤。它已經等了很久很久，等有人來問它問題。"
L["Years after Archimonde fell, Mount Hyjal is still scarred. Fel ash poisons its slopes, warlocks pick through the ruins of the war, and the Wild Gods who watch over the mountain have begun to falter.\n\nWhen a dying god presses a corrupted branch of the World Tree into your hands, a hermit druid, a meddling crow and the wild spirits of the mountain all have questions about it, and none of them are simple."] = "阿克蒙德殞落多年之後，海加爾山依然傷痕累累。魔化灰燼毒害著山坡，術士們在戰爭的廢墟中翻找，而守護這座山的荒野之神們也開始動搖。\n\n當一位垂死的神把一根腐化的世界之樹枝條塞進你手裡，一位隱士德魯伊、一隻愛管閒事的烏鴉，以及山上的荒野之靈，都對它有一堆疑問，而且沒有一個是簡單的。"
L["At Steamwheedle Port, Yeh'kinya asks for help with old troll spirits and older tablets. It sounds like simple archaeology, and Yeh'kinya is very polite about it.\n\nFollow the tablets from Feralas and Zul'Farrak into older and darker places, and see where an old troll's errand leads."] = "在熱砂港，葉基亞請你協助處理古老的食人妖靈魂，以及更古老的石板。聽起來只是單純的考古工作，而葉基亞對此非常客氣。\n\n循著石板從菲拉斯和祖爾法拉克走進更古老、更黑暗的地方，看看一個老食人妖的差事會把你帶到哪裡。"
L["The crystal caverns beneath Desolace are holy ground, burial ground, and wound all at once. Satyrs, centaur spirits and corrupted plants all pull at the same buried story.\n\nEnter Maraudon from the orange and purple passages and follow its old stories as far down as they go."] = "淒涼之地底下的水晶洞穴，同時是聖地、墓地，也是一道傷口。薩特、半人馬的靈魂和腐化的植物，全都在拉扯同一個被埋藏的故事。\n\n從橙色和紫色的通道進入瑪拉頓，跟著它古老的故事一路往下走，能走多深就走多深。"
L["North of the road into Deadwind Pass, two Forsaken agents keep a quiet post at Beggar's Haunt. A human infiltrator has seen too much, and Stonard's orcs have taken him alive before the matter could be settled.\n\nWork with Deathstalker Zraedus and Apothecary Faustin on a serum meant to draw out the truth."] = "在通往逆風小徑那條路的北邊，兩名被遺忘者特務在乞丐鬼屋守著一處安靜的崗哨。一個人類間諜看到了太多東西，而在事情了結之前，斯通納德的獸人就先把他活捉了。\n\n和亡靈哨兵萊度斯與藥劑師法奧斯丁合作，調製一種用來逼出實話的藥劑。"
L["Caer Darrow's ruined school is locked behind more than a door. The Scourge has made Scholomance a place of experiments, ghosts and old family secrets that refuse to stay buried.\n\nForge the Skeleton Key, then follow the stories Caer Darrow's ghosts still want told."] = "凱爾達隆那座殘破的學校，鎖住它的不只是一扇門。天譴軍團把通靈學院變成了一個充滿實驗、鬼魂，以及不肯安分埋在土裡的家族秘密的地方。\n\n打造骷髏鑰匙，然後追尋凱爾達隆的鬼魂們仍想訴說的故事。"
L["On the road between Dustwallow Marsh and the Barrens, the Shady Rest Inn is nothing but ash, hoofprints, a scorched shield, and a guard badge that should not be there.\n\nFollow the clues before faction blame buries the truth."] = "在塵泥沼澤和貧瘠之地之間的路上，樹蔭旅店只剩下灰燼、蹄印、一面燒焦的盾牌，還有一枚不該出現在那裡的衛兵徽章。\n\n趁陣營之間的互相指責還沒把真相埋掉，循著線索查下去。"
L["Aramis Hammerhand in Tirisfal Glades believes the Light still answers you, whatever anyone else thinks. A paladin's lessons are not only prayers; they ask for aid given, judgment shown, and materials gathered with care.\n\nFollow the order's tests from your first doubts to the rites reserved for those who have carried the Light long enough to be trusted with more."] = "提里斯法林地的阿拉米斯‧錘手相信，不管別人怎麼想，聖光依然會回應你。聖騎士的課程不只是禱告；它們要求你伸出援手、做出判斷，還要細心收集材料。\n\n從你最初的疑惑開始，一路跟著騎士團的考驗走下去，直到那些只留給背負聖光夠久、值得託付更多的人的儀式。"
L["Master Mathias Shaw does not teach by lecture. SI:7 sends its rogues into guarded places, locked boxes, and situations where an antidote matters as much as a blade.\n\nBegin with the work Shaw hands you, then follow the hints that lead beyond city trainers into a wider trade of signals and reputation."] = "馬迪亞斯‧肖爾大師不靠講課教人。軍情七處會把旗下的盜賊送進戒備森嚴的地方、上了鎖的箱子，還有那種解毒劑跟刀子一樣重要的處境。\n\n從肖爾交給你的工作開始，然後跟著那些暗示走，越過城裡的訓練師，進入一個由暗號和名聲構成的更大的行當。"
L["Shenthul does not teach by lecture. The Shattered Hand sends its rogues into guarded places, locked boxes, and situations where an antidote matters as much as a blade.\n\nBegin with the work Shenthul hands you, then follow the hints that lead beyond city trainers into a wider trade of signals and reputation."] = "申蘇爾不靠講課教人。碎手氏族會把旗下的盜賊送進戒備森嚴的地方、上了鎖的箱子，還有那種解毒劑跟刀子一樣重要的處境。\n\n從申蘇爾交給你的工作開始，然後跟著那些暗示走，越過城裡的訓練師，進入一個由暗號和名聲構成的更大的行當。"
L["Jaina Proudmoore's marines have brought in a man found washed up on the shore, and his claim is one SI:7 cannot ignore. Master Mathias Shaw wants someone discreet in Theramore to learn the truth.\n\nThe trail bends toward Alcaz Island, an old ruin off the marsh's coast that hardly anyone thinks about. Whatever waits beneath its keep, someone has gone to great lengths to hide it."] = "珍娜‧普勞德摩爾的陸戰隊帶回了一個被沖上岸的男人，而他的說法讓軍情七處無法置之不理。馬迪亞斯‧肖爾大師需要一個行事低調的人，到塞拉摩查明真相。\n\n線索轉向了奧卡茲島，沼澤外海一座幾乎沒人會想到的古老廢墟。不管它的要塞底下等著的是什麼，都有人費盡心思想把它藏起來。"
L["In Orgrimmar, Eitrigg has a worry: a band of Kor'kron Elite sent into Dustwallow Marsh is long overdue, and nobody has heard a word from them.\n\nThe trail bends toward Alcaz Island, an old ruin off the marsh's coast that hardly anyone thinks about. Whatever waits beneath its keep, someone has gone to great lengths to hide it."] = "在奧格瑪，伊崔格有件心事：一隊派往塵泥沼澤的柯爾克隆精英早就該回來了，卻一點音訊都沒有。\n\n線索轉向了奧卡茲島，沼澤外海一座幾乎沒人會想到的古老廢墟。不管它的要塞底下等著的是什麼，都有人費盡心思想把它藏起來。"
L["Azshara's broken towers still hold the secrets of the highborne, and everyone has come to dig for them. Night elf sentinels at Talrendis Point fight the Spitelash naga for the ruins of Eldarath.\n\nTo the north, the Blackmaw furbolgs shelter in the camps of Ursolan, driven from their home by the Legashi satyr and sickening from the corruption the demons spread. Their gatekeeper is looking for allies."] = "艾薩拉殘破的高塔裡仍藏著上層精靈的秘密，所有人都趕來挖寶。塔倫迪斯營地的夜精靈哨兵，正和惡鞭納迦爭奪艾達拉斯廢墟。\n\n在北方，黑喉熊怪躲在烏索蘭的營地裡，他們被雷加希薩特趕出了家園，又被惡魔散播的腐化折磨得越來越虛弱。他們的守門人正在尋找盟友。"
L["Azshara's broken towers still hold the secrets of the highborne, and everyone has come to dig for them. At Valormok, the Horde has paid in blood for trusting a blood elf mage.\n\nTo the north, the Blackmaw furbolgs shelter in the camps of Ursolan, driven from their home by the Legashi satyr and sickening from the corruption the demons spread. Their gatekeeper is looking for allies."] = "艾薩拉殘破的高塔裡仍藏著上層精靈的秘密，所有人都趕來挖寶。在瓦羅莫克，部落為了信任一名血精靈法師，付出了血的代價。\n\n在北方，黑喉熊怪躲在烏索蘭的營地裡，他們被雷加希薩特趕出了家園，又被惡魔散播的腐化折磨得越來越虛弱。他們的守門人正在尋找盟友。"
L["No one has held the Riverglades for long. The humans of Farholde Keep, who feel Stormwind has forgotten them, have fought the orcs of Rog'mar across the river for years. Now the Twilight's Hammer has burned the village of Sunnyglade and started digging under the hills.\n\nFarholde needs to know what the cult is looking for."] = "從來沒有人能長久佔據大河林地。遠境堡要塞的人類覺得暴風城已經遺忘了他們，多年來一直隔著河與羅格瑪的獸人交戰。如今暮光之錘燒了陽光谷村，還開始在山丘底下挖掘。\n\n遠境堡需要知道那個教派在找什麼。"
L["No one has held the Riverglades for long. The orcs of Rog'mar have fought the humans of Farholde Keep across the river for years. Now the Twilight's Hammer has burned the village of Sunnyglade and started digging under the hills.\n\nRog'mar needs to know what the cult is looking for, and the answer may lie with ogres who have already turned their backs on it."] = "從來沒有人能長久佔據大河林地。羅格瑪的獸人多年來一直隔著河與遠境堡要塞的人類交戰。如今暮光之錘燒了陽光谷村，還開始在山丘底下挖掘。\n\n羅格瑪需要知道那個教派在找什麼，而答案也許就在那些已經背棄教派的巨魔身上。"
L["When your old dungeon armor has seen enough battle, Deliana in Ironforge will offer work that sounds simple enough: bring the right pieces, prove you are ready, and keep following instructions.\n\nThe errands soon reach far beyond a single set of bracers. Expect old dungeons, stranger patrons, expensive favors, and a brazier whose purpose is not explained all at once."] = "當你的地城舊護甲已經打過夠多的仗，鐵爐堡的德莉娜會給你一份聽起來夠簡單的工作：帶來對的裝備，證明你已經準備好，然後一直照著指示做。\n\n這些差事很快就會遠遠超出一副護腕的範圍。準備好面對古老的地城、更奇怪的委託人、代價高昂的人情，還有一個用途不會一次說清楚的火盆。"
L["When your old dungeon armor has seen enough battle, Mokvar in Orgrimmar will offer work that sounds simple enough: bring the right pieces, prove you are ready, and keep following instructions.\n\nThe errands soon reach far beyond a single set of bracers. Expect old dungeons, stranger patrons, expensive favors, and a brazier whose purpose is not explained all at once."] = "當你的地城舊護甲已經打過夠多的仗，奧格瑪的莫克瓦會給你一份聽起來夠簡單的工作：帶來對的裝備，證明你已經準備好，然後一直照著指示做。\n\n這些差事很快就會遠遠超出一副護腕的範圍。準備好面對古老的地城、更奇怪的委託人、代價高昂的人情，還有一個用途不會一次說清楚的火盆。"
L["In the Burning Steppes, Helendis Riverhorn has orders against the black dragonkin gathering near Morgan's Vigil.\n\nTake the first report and follow the chain of summons, proofs, and dangerous names wherever it leads. The amulet at the end of the road is not given to anyone who has only heard rumors of dragons."] = "在燃燒平原，赫林迪斯·河角接到命令，要對付在摩根的崗哨附近集結的黑色龍類。\n\n接下第一份報告，然後跟著一連串的召喚、證明和危險的名字走，不管它帶你到哪裡。路的盡頭那個護符，可不會交給只聽過龍的傳聞的人。"
L["In Kargath, Warlord Goretooth has a command that points into Blackrock Spire.\n\nTake the first order and follow the chain of summons, proofs, and dangerous names wherever it leads. The amulet at the end of the road is not given to anyone who has only heard rumors of dragons."] = "在卡加斯，軍官高圖斯有一道指向黑石塔的命令。\n\n接下第一道命令，然後跟著一連串的召喚、證明和危險的名字走，不管它帶你到哪裡。路的盡頭那個護符，可不會交給只聽過龍的傳聞的人。"
