L["Undercity"] = "幽暗城"
L["Lorekeeper Nok at Ursolan wanted two totems brought out of Blackmaw Hold, one for Ursoc and one for Ursol, the twin bears every furbolg looks up to. I found both and carried them very carefully. Losing a fight in there is one thing. Dropping a demigod on the way home is another."] = "烏索蘭的博識者諾克要我從黑喉要塞帶回兩個圖騰，一個屬於厄索克，一個屬於厄索爾，就是每個熊怪都崇敬的那對雙子熊神。兩個我都找到了，一路上拿得小心翼翼。在裡面打輸一場架是一回事。回家路上把一位半神給摔了，那又是另一回事。"
L["Ekkal wanted five Blackmaw pouches fetched out of the hold. Not weapons, not treasure. Pouches. I didn't look inside. Some things you carry without asking, and a furbolg's pouch is one of them."] = "艾卡爾要我從要塞裡拿回五個黑喉袋子。不是武器，不是寶藏。是袋子。我沒往裡面看。有些東西拿著就好，不用多問，熊怪的袋子就是其中之一。"
L["Ogtinc, out by the Ruins of Eldarath, wanted the claws of the Great Bear and the tusks of the Unbroken from inside the hold. Both came attached to their owners, who had opinions about that. Claws that rend and tusks that gore, I'd been warned. I can confirm both."] = "艾達拉斯廢墟那邊的奧汀克，想要要塞裡巨熊的利爪和不屈者的獠牙。這兩樣東西都還長在主人身上，而主人對此很有意見。有人警告過我，爪子會撕裂，獠牙會穿刺。這兩點我都可以作證。"
L["In the hold I came across a feathered charm necklace that plainly belonged to somebody. Somebody turned out to be Unele, back at Ursolan, so I gave it back. Some loot is worth more returned than sold."] = "我在要塞裡撿到一條羽飾符咒項鍊，一看就知道是有主人的。結果主人是烏索蘭的烏尼勒，所以我就物歸原主了。有些戰利品，還回去比賣掉更值錢。"
L["Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus wanted ten Nordrassil root caps, and the place to pick them, of all places, was Blackmaw Hold. I picked ten. I didn't ask what a druid wants with them. Ask a druid a question and the answer takes the rest of the afternoon."] = "達納蘇斯的瑪斯雷·馭熊者想要十個諾達希爾根冠，而能採到它們的地方，偏偏就是黑喉要塞。我採了十個。我沒問德魯伊要這些做什麼。問德魯伊一個問題，答案會占掉你整個下午。"
L["Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff wanted ten Nordrassil root caps, and the place to pick them, of all places, was Blackmaw Hold. I picked ten, between fights. I didn't ask what they were for. Up on the Elder Rise a question turns into a lesson, and the lesson turns into the evening."] = "雷霆崖的納拉·蠻鬃想要十個諾達希爾根冠，而能採到它們的地方，偏偏就是黑喉要塞。我一邊打一邊採，湊滿了十個。我沒問要拿來做什麼。在長者高地上，一個問題會變成一堂課，一堂課會變成一整晚。"
L["Archmage Timear of the Kirin Tor wanted a Blackmaw ritual totem brought out of the hold. I found one and carried it all the way to Dalaran. Mages will study anything that sits still long enough. Totems are very good at sitting still."] = "祈倫托的大法師泰彌亞想要一個黑喉儀式圖騰，得從要塞裡帶出來。我找到一個，一路扛回達拉然。法師什麼都願意研究，只要它乖乖待著不動夠久。圖騰最擅長的就是待著不動。"
L["Muln Earthfury of the Earthen Ring wanted a Blackmaw ritual totem brought out of the hold. I found one and carried it home to Mulgore. I didn't ask what it had to say. With the Earthen Ring, the totems do most of the talking."] = "陶土議會的穆倫‧地怒想要一個黑喉儀式圖騰，得從要塞裡帶出來。我找到一個，帶回了莫高雷。我沒問它有什麼話要說。在陶土議會，大部分的話都是圖騰在講。"
L["Ashe Amberhall had one more use for the satchel of cult trinkets from Krol'dok: send it across the keep to Melanie Sable, the enchanter. Curios, Ashe called them. I'd have called them evidence. I suppose to an enchanter it's all just material."] = "艾希‧安珀荷對那袋從克羅多克弄來的教派小玩意兒還有一個用處：送到要塞另一頭，交給附魔師梅蘭妮‧沙伯。艾希說那些是珍品。換作是我，會叫它們證物。我想在附魔師眼裡，這些全都只是材料。"
L["Before I went into Krol'dok, Ranath Nightstride in Dalaran gave me a name to look for: Zalfan Moonshadow. Ranath is Highborne, and undead, and called it vengeance. I didn't ask for the history. With the Highborne there's always history, and it's always long. Zalfan didn't come out of Krol'dok."] = "我進克羅多克之前，達拉然的拉納斯‧夜路給了我一個名字，要我留意：薩爾凡‧月影。拉納斯是精靈貴族，也是不死族，說這叫復仇。我沒問前因後果。跟精靈貴族打交道，總是有前因後果，而且總是很長。薩爾凡沒能從克羅多克出來。"
L["Deathguard Kristof had reports of an unholy fog over the ruins, with the Scourge moving about inside it and a new necromancer called Rath'mael behind it all. I took friends, and we put Rath'mael down. Kristof expects another one along soon, because deathguards are not optimists."] = "亡靈衛兵克里斯多夫收到回報，說廢墟上籠罩著一片邪惡的霧，天譴軍團在霧裡走來走去，幕後還有個叫拉斯梅爾的新死靈法師。我找了幾個朋友，一起把拉斯梅爾解決了。克里斯多夫認為很快又會冒出另一個，因為亡靈衛兵可不是什麼樂觀主義者。"
L["Tabitha Heartweaver at the Sepulcher had a husband, Edward, who walked to a graveyard in the ruins every week to look for the son they lost when the city fell. One week he didn't come home. I went in and found out why, and that part stays between Tabitha and me."] = "瑟伯切爾的塔比薩‧織心者有個丈夫叫愛德華，他每個星期都會走到廢墟裡的一座墓地，尋找城市淪陷時他們失去的兒子。有一個星期，他沒有回家。我進去查出了原因，至於那部分，就留在塔比薩和我之間吧。"
L["Morbin Lightbane serves the Light and the Dark Lady both and sees no trouble in it. What Morbin wanted was twenty-five intact limbs off the Scourge in the ruins: spare parts, for Forsaken whose own were wearing out. The Scourge had no further use for theirs by the time I left."] = "莫賓‧光寂同時侍奉聖光和黑暗女王，而且完全不覺得有什麼問題。莫賓要的是從廢墟裡的天譴軍團身上弄來二十五份完好的肢體：備用零件，給那些自己的手腳快用壞的被遺忘者。等我離開的時候，天譴軍團已經用不到它們了。"
L["Somewhere in the ruins I picked up an old crest with Lordaeron's mark on it, and Oran Snakewrithe in the Undercity was glad to have it. Oran checked it was genuine by biting it. I've seen people test gold that way, never history."] = "我在廢墟裡撿到一枚刻著羅德隆標誌的舊紋章，幽暗城的奧蘭‧蛇繞很樂意收下。奧蘭咬了一口來驗真假。我看過有人這樣驗黃金，驗歷史倒是第一次。"
L["The thing I put down in the ruins lost its head, and Faranell knew whose it was: a grand marshal the Dark Lady had killed personally. Faranell found the head a new body, and it woke up calling me an abomination, which was rich, coming from it. I put a serum in the drip above it, and now it simmers in its new home while Faranell makes plans."] = "我在廢墟裡解決掉的那個東西掉了腦袋，而法拉尼爾認得那是誰的：一位被黑暗女王親手殺死的大元帥。法拉尼爾幫這顆頭找了副新身體，它一醒來就罵我是憎惡體，這話從它嘴裡說出來還真諷刺。我往它上方的點滴管裡加了一劑藥水，現在它就在新家裡慢慢燉著，法拉尼爾則在一旁盤算著什麼。"
L["Alba Fairmoon at Sentinel Hill had traced the poison in Westfall's soil to a forge hidden in the Deadmines, and handed me something labeled Extra-Destructive Explosives. I found the forge and tucked them in close. Then I walked back out at a very respectful pace."] = "哨兵嶺的艾芭‧皎月追查西部荒野土壤裡的毒，一路查到死亡礦坑裡藏著的一座熔爐，然後交給我一包標著「威力驚人的爆裂物」的東西。我找到熔爐，把它們塞在旁邊放好。接著我用非常恭敬的步伐走了出來。"
L["Wilder Thistlenettle got out when the tunnel came down in the mine under Moonbrook, but the foreman, Wilder's brother, didn't. Wilder asked me for the Explorers' League badge the foreman never went anywhere without. I brought the badge back, and Wilder had already guessed what that meant."] = "月溪鎮底下那座礦坑的隧道坍塌時，維爾德·薊草逃了出來，但工頭，也就是維爾德的兄弟，沒能出來。維爾德請我去找那枚探險者協會徽章，工頭走到哪裡都帶著它。我把徽章帶了回來，而維爾德早就猜到這代表什麼了。"
L["Wilder Thistlenettle lost a good many workmates in the collapsed wing of the mine under Moonbrook, and wanted their Miners' Union Cards brought out so the families would know. I brought out four. Wilder took them like letters nobody wants to deliver."] = "維爾德·薊草在月溪鎮底下礦坑的坍塌區失去了不少工友，想把他們的礦業工會會員卡帶出來，好讓家屬知道。我帶出來四張。維爾德接過去的樣子，就像接過幾封沒人想送的信。"
L["Motley Garmason at Dun Modr hates the Dark Irons in general and Kam Deepfury in particular, since Deepfury helped plan the attack on the Thandol Span. Stormwind kept Deepfury tucked away in the Stockade for reasons of politics. Motley had no use for politics, and after my visit, neither did Deepfury."] = "丹莫德的莫特雷·加瑪森痛恨所有黑鐵矮人，尤其是卡姆·深怒，因為深怒參與策劃了對薩多爾大橋的襲擊。暴風城因為政治因素，把深怒好好地關在監獄裡。莫特雷才不管什麼政治，而在我去拜訪過之後，深怒也不必再管了。"
L["Councilman Millstipe of Darkshire wanted Dextren Ward's hand. Ward had sold bodies out of Duskwood's cemetery, and Darkshire sentenced him to death, but the nobles in Stormwind kept him in the Stockade instead. I carried out Darkshire's sentence, and the councilman took the hand as a message to the nobles."] = "夜色鎮的米爾斯迪普議員想要迪克斯特·瓦德的手。瓦德把暮色森林墓地裡的屍體拿去賣，夜色鎮判了他死刑，但暴風城的貴族卻只把他關進監獄。我執行了夜色鎮的判決，議員收下那隻手，當作捎給貴族們的一句話。"
L["Nikova Raskol's grandson Mac was fourteen and a guard in the Stockade, and he got a knife in the back for telling the Defias to stop tearing their blankets into bandanas. Nikova wanted ten of those bandanas, and I brought them. They didn't bring Mac back, and Nikova knew that better than I did."] = "尼科瓦·拉斯克的孫子麥克才十四歲，是監獄的守衛，只因為叫迪菲亞的人別再把毯子撕成頭巾，背後就挨了一刀。尼科瓦要十條那種頭巾，我帶回來了。它們換不回麥克，這一點尼科瓦比我還清楚。"
L["Guard Berton in Lakeshire remembered Targorr the Dread, who tortured Stormwind's soldiers for Gath'Ilzogg, and didn't trust the noble who kept putting off the execution. So Berton skipped the courts and sent me. Berton called it justice beyond the reach of politics, and Targorr didn't get a say."] = "湖畔鎮的衛兵伯爾頓記得可怕的塔高爾，那傢伙曾替加塞爾佐格折磨暴風城的士兵；伯爾頓也信不過那個一再拖延行刑的貴族。所以伯爾頓跳過了法庭，直接派我去。伯爾頓說這叫政治管不到的正義，而塔高爾沒有發言的餘地。"
L["Lethtendris had built a web in Dire Maul to soak up the magic leaking out of the place, and fancied herself its master. Latronicus Moonspear at Feathermoon thought otherwise and wanted the web, to let the magic out over the wilds and then smash the thing. I settled the argument for them."] = "蕾瑟塔蒂絲在厄運之槌織了一張網，用來吸收那裡外洩的魔法，還自以為是它的主人。羽月要塞的拉托尼庫斯·月矛可不這麼想，他要那張網，好把魔法釋放到荒野上，再把那東西砸爛。我替他們把這場爭論解決了。"
L["Lethtendris had built a web in Dire Maul to soak up the magic leaking out of the place, and meant to aim it at her enemies. Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache reckoned she'd never hand it over alive, and Talo was right. The web went off to someone more responsible, which by then was nearly anybody."] = "蕾瑟塔蒂絲在厄運之槌織了一張網，用來吸收那裡外洩的魔法，還打算拿它對付她的敵人。莫沙徹營地的塔羅·刺蹄認為她只要還活著，就絕不會交出來，塔羅說得沒錯。那張網最後交給了更可靠的人，而到了那時候，幾乎任何人都比她可靠。"
L["Scholar Runethorn at Feathermoon was after an old elven master whose trail ran from Quel'Thalas all the way to Dire Maul, along with a cartload of lost artifacts. I found where the trail ended. Runethorn took the news hard, and the lack of artifacts harder."] = "羽月要塞的學者盧索恩·紋角在尋找一位古老的精靈大師，他的蹤跡從奎爾薩拉斯一路延伸到厄運之槌，還帶著一整車失落的神器。我找到了蹤跡的盡頭。盧索恩聽到消息很難過，得知神器沒了更難過。"
L["Sage Korolusk at Camp Mojache was after an old elven master whose trail ran from Quel'Thalas all the way to Dire Maul, along with a cartload of lost artifacts. I found where the trail ended. Korolusk took the news hard, and the lack of artifacts harder."] = "莫沙徹營地的先知科魯拉克在尋找一位古老的精靈大師，他的蹤跡從奎爾薩拉斯一路延伸到厄運之槌，還帶著一整車失落的神器。我找到了蹤跡的盡頭。科魯拉克聽到消息很難過，得知神器沒了更難過。"
L["Azj'Tordin, an old Shen'dralar lying low at the Lariss Pavilion, had been robbed by an imp called Pusillin: one Book of Incantations, with the key to Dire Maul thrown in. Getting the book back meant chasing Pusillin all over the Warpwood Quarter. Azj'Tordin regretted nothing, and I only regretted the running."] = "埃斯托爾迪是一位躲在拉瑞斯小亭的辛德拉老精靈，被一個叫普希林的小鬼偷了東西：一本咒術之書，外加厄運之槌的鑰匙。要拿回那本書，就得在扭木廣場到處追著普希林跑。埃斯托爾迪什麼都不後悔，我只後悔跑了那麼多路。"
L["The Shen'dralar Ancient in the courtyard wanted the madness in Dire Maul ended, which meant five pylons, one caged demon, and finally Prince Tortheldrin. I'd been warned the Prince was persuasive, and he wasn't persuasive enough. The reward was a chest tucked under the library stairs, which is exactly where I'd hide treasure too."] = "庭院裡的辛德拉古靈想終結厄運之槌的瘋狂，這代表五座水晶塔、一個被關起來的惡魔，最後還有托塞德林王子。有人警告過我，王子很會說服人，可惜他還不夠會說。報酬是藏在圖書館樓梯下的一個箱子，換作是我也會把寶藏藏在那裡。"
L["Prince Tortheldrin looked a great deal older dead than he had alive, as if the centuries had all caught up with him at once. One of his glaives lay beside him, snapped in two. I took the pieces to the Shen'dralar Ancients, who wanted to hear every detail."] = "托塞德林王子死後看起來比活著時老了許多，彷彿幾百年的歲月一下子全追上了他。他的一把戰刃躺在身旁，斷成兩截。我把碎片帶去給辛德拉古靈們，他們想聽每一個細節。"
L["I returned Nostro's Compendium of Dragon Slaying to the library, and Lorekeeper Lydros mentioned what it would have fetched on the black market. Then I showed Lydros a dull, flat elven blade and got instructions back: heat it in a certain dragon's breath and temper it in her blood. Lydros said it like a recipe."] = "我把《諾斯卓的屠龍技術綱要》還給了圖書館，博學者萊德羅斯隨口提了一句它在黑市上能賣多少錢。接著我給萊德羅斯看了一把黯淡的精靈劍，換來一套說明：用某條龍的吐息把它燒熱，再用她的血淬火。萊德羅斯講得就像在念食譜。"
L["Knot Thimblejack, a goblin chained up in the Gordok wing, offered to sew me an ogre suit if I brought the runecloth, leather and ogre tannin. It would hold together for ten minutes. Knot reckoned that was plenty to fool an ogre captain, and Knot has had a long time to study ogres."] = "諾特·希姆加克是個被拴在戈多克巨魔那一區的哥布林，說只要我帶來符文布、皮革和巨魔鞣酸，就幫我縫一套巨魔裝。這套衣服能撐十分鐘。諾特覺得騙過一個巨魔隊長綽綽有餘，而諾特研究巨魔的時間可不短了。"
L["Knot Thimblejack had been chained up by the ogres long enough to have pet names for them. One of them was carrying the shackle key, so I let Knot go. Knot said a goblin's life was meant for more than being an ogre's appetizer, and I didn't argue."] = "諾特·希姆加克被巨魔拴了太久，久到都幫他們取了暱稱。其中一個身上帶著鐐銬鑰匙，所以我放了諾特。諾特說，哥布林的一生不該只是當巨魔的開胃菜，我沒跟他爭。"
L["Captain Kromcrush had an old story about a creepy elf calling himself a prince, who stole the Gauntlet of Gordok Might from an ogre king. The story was true, and the gauntlet was sitting in the prince's own chest. Kromcrush put the magic back into it and handed it to the new king, long live me."] = "克羅卡斯有個老故事，說一個自稱王子的詭異精靈，從一位巨魔大王手中偷走了戈多克力量護手。故事是真的，護手就放在王子自己的箱子裡。克羅卡斯把魔力重新灌了進去，交給了新的大王。大王萬歲，也就是我。"
L["Being king of the Gordok came with one perk worth mentioning: Stomper Kreeg, who keeps the brews, brought me free samples of the good stuff. One of them was called Kreeg's Stout Beatdown. Honest name."] = "當戈多克大王只有一個好處值得一提：管酒的踐踏者克雷格送來了好酒的免費試喝品。其中一種叫「克雷格的烈酒」。名副其實。"
L["I found the Codex of Defense in a pile of dust in Dire Maul and gave it back to the librarians for a royal seal. Never read it. Didn't need to."] = "我在厄運之槌的一堆灰塵裡找到了《防禦寶典》，還給圖書館員，換了一枚皇家徽記。一頁都沒讀。也不需要讀。"
L["The Light and How To Swing It was gathering dust in Dire Maul, so I returned it, because that's what you do with a library book. The librarians gave me a royal seal. The title had already told me everything inside."] = "《聖光之力》在厄運之槌積灰塵，所以我把它還了回去，圖書館的書本來就該這樣。圖書館員給了我一枚皇家徽記。書名已經把裡面的內容全告訴我了。"
L["The librarians paid a royal seal for The Greatest Race of Hunters, which I'd found in the dust in Dire Maul. My pet wanted to chew it first. I said no, mostly."] = "我在厄運之槌的灰塵裡找到了《最偉大的獵手》，圖書館員為它付了一枚皇家徽記。我的寵物想先咬兩口。我沒讓牠咬。至少大部分沒讓。"
L["Garona: A Study on Stealth and Treachery was lying in the dust in Dire Maul, unguarded. I could have sold it, but the librarians offered a royal seal, and for once honest work paid better."] = "《迦羅娜：潛行與詭計研究》就躺在厄運之槌的灰塵裡，沒人看守。我本來可以把它賣掉，但圖書館員開價一枚皇家徽記，難得一次，老實做事反而賺得更多。"
L["There was a book in the dust at Dire Maul called Holy Bologna: What the Light Won't Tell You. I gave it back to the librarians for a royal seal. They didn't ask whether I'd read it, and I didn't say."] = "厄運之槌的灰塵裡有本書，叫《光明不會告訴你的事情》。我把它還給圖書館員，換了一枚皇家徽記。他們沒問我讀過沒有，我也沒說。"
L["Frost Shock and You turned up in the dust in Dire Maul, and the librarians gave me a royal seal to have it back. The elements had opinions about that title. For once I agreed with them."] = "《你與冰霜震擊》在厄運之槌的灰塵裡冒了出來，圖書館員給了我一枚皇家徽記，把它要了回去。元素們對這個書名很有意見。難得一次，我跟它們意見一致。"
L["Somebody had left The Arcanist's Cookbook lying in the dust in Dire Maul, so I returned it to the librarians for a royal seal. Did I try any of the recipes first? I'm not saying."] = "有人把《祕法師的食譜》丟在厄運之槌的灰塵裡，所以我把它還給圖書館員，換了一枚皇家徽記。我有沒有先試做幾道菜？這我不說。"
L["A tome called Harnessing Shadows was lying in the dust in Dire Maul. I gave it back to the librarians for a royal seal. Some of the company I keep would have kept it, but they're not the sort you lend books to."] = "一本叫《束縛之影》的典籍躺在厄運之槌的灰塵裡。我把它還給圖書館員，換了一枚皇家徽記。我身邊有些夥伴大概會把它留下來，不過那些傢伙本來就不是能借書的對象。"
L["I found The Emerald Dream lying in the dust in Dire Maul and took my time returning it. The librarians gave me a royal seal anyway. They'd waited this long; another afternoon did them no harm."] = "我在厄運之槌的灰塵裡發現了《翡翠夢境》，然後不慌不忙地拿去還。圖書館員還是給了我一枚皇家徽記。他們都等這麼久了，多等一個下午也無妨。"
L["Tabetha keeps a farm out in the Dustwallow muck, and while she was away somebody raided it and made off with her Tiara of the Deep. It turned up on Hydromancer Velratha, a sand troll in Zul'Farrak. I brought it home, and Tabetha apologized for having been so sharp with me, which almost never happens."] = "塔貝薩在塵泥沼澤的爛泥地裡有座農場，她不在的時候有人洗劫了那裡，搶走了她的深淵皇冠。後來皇冠出現在祖爾法拉克的沙怒食人妖水占師維蕾薩身上。我把它帶了回去，塔貝薩還為之前對我那麼兇道了歉，這種事幾乎從來沒發生過。"
L["Tran'rek in Gadgetzan had promised a cousin in Booty Bay a load of scarab shells weeks ago and was still telling stories instead of delivering. The last scarabs in Tanaris live in Zul'Farrak, so I went and got five. Uncracked, as ordered, though the scarabs had their own ideas about that."] = "加基森的特蘭雷克幾個星期前就答應要送一批聖甲蟲殼給藏寶海灣的一個表親，到現在還在編故事，就是不出貨。塔納利斯最後的聖甲蟲住在祖爾法拉克，所以我去弄了五個。照要求都是完整的，雖然聖甲蟲們對此另有想法。"
L["Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan had lent a Divino-matic Rod, a gadget for finding water, to a Sergeant Bly, who took it into Zul'Farrak with a band of adventurers and kept it. I found Bly and asked nicely. Then I asked the other way, which the engineer liked a lot better."] = "加基森的首席工程師沙克斯·比格維茲把一根探水棒，一種找水用的小玩意兒，借給了一個叫布萊中士的人，結果布萊帶著一群冒險者進了祖爾法拉克，從此就不還了。我找到布萊，好聲好氣地跟他要。然後我換了一種方式要，工程師對這種方式滿意多了。"
L["Trenton Lighthammer in Gadgetzan wanted twenty vials of troll temper, which the Sandfury brew out of sandstone. They carry it on them, so gathering it was mostly a matter of gathering trolls. Trenton called it very nice temper indeed, and I've never thought about temper since."] = "加基森的特倫頓·輕錘想要二十瓶食人妖調和劑，那是沙怒食人妖用砂岩熬出來的東西。他們隨身攜帶，所以收集調和劑基本上就是收集食人妖。特倫頓說這調和劑真是好極了，而從那之後我再也沒琢磨過調和劑這件事。"
L["Wizzle Brassbolts at the Mirage Raceway wanted an electrified scale off Gahz'rilla to power a racing car. Gahz'rilla is a hydra the Zul'Farrak trolls keep in a sacred pool, and they don't lend it out. Wizzle's only question when I got back was how big it really was, and the honest answer is bigger than whatever you're picturing."] = "沙漠賽道的維茲爾·銅栓想要加茲瑞拉身上一片帶電的鱗片，幫賽車提供動力。加茲瑞拉是祖爾法拉克的食人妖養在聖池裡的九頭蛇，他們可不外借。我回來之後，維茲爾唯一的問題是牠到底有多大，老實說，比你現在想像的還要大。"
L["Mallet of Zul'Farrak"] = "祖爾法拉克之槌"
L["the Altar of Zul, The Hinterlands"] = "祖爾祭壇，辛特蘭"
L["Take the Sacred Mallet from Qiaga the Keeper at the top of the Altar of Zul. Then use it at the altar at the top of Jintha'Alor to make the Mallet of Zul'Farrak, which rings the gong at Gahz'rilla's pool."] = "從祖爾祭壇頂上的守護者奇爾加手中奪取神聖之槌。接著在辛薩羅山頂的祭壇上使用它，把它變成祖爾法拉克之槌。用它可以敲響加茲瑞拉水池邊的鑼。"
L["The gong at Gahz'rilla's pool in Zul'Farrak answers to one mallet, and nobody sells it. Qiaga the Keeper had the Sacred Mallet at the top of the Altar of Zul and no plans to give it up. I took it anyway. It still had to go to the altar at the top of Jintha'Alor, and one use there made it the Mallet of Zul'Farrak.\n\nIt doesn't break and it doesn't get used up, so I can ring for that hydra whenever I like. Whether I'd like to is another matter."] = "祖爾法拉克裡加茲瑞拉水池邊的那面鑼，只認一把槌子，而且沒人在賣。神聖之槌在祖爾祭壇頂上的守護者奇爾加手裡，對方根本沒打算交出來。我還是拿到手了。之後還得把它帶到辛薩羅山頂的祭壇上，在那裡用一次，它就成了祖爾法拉克之槌。\n\n它不會壞，也不會用掉，所以我想什麼時候叫那隻九頭蛇出來都行。至於我想不想，那是另一回事。"
L["Venom Bottle"] = "毒液瓶"
L["In a Witherbark village in the Hinterlands there were more bottles of vile green venom than any troll needs, so I took one to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill. Lydon wanted better than a bottle: an undamaged venom sac, and undamaged was the hard part. Once Lydon had it, the question was what kind of spider the trolls had been milking, and Lydon sent me to ask Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village, who knows trolls."] = "辛特蘭的一個枯木食人妖村子裡，擺著的噁心綠色毒液瓶比哪個食人妖需要的都多，所以我拿了一瓶去給塔倫米爾的藥劑師林度恩。林度恩想要的比一瓶毒液更好：一個完好無損的毒囊，難就難在完好無損。東西到手後，問題就成了食人妖們到底是從哪種蜘蛛身上擠的毒，林度恩便打發我去森金村問加德林大師，他懂食人妖。"
L["Gryphon Master Talonaxe at Aerie Peak had lost a young gryphon called Sharpbeak and suspected the Witherbark trolls. I searched the cages in both of their villages and found no gryphon. At the top of the Altar of Zul I found one of Sharpbeak's feathers, and no Sharpbeak. Talonaxe sent me off with the feather to Thadius Grimshade at Nethergarde Keep, who finds things by other means."] = "鷹巢山的獅鷲獸管理員沙拉克·鷹斧丟了一隻叫沙普比克的小獅鷲，懷疑是枯木食人妖幹的。我把他們兩個村子裡的籠子都搜了一遍，沒找到獅鷲。在祖爾祭壇頂上，我找到一根沙普比克的羽毛，卻沒見到沙普比克。沙拉克·鷹斧讓我帶著羽毛去守望堡找薩迪斯·格希德，他有別的辦法找東西。"
L["Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village needed the true name of the spider god the Witherbark worship, and it was written on a tablet in Zul'Farrak that Theka the Martyr was guarding. Theka stopped guarding it. The name is Elortha no Shadra, and I'm told to say it only in whispers, so lean in."] = "森金村的加德林大師需要枯木食人妖崇拜的蜘蛛之神的真名，那名字刻在祖爾法拉克的一塊石板上，由殉教者塞卡守著。後來塞卡不守了。那名字是伊洛薩·諾·沙德拉，有人交代我只能小聲說，所以靠過來一點。"
L["Mazu'kon, out in Mulgore, wanted the head of Witch Doctor Zum'rah, who keeps the graveyard in Zul'Farrak and doesn't welcome visitors. Zum'rah raised the dead at us by the handful. The head came back with me anyway, which was the only part Mazu'kon cared about."] = "莫高雷的瑪庫可想要巫醫祖穆拉恩的腦袋，那傢伙看守著祖爾法拉克的墓地，不歡迎訪客。祖穆拉恩一批一批地喚起死人來對付我們。腦袋最後還是跟著我回來了，而瑪庫可在乎的也只有這一點。"
L["Thadius Grimshade at Nethergarde Keep offered to find a lost gryphon named Sharpbeak by magic, in exchange for Nekrum Gutchewer's medallion out of Zul'Farrak. Rumor said it gave its wearer an unnaturally long life at a price, and Grimshade was confident the price could be avoided. They always are."] = "守望堡的薩迪斯·格希德提議用魔法找到一頭叫沙普比克的走失獅鷲，條件是拿祖爾法拉克裡耐克魯姆的徽章來換。傳聞那枚徽章能讓佩戴者活得異常長久，但要付出代價，而格希德很有把握能避開這個代價。他們總是很有把握。"
L["Archmage Lan'dalock of Dalaran wanted the head of Witch Doctor Zum'rah, who keeps the graveyard in Zul'Farrak. Zum'rah's reply was to wake the graveyard up. The archmage got the head all the same, and I learned that the dead there stay down only once their witch doctor does."] = "達拉然的大法師朗達拉克想要巫醫祖穆拉恩的腦袋，那傢伙看守著祖爾法拉克的墓地。祖穆拉恩的回應是把整片墓地都叫醒。大法師照樣拿到了腦袋，而我學到一件事：那裡的死人，要等他們的巫醫倒下了才會乖乖躺好。"
L["Marvon Rivetseeker, a goblin who studies troll ruins, had been inside the Sunken Temple once and nearly died poking a serpent statue. Marvon's theory was that the altar at the bottom of the round room held the secret, so down I went with a stone circle to test it. It fit exactly and locked in place, which in that temple is never the end of it."] = "瑪爾馮·瑞文斯克是個研究食人妖遺跡的哥布林，進過一次沉沒的神廟，戳了一座蛇像，差點沒命。瑪爾馮的理論是，圓形大廳底部的祭壇藏著秘密，所以我帶著一塊石環下去驗證。它剛好嵌了進去，牢牢卡住，而在那座神廟裡，這從來都不是事情的結尾。"
L["Marvon Rivetseeker had a hazy memory of lights over the ring of serpent statues in the Sunken Temple, and a hunch they guarded treasure. Light them in the right order and something does happen: a very large guardian turns up to object. Behind the idol's glass eye sat the Atal'ai treasure, worth every bit of the argument."] = "瑪爾馮·瑞文斯克模糊記得，沉沒的神廟裡那一圈蛇像上方曾經亮起光芒，直覺那是在守護寶藏。照正確的順序把它們點亮，確實會發生一些事：一個非常巨大的守護者跑出來表示反對。神像的玻璃眼睛後面就是阿塔萊的寶藏，這一架打得值得。"
L["Brohann Caskbelly in Stormwind had one last assignment for the Explorers' League before retiring: ten Atal'ai tablets out of the Sunken Temple. Pride kept him from asking for help, right up until he asked me. I brought the tablets, and Brohann said both our names would go into the League's history, though I've never gone to check."] = "暴風城的布羅哈恩·鐵桶退休前還有探險者協會的最後一項任務：從沉沒的神廟裡帶出十塊阿塔萊石板。自尊心讓他一直不肯求助，直到他開口找了我。我帶回了石板，布羅哈恩說我們兩個的名字都會寫進協會的歷史，不過我從來沒去確認過。"
L["Fel'zerul in Stonard didn't trust the Atal'ai or their talk of Hakkar making them immortal, and wanted twenty of their Fetishes of Hakkar to learn what they were for. Twenty is a lot of fetishes. Every one of them came off an Atal'ai who believed very sincerely."] = "斯通納德的費澤盧爾不信任阿塔萊，也不信他們說哈卡會讓他們永生那一套，想要二十個哈卡神像，弄清楚那些東西是做什麼用的。二十個神像可不少。每一個都是從一個非常虔誠的阿塔萊身上拿來的。"
L["An Atal'ai exile out in the Hinterlands, cast out by the tribe, wanted the head of Jammal'an the Prophet, who had convinced them all that Hakkar would make them immortal. I brought the head. The exile had hoped it might free the tribe, and mourned them anyway."] = "辛特蘭有個被部族趕出來的阿塔萊流放者，想要預言者迦瑪蘭的腦袋，正是迦瑪蘭讓全族都相信哈卡會讓他們永生。我帶回了腦袋。流放者原本希望這能讓部族解脫，但還是為他們哀悼。"
L["When the shade of Eranikus fell, it left a gem holding part of the dragon's essence, and a voice asking me to set it in the font in its lair so it could finally rest. I did, and the font turned out to be tainted as well, and the last I heard was Eranikus begging me to find the green dragonflight. I've done favors that went better."] = "伊蘭尼庫斯的陰影倒下後，留下了一顆封存著巨龍部分精華的寶石，還有一個聲音，請我把它放進巢穴裡的精華之泉，讓它終於能夠安息。我照做了，結果泉水也被汙染了，我最後聽到的，是伊蘭尼庫斯求我去找綠龍軍團。我幫過的忙裡，比這順利的多得是。"
L["Olana Brighthoof, a sun priest near Thunder Bluff, had seen it in a vision: past Earth Song Falls, a chamber of white crystals with giants on guard, and at the very top, the right eye of the Earthmother. The vision was right about everything, giants included. I carried it back to Mulgore, where it belongs, under the open sky."] = "歐菈娜‧亮蹄是雷霆崖附近的一位太陽祭司，曾在幻象中看見：越過地歌瀑布，有一間滿是白色水晶的石室，巨人在那裡守衛，而在最頂端，就是大地之母的右眼。幻象說的全都對，連巨人都沒說錯。我把它帶回了莫高雷，回到它該在的地方，開闊的天空底下。"
L["In the lower Spire a goblin named Bijou, who doesn't usually deal with my sort, traded me a map for her lost belongings. Marshal Maxwell picked three names off it, a war master, a highlord and an overlord, and sent me back to cross them out. That bought the Alliance precious, precious time, he said, precious enough to say twice."] = "在黑石塔下層，一個叫比修的哥布林，平常不跟我這種人打交道，卻用一張地圖跟我換回她遺失的東西。麥克斯韋爾元帥從地圖上挑出三個名字，一個指揮官、一個大王、一個主宰，派我回去把他們劃掉。他說，這為聯盟爭取到寶貴的、寶貴的時間，寶貴到值得說兩次。"
L["A dead serpent in the lower Spire turned out to be carrying a letter: General Drakkisath's own orders, mostly about protocol. Marshal Maxwell read it, said the plot thickened, and sent me back up to destroy the general. I was going anyway, but I let him think it was his idea."] = "黑石塔下層有條死掉的大蛇，身上居然帶著一封信：達基薩斯將軍親自下的命令，大部分在講禮節規矩。麥克斯韋爾元帥讀完，說事情越來越複雜了，又派我回去消滅那位將軍。我本來就要去，不過我讓他以為這是他的主意。"
L["On the way up to the Spire, a quartermaster was carrying a letter from Rend Blackhand, mostly insults, saying only those with the Mark of Drakkisath could use the Orb of Command into Blackwing Lair, and the general guards the brand himself. With the general past guarding anything, I pressed my hand to the smoldering brand. I didn't flinch, much."] = "在上黑石塔的路上，有個軍需官身上帶著雷德·黑手的一封信，內容大半是罵人的話，說只有身負達基薩斯徽記的人才能用命令寶珠進入黑翼之巢，而那枚烙印由將軍親自看守。既然將軍已經什麼都守不了了，我就把手按在那枚冒著煙的烙印上。我沒怎麼縮手。"
L["Helendis Riverhorn at the Vigil had noticed that killing worgs never left fewer worgs, and sent me into the Spire to find out why. The why was Halycon, their gigantic den mother, and I put her down. Helendis told me not to dwell on her suffering, which I hadn't planned to."] = "在摩根的崗哨，赫林迪斯·河角注意到，座狼怎麼殺都不會變少，於是派我進黑石塔查個清楚。原因就是哈雷肯，牠們那頭巨大的狼窩之母，我把她解決了。赫林迪斯叫我別去想她受的苦，我本來也沒打算去想。"
L["Mayara Brightwing hunts art for Count Remington Ridgewell's family museum and had found a piece in the Spire: Doomrigger's Clasp, a jeweled relic said to make dwarves weep. I dug it out of the old Hall of Fortune and took it to the count in a crate. His gratitude, I was told, is nigh worth a king's ransom, and nigh is doing a lot of work there."] = "瑪亞拉·布萊特文替雷明頓·瑞治維爾伯爵的家族博物館搜羅藝術品，在黑石塔裡找到了一件：末日扣環，一件鑲滿寶石的遺物，據說能讓矮人看了落淚。我從昔日的財富大廳裡把它挖了出來，裝進箱子送去給伯爵。有人告訴我，他的感激幾乎抵得上一筆國王的贖金，而「幾乎」這兩個字在這裡可是出了大力。"
L["Vaelan, in the lower Spire, wanted a gemstone from each of three generals and an old seal to set them in. Forging it took black dragonfire, so I wore Emberstrife down in the Wyrmbog and borrowed his mind just long enough to make him breathe on it. That seal is the key to the upper Spire, and not many keys get made that way."] = "黑石塔下層的維埃蘭想要三位將軍身上各一塊寶鑽，外加一枚用來鑲嵌它們的古老印章。鑄造它需要黑龍之火，所以我在巨龍沼澤把艾博斯塔夫打到筋疲力盡，借用了他的心智，剛好夠讓他朝印章噴一口火。那枚印章就是黑石塔上層的鑰匙，用這種方法造出來的鑰匙可不多。"
L["Tinkee Steamboil at Flame Crest had built a gadget for freezing black dragon eggs solid and needed someone to try it in the Rookery atop the Spire. It worked, so I went back up and collected eight. Freeze them first, Tinkee said, or they might hatch before you get them, which is advice you only need once."] = "烈焰峰的丁奇·斯迪波爾做了一個能把黑龍蛋凍得硬梆梆的裝置，需要有人去黑石塔頂的孵化間試試看。它有用，所以我又上去收集了八顆。丁奇說，先把它們凍起來，不然你還沒拿到就孵出來了，這種建議你只需要聽一次。"
L["Kibler at Flame Crest tames exotic beasts for rich clients, and wanted a Bloodaxe worg pup out of the Spire before it grew too old to train. I carried one back in a cage, and Kibler gave me a tame one of my own. It is very ferocious and about the size of a boot."] = "烈焰峰的基布雷爾幫有錢的客人馴養奇珍異獸，想要一隻黑石塔裡的小血斧座狼，得趁牠還沒大到訓練不了的時候弄來。我用籠子提回來一隻，基布雷爾送了我一隻馴好的。牠非常兇猛，個頭大概跟一隻靴子差不多。"
L["Kibler's helper had gone into the Spire for spider eggs weeks before and still wasn't back, so I fetched fifteen myself. Some people, Kibler says, will pay good gold for the most vile of domesticated beasts. I got one free, a little Smolderweb spider, along with a warning not to get bitten."] = "基布雷爾的助手幾個星期前進黑石塔去拿蜘蛛卵，到現在還沒回來，所以我自己去拿了十五枚。基布雷爾說，有些人願意花大把金幣買最噁心的家養野獸。我免費得到一隻，一隻小小的煙網蜘蛛，外加一句叮嚀：別被咬了。"
L["Ragged John wanted Mother Smolderweb's venom, and not in a jar: he wanted it live, in my veins. So I let the biggest spider in the Spire bite me, walked back feeling awful, and he milked it out of me for the best ale he'd ever brewed. You thought I wanted it for poison, he said, crazy kids."] = "狼狽不堪的約翰想要煙網蛛后的毒液，而且不要裝在罐子裡的：他要活的，流在我血管裡的。於是我讓黑石塔裡最大的那隻蜘蛛咬了我一口，一路難受地走回去，他再從我身上把毒液擠出來，釀出他這輩子最棒的麥酒。他說，你們還以為我要拿它做毒藥啊，瘋孩子們。"
L["Urok Doomhowl had cursed Warosh mute, so all Warosh could do was hand me a scroll that came down to: get my mojo. I got the mojo, and with a voice again Warosh told me I was a fool to think I'd reach the top of the Spire, but that my bravery was beyond question. I've had warmer thanks, and worse."] = "烏洛克詛咒瓦羅什變成啞巴，所以瓦羅什能做的只有遞給我一張卷軸，歸結起來就一句話：把我的魔精拿來。我拿到了魔精，瓦羅什又能說話了，就告訴我，以為自己能登上黑石塔頂真是個傻瓜，不過我的勇氣無庸置疑。我收過更熱情的道謝，也收過更糟的。"
L["Deep in the Spire, Awbee gave me a scale and sent me to Winterspring, where you stand on a cobalt rune in the caves of Mazthoril and end up in front of Haleh. Haleh scried what Awbee had seen in that doomed place. Dragons, I learned, are forbidden to meddle in mortal affairs, unless one of their own starts it."] = "在黑石塔深處，奧比給了我一片鱗片，要我去冬泉谷，在麥索瑞爾的洞穴裡站上一枚鈷藍色的符文，人就會出現在哈爾琳面前。哈爾琳用占卜看到了奧比在那個註定毀滅的地方所見的一切。我這才知道，巨龍是不准插手凡人事務的，除非是牠們自己的同類先動的手。"
L["We skinned the Beast in the upper Spire, and out climbed a gnome named Pip Quickwit, in a suit, delighted with how the suit had held up. Pip sent me to Malyfous Darkhammer in Everlook with the news and a glowing lump of the Beast's insides. Malyfous asked if Pip was alive, if the suit worked, and then mostly about the lump."] = "我們在黑石塔上層幫比斯巨獸剝皮，結果裡面爬出來一個叫皮普·捷思的地精，穿著一身防護服，對這身衣服的表現非常滿意。皮普要我帶著這個消息和一塊發光的比斯巨獸內臟，去永望鎮找瑪雷弗斯·暗錘。瑪雷弗斯問了皮普是不是還活著、衣服好不好用，接下來問的幾乎都是那塊東西。"
L["Lorax, out in the snows of Winterspring, had bought the soul of a Spire smith named Goraluk Anvilcrack and sent me to collect it with a fel-soaked pike. Goraluk died, the pike drank him up, and I brought back the breastplate he'd stolen too. Lorax thanked me in rhyme, which somehow made it worse."] = "冬泉谷雪地裡的羅拉克斯買下了黑石塔一個鐵匠古拉魯克的靈魂，派我帶著一支浸滿惡魔能量的長矛去收貨。古拉魯克死了，長矛把他吸得一乾二淨，我順便把他偷走的胸甲也帶了回來。羅拉克斯用押韻的話向我道謝，不知為何，這讓事情變得更糟。"
L["Warlord Goretooth was recruiting in Kargath for the Expeditionary Force and wanted the Horde's best, with a speech to match. The cowards were invited to leave. I stayed, and got a grin and my orders, which from Goretooth is about as warm as it gets."] = "軍官高圖斯在卡加斯為遠征軍招兵，要的是部落最優秀的人，還配上一段相稱的演講。膽小鬼被請出去了。我留了下來，得到一個咧嘴笑和我的命令，在高圖斯那裡，這已經算是最熱情的待遇了。"
L["Grandmaster Lexlort in Kargath warned me never to trust a goblin, then sent me into the Spire to bring one back: Bijou, an operative who'd been spending Horde gold on side jobs. Bijou had lost her spy gear fleeing an alarm, so I found it, and the reports came back to Kargath without her. Lexlort had to hand it to her: weaseled out again."] = "卡加斯的雷克斯洛特大師警告我永遠別相信哥布林，接著就派我進黑石塔去帶一個回來：比修，一個拿部落的金子去做私活的探子。比修在躲警報的時候弄丟了她的間諜裝備，於是我把它找了回來，報告送回了卡加斯，人卻沒有。雷克斯洛特也不得不佩服她：又讓她溜了。"
L["Galamav the Marksman in Kargath said the Blackrock worgs were no demons, just the brood of Halycon and her mate, so I went into the Spire and killed Halycon. Galamav asked whether I'd survived the rabid pups and Gizrul the Slavener too. I was standing right there, so I let the question answer itself."] = "卡加斯的神射手賈拉瑪弗說，黑石的座狼不是什麼惡魔，只是哈雷肯和牠配偶的後代，於是我進黑石塔殺了哈雷肯。賈拉瑪弗問我，是不是連那些發狂的幼狼和奴役者基茲盧爾也撐過來了。我就站在那裡，所以讓這個問題自己回答。"
L["Word came from the Undercity that Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave in Kargath wanted a tablet out of the Spire. Urheld Darkstone, a dwarven alchemist thought mad in his day, had carved his formulae into stone rather than share them, and I found one in what was once the Hall of Fortune. Mad or not, the man kept good notes."] = "幽暗城傳來消息，說卡加斯的暗法師薇薇安·拉格雷想要黑石塔裡的一塊石板。烏赫爾德·黑石是一位矮人鍊金術師，在他那個年代被當成瘋子，他寧可把配方刻進石頭裡也不願與人分享，而我在昔日的財富大廳裡找到了一塊。瘋不瘋另當別論，這人的筆記做得可真好。"
L["Franclorn Forgewright, the architect of the Dark Iron city, only appears to the dead, so the first thing I had to do was die. Franclorn's hammer, Ironfel, was in the hands of Fineous Darkvire. I took it back and laid it in the hands of Franclorn's statue, and a little door in the base opened on the key to the city."] = "弗蘭克羅恩·鑄鐵是黑鐵之城的建築師，只在死人面前現身，所以我要做的第一件事就是去死。弗蘭克羅恩的戰錘鐵膽落在弗諾斯·達克維爾手裡。我把它奪了回來，放到弗蘭克羅恩雕像的手中，底座上的一扇小門打開了，裡面就是這座城市的鑰匙。"
L["Cyrus Therepentous, out in the Burning Steppes, wanted to taste the fire of Blackrock. Not a request I get often. The fire was Bael'Gar, a giant of pure flame down in the depths. Once Bael'Gar was dead, a scrap of altered dragon molt drew out the essence. Cyrus snatched it from me and told me to take my reward and get out of sight."] = "燃燒平原的塞勒斯·薩雷芬圖斯想嚐嚐黑石的火焰。這種要求我可不常聽到。那火焰就是貝爾加，深淵底下一個純粹由烈焰構成的巨人。貝爾加一死，一塊特殊的黑龍皮就把精華吸了出來。塞勒斯從我手裡一把搶過去，叫我拿了報酬就快從他眼前消失。"
L["Yuka Screwspigot at Flame Crest had a relative to collect: Ribbly, who'd spent the family's money on one scheme after another and was hiding in Blackrock Depths. Booty Bay had put a bounty on Ribbly, and the family was delighted. Ribbly was finally worth something. Yuka wanted Ribbly back alive, if possible. It wasn't."] = "烈焰峰的尤卡·斯庫比格特有個親戚要帶回去：雷布里，這傢伙把家裡的錢一次又一次砸進各種發財計畫，現在躲在黑石深淵裡。藏寶海灣懸賞捉拿雷布里，全家都樂壞了。雷布里終於值點錢了。尤卡希望雷布里能活著回來，如果可能的話。結果不可能。"
L["Maxwort Uberglint at Flame Crest had wanted the Heart of the Mountain for years, a gem the size of your fist, and the Dark Irons wouldn't sell. So I let myself into their vault. You open every coffer in the place before the safe's watchman turns up, and then the watchman has to go. Maxwort was delighted. The Dark Irons, less so."] = "烈焰峰的麥克斯沃特·尤柏格林惦記山脈之心好多年了，那是一顆拳頭大的寶石，可是黑鐵矮人就是不賣。所以我自己進了他們的寶庫。你得先把裡面每個保險箱都打開，金庫的看守才會出現，然後就得把看守解決掉。麥克斯沃特高興極了。黑鐵矮人就沒那麼高興了。"
L["Jalinda Sprig at Morgan's Vigil couldn't get a team into the mountain while Lord Incendius kept raising Overmaster Pyron from the ashes. So Incendius had to go. When I reported that Incendius had said the name Ragnaros, Jalinda asked if I was sure, patted my wrist and drifted off into deep thought. I was sure. I'd rather not have been."] = "在摩根的崗哨，加琳達沒辦法派人進山，因為伊森迪奧斯一直讓征服者派隆從灰燼中復活。所以伊森迪奧斯非死不可。當我回報說伊森迪奧斯提到了拉格納羅斯的名字，加琳達問我確不確定，拍了拍我的手腕，就陷入了沉思。我很確定。我倒寧願自己不確定。"
L["Oralius at Morgan's Vigil talks like a pirate and was convinced the Dark Irons kept the good stuff in their fanny packs. I brought back twenty. Oralius sniffed through the pile, very happy with the goodies, and let me keep one. I'm still not sure what the good stuff was. I'm not sure I want to know."] = "摩根的崗哨有個奧拉留斯，說話像個海盜，堅信黑鐵矮人把好東西都藏在他們的挎包裡。我帶回來二十個。奧拉留斯在那堆東西裡嗅來嗅去，對這些寶貝非常滿意，還讓我留了一個。我到現在都不確定那好東西到底是什麼。我也不確定我想不想知道。"
L["Ragnar Thunderbrew in Kharanos had a grievance: the Dark Irons had stolen the family lager recipe. Ragnar wanted every keg of it in Blackrock Depths smashed and the recipe brought home, and called the thieves villains who didn't deserve such a fine brew. Hurley Blackbreath, who had it, disagreed. Briefly. Part of my pay was lager."] = "卡拉諾斯的拉格納·雷酒滿肚子怨氣：黑鐵矮人偷走了家傳的淡啤酒秘方。拉格納要我把黑石深淵裡每一桶這種酒都砸爛，再把秘方帶回家，還說那些小偷都是惡棍，根本不配喝這麼好的酒。秘方在霍爾雷·黑鬚手上，他有不同的意見。沒持續多久。我的報酬裡有一部分是淡啤酒。"
L["Mistress Nagmara, a succubus working the Grim Guzzler, had one customer immune to her charms: Private Rocknot. So she wanted a love potion, and I did the shopping. Gromsblood, silver veins out of the cliff giants of Azshara, and spring water from Un'Goro. Last I saw, Nagmara was mixing it and Rocknot was still drinking. Poor Rocknot."] = "娜瑪拉小姐是在黑石深淵的酒館裡招呼客人的魅魔，有一位客人對她的魅力完全免疫：羅克諾特下士。所以她想要一瓶愛情藥水，而跑腿採買的是我。格羅姆之血、艾薩拉懸崖巨人身上的銀礦，還有安戈洛的溫泉水。我最後一次看到他們時，娜瑪拉正在調藥，羅克諾特還在喝酒。可憐的羅克諾特。"
L["Somewhere in the depths there's a chalice floating in the air, and it takes offerings: two star rubies, twenty gold bars and ten of truesilver. They made no sound going in. For that, Gloom'rel agreed to teach me to smelt dark iron. Easily the most expensive lesson I've ever taken."] = "深淵裡的某個地方有一隻飄在半空中的杯子，它接受供品：兩顆紅寶石、二十塊金錠、十塊真銀錠。丟進去的時候一點聲音都沒有。為此，格魯雷爾答應教我熔煉黑鐵。這絕對是我上過最貴的一堂課。"
L["Lokhtos Darkbargainer sells the Thorium Brotherhood's secrets out of the Grim Guzzler, and everything comes with a contract. Mine had me swear my sulfuron ingot was genuine and not a facsimile, and that TB Ltd. was not responsible for anything that happened if I went looking for Sulfuras. I signed. I got hammer plans and a cheerful good luck."] = "羅克圖斯·暗契在黑石深淵的酒館裡兜售瑟銀兄弟會的秘密，什麼東西都附帶一份契約。我那份要我發誓，我的薩弗隆鐵錠是真品而不是仿製品，還要我同意，如果我跑去找薩弗拉斯，不管出了什麼事都與瑟銀兄弟會（TB Ltd.）無關。我簽了。我拿到了錘子的設計圖，外加一句開朗的「祝你好運」。"
L["Kargath has its own way of hiring: a poster that says KILL ON SIGHT. The first one listed the Dark Iron rank and file, guardsmen, wardens and footmen. Once Warlord Goretooth had counted those, a second poster went up for the medics, soldiers and officers. I appreciate an employer who puts it in writing."] = "卡加斯招人有自己的一套：一張寫著「格殺勿論」的告示。第一張列的是黑鐵矮人的一般兵卒：衛士、獄卒和步兵。等軍官高圖斯把這些數清楚了，第二張告示就貼了出來，這次是醫師、士兵和軍官。我欣賞白紙黑字寫清楚的雇主。"
L["Lexlort in Kargath wanted a traitor, Grark Lorkrub, who'd been feeding our plans to the Blackrock orcs. I shackled Grark in a Blackrock fortress and walked him out through the mountain, hearing all the way that I'd never make it. I made it. Then Warlord Goretooth sent me after General Angerforge, who'd planned the slaughter of the 109th. Also done."] = "卡加斯的雷克斯洛特要抓一個叛徒，格拉克·洛克魯布，他一直把我們的計畫洩漏給黑石獸人。我在一座黑石要塞裡幫格拉克銬上鐐銬，押著他穿過整座山走出來，一路上都在聽他說我絕對走不出去。我走出去了。接著軍官高圖斯派我去對付安格弗將軍，就是他策劃了對第109師的屠殺。這件事也辦完了。"
L["Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave in Kargath wanted a lager recipe the Dark Irons had stolen from some dwarven brewers. The ale is said to make the drinker stronger and braver, and the Forsaken would like to know how. I fetched it, and off it went to the Apothecarium for study. It's the first time I've felt sorry for a beer."] = "卡加斯的暗法師薇薇安·拉格雷想要一份淡啤酒秘方，那是黑鐵矮人從幾個矮人釀酒師手中偷來的。據說這種酒能讓喝的人更強壯、更勇敢，被遺忘者很想知道原因。我把它拿回來了，然後它就被送去煉金區做研究。這是我第一次替一杯啤酒感到難過。"
L["The Dark Irons' golems run on something special, and Vivian Lagrave wanted ten essences of it for some Forsaken abominations. Turn the city upside down if you must, I was told. I started with the golems and the dwarves who build them, and never needed to turn anything else over."] = "黑鐵矮人的傀儡靠一種特別的東西驅動，薇薇安·拉格雷想要十份這種精華，用在被遺忘者的憎惡體身上。必要的話就把整座城翻過來，有人這樣跟我說。我先從傀儡和製造傀儡的矮人下手，結果根本不用再翻其他地方。"
L["Thunderheart in Kargath felt something foul seeping out of Blackrock Mountain, and wanted Lord Incendius dead on the theory that the servant leads you to the master. Incendius died, and I brought back the Tablet of Kurniya. Thunderheart took it, said the name Ragnaros, and told Kargath to decide whether to stand or run. I've had warmer welcomes."] = "卡加斯的桑德哈特感覺到有某種汙穢的東西正從黑石山滲出來，想要伊森迪奧斯的命，理由是僕人會帶你找到主人。伊森迪奧斯死了，我帶回了庫爾尼亞石板。桑德哈特接過去，說出了拉格納羅斯的名字，然後要卡加斯決定是要堅守還是逃跑。我受過更熱情的歡迎。"
L["Lotwil Veriatus was sure Golem Lord Argelmach had died ten years ago, so new machines bearing Argelmach's marks had Lotwil rattled. I brought back Argelmach's head and ten elemental cores from the golems around him. The head was metal, a Dark Iron construct. Lotwil now expects another one, and frankly so do I."] = "魯特維爾·沃拉圖斯確信傀儡統帥阿格曼奇十年前就死了，所以那些帶著阿格曼奇標記的新機器讓魯特維爾心神不寧。我帶回了阿格曼奇的頭，還有從他身邊那些傀儡身上弄來的十塊元素核心。那顆頭是金屬做的，是黑鐵矮人造的構裝體。魯特維爾現在預料還會再冒出一個，老實說，我也這麼想。"
L["Alaana Stormwalker near Thunder Bluff had word that the wall between our world and the Firelands had cracked somewhere under Blackrock Mountain, and that giants of molten rock were walking through. Alaana called that thrilling and terrifying and wanted a piece of one to study. I brought back a fragment. I'd have gone with terrifying."] = "雷霆崖附近的阿菈娜‧雷暴行者聽說，我們的世界和火源之界之間的屏障在黑石山底下某處裂開了，熔岩巨人正從裂縫走過來。阿菈娜說這既刺激又可怕，想要一塊它們身上的碎片來研究。我帶回了一塊碎片。換作是我，只會說可怕。"
L["Betina Bigglezink at Light's Hope has studied the plague for years and thinks the rest of us don't worry enough. Twenty samples of fresh plagued flesh said the plague had changed, so it was back into Stratholme to search the ziggurats for Scourge data. Betina called it astonishing and months of work, which to a scientist is good news."] = "聖光之願禮拜堂的貝蒂娜·比格辛克研究瘟疫好多年了，覺得我們其他人擔心得還不夠。二十份新鮮的瘟疫肉塊顯示瘟疫已經變異，所以我又回到斯坦索姆，到通靈塔裡搜尋天譴軍團的檔案。貝蒂娜說這真是驚人，夠她忙好幾個月，這對一個科學家來說可是好消息。"
L["Smokey LaRue at Light's Hope hadn't had a decent smoke since Stratholme fell, and said so, often. The tobacconist there had vowed to burn every leaf before the Scourge got any, and missed a box. Smokey got the stogies back, and I got Smokey's lighter, which seemed fair."] = "聖光之願禮拜堂的煙鬼拉魯恩自從斯坦索姆淪陷後就沒抽過一口像樣的菸，這話常掛在嘴邊。那裡的菸草商發過誓，寧可把每一片菸葉都燒掉也不留給天譴軍團，結果漏了一盒。煙鬼拿回了雪茄，我拿到了煙鬼的打火機，這很公平。"
L["Leonid Barthalomew the Revered calls undeath an illness, Leonid's own included, and gets on with the work regardless. The work this time was the Argent Dawn's spare holy water, sitting in supply crates in Stratholme. The Scourge won't touch holy water, but the vermin in those crates hadn't heard."] = "萊尼德·巴薩羅梅把不死狀態稱作一種病，包括萊尼德自己的，然後照樣埋頭工作。這次的工作是銀色黎明的備用聖水，就放在斯坦索姆的補給箱裡。天譴軍團不會碰聖水，可是那些箱子裡的害蟲顯然沒聽說過。"
L["Egan lives out in Terrordale on hatred of the Scourge, and handed me a blaster for the ghosts in Stratholme's streets. Blast a ghost and the soul steps out of it, blast it again and it's free. After fifteen of those, Egan asked whether I'd seen his mother."] = "伊根住在恐懼谷，靠著對天譴軍團的仇恨活著，他交給我一把衝擊器，專門對付斯坦索姆街上的鬼魂。衝擊一個鬼魂，靈魂就會從裡面走出來，再衝擊一次，它就自由了。這樣解放了十五個之後，伊根問我有沒有看到他的母親。"
L["Nathanos Blightcaller has a grudge with a face on it: Ramstein the Gorger stood over him when he died defending his own farm, and he hunted it across the wastes until it hid in Stratholme. I brought him the head. He spat and said it was going on his wall."] = "納薩諾斯‧凋零者的仇恨是有臉的：當年他為了保衛自己的農場而死時，吞嚥者拉姆斯登就站在他身旁，後來他一路追殺這傢伙橫越荒野，直到牠躲進斯坦索姆。我把那顆頭帶給他。他啐了一口，說要把它掛到牆上。"
L["Aurius was holed up in a Stratholme chapel, the only thing keeping him from turning death knight. With the Medallion of Faith back from a Scarlet zealot he could leave, and he went straight for Baron Rivendare. He was dying when it was over, but he said his soul was saved, and seemed to think that the better bargain."] = "奧里克斯躲在斯坦索姆的一座小教堂裡，那是唯一能讓他不變成死亡騎士的地方。等我從一個血色狂熱者手中拿回信仰獎章，他終於能離開了，而他直接衝向瑞文戴爾男爵。一切結束時他已經奄奄一息，但他說他的靈魂得救了，看來他覺得這筆交易比較划算。"
L["Leonid Barthalomew sent me over to Betina Bigglezink with some frozen eggs, and Betina sent me back into Scholomance with something called Dawn's Gambit, to set down in the Viewing Room. A gambit, as I understand it, means giving up a piece to win the game. I made sure the piece was Vectus."] = "萊尼德·巴薩羅梅要我帶著幾顆冰凍的龍蛋去找貝蒂娜·比格辛克，貝蒂娜又要我帶著一個叫「黎明先鋒」的東西回到通靈學院，把它放在觀察室裡。照我的理解，先鋒就是棋盤上最先被犧牲的那一枚。我確保被犧牲的是維克圖斯。"
L["Betina Bigglezink at Light's Hope wanted twenty plagued dragon hatchlings put down in Scholomance. Somewhere in all that plague I found one healthy dragon scale, and brought that back too. I don't know what Betina wanted it for. In Scholomance, anything healthy is worth a second look."] = "聖光之願禮拜堂的貝蒂娜·比格辛克要我在通靈學院解決二十隻瘟疫幼龍。在那一大片瘟疫裡，我找到了一片健康的龍鱗，也一起帶了回來。我不知道貝蒂娜要它做什麼。在通靈學院，任何健康的東西都值得多看一眼。"
L["Prospector Ironband in Loch Modan had lost a prospector named Agmond, whose last report mentioned carved stone urns at the dig outside Uldaman, and Ironband suspected the urns were what had stirred up the troggs. I brought back four. The troggs did seem to feel strongly about them."] = "洛克莫丹的勘察員基恩薩·鐵環手下有個叫阿戈莫德的勘察員失蹤了，他最後一份報告提到了奧達曼外挖掘場的雕紋石罐，鐵環懷疑正是這些石罐驚動了穴居人。我帶回來四個。穴居人對它們的感情看來確實很深。"
L["When the troggs overran Uldaman, Krom Stoutarm left his greatest treasure behind in a chest at the end of the North Common Hall. I fought my way to it and carried it home to Ironforge, and it was a beer stein. A Stoutarm without a stein, Krom explained with feeling, is hardly a Stoutarm at all."] = "穴居人佔領奧達曼的時候，克羅姆·粗臂把他最珍貴的寶物留在北部大廳盡頭的一個箱子裡。我一路殺過去，把它帶回了鐵爐堡，結果那是個啤酒杯。克羅姆激動地解釋說，粗臂家的人沒有啤酒杯，根本就稱不上是粗臂家的人。"
L["Prospector Stormpike of the Explorers' League sent me after Baelog, whose band had gone into Uldaman and got stuck there. Baelog couldn't go anywhere, but his journal told me how to open a hidden chamber behind a huge locked door, and the chamber was real. Stormpike admitted to having had doubts, which Baelog never had."] = "探險者協會的勘察員塔伯斯·雷矛派我去找貝洛格，他的隊伍進了奧達曼，被困在裡面。貝洛格哪裡也去不了了，不過他的日記告訴我怎麼打開一扇上鎖巨門後面的密室，而那間密室真的存在。雷矛承認之前有過懷疑，而貝洛格從來沒懷疑過。"
L["In the end Talvash del Kissel let me keep the necklace, on two conditions: that I tell everyone, loudly and often, who made it, and that I mention it really isn't cursed. Talvash made it, and it isn't cursed, as far as I know."] = "最後，塔瓦斯德·基瑟爾讓我留下那條項鍊，條件有兩個：我要大聲地、經常地告訴每個人是誰做的，還要順便提一下它真的沒有被詛咒。是塔瓦斯德做的，而且就我所知，它沒有被詛咒。"
L["Ghak Healtouch in Thelsamar sent me into the Badlands with a shopping list: buzzard gizzards, crag coyote fangs and shards from the rock elementals. The buzzards and the coyotes gave theirs up easily enough. The elementals argued the point. Ghak went over every piece, decided I could be trusted with reagents, and had a harder errand ready before I'd sat down."] = "塞爾薩瑪的加克給了我一張採購清單，打發我去荒蕪之地：禿鷲的胗、峭壁土狼的獠牙，還有岩石元素的碎片。禿鷲和土狼交出來得還算痛快，元素們可不這麼想。加克把每一樣都檢查了一遍，認定材料可以放心交給我，我還沒坐下，更難的差事就已經準備好了。"
L["Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath wanted reagents from the Badlands outside the walls: five buzzard gizzards, ten crag coyote fangs and five shards of rock elemental. Out there everything bites, so I collected from whatever bit first. Jarkal counted it all twice and said the ingredient that really mattered was down in Uldaman."] = "卡加斯的加卡爾想要城牆外荒蕪之地的材料：五個禿鷲的胗、十顆峭壁土狼的獠牙和五塊岩石元素的碎片。那地方什麼都會咬人，所以我就從先咬我的那個下手。加卡爾把東西數了兩遍，說真正要緊的材料在下面的奧達曼裡。"
L["Ghak Healtouch, the alchemist in Thelsamar, wanted a dozen magenta fungus caps from the Uldaman tunnels, with a warning that they puff poison spores when jostled. They do. Ghak paid me with a restorative potion and called the caps an interesting study, yon verily, and I still don't know what yon verily means."] = "塞爾薩瑪的鍊金術師加克想要十二顆奧達曼隧道裡的紫色蘑菇，還警告我，一碰到它們就會噴出毒孢子。確實會。加克用一瓶恢復藥水付了帳，還說這些蘑菇是「有趣的研究，然也然也」，我到現在都不知道「然也然也」是什麼意思。"
L["Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath wanted a dozen magenta fungus caps out of the Uldaman tunnels, which let off poison spores if you disturb them, so a little care was called for. I took a little care and a lot of poison. Jarkal paid me with a restorative potion, which was exactly the right reward."] = "卡加斯的加卡爾想要十二顆奧達曼隧道裡的紫色蘑菇，這東西一被驚動就會放出毒孢子，所以得稍微小心一點。我是小心了一點，毒也吃了一大堆。加卡爾用一瓶恢復藥水付了帳，這報酬再適合不過了。"
L["Patrick Garrett swept the bat pens in the Undercity and felt it was beneath a Garrett. The family weapon was still in their old chest in Uldaman's South Common Hall, from back when the Garretts dug there. I brought it back, and Patrick turned straight to the bats and told them to tremble, which they didn't."] = "派翠克·加瑞特在幽暗城打掃蝙蝠棚，覺得這工作有失加瑞特家的身分。家傳的武器還放在奧達曼南部大廳的舊箱子裡，那是加瑞特家當年在那裡挖掘時留下的。我把它帶了回來，派翠克馬上轉身對著蝙蝠，叫牠們發抖吧，牠們並沒有。"
L["Odd Jobs in the Badlands"] = "荒蕪之地的零活"
L["Theldurin's Doom"] = "塞爾杜林的厄運"
L["Plenty of people want something out of the Badlands or Uldaman, and few of them want to fetch it themselves. Prospector Ironband has lost a prospector, Krom Stoutarm a treasure, Ghak Healtouch in Thelsamar needs reagents, and a tinkerer called Rigglefuzz is after power stones. None of it is urgent. All of it pays."] = "很多人都想從荒蕪之地或奧達曼弄點什麼回來，可沒幾個人願意親自去拿。勘察員鐵環丟了一個勘察員，克羅姆·粗臂丟了一件寶貝，塞爾薩瑪的加克需要材料，還有個叫里格弗茲的工匠在找能量石。這些事都不急，但都有報酬。"
L["Plenty of people want something out of the Badlands or Uldaman, and few of them want to fetch it themselves. Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath needs reagents, Patrick Garrett in the Undercity wants the family weapon back, and a tinkerer called Rigglefuzz is after power stones. None of it is urgent. All of it pays."] = "很多人都想從荒蕪之地或奧達曼弄點什麼回來，可沒幾個人願意親自去拿。卡加斯的加卡爾需要材料，幽暗城的派翠克·加瑞特想拿回家傳的武器，還有個叫里格弗茲的工匠在找能量石。這些事都不急，但都有報酬。"
L["Between the big jobs, the Badlands kept me busy with small ones. Everybody out there wanted something fetched, found or carried home from Uldaman, and nobody wanted to go down and get it themselves. So I did."] = "大活兒之間，荒蕪之地總有些小活兒讓我忙個不停。那裡的人個個都想讓人去取點東西、找點東西，或者從奧達曼帶點東西回來，可誰都不想自己下去拿。所以我去了。"
L["Out in the Badlands, Theldurin the Lost is sure a doom is coming. He won't say its name in case it hears him, but he knows what he needs to stop it, and it's somewhere down in Uldaman."] = "在荒蕪之地，『迷失者』塞爾杜林確信厄運就要降臨。他不肯說出它的名字，怕被它聽見，但他知道要阻止它需要什麼，那東西就在奧達曼深處的某個地方。"
L["Theldurin the Lost, a jumpy dwarf out in the Badlands, was sure a doom was coming and wouldn't say its name in case it heard him. He needed the Tablet of Ryun'eh, from a chest in Uldaman older than anything dwarves ever made. I brought it, and he said it might hold the secret to saving us all, though he still wouldn't say from what.\n\nThe tablet from Uldaman told Theldurin a lot, but not enough. He wanted Yagyin's Digest, a book kept by the very people he'd fled, and he gave me their sigil so they would take me for one of their own.\n\nThey did. Their contact in the city decided I was off to found a new chapter of their order and was glad to help, once I'd brought him three relics he wouldn't say out loud. He wrote them down instead. I brought them.\n\nThe book came with a warning that the truth can burn. Theldurin said they should build me a monument and praise my name until my grandchildren had grandchildren. Then he added that if THEY ever get loose, I can forget the grandchildren. We're all worm food."] = "『迷失者』塞爾杜林是荒蕪之地一個神經兮兮的矮人，他確信厄運就要降臨，還不肯說出它的名字，怕被它聽見。他需要雷烏納石板，那東西放在奧達曼的一個箱子裡，那箱子比矮人造過的任何東西都古老。我把石板帶了回去，他說裡面也許藏著拯救我們所有人的秘密，不過他還是不肯說要從什麼手中拯救。\n\n奧達曼的石板告訴了塞爾杜林很多事，但還不夠。他想要《雅格因的筆記》，偏偏保管那本書的，就是他當年逃離的那群人。他把他們的徽章交給我，好讓他們把我當成自己人。\n\n他們還真的信了。他們在城裡的聯絡人認定我是要去創立他們教團的新分會，很樂意幫忙，前提是我得先帶來三件他不肯說出口的聖物。他改用寫的。我帶來了。\n\n那本書附帶了一句警告：真相會灼傷人。塞爾杜林說，他們應該替我蓋座紀念碑，一直讚頌我的名字，直到我的孫子都有了孫子。接著他又補了一句，要是「他們」哪天跑出來了，孫子就別想了。我們全都會變成蟲子的食物。"
L["Rigglefuzz, a tinkerer in the Badlands, had once shown the Shadowforge dwarves how to use the power stones they dig out of Uldaman, and was thanked by being thrown out. Now Rigglefuzz wanted sixteen of them, to run a robotic rodent forever. The Shadowforge were no better at sharing the second time."] = "里格弗茲是荒蕪之地的一個工匠，曾經教暗爐矮人怎麼使用他們從奧達曼挖出來的能量石，得到的感謝是被趕了出去。現在里格弗茲想要十六塊，好讓一隻機械老鼠永遠跑下去。第二次，暗爐矮人也沒有變得更懂得分享。"
L["A Bit of Wet Work"] = "幹點髒活"
L["Sully had been watching Alcaz through his looking glass and saw naga coming ashore, led by a sorceress barking orders. He asked me to thin them out while I was in there and bring back her head. I did both. As Sully put it, the enemy of your enemy is still a naga."] = "蘇利一直用望遠鏡盯著奧卡茲，看見納迦正在上岸，帶頭的是個大聲發號施令的女巫。他要我進去的時候順便減少一下牠們的數量，再把她的頭帶回來。兩件事我都辦了。照蘇利的說法，敵人的敵人，也還是納迦。"
L["The Dragon's Journal"] = "龍之日記"
L["Archmage Lan'dalock had been scrying Alcaz Island from Dalaran until someone on the island noticed and shut the spell down. Just before that, it caught a journal written in old draconic, and Lan'dalock wanted it. I found it. I can't read a word of draconic, so I'm taking the archmage's word that it was worth the trip."] = "大法師朗達拉克一直在達拉然用法術窺視奧卡茲島，直到島上有人察覺，把法術切斷了。就在那之前，法術捕捉到了一本用古龍語寫的日記，朗達拉克想要它。我找到了。龍語我一個字都看不懂，所以這一趟值不值得，我就相信大法師的話了。"
L["A Little Payback"] = "還以顏色"
L["Sergeant Ulka had lost good orcs on Alcaz and wanted it squared, naga for orc, starting with the sorceress giving the orders. I came back with her head and a long list of naga who wouldn't be needing theirs. Ulka didn't smile, exactly. From the Kor'kron, that's practically a hug."] = "士官烏爾卡在奧卡茲折損了不少好獸人，想把這筆帳算清楚，一個納迦抵一個獸人，就從那個發號施令的女巫算起。我帶回了她的頭，外加一長串再也用不到自己腦袋的納迦。烏爾卡稱不上是笑了。不過在柯爾克隆那裡，這幾乎等於一個擁抱。"
L["Blood Red Bandanas"] = "血紅頭巾"
L["Ulka's people had been fighting humans in red bandanas on Alcaz, which put Ulka in mind of a gang from the Eastern Kingdoms. I collected the bandanas and carried them to Eitrigg in Orgrimmar. Eitrigg confirmed it: Defias, a very long way from Westfall. Nobody could tell me what they were doing there."] = "烏爾卡的手下在奧卡茲一直跟一群戴紅頭巾的人類交手，這讓烏爾卡想起東部王國的一個幫派。我收集了那些頭巾，帶去奧格瑪交給伊崔格。伊崔格證實了：是迪菲亞，離西部荒野可遠得很。至於他們在那裡做什麼，沒人說得上來。"
L["Krol'dok No More!"] = "逃離克羅多克！"
L["Marcus Tilwell"] = "馬庫斯‧迪威爾"
L["Somewhere in Krol'dok I found Marcus Tilwell, who wouldn't explain how any of it had happened and only wanted out. So we left together, me in front. Apparently I wouldn't believe the story anyway. Having seen the place, I'd believe almost anything."] = "我在克羅多克的某個角落找到了馬庫斯‧迪威爾，他不肯解釋這一切是怎麼發生的，只想趕快出去。於是我們一起離開，我走在前面。據說就算他講了，我也不會相信。見識過那個地方之後，我幾乎什麼都信。"
L["Magus Olvek"] = "魔導師奧爾維克"
L["Past Due"] = "逾期"
L["Magus Olvek in Dalaran needed a book for a thesis, and Arcanist Doan had borrowed it from the old Dalaran library before the Third War and never brought it back. Doan lives in the Scarlet Monastery now, so I collected it the hard way. Considering the late fees, Doan got off lightly."] = "達拉然的魔導師奧爾維克寫論文需要一本書，而祕法師杜安在第三次大戰之前從達拉然的舊圖書館把它借走，就再也沒還。杜安現在住在血色修道院，所以我只好用硬的方式去收。考慮到那筆逾期罰金，杜安這樣已經算便宜他了。"
L["the gates of Stormwind, Elwynn Forest"] = "暴風城城門，艾爾文森林"
L["Major Mattingly"] = "瑪丁雷少校"
L["the Valley of Strength, Orgrimmar"] = "力量谷，奧格瑪"
L["Overlord Runthak"] = "倫薩克"
L["The Drakefire Amulet opens the way into Onyxia's Lair, in the south of Dustwallow Marsh. Behind it waits the dragon who sat at Stormwind's court for years as Lady Prestor. Highlord Bolvar Fordragon would very much like a word with her, or failing that, her head."] = "龍火護符打開了通往奧妮克希亞的巢穴的道路，巢穴就在塵泥沼澤南部。裡面等著的，正是那頭化身普瑞斯托女伯爵、在暴風城宮廷裡坐了好多年的巨龍。大領主伯瓦爾‧弗塔根很想跟她談一談，談不成的話，要她的腦袋也行。"
L["The Drakefire Amulet opens the way into Onyxia's Lair, in the south of Dustwallow Marsh. Behind it waits the brood mother of the black dragonflight, Deathwing's own daughter. Thrall would like all of Orgrimmar to see how that meeting ends."] = "龍火護符打開了通往奧妮克希亞的巢穴的道路，巢穴就在塵泥沼澤南部。裡面等著的是黑龍軍團的龍母，死亡之翼的親生女兒。索爾希望整個奧格瑪都能看到這場會面的結局。"
L["The amulet got us through the door of Onyxia's Lair, down in the south of Dustwallow Marsh, and after that it was up to us. Onyxia had spent years in Stormwind as Lady Prestor, at the king's table, steering the kingdom wherever she liked. In her own home she didn't bother with manners. There were whelps. There were a great many whelps.\n\nWe came out with her head, and I carried it to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep. Bolvar had it hung over the city gates, where everyone passing through could see what had been whispering to their king. The whole city stood a little straighter that day.\n\nMajor Mattingly at the gates had a reward for me afterwards, and a speech to go with it: the journey, he said, had only just begun. I've been walking ever since, so he may have had a point."] = "護符帶我們穿過了奧妮克希亞的巢穴大門，那地方在塵泥沼澤最南邊，之後就全靠我們自己了。奧妮克希亞化身普瑞斯托女伯爵，在暴風城待了好幾年，在國王的桌邊佔著一席之地，想把王國帶到哪裡就帶到哪裡。回到自己家裡，她就懶得講禮貌了。裡面有雛龍。有非常、非常多的雛龍。\n\n我們帶著她的頭出來了，我把它送到暴風要塞的大領主伯瓦爾‧弗塔根手上。伯瓦爾下令把它掛在城門上方，讓每個進出城的人都看看，一直在他們國王耳邊低語的到底是什麼東西。那天，整座城的人腰桿都挺得更直了一點。\n\n後來，城門口的瑪丁雷少校給了我一份獎勵，外加一番演說：他說，一切才剛剛開始。從那之後我就一直在路上，所以他說的也許沒錯。"
L["The amulet got us through the door of Onyxia's Lair, down in the south of Dustwallow Marsh, and after that it was up to us. Onyxia didn't greet us. She breathed on us, which is how dragons say hello. Then came the whelps, a great many whelps, as if she'd been saving them for company.\n\nWe came out with her head, and I carried it to Thrall in Orgrimmar. Thrall sent me on to Overlord Runthak, who had it raised over the Valley of Strength for all to see. Every orc in the city stood a little taller that day, and so did I.\n\nRunthak had a reward for me afterwards, and a speech to go with it: the journey, he said, had only just begun. Easy for him to say. He wasn't the one who carried the head."] = "護符帶我們穿過了奧妮克希亞的巢穴大門，那地方在塵泥沼澤最南邊，之後就全靠我們自己了。奧妮克希亞沒跟我們打招呼。她朝我們噴了一口氣，龍打招呼就是這樣打的。接著來的是雛龍，一大堆雛龍，好像她特地留著招待客人似的。\n\n我們帶著她的頭出來了，我把它送到奧格瑪的索爾那裡。索爾又叫我去找倫薩克，倫薩克把它高高掛在力量谷上方，讓所有人都看得到。那天，城裡每個獸人都站得更挺了一點，我也是。\n\n後來，倫薩克給了我一份獎勵，外加一番演說：他說，一切才剛剛開始。說得倒輕鬆。扛著那顆頭的又不是他。"
L["Victory for the Alliance"] = "聯盟的勝利"
L["Onyxia's Lair, Dustwallow Marsh"] = "奧妮克希亞的巢穴，塵泥沼澤"
L["Celebrating Good Times"] = "英雄慶典"
L["The Journey Has Just Begun"] = "一切才剛剛開始"
L["Victory for the Horde"] = "部落的勝利"
L["For All To See"] = "萬眾敬仰"
L["Lorekeeper Lydros had said the blade wasn't finished until a dragon breathed on it, which is an odd way to temper steel and a very common way to die. So in the middle of all that, I laid Quel'Serrar on the floor of Onyxia's Lair and let her do the forging. Lydros was right. It came out of the fire a proper sword."] = "博學者萊德羅斯說過，這把劍要等龍對它噴過一口氣才算完成。這種淬火的方法很怪，這種送命的方法倒是很常見。所以在那一片混亂之中，我把奎爾塞拉放在奧妮克希亞的巢穴的地上，讓奧妮克希亞來當鐵匠。萊德羅斯說得沒錯。從火裡出來的，是一把真正的劍。"
L["Sprite Jumpsprocket"] = "斯普萊特"
L["Jasper Fel"] = "賈斯伯·菲爾"
L["Toxic Soil"] = "有毒的土壤"
L["Alba Fairmoon, at Sentinel Hill, says something is poisoning Westfall. The crops are failing, the wells taste of metal, and if nobody finds the source, nothing will grow there for decades. Alba has a sample kit and a great many questions."] = "哨兵嶺的艾芭‧皎月說，有東西正在毒害西部荒野。作物一片片枯死，井水喝起來有金屬味，要是沒人找出源頭，那裡幾十年都長不出任何東西。艾芭帶著一套取樣工具組，還有一大堆問題。"
L["Alba Fairmoon turned up at Sentinel Hill with a sample kit and a theory: something was poisoning Westfall. I drew water from the farm wells and pulled gills off the murlocs along the shore, because murlocs, it turns out, are very sensitive souls. The wells came back full of metal. Not the good kind.\n\nThe Defias held the mines, so I ran their miners out of the Jangolode and the Gold Coast Quarry. Wrong mines. The poison came from somewhere deeper, and the crates lying around Moonbrook said where: the Deadmines, busy again after all these years.\n\nAlba wanted it blown up. A gnome called Sprite Jumpsprocket in the Dwarven District was thrilled to hear it, and SI:7 already knew all about it, which I found less thrilling. Jasper Fel handed me a remote detonator and asked me not to mention him to the elf. So I won't."] = "艾芭‧皎月帶著一套取樣工具組和一個推論來到哨兵嶺：有東西在毒害西部荒野。我從農場的水井打了水，又從海岸邊的魚人身上扯下幾片鰓，因為事實證明，魚人是非常敏感的生物。井水的結果出來了：滿滿的金屬。可惜不是值錢的那種。\n\n礦坑都被迪菲亞兄弟會佔著，所以我把他們的礦工從詹戈洛德礦坑和金海岸礦坑裡趕了出去。找錯礦坑了。毒是從更深的地方來的，散落在月溪鎮四周的那些箱子說明了來源：死亡礦坑，過了這麼多年，又忙了起來。\n\n艾芭想把那裡炸掉。矮人區有個叫斯普萊特的地精，一聽到這件事就興奮得不得了；軍情七處則早就一清二楚，這點就沒那麼讓我興奮了。賈斯伯·菲爾塞給我一個遙控引爆器，還要我別在那個精靈面前提到他。所以我不會提的。"
L["Testing the Wells"] = "測試井水"
L["Murloc Gills"] = "魚人鰓"
L["The State of the Mines"] = "礦坑狀態"
L["Moonbrook Espionage"] = "月溪鎮諜戰"
L["Explosive Consultation"] = "炸藥諮詢"
L["A Dynamite Plan"] = "火藥計畫"
L["Detonation at a Distance"] = "遠程引爆"
L["Alba was waiting in the hills behind Moonbrook, wearing the look people get right before something loud. I pressed the button. Somewhere under Westfall a forge stopped being a forge, and for the first time in years the soil had a chance. Best thing I ever did with a button."] = "艾芭在月溪鎮後方的山丘上等著，臉上掛著人們在巨響前一刻特有的那種表情。我按下了按鈕。西部荒野地底下的某處，一座熔爐不再是熔爐了，這麼多年來，這片土地頭一次有了機會。這是我用按鈕做過最棒的一件事。"
-- New stories: Green Hills, Naralex, Yeti, Myzrael, Thunderfury
L["The Green Hills of Stranglethorn"] = "荊棘谷的青山"
L["In the north of Stranglethorn Vale, a famous dwarf hunter has pitched camp with a handful of companions and a great many guns. Hemet Nesingwary has come for big game, and he only takes on hunters who can prove themselves.\n\nLearn the jungle's tigers, panthers and raptors from the expedition's own hunters, and you may hear what Hemet really came for. Barnil Stonepot, meanwhile, has a small literary emergency and would rather Master Nesingwary never heard about it."] = "在荊棘谷北部，一位鼎鼎大名的矮人獵人帶著幾個同伴和一大堆槍紮了營。赫米特‧奈辛瓦里是來獵大型獵物的，而且只收能證明自己實力的獵人。\n\n跟著遠征隊自家的獵人學會對付叢林裡的猛虎、黑豹和迅猛龍，你或許就能聽到赫米特此行真正的目的。與此同時，巴尼爾‧石罐碰上了一樁小小的文學緊急事件，而且最好別讓奈辛瓦里大師聽到風聲。"
L["Welcome to the Jungle"] = "歡迎來到叢林"
L["Barnil Stonepot"] = "巴尼爾‧石罐"
L["Nesingwary's Expedition, Stranglethorn Vale"] = "奈辛瓦里遠征隊營地（荊棘谷）"
L["Ajeck Rouack"] = "艾耶克‧羅歐克"
L["Sir S. J. Erlgadin"] = "艾爾加丁爵士"
L["Kravel Koalbeard"] = "克拉維爾‧濃須"
L["Roon Wildmane"] = "魯恩‧蠻鬃"
L["Barnil Stonepot greets visitors at Nesingwary's Expedition, in the north of Stranglethorn Vale. The camp belongs to Hemet Nesingwary, a famous big game hunter who doesn't usually welcome strangers. Barnil thinks you look like you've seen enough action to meet him."] = "巴尼爾‧石罐在荊棘谷北部的奈辛瓦里遠征隊營地迎接訪客。營地的主人是赫米特‧奈辛瓦里，一位知名的大型獵物獵人，平常不太歡迎陌生人。巴尼爾覺得你看起來身經百戰，夠格去見他一面。"
L["So there's a camp up in the north of Stranglethorn, and the first face you meet there is Barnil Stonepot. Barnil told me whose camp it was. Hemet Nesingwary's: war hero, big game hunter, not one for welcoming strangers. Then Barnil looked me over and decided I'd seen enough action to risk an introduction.\n\nHemet turned out friendlier than his reputation. He'd come to the jungle for a rare beast, he said, and I could join the hunt once I'd proved myself. Raptors with him. Tigers and panthers with two of his hunters.\n\nI'd come to Stranglethorn looking for paid work. I'd found three teachers and an exam."] = "話說荊棘谷北邊有座營地，到那裡第一個碰到的就是巴尼爾‧石罐。巴尼爾告訴我這是誰的營地：赫米特‧奈辛瓦里的。戰爭英雄，大型獵物獵人，不太歡迎陌生人。接著巴尼爾上下打量了我一番，認定我見過的陣仗夠多，值得冒險引薦一下。\n\n赫米特本人比傳聞中友善。他說他是為了一頭稀有的野獸才來叢林的，等我證明了自己，就能加入狩獵。迅猛龍跟他學。猛虎和黑豹跟他手下的兩位獵人學。\n\n我來荊棘谷是想找份有錢拿的差事。結果找到了三位老師和一場考試。"
L["Kravel Koalbeard, at the Mirage Raceway, had a crate for an old customer who'd long since left for Stranglethorn. Hemet's a rich dwarf, Kravel explained, and it's a good idea to keep up with the rich ones. The crate held special-gauge ammunition. Hemet paid me, asked after crusty old Kravel, and answered the question himself: still up to no good, he'd wager."] = "沙漠賽道的克拉維爾‧濃須有個箱子，要交給一位早就去了荊棘谷的老主顧。克拉維爾解釋說，赫米特是個有錢的矮人，跟有錢人保持聯絡總是沒錯。箱子裡裝的是特殊口徑的彈藥。赫米特付了錢給我，問起老頑固克拉維爾過得怎樣，又自己替我回答了：他敢打賭，那傢伙八成還在搞鬼。"
L["Roon Wildmane, in Shadowprey Village, once spent many days hunting Desolace with a dwarf named Hemet, long enough for the old enmity between their peoples to be forgotten. Roon sent me to Stranglethorn with a kodo horn. Hemet knew whose it was at a glance, and what it meant: come back and hunt again. His next expedition might take him to Desolace, he said. Hunters always say that about the next expedition."] = "葬影村的魯恩‧蠻鬃曾經和一個叫赫米特的矮人在淒涼之地一起狩獵了好些日子，久到兩族之間的宿怨都被拋在腦後。魯恩要我帶著一支科多獸角去荊棘谷。赫米特一眼就認出那是誰的角，也明白它的意思：回來，再一起打獵。他說下一次遠征或許會去淒涼之地。獵人說到下一次遠征，總是這麼說。"
L["Hunting in Stranglethorn"] = "荊棘谷狩獵"
L["Tiger Mastery"] = "獵虎大師"
L["Ajeck Rouack, at Nesingwary's Expedition, learned tiger hunting from her father as a girl, and she teaches it the same way: start easy, on the young tigers near camp. It gets harder from there."] = "奈辛瓦里遠征隊營地的艾耶克‧羅歐克小時候跟著父親學會了獵虎，她教人的方式也一樣：從簡單的開始，先獵營地附近的小猛虎。接下來就越來越難了。"
L["Ajeck Rouack learned to hunt tigers from her father when she was a girl, and she teaches it the way he must have: start small. The young ones live near camp. From there you work your way up the family tree, and the elders take it personally.\n\nThen the real lesson. The party had been tracking one tigress for weeks without getting near her. They called her Sin'Dall. Ajeck wanted her paw, and wanted me to do what nobody of my kind had done before.\n\nTracking her was no easy task, exactly as promised. But I came back with the paw, and Ajeck named me a Master Tiger Hunter. Most impressive, I do say, was how she put it.\n\nNo certificate, mind you. Just the title, and a paw nobody asked to have back."] = "艾耶克‧羅歐克小時候跟父親學會了獵虎，她教人的方法想必和她父親當年一樣：從小的開始。小老虎就住在營地附近。從那裡開始，你就順著牠們的家譜一路往上獵，而輩分越高的，越把這件事當成私仇。\n\n接著才是真正的一課。狩獵隊追蹤一隻母老虎已經好幾個星期了，卻始終近不了牠的身。他們叫牠辛達爾。艾耶克想要牠的爪子，還要我做到我的同族從來沒人做到過的事。\n\n追蹤牠果然不是件簡單的差事，就跟說好的一樣。不過我帶著爪子回來了，艾耶克封我為獵虎大師。她的原話是：我得說，你真是太出色了。\n\n先講清楚，沒有證書。只有一個頭銜，外加一隻沒人想要回去的爪子。"
L["Young Tigers"] = "小猛虎"
L["Stranglethorn Tigers"] = "荊棘谷猛虎"
L["Elder Tigers"] = "老年猛虎"
L["Sin'Dall"] = "辛達爾"
L["Panther Mastery"] = "獵豹大師"
L["Sir S. J. Erlgadin, at Nesingwary's Expedition, won't let anyone into Hemet's crack hunting party who can't handle a panther. The lessons start easy, with the young ones. Tracking them down, the knight warns, is only half the challenge."] = "奈辛瓦里遠征隊營地的艾爾加丁爵士，不會讓任何對付不了黑豹的人加入赫米特的精銳狩獵隊。課程從簡單的開始，先獵小豹。這位騎士提醒你：找到牠們只是挑戰的一半。"
L["Sir S. J. Erlgadin handles the panthers, and in the knight's view Hemet has assembled a crack group, and nobody joins a crack group without proving it. So: panthers. They start you easy, on the young ones, and work you up to the shadowmaws.\n\nTracking them down is only half the challenge, Erlgadin says. I can tell you what the other half is. It's the panther.\n\nAt the top of the list sat Bhag'thera, a great panther who'd been prowling the jungle and slipping the whole expedition. His fang would earn me Erlgadin's respect. I spent a good while learning why everyone else had come home empty-handed. Then I didn't.\n\nErlgadin cheered and called me mighty. I've been living up to it ever since, mostly sitting down."] = "黑豹歸艾爾加丁爵士管。在這位騎士看來，赫米特組建的是一支精銳隊伍，而沒證明過自己，誰都別想加入精銳隊伍。所以：黑豹。先從簡單的小豹開始，一路練到深喉獵豹。\n\n艾爾加丁說，找到牠們只是挑戰的一半。另一半是什麼，我可以告訴你。是黑豹本身。\n\n名單最上頭的是巴爾瑟拉，一頭巨大的黑豹，一直在叢林裡遊蕩，把整支遠征隊耍得團團轉。拿到牠的牙，我就能贏得艾爾加丁的敬重。我花了好一陣子才搞懂，為什麼其他人都空手而歸。後來，我沒有空手而歸。\n\n艾爾加丁歡呼起來，說我真是勇猛無比。從那之後，我一直努力配得上這個稱號——大多時候是坐著努力。"
L["Young Panthers"] = "小獵豹"
L["Panthers"] = "黑豹"
L["Shadowmaw Panthers"] = "深喉獵豹"
L["Bhag'thera"] = "巴爾瑟拉"
L["Raptor Mastery"] = "獵龍"
L["Hemet Nesingwary teaches the raptor lessons himself, at his camp in northern Stranglethorn. He'll tell you which raptors to hunt. He won't tell you where to find them. Locating the beasts, he says, is half the challenge."] = "赫米特‧奈辛瓦里在他位於荊棘谷北部的營地親自傳授迅猛龍課程。他會告訴你該獵哪種迅猛龍，但不會告訴你去哪裡找。他說，找到野獸本身就是挑戰的一半。"
L["Hemet teaches raptors himself, and his first lesson is that he won't tell you where they are. Locating the beasts is half the challenge, he says. Raptors, in my experience, are happy to help with that half.\n\nThree breeds of raptor later, he told me about the one that kept getting away from him. Tethis, Ajeck calls him, a wily old raptor that even Hemet had failed to kill. Prove yourself a true master, Hemet said, and bring back the talon.\n\nTethis was elusive right up until the moment he wasn't. I'll leave it there.\n\nHemet took the talon and tried a title out on me: Master Raptor Slayer. Has a nice ring to it, eh? It does. I'd never once managed to work it into conversation. Until now."] = "迅猛龍課是赫米特親自教的，他的第一課就是：他不會告訴你牠們在哪裡。他說，找到野獸就是挑戰的一半。根據我的經驗，迅猛龍很樂意幫你搞定這一半。\n\n獵完三種迅猛龍之後，他跟我說起那隻老是從他手裡溜走的。艾耶克叫牠泰希斯，一隻狡猾的老迅猛龍，連赫米特都沒能殺掉牠。赫米特說，證明你是真正的大師，把牠的爪子帶回來。\n\n泰希斯一直神出鬼沒，直到牠不再神出鬼沒的那一刻。就說到這裡吧。\n\n赫米特接過爪子，試著給我安了個頭銜：迅猛龍獵殺大師。聽起來挺響亮的，對吧？確實響亮。只是我一次都沒能把它塞進聊天裡。直到現在。"
L["Stranglethorn Raptors"] = "荊棘谷迅猛龍"
L["Lashtail Raptors"] = "鞭尾迅猛龍"
L["Jungle Stalkers"] = "叢林捕獵者"
L["Tethis"] = "泰希斯"
L["The Missing Pages"] = "遺失的書頁"
L["Barnil Stonepot, at Nesingwary's Expedition, was trusted to proofread Hemet's novel, The Green Hills of Stranglethorn, right up until a gust of wind scattered it across the jungle. Barnil needs the missing pages back before Master Nesingwary finds out."] = "奈辛瓦里遠征隊營地的巴尼爾‧石罐一直負責校對赫米特的小說《荊棘谷的青山》，深受信任——直到一陣風把書稿吹得散落整片叢林。巴尼爾得趕在奈辛瓦里大師發現之前，把遺失的書頁找回來。"
L["Barnil Stonepot was proofreading Hemet's novel, The Green Hills of Stranglethorn, when a gust of wind went through camp and took the novel with it. Barnil got most of it back. The rest was out in the jungle, and Master Nesingwary, I was told firmly, must never find out.\n\nHere's what nobody tells you about collecting a book one page at a time. The pages don't share. A page only stacks with copies of itself, and I got copies of every page except the one I needed. For weeks I carried more of that novel than its author did. Somewhere in Booty Bay, someone is still asking for page fourteen.\n\nI read a few on the walk back. The sentences were short. The hunts were long. Somebody was always having a drink and being brave about it.\n\nBarnil says the ending is quite something. I'll take Barnil's word for it."] = "巴尼爾‧石罐正在校對赫米特的小說《荊棘谷的青山》，一陣風颳過營地，把小說一起捲走了。巴尼爾撿回了大半。剩下的散落在叢林裡，而且有人很嚴肅地告訴我，這件事絕對不能讓奈辛瓦里大師知道。\n\n一頁一頁收集一本書，有件事沒人會事先告訴你：這些書頁互不合群。每一頁只能跟同一頁的副本疊在一起，而我撿到了每一頁的副本，偏偏就缺我要的那一頁。那幾個星期，我身上帶著的這本小說比作者本人手上的還多。藏寶海灣的某個角落，至今還有人在收購第十四頁。\n\n回程路上我讀了幾頁。句子很短。狩獵很長。總有人在喝酒，而且喝得一臉英勇。\n\n巴尼爾說結局相當了不起。我就相信巴尼爾吧。"
L["Chapter I"] = "荊棘谷的青山 - 第一章"
L["Chapter II"] = "荊棘谷的青山 - 第二章"
L["Chapter III"] = "荊棘谷的青山 - 第三章"
L["Chapter IV"] = "荊棘谷的青山 - 第四章"
L["King Bangalash"] = "虎王邦加拉西"
L["You've proved yourself against the expedition's tigers, panthers and raptors, and Hemet Nesingwary is finally ready to tell you why he came to Stranglethorn: a great white tiger he has had in his sights for a long time."] = "你已經在猛虎、黑豹和迅猛龍身上證明了自己，赫米特‧奈辛瓦里終於準備告訴你，他為什麼來到荊棘谷：為了一頭他盯了很久的巨大白虎。"
L["With the tigers, the panthers and the raptors behind me, Hemet finally told me about the big hunt. King Bangalash, a great white tiger. Hemet had had his sights on that tiger for a long time. He was the reason the whole expedition was in Stranglethorn.\n\nI won't tell you where the king holds court. Locating the beast is half the challenge, as a dwarf once told me. I'll tell you he was well named, and that I came back with his head.\n\nHemet was delighted. Bloody well done, right-o, cheers, I say, cheers. He said he was honored to count me a comrade of his great hunting party, which is a thing I now get to say in taverns.\n\nIn the morning the sun also rose, over a jungle with one king fewer in it."] = "猛虎、黑豹和迅猛龍都解決之後，赫米特終於跟我說起那場大狩獵。虎王邦加拉西，一頭巨大的白虎。赫米特盯上那頭老虎已經很久了。整支遠征隊之所以會來荊棘谷，就是為了牠。\n\n我不會告訴你這位國王在哪裡上朝。就像一位矮人曾經告訴我的，找到野獸就是挑戰的一半。我只告訴你，牠的確名副其實，而我帶著牠的腦袋回來了。\n\n赫米特高興壞了。幹得太漂亮了，好極了，乾杯，我說，乾杯！他說能把我算作他偉大狩獵隊的一員，他深感榮幸。這句話我現在可以在酒館裡拿出來說了。\n\n隔天早上，太陽依舊升起，照在一片少了一位國王的叢林上。"
L["Big Game Hunter"] = "王牌獵人"
L["Waking Naralex"] = "喚醒納拉雷克斯"
L["Beneath the Barrens, in the Wailing Caverns, a druid named Naralex lies asleep. He went down to dream the dry land green again, and the dream went wrong. Strange beasts crawl out of the caves now, and the oases carry a taint nobody can name.\n\nFind his disciples above the caverns' entrance, and follow the trouble down into the dark to where the dreamer sleeps."] = "在貧瘠之地的地底，哀嚎洞穴之中，一位名叫納拉雷克斯的德魯伊正在沉睡。他下去是為了用夢境讓這片乾旱的土地重新變綠，夢境卻出了差錯。如今怪異的野獸從洞穴裡爬出來，綠洲也沾染了一種誰也說不出來歷的汙染。\n\n到洞穴入口上方找他的信徒，然後循著麻煩一路深入黑暗，直到那位作夢者沉睡之處。"
L["Above the entrance to the Wailing Caverns, in the Barrens, the disciples of a druid named Naralex keep a lonely watch. Their master went down to dream the dry land green again, and strange beasts have been crawling up out of the caves ever since.\n\nLend the disciples a hand, and follow the trouble down into the dark to where the dreamer sleeps."] = "在貧瘠之地的哀嚎洞穴入口上方，德魯伊納拉雷克斯的信徒們正孤單地守望著。他們的導師下去是為了用夢境讓這片乾旱的土地重新變綠，從那之後，怪異的野獸就不斷從洞穴裡爬上來。\n\n幫這些信徒一把，然後循著麻煩一路深入黑暗，直到那位作夢者沉睡之處。"
L["New oases have sprung up across the Barrens, and the druids of Thunder Bluff can feel a strange power seeping up beneath them. Tonga Runetotem, at the Crossroads, wants to know where it comes from.\n\nFollow the water down to the Wailing Caverns, where a druid named Naralex went to dream the Barrens green again and never came back up."] = "貧瘠之地各處冒出了新的綠洲，雷霆崖的德魯伊們能感覺到一股奇怪的力量正從底下滲上來。十字路口的圖加‧符文圖騰想知道這股力量從何而來。\n\n循著水源一路往下，來到哀嚎洞穴。一位名叫納拉雷克斯的德魯伊曾經下到那裡，想用夢境讓貧瘠之地重新變綠，卻再也沒有上來。"
L["The Barrens / Thunder Bluff / Darnassus / Wailing Caverns"] = "貧瘠之地 / 雷霆崖 / 達納蘇斯 / 哀嚎洞穴"
L["The Forgotten Pools"] = "遺忘之池"
L["Elder Rise, Thunder Bluff"] = "長者高地（雷霆崖）"
L["Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem"] = "大德魯伊哈繆爾‧符文圖騰"
L["the cave above the Wailing Caverns entrance, The Barrens"] = "哀嚎洞穴入口上方的山洞，貧瘠之地"
L["Nalpak"] = "納爾派克"
L["Ebru"] = "厄布魯"
L["the Pools of Vision, Thunder Bluff"] = "預見之池（雷霆崖）"
L["Apothecary Zamah"] = "藥劑師札瑪"
L["the docks, Ratchet, The Barrens"] = "棘齒城碼頭（貧瘠之地）"
L["Crane Operator Bigglefuzz"] = "起重機操作員比戈弗茲"
L["Mebok Mizzyrix"] = "麥伯克‧米希瑞克斯"
L["near the Wailing Caverns, The Barrens"] = "哀嚎洞穴附近，貧瘠之地"
L["Falla Sagewind"] = "菲拉‧古風"
L["the Cenarion Enclave, Darnassus"] = "塞納里奧區（達納蘇斯）"
L["The Dreaming Oases"] = "夢境綠洲"
L["New oases have been springing up across the Barrens, and the druids can feel a strange power seeping up from beneath them. Tonga Runetotem, at the Crossroads, wants someone to go and look into the water. Closely."] = "貧瘠之地各處不斷冒出新的綠洲，德魯伊們能感覺到一股奇怪的力量正從底下滲上來。十字路口的圖加‧符文圖騰想找個人去水裡看看。仔細地看。"
L["Tonga Runetotem, at the Crossroads, had a problem most places would envy: the Barrens kept growing new oases. Tonga didn't trust it. The druids could feel some power seeping up from below, and a druid who feels something will not rest until somebody else has gone and poked it.\n\nI poked. There were cracks in the bottoms of the pools, with gas bubbling up out of them. Tonga gave me a handful of seeds, dead and dry, and had me drop them into the crack at the Stagnant Oasis. They grew. Right there, out of nothing.\n\nA few snapjaw shells later, Tonga had an answer and didn't like it. The land was dreaming and couldn't wake, and the dream was coming from the Wailing Caverns. Before I went anywhere near them, I was to see Hamuul Runetotem in Thunder Bluff. Druids always want a second opinion."] = "十字路口的圖加‧符文圖騰碰上了一個大多數地方求之不得的問題：貧瘠之地不停長出新的綠洲。圖加信不過這件事。德魯伊們能感覺到有某種力量從地底滲上來，而德魯伊一旦感覺到了什麼，不等別人去戳一戳，是絕不會罷休的。\n\n我去戳了。池底有裂縫，氣體正從裡面咕嘟咕嘟往外冒。圖加給了我一把種子，又死又乾，要我把它們丟進死水綠洲的裂縫裡。它們長出來了。就在那裡，憑空長出來。\n\n收了幾塊鉗嘴龜殼之後，圖加有了答案，而且不喜歡這個答案。這片土地在作夢，醒不過來，而夢是從哀嚎洞穴來的。在我靠近那裡之前，得先去雷霆崖見哈繆爾‧符文圖騰。德魯伊總想再多聽一個意見。"
L["The Barrens Oases"] = "貧瘠之地的綠洲"
L["The Stagnant Oasis"] = "死水綠洲"
L["Altered Beings"] = "變異的生物"
L["Hamuul Runetotem"] = "哈繆爾‧符文圖騰"
L["Disciples of Naralex"] = "納拉雷克斯的信徒"
L["Above the entrance to the Wailing Caverns, in the Barrens, two disciples of the druid Naralex keep watch: Nalpak and Ebru. Their master went down into the caverns to heal the land, and strange beasts have been coming up ever since."] = "在貧瘠之地的哀嚎洞穴入口上方，德魯伊納拉雷克斯的兩位信徒守在那裡：納爾派克和厄布魯。他們的導師下到洞穴裡去治癒這片土地，從那之後，怪異的野獸就不斷爬上來。"
L["Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem, on Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff, has walked in the land of dreams and seen what waits in the Wailing Caverns. Above the caverns' entrance, two disciples of the druid Naralex could use a hand too."] = "雷霆崖長者高地上的大德魯伊哈繆爾‧符文圖騰曾行走於夢境之地，看見了哀嚎洞穴裡等待著的東西。洞穴入口上方，德魯伊納拉雷克斯的兩位信徒也需要有人幫一把。"
L["There's a cave above the entrance to the Wailing Caverns, and in it two disciples of a druid named Naralex. Naralex had a lovely plan: enter the Emerald Dream and grow the Barrens back into a forest. Somewhere along the way the dream went bad, and the caverns filled up with whatever crawled out of it.\n\nDeviates, the disciples call them. Nalpak looks on the bright side and thought their hides would make good leather. Ebru just wanted them dead, seven each of four kinds, and was very particular about the count. Happily, the hides came off the same beasts, so I did both jobs at once.\n\nEbru called it the first step toward a restored Barrens. Their master, I gathered, was still down there somewhere, asleep."] = "哀嚎洞穴入口上方有個山洞，裡面住著一位名叫納拉雷克斯的德魯伊的兩個信徒。納拉雷克斯有個美好的計畫：進入翡翠夢境，讓貧瘠之地重新長成一片森林。可是半路上夢變了調，洞穴裡於是擠滿了從夢裡爬出來的各種東西。\n\n信徒們叫牠們變異生物。納爾派克凡事往好處想，覺得牠們的皮能做成好皮革。厄布魯只想要牠們死，四種各七隻，數目一隻都不能差。幸好皮就長在同一批野獸身上，所以兩份差事我一次搞定。\n\n厄布魯說這是讓貧瘠之地恢復原貌的第一步。聽起來，他們的導師還在下面某個地方睡著呢。"
L["Hamuul Runetotem does his scouting asleep. He'd gone into the land of dreams and seen a cult of druids in the Wailing Caverns, druids who had meant to heal the Barrens and lost their way. He was too old to stay long. Nara Wildmane had stayed, and Nara had seen their faces.\n\nThe Druids of the Fang, she called them. Four leaders, a dream gem apiece, and all four haunting her sleep. She wanted the gems. I understood that to include the leaders.\n\nAbove the cave mouth, two disciples of Naralex had requests of their own, hides and a body count, and the caverns supplied both. When I came back with the gems, Nara said her dreams were finally free of those faces. Somebody slept well that night. Not me."] = "哈繆爾‧符文圖騰偵察都是在睡夢裡進行的。他進入了夢境之地，看見哀嚎洞穴裡有一群德魯伊結成了教派，他們本想治癒貧瘠之地，最後卻迷失了方向。他年紀太大，沒辦法久留。納拉‧蠻鬃留了下來，也看清了他們的臉。\n\n她稱他們為尖牙德魯伊。四個首領，每人一顆夢境寶石，四個都在她的睡夢裡陰魂不散。她要那些寶石。我理解為：連首領一起拿下。\n\n洞口上方，納拉雷克斯的兩個信徒也有自己的要求：皮革，還有擊殺數，洞穴裡兩樣都供應充足。我帶著寶石回來時，納拉說她的夢裡終於不再有那些臉了。那天晚上有人睡了個好覺。不是我。"
L["Leaders of the Fang"] = "尖牙德魯伊"
L["Deviate Hides"] = "變異皮革"
L["Deviate Eradication"] = "清除變異者"
L["Apothecary Zamah, sent out to Thunder Bluff by the Royal Apothecary Society, wanted ten serpentbloom from the darkest corners of the Wailing Caverns, in the service of the Dark Lady. I picked them between snakes. Zamah called them splendid specimens, which from an apothecary is practically a hug."] = "藥劑師札瑪是皇家藥劑師協會派駐雷霆崖的，為了替黑暗女王效力，想要十朵長在哀嚎洞穴最黑暗角落裡的毒蛇花。我在一條條蛇之間把它們摘了回來。札瑪稱讚它們是絕佳的樣本，這話從藥劑師嘴裡說出來，幾乎就等於一個擁抱了。"
L["Serpentbloom"] = "毒蛇花"
L["Crane Operator Bigglefuzz in Ratchet had tried to unload a huge shipment from Booty Bay all at once and brought the lot down, and in the confusion Mad Magglish ran off with a bottle of 99-year-old port and hid in the Wailing Caverns. I brought the bottle back. Bigglefuzz, who had been about to lose the job over it, hurried it off to Gazlowe as a gift."] = "棘齒城的起重機操作員比戈弗茲想一口氣卸下一大批從藏寶海灣運來的貨，結果整批都砸了下來。混亂之中，瘋狂的馬格利什捲走了一瓶99年波爾多陳釀，躲進了哀嚎洞穴。我把酒帶了回來。比戈弗茲差點為這件事丟了飯碗，趕緊把它當作禮物送去給加茲魯維。"
L["Trouble at the Docks"] = "港口的麻煩"
L["Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet is convinced the raptors of the Barrens are cleverer than other raptors, that the cleverness lives in their horns, and that ground horn in wine makes a smart drink worth a fortune. I brought back horns off the sunscale scytheclaws. Mebok was grinding them before I'd let go."] = "棘齒城的麥伯克‧米希瑞克斯堅信，貧瘠之地的迅猛龍比別處的迅猛龍聰明，聰明勁兒就藏在牠們的角裡，把角磨成粉加進酒裡，就是一種能賺大錢的智慧飲料。我從赤鱗鐮爪龍身上弄回了角。我還沒鬆手，麥伯克就已經開始磨了。"
L["Raptor Horns"] = "迅猛龍角"
L["The horns didn't work. Mebok wasn't discouraged, since nobody gets rich on the first try, and had moved on to Wailing Essence, which gathers in the ectoplasmic things down in the Wailing Caverns and might be what makes the Barrens so strange. I brought six portions. Mebok promised to send me more once the fortune came in. I'm still waiting."] = "角沒有用。麥伯克並不灰心，畢竟沒人第一次就能發財，於是轉而研究哀嚎香精。這玩意兒聚集在哀嚎洞穴深處那些靈質生物身上，說不定正是貧瘠之地這麼古怪的原因。我帶回了六份。麥伯克答應等發了財就再多分我一些。我還在等。"
L["Smart Drinks"] = "智慧飲料"
L["Just inside the Wailing Caverns, a Disciple of Naralex waits for the four Fanglords to fall. Once they have, the disciple means to walk all the way down to the sleeping druid and wake him, and will need protecting every step."] = "就在哀嚎洞穴裡面不遠處，一位納拉雷克斯的信徒正等著四位尖牙領主倒下。等他們都倒下了，這位信徒打算一路走到沉睡的德魯伊身邊，把他喚醒，而每一步都需要有人保護。"
L["With the Fanglords dead, the disciple waiting inside the caverns finally had a clear road and someone to stand in front. We walked all the way down. Every time the disciple stopped to cast, the caverns sent something to interrupt, and I interrupted back.\n\nNaralex lay at the bottom, tossing in his sleep. The disciple reached into the dream after him, and Naralex, not helping, dreamed up something huge and hungry that climbed out of the water. It went down. Naralex woke with a shout, thanked us kindly, and left to find the rest of his disciples.\n\nThe beast left a glowing green shard behind. Someone in Ratchet sent me back toward the caverns to Falla Sagewind, who called it a nightmare and said it belonged with a wise druid. Mathrengyl Bearwalker, all the way over in Darnassus, looked into it, said things in the Emerald Dream were not as anyone had thought, and that the Cenarion druids alone would attend to it. I took the hint."] = "尖牙領主們一死，等在洞穴裡的那位信徒終於有了一條暢通的路，還有個人擋在前面。我們一路走到了最底下。每當信徒停下來施法，洞穴就會派點什麼東西來打斷，而我就把它們打斷回去。\n\n納拉雷克斯躺在最深處，在睡夢裡輾轉反側。信徒探進夢裡去找他，而納拉雷克斯非但不幫忙，還夢出了一個又大又餓的東西，從水裡爬了出來。它倒下了。納拉雷克斯大喊一聲醒了過來，客客氣氣地向我們道謝，就去找他其餘的信徒了。\n\n那頭野獸留下了一塊發著綠光的碎片。棘齒城有人要我回洞穴那邊找菲拉‧古風，菲拉說這是一場噩夢，應該交給一位睿智的德魯伊。遠在達納蘇斯的瑪斯雷‧馭熊者仔細看了看，說翡翠夢境裡的事情並不像大家想的那樣，這件事只有塞納里奧議會的德魯伊會去處理。我聽懂了弦外之音。"
L["With the Fanglords dead, the disciple waiting inside the caverns finally had a clear road and someone to stand in front. We walked all the way down. Every time the disciple stopped to cast, the caverns sent something to interrupt, and I interrupted back.\n\nNaralex lay at the bottom, tossing in his sleep. The disciple reached into the dream after him, and Naralex, not helping, dreamed up something huge and hungry that climbed out of the water. It went down. Naralex woke with a shout, thanked us kindly, and left to find the rest of his disciples.\n\nThe beast left a glowing green shard behind. Someone in Ratchet sent me back toward the caverns to Falla Sagewind, who called it a nightmare and said it belonged with a wise druid. Hamuul Runetotem looked into it, said things in the Emerald Dream were not as anyone had thought, and told me not to concern myself with it. I'm trying."] = "尖牙領主們一死，等在洞穴裡的那位信徒終於有了一條暢通的路，還有個人擋在前面。我們一路走到了最底下。每當信徒停下來施法，洞穴就會派點什麼東西來打斷，而我就把它們打斷回去。\n\n納拉雷克斯躺在最深處，在睡夢裡輾轉反側。信徒探進夢裡去找他，而納拉雷克斯非但不幫忙，還夢出了一個又大又餓的東西，從水裡爬了出來。它倒下了。納拉雷克斯大喊一聲醒了過來，客客氣氣地向我們道謝，就去找他其餘的信徒了。\n\n那頭野獸留下了一塊發著綠光的碎片。棘齒城有人要我回洞穴那邊找菲拉‧古風，菲拉說這是一場噩夢，應該交給一位睿智的德魯伊。哈繆爾‧符文圖騰仔細看了看，說翡翠夢境裡的事情並不像大家想的那樣，又要我別為這件事操心。我正在努力。"
L["The Glowing Shard"] = "發光的碎片"
L["Glowing Shard"] = "發光的碎片"
L["the depths of the Wailing Caverns"] = "哀嚎洞穴深處"
L["In Nightmares"] = "在噩夢中"
L["Are We There, Yeti?"] = "雪怪計畫！"
L["Everlook sits at the cold end of Winterspring, a goblin trading town where travelers come in out of the snow. Umi Rumplesnicker has been drawing up plans there, and she'll let you in on them if you promise not to tell.\n\nUmi's friends always seem to have the great ideas. This time she has one of her own. It needs a few things from the snowfields outside town, and someone who can keep a straight face."] = "永望鎮坐落在冬泉谷寒冷的一端，是座地精貿易小鎮，旅人們從風雪中進來歇腳。烏米一直在那裡畫著設計圖，只要你保證不說出去，她就讓你知道其中的秘密。\n\n烏米的朋友們好像總有好點子。這一次，她也有了一個自己的點子。這個點子需要鎮外雪原上的幾樣東西，還需要一個能憋住不笑的人。"
L["Winterspring / Tanaris / Un'Goro Crater"] = "冬泉谷 / 塔納利斯 / 安戈洛環形山"
L["Umi Rumplesnicker"] = "烏米"
L["Legacki"] = "萊加奇"
L["Sprinkle"] = "斯普琳科"
L["Quixxil"] = "奎克希爾"
L["Umi's Secret"] = "烏米的秘密"
L["Umi Rumplesnicker, in Everlook in Winterspring, has plans for something great and is bursting to tell someone. Promise to keep it quiet and she'll let you in on the secret, and on the shopping list that comes with it."] = "冬泉谷永望鎮的烏米正計劃著一件了不起的東西，憋著不跟人說就渾身難受。只要你保證守口如瓶，她就會把秘密告訴你，連同附帶的採購清單一起。"
L["So there's a tinkerer in Everlook called Umi Rumplesnicker, and she had a secret. She'd let me in on it if I promised not to tell. I promised, and I've kept my word right up until now.\n\nHer friends, she said, always had the great ideas. Well, now she had one. A mechanical yeti. They'd be frightened out of their wits, and then, once they'd stopped shaking, terribly impressed.\n\nA yeti needs a coat, so I went southeast and collected ten thick furs from the ice thistle yetis, who were still wearing them. Then it needed horns, the big ones off the patriarchs and matriarchs in their cave. Only the best-looking ones, Umi said. No beat up or broken horns, please.\n\nTry asking a yeti patriarch to hold still so you don't scuff the goods."] = "話說永望鎮有個叫烏米的工匠，她有個秘密。只要我保證不說出去，她就告訴我。我保證了，而且一直守口如瓶，直到現在。\n\n她說，她的朋友們總是有好點子。這下好了，她也有了一個。一隻機械雪人。朋友們會被嚇得魂飛魄散，然後，等他們不再發抖了，就會佩服得五體投地。\n\n雪人得有件外套，所以我往東南方去，從冰薊雪人身上收集了十張厚毛皮，牠們當時還穿在身上呢。接下來還需要角，得是洞裡那些雪人王和雪人女王頭上的大角。烏米說了，只要最好看的。撞壞的、斷掉的角，麻煩不要。\n\n你倒是試試叫一隻雪人王站著別動，好讓你別把貨給刮花了。"
L["Thick Yeti Fur"] = "厚雪人毛皮"
L["Pristine Yeti Horns"] = "完美的雪人角"
L["Umi Rumplesnicker's project is finished, and she has already written to her friends in Everlook, Gadgetzan and Un'Goro Crater to say a surprise is coming. Somebody has to deliver it. Umi, in Everlook, is looking at you."] = "烏米的作品完工了，她已經寫信給永望鎮、加基森和安戈洛環形山的朋友們，說有個驚喜就要到了。總得有人去送這個驚喜。永望鎮的烏米正看著你呢。"
L["Umi had written ahead to tell her friends a surprise was coming. The surprise was me, with her mechanical yeti in my pack.\n\nFirst stop, right there in Everlook: Legacki. I switched the yeti on, it went stomping over roaring its head off, and Legacki jumped a foot in the air, called me a big meanie and guessed who'd put me up to it in one try. Umi, it turns out, is always playing jokes on Legacki.\n\nThen the long road south. In Gadgetzan the next friend also guessed Umi. At Marshal's Refuge in Un'Goro, Quixxil didn't guess anything. Quixxil ran. The yeti followed. Quixxil asked it why. It roared, which I suppose is an answer.\n\nBack in Everlook, Umi was thrilled. That would teach them to make fun of her ideas, she said. I didn't mention what Legacki had told me. Some secrets you keep."] = "烏米事先寫了信，告訴朋友們有個驚喜要來。那個驚喜就是我，背包裡裝著她的機械雪人。\n\n第一站就在永望鎮：萊加奇。我打開雪人的開關，它一路咚咚咚地衝過去，吼得震天響，萊加奇嚇得跳起一尺高，罵我是個大壞蛋，然後一猜就猜中了是誰指使我的。原來烏米老是拿萊加奇開玩笑。\n\n接著是往南的漫漫長路。到了加基森，下一位朋友也猜到了是烏米。在安戈洛的馬紹爾營地，奎克希爾什麼都沒猜。奎克希爾拔腿就跑。雪人在後面追。奎克希爾問它為什麼。它吼了一聲，我想這也算是個回答吧。\n\n回到永望鎮，烏米樂壞了。她說，這下看他們還敢不敢嘲笑她的點子。萊加奇跟我說的話，我一個字也沒提。有些秘密，就該守著。"
L["Umi's Friends"] = "烏米的朋友們"
L["The Shards of Myzrael"] = "密斯賴爾水晶碎塊"
L["High in the northern mountains of the Arathi Highlands, a cluster of crystals pulses with a voice. It belongs to Myzrael, a princess of the earth, held deep beneath the Highlands by the giants.\n\nFind the Shards of Myzrael and hear her out. Freeing a princess is the stuff of old songs, though the songs never mention how much walking is involved."] = "在阿拉希高地北部的高山上，一簇水晶隨著一個聲音明滅跳動。那聲音屬於密斯賴爾，一位大地公主，被巨人們囚禁在高地深處。\n\n找到密斯賴爾水晶碎塊，聽聽她怎麼說。解救公主是古老歌謠裡的情節，只不過歌謠裡從來不提要走多少路。"
L["Arathi Highlands / Ironforge / Badlands"] = "阿拉希高地 / 鐵爐堡 / 荒蕪之地"
L["The Princess Trapped"] = "受困的公主"
L["Shards of Myzrael"] = "密斯賴爾水晶碎塊"
L["the northern mountains, Arathi Highlands"] = "北部山區，阿拉希高地"
L["Drywhisker Gorge, Arathi Highlands"] = "枯鬚峽谷（阿拉希高地）"
L["Iridescent Shards"] = "虹光水晶碎塊"
L["the Circle of Inner Binding, Arathi Highlands"] = "內禁錮法陣（阿拉希高地）"
L["Stone of Inner Binding"] = "內禁錮之石"
L["Keystone"] = "鑰匙之石"
L["the Forlorn Cavern, Ironforge"] = "荒棄的洞穴（鐵爐堡）"
L["Gerrig Bonegrip"] = "葛利‧硬骨"
L["Hammerfall, Arathi Highlands"] = "落錘鎮（阿拉希高地）"
L["Zaruk"] = "薩魯克"
L["In the northern mountains of the Arathi Highlands, a cluster of crystals called the Shards of Myzrael pulses with a voice. It belongs to a princess of the earth, trapped beneath the Highlands by giants, and she would very much like out."] = "在阿拉希高地北部的山中，一簇名為密斯賴爾水晶碎塊的水晶隨著一個聲音明滅跳動。那聲音屬於一位被巨人困在高地地底的大地公主，而她非常想出來。"
L["So there's a crystal up in the mountains of northern Arathi, and it talks. Put a hand on it and a voice turns up in your head: Myzrael, a princess of the earth, chained deep under the Highlands by the giants. She asked very nicely.\n\nThe kobolds of Drywhisker Gorge were allies of the giants, and they had what she needed: a dozen Motes of Myzrael, to wake a second cluster of shards in their cave. They gave them up eventually.\n\nThen the Stones of Binding. Three stone circles across the Highlands, a key in each, and elementals on guard at every one. I brought all three keys to the Stone of Inner Binding, and the princess called me her rescuer.\n\nNobody had ever called me that before. I could get used to it."] = "話說阿拉希北部的山上有塊水晶，它會說話。把手放上去，腦子裡就會響起一個聲音：密斯賴爾，一位大地公主，被巨人們鎖在高地深深的地底。她請求得非常客氣。\n\n枯鬚峽谷的狗頭人是巨人的盟友，而他們手上正好有她需要的東西：十二份密斯賴爾之塵，用來喚醒他們洞裡的另一簇水晶碎塊。他們最後還是交出來了。\n\n接著是禁錮之石。高地各處有三座石陣，每座裡面有一把鑰匙，每座都有元素生物把守。我把三把鑰匙都帶到了內禁錮之石，公主稱我為她的拯救者。\n\n以前從來沒人這樣叫過我。我可以習慣這個稱呼。"
L["I took a pendant off a fallen foe once, and it would not stop pulsing. Hold it and a vision comes: the northern mountains of Arathi, a brilliant crystal jutting out of the earth, and a sense of someone pleading for help. I followed the vision. The crystal was there, and so was the pleading."] = "有一回我從一個倒下的敵人身上拿到一枚墜飾，它一刻不停地跳動著。握住它，就會看到一個幻象：阿拉希北部的群山，一塊耀眼的水晶從地裡突出來，還有一種有人在苦苦求救的感覺。我跟著幻象去了。水晶在那裡，求救聲也在。"
L["Crystal in the Mountains"] = "山中的水晶"
L["Pendant of Myzrael"] = "密斯賴爾墜飾"
L["a rare drop from foes around level 30 to 40"] = "約30至40級敵人的稀有掉落物"
L["Stones of Binding"] = "禁錮之石"
L["Breaking the Keystone"] = "打開鑰匙之石"
L["Myzrael has one more favor to ask, through the Stone of Inner Binding. A last lock, the Keystone, still holds her, and its key is carried by Fozruk, a stone watcher who walks the Arathi Highlands. You may want company."] = "密斯賴爾透過內禁錮之石，還有最後一個忙要請你幫。最後一道鎖——鑰匙之石——仍然困著她，而它的鑰匙在弗茲魯克身上。弗茲魯克是一位在阿拉希高地上四處行走的石頭守望者。你最好找幾個同伴。"
L["The last lock was the Keystone, and its key, the Rod of Order, belonged to Fozruk. Fozruk is a stone watcher, which is a polite word for a giant, and spends the day walking the Highlands. Finding the giant took a while. Taking the rod took a while longer.\n\nI set the rod in the Keystone and felt the ground shudder. Then the princess, very loud: free, she was free! Not ready to face her old jailers, mind you. She needed time to gather her strength, and when she was ready, someone would have to summon her to the surface. You can guess who.\n\nShe sent me to a friend of hers, Gerrig Bonegrip, in a shop in the Forlorn Cavern of Ironforge. Gerrig had been expecting me, and welcomed me as one who serves a higher cause. Nobody had ever said that about me before either."] = "最後一道鎖是鑰匙之石，而它的鑰匙——秩序魔棒——在弗茲魯克手裡。弗茲魯克是一位石頭守望者，這是對巨人的客氣說法，成天在高地上走來走去。找到這個巨人花了一陣子。把魔棒拿到手，又花了更長一陣子。\n\n我把魔棒插進鑰匙之石，感覺大地一陣震顫。接著是公主的聲音，響亮極了：自由了，她自由了！不過，她還沒準備好面對當年的獄卒。她需要時間恢復力量，等她準備好了，得有人把她召喚到地面上來。你猜得到是誰。\n\n她要我去找她的一位朋友：葛利‧硬骨，在鐵爐堡荒棄的洞穴裡開了間店。葛利早就在等我了，歡迎我這位侍奉更崇高使命的人。以前也從來沒人這樣說過我。"
L["The last lock was the Keystone, and its key, the Rod of Order, belonged to Fozruk. Fozruk is a stone watcher, which is a polite word for a giant, and spends the day walking the Highlands. Finding the giant took a while. Taking the rod took a while longer.\n\nI set the rod in the Keystone and felt the ground shudder. Then the princess, very loud: free, she was free! Not ready to face her old jailers, mind you. She needed time to gather her strength, and when she was ready, someone would have to summon her to the surface. You can guess who.\n\nShe sent me to a friend of hers, Zaruk, in Hammerfall. Zaruk had been expecting me, and said that if we were to bring the Lady back to the surface, we had much to discuss. Nobody had ever needed me for anything that grand before."] = "最後一道鎖是鑰匙之石，而它的鑰匙——秩序魔棒——在弗茲魯克手裡。弗茲魯克是一位石頭守望者，這是對巨人的客氣說法，成天在高地上走來走去。找到這個巨人花了一陣子。把魔棒拿到手，又花了更長一陣子。\n\n我把魔棒插進鑰匙之石，感覺大地一陣震顫。接著是公主的聲音，響亮極了：自由了，她自由了！不過，她還沒準備好面對當年的獄卒。她需要時間恢復力量，等她準備好了，得有人把她召喚到地面上來。你猜得到是誰。\n\n她要我去落錘鎮找她的一位朋友：薩魯克。薩魯克早就在等我了，說如果我們要把那位女士帶回地面，有很多事要商量。以前從來沒人需要我去做這麼宏大的事。"
L["Myzrael's Allies"] = "密斯賴爾的盟友"
L["Gerrig Bonegrip, in the Forlorn Cavern of Ironforge, knows how Myzrael can be summoned. It takes a scroll, and the scroll went missing along with someone called Theldurin the Lost, last heard of in the Badlands. The name is not encouraging."] = "鐵爐堡荒棄的洞穴裡的葛利‧硬骨知道該怎麼召喚密斯賴爾。這需要一份卷軸，而卷軸跟一個叫迷失者塞爾杜林的人一起不見了，最後聽說他在荒蕪之地。這名字可不怎麼讓人放心。"
L["Zaruk, in Hammerfall, knows how Myzrael can be summoned. It takes a scroll, and the scroll went missing along with someone called Theldurin the Lost, last heard of in the Badlands. The name is not encouraging."] = "落錘鎮的薩魯克知道該怎麼召喚密斯賴爾。這需要一份卷軸，而卷軸跟一個叫迷失者塞爾杜林的人一起不見了，最後聽說他在荒蕪之地。這名字可不怎麼讓人放心。"
L["Gerrig had more to say after that. The higher cause had a name, the Twilight's Hammer, and the Lady was their Lady. To bring her back they needed the Scroll of Myzrael, and one of their own, Theldurin, had lost his mind, scorned their teachings and fled to the Badlands with it.\n\nTheldurin was mad, all right. He said hello seven times, apologized, and took the apology back. But when I mentioned the scroll, he made perfect sense. Summon her? You don't want that, he said. If she comes up, we're all in trouble. Maybe she's already free, gathering her strength.\n\nI had just finished setting her free.\n\nThe scroll had been torn up by enraged rock elementals, who were still fighting over the scraps. I collected the scraps. Theldurin called them our only chance against the evil of Myzrael, and went looking for his scrap-ratchet."] = "之後葛利還有話要說。那個更崇高的使命有個名字：暮光之錘。而那位女士，正是他們的女主人。要把她帶回來，他們需要密斯賴爾卷軸，可他們自己人當中有個叫塞爾杜林的，失了心智，唾棄他們的教義，帶著卷軸逃到了荒蕪之地。\n\n塞爾杜林確實瘋了。他跟我打了七次招呼，道了個歉，又把道歉收了回去。可我一提到卷軸，他說的話就句句在理了。召喚她？你不會想那麼做的，他說。要是她上來了，我們全都要遭殃。說不定她已經自由了，正在積蓄力量呢。\n\n我才剛把她放出來。\n\n卷軸被一群被激怒的石元素撕碎了，它們還在為那些碎片打個不停。我把碎片收齊了。塞爾杜林說這是我們對抗密斯賴爾之邪惡的唯一機會，然後就去找他的碎片棘輪了。"
L["Zaruk had more to say after that. The higher cause had a name, the Twilight's Hammer, and the Lady was their Lady. To bring her back they needed the Scroll of Myzrael, and one of their own, Theldurin, had lost his mind, scorned their teachings and fled to the Badlands with it.\n\nTheldurin was mad, all right. He said hello seven times, apologized, and took the apology back. But when I mentioned the scroll, he made perfect sense. Summon her? You don't want that, he said. If she comes up, we're all in trouble. Maybe she's already free, gathering her strength.\n\nI had just finished setting her free.\n\nThe scroll had been torn up by enraged rock elementals, who were still fighting over the scraps. I collected the scraps. Theldurin called them our only chance against the evil of Myzrael, and went looking for his scrap-ratchet."] = "之後薩魯克還有話要說。那個更崇高的使命有個名字：暮光之錘。而那位女士，正是他們的女主人。要把她帶回來，他們需要密斯賴爾卷軸，可他們自己人當中有個叫塞爾杜林的，失了心智，唾棄他們的教義，帶著卷軸逃到了荒蕪之地。\n\n塞爾杜林確實瘋了。他跟我打了七次招呼，道了個歉，又把道歉收了回去。可我一提到卷軸，他說的話就句句在理了。召喚她？你不會想那麼做的，他說。要是她上來了，我們全都要遭殃。說不定她已經自由了，正在積蓄力量呢。\n\n我才剛把她放出來。\n\n卷軸被一群被激怒的石元素撕碎了，它們還在為那些碎片打個不停。我把碎片收齊了。塞爾杜林說這是我們對抗密斯賴爾之邪惡的唯一機會，然後就去找他的碎片棘輪了。"
L["The Lost Fragments"] = "遺失的卷軸碎片"
L["Summoning the Princess"] = "召喚大地公主"
L["Theldurin the Lost, hiding in the Badlands, has pieced the Scroll of Myzrael back together with his scrap-ratchet. Read at the Shards of Myzrael, where you first heard her voice, it will call the princess up. Theldurin has some firm ideas about what happens next."] = "躲在荒蕪之地的迷失者塞爾杜林用他的碎片棘輪把密斯賴爾卷軸拼回了原樣。在你第一次聽見她聲音的密斯賴爾水晶碎塊那裡宣讀卷軸，就能把公主召喚上來。至於接下來該怎麼做，塞爾杜林有些相當堅定的想法。"
L["I read the scroll at the Shards of Myzrael, right where the princess first asked me for help, and up she came. Free, rested, and in no mood to thank anyone. She'd promised me once that her gratitude would shake the very foundations of the earth. She meant it literally.\n\nWhen she finally went down, I took her Eldritch Shackles and bound them to the Shards. From somewhere far below came a wail, and then a roar.\n\nThe Shards don't feel warm anymore. They hum with something that wishes the surface ill. Fair enough. If somebody let me out and then put me back, I'd hold a grudge too.\n\nRescuing a princess, it turns out, is only half the job. The other half is putting her back."] = "我在密斯賴爾水晶碎塊那裡宣讀了卷軸，就在公主第一次向我求助的地方，然後她就上來了。自由了，休養好了，而且完全沒有要感謝誰的意思。她曾經向我保證，她的感激之情將撼動大地的根基。她是認真的，字面上的意思。\n\n等她終於倒下，我取下她的怪異鐐銬，把它們和水晶碎塊縛在一起。從極深的地底傳來一聲哀號，接著是一聲咆哮。\n\n水晶碎塊摸起來不再溫暖了。它們嗡嗡作響，帶著某種對地面世界的惡意。這也說得過去。要是有人把我放出來又把我塞回去，我也會記仇的。\n\n原來解救公主只是差事的一半。另一半是把她送回去。"
L["Thunderfury"] = "雷霆之怒"
L["Deep in Molten Core, Garr and Baron Geddon each keep half of a relic called the Bindings of the Windseeker. They give them up rarely, and only after a great many evenings of asking.\n\nCarry a half to Silithus and see where it leads. Legends are made at the end of roads like this one, provided you bring patience, a great deal of arcanite, and thirty-nine friends."] = "在熔火之心深處，加爾和迦頓男爵各自保管著一件名為逐風者禁錮之顱的遺物的一半。這兩位很少交出來，就算交，也得你上門討上好多個晚上。\n\n帶著其中一半去希利蘇斯，看看它會把你引向何方。傳奇就誕生在這樣一條路的盡頭——前提是你帶上耐心、大量的奧金，還有三十九個朋友。"
L["Molten Core / Silithus"] = "熔火之心 / 希利蘇斯"
L["Examine the Vessel"] = "復生之瓶"
L["the Ravaged Twilight Camp, Silithus"] = "暮光營地廢墟（希利蘇斯）"
L["Prince Thunderaan"] = "桑德蘭王子"
L["The Bindings of the Windseeker"] = "逐風者禁錮之顱"
L["Deep in Molten Core, Garr and Baron Geddon each carry half of the Bindings of the Windseeker, and neither gives it up often. Win either half, then take it to Highlord Demitrian at the Ravaged Twilight Camp in northwestern Silithus."] = "在熔火之心深處，加爾和迦頓男爵各自帶著半個逐風者禁錮之顱，而且誰都不常交出來。拿到任何一半之後，把它帶到希利蘇斯西北部暮光營地廢墟的德米提恩那裡。"
L["Garr and Baron Geddon live down in Molten Core, and each of them carries half of the Bindings of the Windseeker. They carry them the way a miser carries his coin: rarely seen, never offered. We killed the pair of them week after week. I won't say how many weeks. Some of the people who were there still won't talk about it.\n\nThen one night a half dropped, and it was mine.\n\nIt led me to Silithus, to a ruined Twilight camp and a man called Highlord Demitrian, who took one look at it and fell to his knees. My Master's eternal prison, he said. He must be released. He gave me a vessel to examine, I examined it, and he asked the Master to bless my efforts.\n\nI noticed the word Master. I decided to worry about it later."] = "加爾和迦頓男爵住在熔火之心底下，各自帶著半個逐風者禁錮之顱。它們帶著它的樣子，就像守財奴揣著錢袋：難得一見，從不出手。我們一週又一週地把這兩位幹掉。到底多少週我就不說了。當時在場的一些人，到現在都不願意提這件事。\n\n然後某天晚上，掉了一半，而且歸我。\n\n它把我引到了希利蘇斯，一座殘破的暮光營地，還有一個叫德米提恩的人。他只看了一眼，就跪倒在地。他說，這是吾主的永恆牢獄。必須讓他重獲自由。他給了我一個瓶子要我查看，我查看了，然後他祈求吾主保佑我的努力。\n\n我注意到了「吾主」這個詞。我決定晚點再為這件事操心。"
L["Thunderaan the Windseeker"] = "逐風者桑德蘭"
L["Highlord Demitrian, in his ruined camp in Silithus, knows how to free the Windseeker from his prison. It takes both halves of the Bindings, ten bars of elementium, and the Essence of the Firelord, which only Ragnaros can give up."] = "希利蘇斯那座殘破營地裡的德米提恩知道該如何把逐風者從牢獄中釋放出來。這需要禁錮之顱的左右兩半、十塊源質錠，以及火焰之王的精華——而只有拉格納羅斯交得出這東西。"
L["Demitrian's list was short. Both halves of the Bindings. Ten bars of elementium to fortify his vessel. And the Essence of the Firelord, which you only get by destroying Ragnaros' body at the bottom of Molten Core.\n\nThe second half of the Bindings took its own sweet time, same as the first. Ragnaros took some persuading. The elementium took everything else. Every bar wants ten bars of arcanite and a fiery core besides, so a hundred bars of arcanite went into a sword I hadn't even seen yet. I stopped counting the gold. The banker didn't.\n\nWhen I finally laid it all out, Demitrian didn't thank me. He called on his Master to rise and break his bonds, and told me to behold him who is older than existence.\n\nSo I beheld. He was free, and he was not in a grateful mood."] = "德米提恩的清單很短。禁錮之顱的左右兩半。十塊源質錠，用來強化他的瓶子。還有火焰之王的精華，只有在熔火之心最底層摧毀拉格納羅斯的軀體才拿得到。\n\n禁錮之顱的另一半跟第一半一樣，慢吞吞地不肯露面。拉格納羅斯則需要好好「勸」一勸。剩下的一切全耗在源質錠上。每一塊都要十塊奧金錠外加一個熾熱之核，所以有一百塊奧金錠投進了一把我連見都還沒見過的劍。我不再數花了多少金幣。銀行行員可沒停。\n\n等我終於把所有東西擺出來，德米提恩並沒有謝我。他呼喚吾主起身，掙脫束縛，還要我瞻仰這位比存在本身更古老的他。\n\n於是我瞻仰了。他自由了，而且心情可一點都談不上感激。"
L["Rise, Thunderfury!"] = "覺醒吧，雷霆之怒！"
L["The Dormant Wind Kissed Blade is in your hands, and it sleeps. Highlord Demitrian, at the Ravaged Twilight Camp in Silithus, has the craft to wake it. Go and ask him. Firmly."] = "風吻之刃就在你手中，但它沉睡著。希利蘇斯暮光營地廢墟的德米提恩有喚醒它的手藝。去問問他吧。態度堅決一點。"
L["For someone who'd spent ages in a prison that had been riding around in my bags, Prince Thunderaan came out swinging. It took forty of us to put him down. When he went, he left a sword behind, dormant, with the wind still moving in it.\n\nDemitrian was a different man by then. He cowered. He begged me to spare him and hand over the blade, and he'd wake it with the very materials I'd brought for his Master's return. Then I could leave him to reshape his pathetic life. His words. I didn't argue with any of them.\n\nSo he made it. Thunderfury, Blessed Blade of the Windseeker. It takes longer to say than to swing, and far longer to get than either.\n\nNow and then someone in a tavern asks, did someone say Thunderfury? Someone did. It was me."] = "被關了不知多少年，牢獄還一直在我背包裡跟著我到處跑，桑德蘭王子一出來就揮拳開打。我們四十個人才把他放倒。他倒下時留下了一把劍，沉睡著，風仍在劍身裡流動。\n\n那時的德米提恩已經判若兩人。他畏畏縮縮，求我饒他一命，把劍交給他，他會用我為迎接他主人歸來而帶來的那些材料喚醒它。然後我就可以放他走，讓他去重塑他那可悲的人生。這是他的原話。我一句也沒反駁。\n\n於是他把劍鑄成了。雷霆之怒，逐風者的祝福之劍。念完全名比揮一下還費時，而弄到手比這兩樣都費時得多。\n\n三不五時就有人在酒館裡問：有人說雷霆之怒嗎？有人說了。就是我。"
L["Molten Core"] = "熔火之心"
L["The Green Hills"] = "荊棘谷的青山"
-- WoW Forever: The Drowned City
L["The Drowned City"] = "沉沒之城"
L["At the Rebel Camp in northern Stranglethorn, a few deserters are holding out against their old commander, Colonel Kurzen, and Brother Nimetz wants to know what turned a good officer so cruel. To the south, at Grom'gol Base Camp, Kin'weelay of the Darkspear wants a piece of an old legend from the Vile Reef, a troll city the sea swallowed long ago.\n\nBoth trails lead out to the water off Stranglethorn's coast, where something old has come back up. Every treasure hunter in Booty Bay has heard about it."] = "在荊棘谷北部的反抗軍營地，幾個逃兵正在頑抗他們的老長官庫爾森上校，而尼麥茲修士想知道，是什麼讓一位好軍官變得如此殘忍。在南邊的格羅姆高營地，暗矛部族的肯維雷想要暗礁海一段古老傳說的碎片——那是一座早已被大海吞沒的食人妖城市。\n\n兩條線索都通往荊棘谷外海，那裡有某種古老的東西重新浮出了水面。藏寶海灣的每個尋寶人都聽說過這件事。"
L["At the Rebel Camp in northern Stranglethorn, a few deserters are holding out against their old commander, Colonel Kurzen, outnumbered ten to one. Lieutenant Doren needs every blade he can get, and Brother Nimetz wants to know what turned a good officer so cruel.\n\nThe answer leads a long way from the jungle and then straight back to it, out to the water off Stranglethorn's coast, where something old has come back up. Every treasure hunter in Booty Bay has heard about it."] = "在荊棘谷北部的反抗軍營地，幾個逃兵正在頑抗他們的老長官庫爾森上校，對方人數是他們的十倍。多倫上尉需要他能找到的每一把刀劍，而尼麥茲修士想知道，是什麼讓一位好軍官變得如此殘忍。\n\n答案會把你帶到離叢林很遠的地方，然後又直接帶回來，一路通往荊棘谷外海——那裡有某種古老的東西重新浮出了水面。藏寶海灣的每個尋寶人都聽說過這件事。"
L["At Grom'gol Base Camp in Stranglethorn, Kin'weelay of the Darkspear wants a piece of an old legend from the Vile Reef, a troll city the sea swallowed long ago. Commander Aggro'gosh has trouble enough on land without more of it coming out of the water.\n\nThe legend leads out to the reef and past it, to something old that has come back up off Stranglethorn's coast. Every treasure hunter in Booty Bay has heard about it."] = "在荊棘谷的格羅姆高營地，暗矛部族的肯維雷想要暗礁海一段古老傳說的碎片——那是一座早已被大海吞沒的食人妖城市。指揮官阿格羅戈西在陸地上的麻煩已經夠多了，可不想再有更多麻煩從水裡冒出來。\n\n傳說會把你引向礁石，再越過礁石，找到荊棘谷外海重新浮出水面的某種古老的東西。藏寶海灣的每個尋寶人都聽說過這件事。"
