L["The Rebel Camp in northern Stranglethorn is a band of deserters holding out against Colonel Kurzen, their old commander. Private Thorsen, on the road near camp, could use a hand right now, and Sergeant Yohwa has work for anyone who can fight."] = "荊棘谷北部的反抗軍營地是一群逃兵，他們正在頑抗自己的老長官庫爾森上校。營地附近路上的列兵索爾森眼下正需要人幫忙，而尤瓦中士有工作要交給任何能打的人。"
L["So there's a camp of deserters in northern Stranglethorn, outnumbered ten to one by their old colonel. I pulled one of them, Private Thorsen, out of a scrap with Kurzen's men on the road. Thorsen had been sent back to spy on Kurzen. Kurzen, it turned out, knew.\n\nSo somebody in camp was talking. Lieutenant Doren sent me into Kurzen's Compound for his logistics officer's papers. Nothing about Thorsen, but a little brass key hidden in a ledger's binding, and a strongbox in the caves out back that it opened. Inside was a muddy note with Thorsen's whole routine, signed with one letter. M.\n\nBetween errands, the sergeant had me thin out Kurzen's men and rob his medicine men of their remedies. Then the corporal who keeps the patrol schedules told me who'd walked with Thorsen last week. I took that back to Doren and let him do the arithmetic."] = "事情是這樣的，荊棘谷北部有個逃兵營地，他們那位老上校的人馬是他們的十倍。其中一個，列兵索爾森，在路上跟庫爾森的人打了起來，被我拉了出來。索爾森是被派回去監視庫爾森的。結果庫爾森早就知道了。\n\n這表示營地裡有人走漏了消息。多倫上尉派我潛進庫爾森的營地，去拿那邊後勤官的文件。關於索爾森的什麼都沒有，倒是在一本帳簿的書背裡藏著一把小小的黃銅鑰匙，後面山洞裡還有個保險箱，正好能用它打開。裡面是一張沾泥的便箋，寫著索爾森的所有日常行程，署名只有一個字母。M。\n\n跑腿的空檔，中士要我去削減一下庫爾森的人手，再把他那些巫醫的藥搶過來。後來，負責巡邏時間表的那位下士告訴我上週是誰跟索爾森一起走的。我把這消息帶回去交給多倫，剩下的算術就讓他自己做。"
L["Bookie Herod"] = "書呆子赫羅德"
L["The Hidden Key"] = "隱藏的鑰匙"
L["The Spy Revealed!"] = "找出內鬼！"
L["Patrol Schedules"] = "巡邏時間表"
L["Report to Doren"] = "向多倫報告"
L["The Second Rebellion"] = "以彼之道還施彼身"
L["Bad Medicine"] = "庫爾森的藥物"
L["Colonel Kurzen"] = "庫爾森上校"
L["Brother Nimetz at the Rebel Camp has a question nobody else is asking: what turned a once-noble man into the colonel they're fighting? Sergeant Yohwa and Lieutenant Doren, meanwhile, are ready to go after Kurzen's best troops, and the colonel himself."] = "反抗軍營地的尼麥茲修士有個別人都沒在問的問題：是什麼把一個曾經高尚的人變成了他們正在對抗的那位上校？與此同時，尤瓦中士和多倫上尉已經準備好去對付庫爾森的精銳部隊，還有上校本人。"
L["The sergeant sent me after Kurzen's special forces, down in the caves they call the Stockpile, and then the lieutenant sent me after the colonel himself. Kurzen commanded from the very back of it. I came out with his head, which settled the military side of things.\n\nBrother Nimetz was stuck on another side. Kurzen had once been a good man, and Nimetz wanted to know what turned him. So I copied four troll legends off tablets in the old ruins, and pried a handful of fetishes off the Skullsplitter witchdoctors down south.\n\nNimetz added a scout's report: the local trolls were all worked up, repeating one word. I'lalai. He bundled the lot and sent me to a friend of his in Southshore. Stranglethorn to Hillsbrad, with a parcel. Nobody in that camp does anything by halves."] = "中士派我去對付庫爾森的特種部隊，就在他們稱作儲藏室的那片山洞底下，接著上尉又派我去找上校本人。庫爾森躲在最裡頭指揮。我提著他的腦袋出來了，軍事方面的事就這樣解決了。\n\n尼麥茲修士卡在另一方面。庫爾森曾經是個好人，尼麥茲想知道是什麼改變了他。於是我從古老遺跡的石板上抄下了四段食人妖傳說，又從南邊的劈顱巫醫身上撬下了幾個神像。\n\n尼麥茲又加上一份斥候的報告：當地的食人妖都激動得不得了，嘴裡反覆念著同一個詞。伊拉萊。他把這些東西打成一包，派我去找他在南海鎮的一位朋友。從荊棘谷到希爾斯布萊德，帶著一個包裹。那個營地裡的人做什麼事都不馬虎。"
L["Kurzen's Mystery"] = "庫爾森的秘密"
L["Troll Witchery"] = "食人妖巫術"
L["An Acquaintance in Southshore"] = "南海鎮的熟人"
L["Special Forces"] = "特種部隊"
L["Nimetz had one more name for me later on. Kurzen was dead, but whatever had turned him was not: an ogre mage called Mai'Zoth, holed up in a mound in the eastern mountains and said to bend minds. Nimetz was positive Mai'Zoth had done it. I brought back the Mind's Eye, the thing the ogre used, and handed it over very carefully."] = "後來尼麥茲又給了我一個名字。庫爾森已經死了，但把他變成那樣的東西還沒死：一個叫麥佐斯的巨魔法師，盤踞在東邊山裡的一座土丘上，據說能扭曲人的心智。尼麥茲認定就是麥佐斯幹的。我把心靈之眼——那個巨魔用的東西——帶了回來，非常小心地交了出去。"
L["Mai'Zoth"] = "麥佐斯"
L["The Vile Reef"] = "暗礁海"
L["Kin'weelay at Grom'gol Base Camp wants a shard of an old tablet in the Vile Reef, a troll city the sea swallowed long ago. The tablet is sacred to the Darkspear. The murlocs living in the ruins don't care."] = "格羅姆高營地的肯維雷想要暗礁海裡一塊古老石板的碎片，那是一座早已被大海吞沒的食人妖城市。這塊石板對暗矛部族來說是神聖的。住在遺跡裡的魚人才不在乎。"
L["Kin'weelay wanted a shard of a tablet out of the Vile Reef, an old troll city an earthquake sank long ago. Murlocs live in it now. The tablet tells the tale of Gri'lek, a hero of troll legend, and Kin'weelay wanted a piece of it for Orgrimmar. I chipped one off and swam for it.\n\nKin'weelay found the shard odd. It spoke of a lost city, I'lalai, as a great sprawling civilization, and the reef ruins aren't nearly big enough. So I went up the coast to another old ruin with hide and charcoal and took a rubbing of a second legend.\n\nCommander Aggro'gosh had naga swarming the ruins on the sea floor and wanted their tridents. Kin'weelay remembered a cavern by the reef from diving there as a youngster. I found it, west of the reef, with naga gathered all around. Naga never gather anywhere for a good reason."] = "肯維雷想要暗礁海裡一塊石板的碎片。那是一座古老的食人妖城市，很久以前被一場地震沉進了海裡，現在住著魚人。石板上講的是食人妖傳說中的英雄格里雷克的故事，肯維雷想要一塊送去奧格瑪。我敲下一塊，拚命游走了。\n\n肯維雷覺得這塊碎片有點古怪。上面說失落之城伊拉萊是一個龐大繁盛的文明，可是礁石間的那片遺跡遠遠沒那麼大。於是我帶著獸皮和炭筆沿著海岸往上走，到另一處古老遺跡拓印了第二段傳說。\n\n指揮官阿格羅戈西那邊，海底遺跡裡納迦成群，他要他們的三叉戟。肯維雷想起小時候在礁石邊潛水時見過的一個洞穴。我找到了它，就在礁石西邊，周圍聚滿了納迦。納迦聚在一起，從來不會是為了什麼好事。"
L["The Gurubashi Legends of Old"] = "古拉巴什古代傳說"
L["Locating the Lost City"] = "定位失落之城"
L["Enemies in the Water"] = "水中的敵人"
L["Loremaster Dibbs in Southshore has read the report from the Rebel Camp with shaking hands, and he believes a lost city has risen off Stranglethorn's coast. He wants its legends and its magic studied. Krazek in Booty Bay wants something from the place too."] = "南海鎮的博學者迪布斯讀反抗軍營地送來的報告時雙手直發抖，他相信荊棘谷外海有一座失落之城浮出了水面。他想研究那裡的傳說和魔法。藏寶海灣的克拉茲克也想從那地方弄點東西。"
L["Beyond the cavern west of the Vile Reef lie ruins the naga are guarding, and Kin'weelay at Grom'gol thinks they may be the lost city. Commander Aggro'gosh wants to know what the naga are after. Krazek in Booty Bay has an interest in the place too."] = "暗礁海西邊的洞穴另一頭，是納迦把守的遺跡，格羅姆高的肯維雷認為那可能就是失落之城。指揮官阿格羅戈西想知道納迦在找什麼。藏寶海灣的克拉茲克也對那個地方很有興趣。"
L["Loremaster Dibbs read the report with shaking hands. If the trolls were right, the lost city of I'lalai had risen off Stranglethorn's coast, which made it, in his words, the archeological discovery of the century. Could I possibly go back down there? With hide and charcoal?\n\nSo into the Drowned City I went, with friends. I took rubbings of four tablets and collected troll fetishes, since Dibbs suspected whatever magic raised the city might have something to do with what took the colonel's mind.\n\nKrazek in Booty Bay had me on a second job: a crew of Saltseer pirates had got there first and were looting magical things he'd rather loot himself. He especially wanted their captain, Dreadrise, out of the picture. Permanently. The picture is clearer now."] = "博學者迪布斯讀報告的時候手一直在抖。要是食人妖們說得沒錯，失落之城伊拉萊已經在荊棘谷外海浮出了水面，用他的話來說，這是本世紀最重大的考古發現。我能不能再下去一趟？帶上獸皮和炭筆？\n\n於是我帶著朋友們進了沉沒之城。我拓印了四塊石板，還收集了食人妖神像，因為迪布斯懷疑，不管是什麼魔法讓這座城市升了起來，都可能跟奪走上校心智的東西有關。\n\n藏寶海灣的克拉茲克給了我第二份工作：一夥鹽占海盜搶先到了那裡，正在搜刮各種魔法物品，而他寧可自己來搜刮。他特別希望他們的船長懼湧從畫面裡消失。永遠消失。現在畫面清爽多了。"
L["Past the cavern the naga were guarding stood the ruins Kin'weelay had hoped for: the lost city of I'lalai, up out of the sea after all that time. Kin'weelay was too old to go in, and wanted etchings of every tablet inside. Commander Aggro'gosh wanted the naga's leader dead before they found whatever they were looking for. I brought enough friends to manage both.\n\nKrazek in Booty Bay had me on a second job: a crew of Saltseer pirates had got there first and were looting magical things he'd rather loot himself. He especially wanted their captain out of the picture. Permanently. The picture is clearer now."] = "越過納迦把守的那個洞穴，就是肯維雷盼望已久的遺跡：失落之城伊拉萊，過了那麼多年終於從海裡升了起來。肯維雷年紀太大，進不去了，想要裡面每一塊石板的拓印。指揮官阿格羅戈西想在納迦找到他們要找的東西之前，幹掉他們的首領。我找了夠多的朋友，兩件事都辦妥了。\n\n藏寶海灣的克拉茲克給了我第二份工作：一夥鹽占海盜搶先到了那裡，正在搜刮各種魔法物品，而他寧可自己來搜刮。他特別希望他們的船長從畫面裡消失。永遠消失。現在畫面清爽多了。"
L["Take Two With Water"] = "配水服用兩顆"
L["Magics of the Drowned City"] = "沉沒之城的魔法"
L["The Only Good Brinescale..."] = "好的海鱗納迦…"
L["Shady Saltseers"] = "被陰的鹽占海盜"
L["The Saltseer Captain"] = "鹽占船長"
L["Archmage Timear in Dalaran had heard about the ruin and wanted one of the idols the old Gurubashi witch doctors used to focus their blood magic. For its archeological value, the archmage said. I found one and handed it over to the Kirin Tor, who I'm sure will be very responsible with it."] = "達拉然的大法師泰彌亞聽說了那片遺跡，想要一尊古代古拉巴什巫醫用來匯聚血魔法的塑像。用大法師的話來說，是為了它的考古價值。我找到一尊，交給了祈倫托，我相信他們一定會非常負責地對待它。"
L["Ancient Gurubashi Secrets"] = "遠古古拉巴什秘密"
L["Mazu'kon in Mulgore had heard the old Gurubashi channeled their blood magic through idols of pure truesilver and wanted one, strictly for academics. The advice was to kill the most impressive-looking priest in the place. It was good advice. Academics, I'm told, is a very broad field."] = "莫高雷的瑪庫可聽說古代古拉巴什人是透過純真銀打造的塑像來引導血魔法的，於是想要一尊，嚴格來說只為學術研究。別人給的建議是：殺掉那地方看起來最威風的祭司。這建議不錯。聽說學術研究是個非常廣泛的領域。"
L["Ancient Gurubashi Idol"] = "遠古古拉巴什塑像"
L["Somewhere in the city I picked up a scrap of scroll covered in symbols I couldn't read. It didn't feel dangerous, so I took it to Dudd Fizzlescroll in Booty Bay, a collector of odd magic. One less mystery in my pack."] = "在城裡的某個地方，我撿到一片殘缺的卷軸，上面滿是我看不懂的符號。感覺不像危險的東西，所以我把它帶給了藏寶海灣專門收集古怪魔法的杜德‧嘶卷。背包裡少了一個謎團。"
L["Partial Mystical Notes"] = "不完整的神秘筆記"
L["the Drowned City"] = "沉沒之城"
L["A Tale Worth Telling"] = "值得講述的故事"
L["Loremaster Dibbs calls what you brought back a discovery of historical proportions, and has written to the Explorers' League in Ironforge to say so. Someone has to carry the letter. He also has a friend in Dalaran who would love to see one of those fetishes."] = "博學者迪布斯稱你帶回來的東西是一項具有歷史意義的發現，還特地寫信告訴鐵爐堡的探險者協會。總得有人去送這封信。他在達拉然還有一位朋友，很想看看那些神像中的一個。"
L["The Darkspear keep their history by telling it. Kin'weelay at Grom'gol wants your etchings taken to Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village, one of the wisest of the Darkspear, who will want to hear this tale."] = "暗矛部族靠講述來保存自己的歷史。格羅姆高的肯維雷希望你把拓印帶給森金村的加德林大師，他是暗矛部族最睿智的人之一，一定會想聽聽這個故事。"
L["Dibbs called it a discovery of historical proportions and wrote to his colleague at the Explorers' League straight away. I carried the letter to Historian Karnik in Ironforge, with a copy of Dibbs's translations of the tablets. A whole drowned city's worth of legend, in my pack.\n\nI'd gone to Stranglethorn to help a few rebels with their colonel. I came back with the archeological discovery of the century. That's the thing about discoveries of historical proportions: somebody still has to walk them to Ironforge."] = "迪布斯說這是一項具有歷史意義的發現，馬上寫信給他在探險者協會的同事。我把信送到鐵爐堡的史學家卡尼克手上，還附上一份迪布斯翻譯的石板譯文。整整一座沉沒之城的傳說，就裝在我的背包裡。\n\n我當初去荊棘谷，只是想幫幾個反抗軍對付他們的上校。回來的時候卻帶著本世紀最重大的考古發現。具有歷史意義的發現就是這樣：總還是得有人一步一步把它們送到鐵爐堡。"
L["The Darkspear keep their history by telling it, Kin'weelay explained: legends passed down to the younglings, lessons and cautionary tales. So the etchings went to Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village, their spiritual leader, to hear the truth of it. Kin'weelay even made me a copy of my own, and offered another if I ever lost it. For a small fee.\n\nSo the tale of I'lalai goes into the telling now, around the fire in Durotar. Somewhere a youngling is going to hear it and want to go diving. I know the feeling."] = "肯維雷解釋說，暗矛部族靠講述來保存歷史：傳給孩子們的傳說、教訓，還有警世的故事。所以拓印被送到了森金村的加德林大師那裡，他是他們的精神領袖，好讓他聽聽其中的真相。肯維雷甚至幫我也做了一份副本，還說要是我弄丟了，可以再幫我做一份。只收一點小錢。\n\n於是，伊拉萊的故事如今在杜洛塔的營火旁傳講開來。總有一天，某個小傢伙聽了會想去潛水。我懂那種感覺。"
L["Findings for the Explorer's League"] = "探險者協會的發現"
L["Dibbs also had a friend in Dalaran, Abra Cadabra, who studies troll magic and would want a look at one of the fetishes. The Kirin Tor are particular about who they let in. They let me in. Abra got the fetish, and I got to say I'd delivered a troll fetish to someone called Abra Cadabra, which I still enjoy."] = "迪布斯在達拉然還有一位朋友，阿布拉‧卡達布拉，專門研究食人妖魔法，一定想看看其中一個神像。祈倫托對放誰進去很挑剔。他們放我進去了。阿布拉拿到了神像，而我從此可以說，我替一個叫阿布拉‧卡達布拉的人送過食人妖神像，這件事我到現在還覺得很有趣。"
L["The Web of Magic"] = "魔法之網"
L["A Tale Spun Around the Fire"] = "火堆旁的故事"
-- WoW Forever: Highway Robbery
L["Highway Robbery"] = "大道劫匪"
L["On a rise at the edge of the Kodo Graveyard in Desolace, a campfire has gone cold beside a camp that's been picked clean. The travelers who made it never left, and the marks on their bones don't match any centaur's weapon.\n\nIf the caravans' gossip is right, whoever did it has done it before. Following that gossip leads a long way out of Desolace, to the docks of Booty Bay and farther still."] = "在淒涼之地的科多獸墳場邊緣，一處高坡上的營火早已冷卻，旁邊的營地被搜刮得一乾二淨。搭起這處營地的旅人再也沒有離開，而他們骨頭上的痕跡，和任何半人馬的武器都對不上。\n\n如果商隊之間的傳言沒錯，下手的人以前就幹過這種事。循著這些傳言，你會遠遠離開淒涼之地，一路來到藏寶海灣的碼頭，甚至更遠的地方。"
L["Desolace / Stranglethorn Vale / Arathi Highlands"] = "淒涼之地 / 荊棘谷 / 阿拉希高地"
L["Extinguished Campfire"] = "熄滅的營火"
L["the Kodo Graveyard, Desolace"] = "科多獸墳場，淒涼之地"
L["the inn, Booty Bay, Stranglethorn Vale"] = "藏寶海灣的旅店，荊棘谷"
L["The Pillaged Camp"] = "遭掠的營地"
L["On a rise at the edge of the Kodo Graveyard in Desolace, a campfire has burned out and the camp around it has been stripped bare. Take a look at what's left. Whatever happened here, the scavengers of Desolace may have seen it before."] = "在淒涼之地的科多獸墳場邊緣，一處高坡上的營火已經燒盡，周圍的營地被洗劫一空。去看看還剩下什麼。不管這裡發生了什麼事，淒涼之地那些拾荒的人或許早就見過了。"
L["So I'm crossing Desolace, which is never anyone's first choice, and on a rise above the Kodo Graveyard there's a campfire gone cold. Around it lay two humans and a dwarf, or what was left of them. Their packs had been emptied, and the cuts on the bones didn't come from any centaur blade I know.\n\nI wanted someone who knew this country's bones, so I took it to the goblin bone collector at Kormek's Hut. Bibbly F'utzbuckle heard me out and said I'd found another one, in the tone you'd use for a cart that's thrown a wheel again."] = "話說我正在穿越淒涼之地，這種路從來沒人會優先選，結果在科多獸墳場上方的一處高坡上，有一堆冷掉的營火。營火周圍躺著兩個人類和一個矮人，或者說，是他們剩下的部分。他們的背包被搜刮一空，骨頭上的刀痕也不是我認得的任何一種半人馬刀刃留下的。\n\n我想找個熟悉這片土地上那些骨頭的人，所以把這件事帶去考米克小屋，找那個收集骨頭的哥布林。比布里·弗斯巴克聽我說完，說我又找到了一處，那語氣就像在說哪輛貨車又掉了輪子。"
L["On the Lam"] = "亡命之徒"
L["Bibbly F'utzbuckle at Kormek's Hut has seen camps like this before. Caravan gossip blames a band of marauders who fled Desolace with an Alliance marshal on their trail. If one of them is trying to get a boat out, Booty Bay is the place to look."] = "考米克小屋的比布里·弗斯巴克以前就看過這種營地。商隊間的傳言把矛頭指向一群掠奪者，他們被一名聯盟治安官追緝，逃離了淒涼之地。如果其中有人想搭船離開，藏寶海灣就是該找的地方。"
L["According to Bibbly, the caravans blamed a band of marauders who ran once a marshal got on their trail. People on the run end up in ports, so I went to Booty Bay and found one of them, Tokal, drinking at the inn. Tokal asked if I was with the marshal, looked me over and decided I wasn't. I'm still working out how to take that.\n\nThe rest of the story cost me a cherry grog. Tokal's crew had robbed those camps, yes, but for pay, not for the Horde. Their boss was a night elf named Illari Duskfeather. She told them which camps to hit and let them keep most of the loot. The rarer finds she kept for herself, and when the marshal closed in, she left them for dead.\n\nTokal isn't out for revenge, but won't stand in the way of anyone who is. Illari had once mentioned a hideout on the Arathi coast."] = "照比布里的說法，商隊認為是一群掠奪者幹的，一名治安官盯上他們之後，他們就跑了。逃亡的人最後總會跑到港口，所以我去了藏寶海灣，在旅店裡找到了其中一個，托卡，正在喝酒。托卡問我是不是跟治安官一夥的，把我上下打量了一番，認定我不是。這該怎麼解讀，我到現在還在想。\n\n剩下的故事花了我一杯櫻桃酒。托卡那夥人確實搶了那些營地，但那是收錢辦事，不是為了部落。他們的老大是個夜精靈，叫伊拉里‧暮羽。她告訴他們要搶哪些營地，大部分戰利品也讓他們留著。比較稀有的東西她都留給自己，等到治安官逼近，她就把他們丟下等死。\n\n托卡不打算報仇，但誰要去報仇，托卡也不會擋路。伊拉里曾經提過，她在阿拉希海岸有個藏身處。"
L["Bibbly F'utzbuckle"] = "比布里·弗斯巴克"
L["Cherry for Your Thoughts?"] = "你在想櫻桃酒嗎？"
L["Tokal"] = "托卡"
L["No Honor Among Thieves"] = "盜卻無道"
L["Tokal says the crew's old boss, Illari Duskfeather, once mentioned a hideout on the coast of the Arathi Highlands. Near the Arathi end of the Thandol Span, a rope bridge crosses to a hillside, and a rowboat waits at the water below."] = "托卡說，他們以前的老大伊拉里‧暮羽曾經提過，她在阿拉希高地的海岸有個藏身處。在薩多爾大橋靠阿拉希的那一端附近，有一座繩橋通往一處山坡，下方的水邊有一艘划艇在等著。"
L["The rowboat below the Thandol Span goes where no road does, out to a lonely dock on the Arathi coast. Illari Duskfeather was waiting there, and she wanted to know what I was doing on her dock.\n\nShe has her reasons for what happened in Desolace, and how much of them you get to hear depends on who's asking. I'll keep my half of that conversation to myself. It ended with her key in my hand.\n\nThe key opened her cache at the other end of the dock. Inside were a small box and some coin, likely the rarer finds she'd kept from her crew. I took them. The people they were taken from won't be needing them."] = "薩多爾大橋下的那艘划艇，會去到沒有路能到的地方，一路划到阿拉希海岸一座孤零零的碼頭。伊拉里‧暮羽就在那裡等著，想知道我在她的碼頭上做什麼。\n\n對於淒涼之地發生的事，她有她的理由，而你能聽到多少，要看問的人是誰。那場對話裡我說的那一半，我就自己留著了。對話最後，她的鑰匙到了我手上。\n\n鑰匙打開了碼頭另一端她的藏物箱。裡面有一個小盒子和一些錢幣，八成就是她瞞著手下私藏的那些稀有物品。我拿走了。它們原本的主人已經用不到了。"
-- Dungeon stories: Hidden Enemies, Blackfathom Villainy, The Mad King, Thorns of the Razorfen, The City of Dalaran, Lost in the Thicket, An Ancient Grudge
L["The City of Dalaran"] = "達拉然城"
L["An emissary from Dalaran has come to Southshore asking the Alliance for help, and the Kirin Tor's high council would prefer that it stayed quiet. Over in Tarren Mill, Magus Wordeen Voidglare has business at the mages' prison camp on Lordamere Lake, and questions about the city beyond it.\n\nThe Kirin Tor rebuilt Dalaran after the Legion flattened it and have kept outsiders at arm's length ever since. Something has gone wrong inside, and for once they are asking for help."] = "一位來自達拉然的使者來到南海鎮，向聯盟求援，而祈倫托的最高議會寧願這件事別張揚。另一頭，塔倫米爾的魔導師沃迪恩‧虛無之光在洛丹米爾湖畔的法師監獄營地有事要辦，對湖那邊的那座城市也頗有疑問。\n\n燃燒軍團把達拉然夷為平地之後，祈倫托重建了這座城市，從此一直把外人擋在門外。如今城裡出了差錯，他們難得開口求一次助。"
L["An emissary of the Kirin Tor has come to the town hall in Southshore asking the Alliance for help, and the high council would prefer that it stayed quiet. Archmage Modera sent him, and she needs someone who can be discreet.\n\nThe Kirin Tor rebuilt Dalaran after the Legion flattened it and have kept outsiders at arm's length ever since. Something has gone wrong inside, badly enough that they are asking anyway."] = "祈倫托的一位使者來到南海鎮的市政廳，向聯盟求援，而最高議會寧願這件事別張揚。派他來的是大法師莫德菈，她需要一個懂得保密的人。\n\n燃燒軍團把達拉然夷為平地之後，祈倫托重建了這座城市，從此一直把外人擋在門外。如今城裡出了差錯，嚴重到他們顧不了那麼多，還是開口求助了。"
L["Magus Wordeen Voidglare came to Tarren Mill to study, but the Undercity has more urgent work for him. Four Forsaken thieves are locked up in the mages' prison camp on Lordamere Lake, and Wordeen has questions about the city behind it.\n\nThe Kirin Tor rebuilt Dalaran right on the Dark Lady's doorstep and have kept the Forsaken out ever since. Wordeen would very much like to know what they keep in there."] = "魔導師沃迪恩‧虛無之光來塔倫米爾本來是為了做研究，可是幽暗城有更緊急的差事要交給他。四個被遺忘者竊賊被關在洛丹米爾湖畔的法師監獄營地裡，而沃迪恩對營地後面的那座城市也有些疑問。\n\n祈倫托就在黑暗女王的家門口重建了達拉然，從此一直不讓被遺忘者進去。沃迪恩非常想知道，他們在裡面藏了些什麼。"
L["Alterac Mountains / City of Dalaran"] = "奧特蘭克山脈 / 達拉然城"
L["An Alarming Request"] = "令人擔憂的請求"
L["Emissary Jacques"] = "使者賈克"
L["the town hall, Southshore, Hillsbrad Foothills"] = "市政廳，南海鎮，希爾斯布萊德丘陵"
L["the Violet Citadel, Dalaran, Alterac Mountains"] = "紫羅蘭城塞，達拉然，奧特蘭克山脈"
L["the Park, Stormwind City"] = "公園（暴風城）"
L["the top of the Wizard's Sanctum, Mage Quarter, Stormwind City"] = "巫師聖所頂樓，法師區，暴風城"
L["by the Dalaran sewers on Lordamere Lake, Silverpine Forest"] = "洛丹米爾湖畔的達拉然下水道旁，銀松森林"
L["Emissary Jacques has come down from Dalaran to the town hall in Southshore, asking the Alliance for help. The Kirin Tor rarely ask anyone for anything, and their high council would rather this stayed quiet."] = "使者賈克從達拉然下山，來到南海鎮的市政廳向聯盟求援。祈倫托很少有求於人，他們的最高議會也寧願這件事別張揚。"
L["Magus Wordeen Voidglare came to Tarren Mill to study, but has more pressing work. Four Forsaken robbed the Undercity and fled to Dalaran, where the mages locked them in a camp by Lordamere Lake. Wordeen is curious about the city, too."] = "魔導師沃迪恩‧虛無之光來塔倫米爾是為了做研究，但眼下有更要緊的事。四個被遺忘者洗劫了幽暗城，逃到了達拉然，法師們把他們關進了洛丹米爾湖畔的一座營地。沃迪恩對那座城市也很好奇。"
L["There's a Kirin Tor emissary in the town hall in Southshore, Jacques, with the look of a man sent to ask for something his betters would rather not ask for. Something had knocked Dalaran's ley lines loose, and the city's constructs had started breaking things instead of minding them. The high council wanted it kept quiet. Archmage Modera wanted help, and had sent Jacques to find some.\n\nSo I went up to Lordamere Lake and found Modera, or a shimmering image of her, waiting by the water outside the city. The Kirin Tor don't let outsiders in, she told me, but just now they couldn't afford to turn anyone away. The guards on the walls looked calm. Modera warned me not to read anything into that."] = "南海鎮的市政廳裡有個祈倫托的使者，叫賈克，一看就知道是被派來求一件他的上司們寧可不求的事。有什麼東西把達拉然的魔力線震鬆了，城裡的構造體不再看管東西，反而開始砸東西。最高議會想把這件事壓下來。大法師莫德菈想找幫手，就派賈克出來找。\n\n於是我上了洛丹米爾湖，在城外的水邊找到了莫德菈，正確地說，是她的一個閃著微光的影像。她告訴我，祈倫托不讓外人進城，可是眼下他們誰也拒絕不起。城牆上的守衛看起來很鎮定。莫德菈提醒我，別從這一點看出什麼來。"
L["Magus Wordeen came to Tarren Mill to study and ended up running the Dark Lady's errands. Four Forsaken had robbed a vault in the Undercity and fled to Dalaran, and the mages had locked them up in the Lordamere Internment Camp. So I broke into a prison to rob the prisoners. The last of them, Kegan Darkmar, was kept under guard in a house, and the warden's footlocker in there held a grimy key. \"A sewer key?\" said Wordeen, plainly glad he wouldn't be the one using it.\n\nOnce I'd thinned out the wizards patrolling the old ruins, Wordeen had news. Dalaran's barrier was down, and the sewers on the city's northern edge might not be warded. At the entrance stood an image of Archmage Modera, who told me to put my weapon away. She'd been counting on the Horde taking an interest, and she had a proposition."] = "魔導師沃迪恩來塔倫米爾是為了做研究，結果成了替黑暗女王跑腿的。四個被遺忘者洗劫了幽暗城的一座金庫，逃去了達拉然，法師們把他們關進了洛丹米爾收容所。於是我闖進一座監獄，為的是搶劫囚犯。最後一個叫凱根‧達克瑪，被看守在一棟房子裡，房裡典獄長的箱子裡有一把髒兮兮的鑰匙。「下水道鑰匙？」沃迪恩說，顯然很慶幸要用它的人不是他。\n\n我把在舊廢墟裡巡邏的巫師清掉一批之後，沃迪恩有了消息。達拉然的屏障失效了，城北邊緣的下水道可能沒有設防。入口處站著大法師莫德菈的影像，她叫我把武器收起來。她早就料到部落會對這裡感興趣，而她有個提議。"
L["Prison Break In"] = "入室偷竊"
L["Magus Wordeen Voidglare"] = "魔導師沃迪恩‧虛無之光"
L["Key to the City"] = "城市鑰匙"
L["Dalaran Patrols"] = "達拉然巡邏隊"
L["Blood in the Streets"] = "喋血街頭"
L["Archmage Modera's image, by Dalaran's sewers on Lordamere Lake, has a key for you and a quiet way into the city. In Stormwind, Shylamiir and High Sorcerer Andromath each have an errand in Dalaran as well."] = "大法師莫德菈的影像就在洛丹米爾湖畔的達拉然下水道旁，她有一把鑰匙要給你，還有一條悄悄進城的路。在暴風城，莎拉米爾和高階巫士安多瑪斯也各有一件差事要在達拉然辦。"
L["Archmage Modera's image, waiting outside Dalaran's sewers, has a proposition for the Horde. Melisara in Tarren Mill has Forsaken business in the city, and Doctor Martin Felben in the Undercity would like some samples."] = "大法師莫德菈的影像正在達拉然的下水道外等著，她有個提議要給部落。塔倫米爾的梅里薩拉在城裡有被遺忘者的事務要處理，幽暗城的馬丁‧費爾本醫生則想要一些樣本。"
L["Modera's image handed me a sewer key and a plan. The trouble had started at the top of the Violet Citadel, the wards were barely holding, and the Kirin Tor were too busy propping them up to deal with anything else. I was to come in quietly through the sewers and meet her at the citadel.\n\nQuietly lasted as far as the sewers. The streets above were thick with loose magic and constructs that had forgotten whose side they were on. Modera herself, the real one, was waiting on the citadel steps, and she opened a portal up to the Violet Chamber for us.\n\nUp there the Shade of the Archmage was holding the Arcane Mote, and it took some persuading to let go. I carried the mote back out to the lake for her image to look over. It seemed pleased, as far as you can tell with an image."] = "莫德菈的影像交給我一把下水道鑰匙和一個計畫。麻煩是從紫羅蘭城塞頂上開始的，結界勉強撐著，祈倫托忙著幫結界撐住，別的什麼都顧不了。我要悄悄從下水道進去，到城塞跟她會合。\n\n「悄悄」只撐到了下水道。上面的街道到處是失控的魔法，還有忘了自己站在哪一邊的構造體。莫德菈本人，真正的那個，正在城塞的臺階上等著，她為我們開了一道通往紫羅蘭密室的傳送門。\n\n到了上面，大法師之影抓著秘法微粒，得好好勸一勸才肯放手。我把微粒帶回湖邊，給她的影像過目。它看起來挺滿意的，如果影像也看得出滿意的話。"
L["Modera's proposition was plain enough. She doubted the Horde had Dalaran's best interests at heart, and she'd take our help anyway, since if Dalaran fell the Undercity would go with it. She enchanted my sewer key to get past her wards and told me to meet her at the Violet Citadel. The Kirin Tor would be far too busy to stop me. I could help myself to what I found on the way, as long as I remembered what I'd come for.\n\nUnder the streets and up through the city we went, with every construct in Dalaran trying to tidy us away. Modera opened a portal from the citadel steps, and at the top the Shade of the Archmage gave up the Arcane Mote. I didn't hand it to Modera. I took it home to Wordeen in Tarren Mill."] = "莫德菈的提議說得很直白。她不相信部落真心為達拉然著想，但還是願意接受我們的幫助，因為達拉然要是倒了，幽暗城也跑不掉。她對我的下水道鑰匙施了法，好讓它通過她的結界，然後叫我到紫羅蘭城塞跟她會合。祈倫托會忙得根本顧不上攔我。路上找到什麼，我都可以順手拿走，只要記得自己是為了什麼而來。\n\n我們從街道底下鑽過去，又穿過整座城往上走，達拉然的每一個構造體都想把我們當雜物收拾掉。莫德菈在城塞的臺階上開了一道傳送門，到了頂上，大法師之影交出了秘法微粒。我沒有把它交給莫德菈。我把它帶回了塔倫米爾，交給了沃迪恩。"
L["Heart of Disruption"] = "干擾之心"
L["Image of Archmage Modera"] = "大法師莫德菈的影像"
L["Starving Arcane"] = "飢餓的秘法"
L["The breach had scrambled the enchantments and factotums all over Dalaran, the ones keeping up its defenses included, and all that loose magic drew in rogue elementals looking for a free meal. Modera, busy with the wards, asked me to thin out what she called the elemental throng. I worked through the remnants and the mana echoes until the throng was a good deal thinner."] = "裂口把達拉然各處的魔法造物和雜役傀儡都攪亂了，連維持城防的那些也不例外，這麼多散逸的魔法又引來了一群想白吃一頓的失控元素。莫德菈忙著維持結界，便請我去清理一下她所說的「元素群」。我一路收拾那些殘渣和法力回音，直到這群東西稀疏了不少。"
L["A Green Sample"] = "綠色樣本"
L["Shylamiir"] = "莎拉米爾"
L["Shylamiir, the herbalism trainer in Stormwind's park, was annoyed to be disturbed and decided I might as well be useful. Dalaran's mages had taken up botany, the Kirin Tor keep to themselves, and Shylamiir wanted a sample from the city's central garden. The garden had gone fel, with a fel ancient rooted in the middle of it. I came back with one Fel Infused Blossom and a low opinion of Dalaran's gardeners."] = "莎拉米爾是暴風城公園裡的草藥學訓練師，被人打擾很不高興，乾脆決定讓我派上點用場。達拉然的法師們迷上了植物學，祈倫托又向來關起門來過日子，所以莎拉米爾想要一份城中央花園的樣本。那座花園已經魔化了，正中間還扎根著一棵魔化古樹。我帶回來一朵魔化灌注之花，還有對達拉然園丁的一肚子意見。"
L["Power Overwhelming"] = "壓倒性的力量"
L["High Sorcerer Andromath"] = "高階巫士安多瑪斯"
L["High Sorcerer Andromath in Stormwind was worried about the Kirin Tor. They had kept to themselves since Archimonde flattened their city, and now they were rebuilding it with arcane energy leaking out everywhere. If the Alliance didn't help, it could lose one of its strongest allies. So I went after the worst of the leaks, a mana elemental called the Arcanic Enigma, and dispersed it."] = "暴風城的高階巫士安多瑪斯很擔心祈倫托。自從阿克蒙德把他們的城市夷為平地，他們就一直關起門來過日子，現在他們正在重建，秘法能量卻四處外洩。聯盟要是不伸手幫一把，可能就會失去一個最強大的盟友。於是我去對付其中最嚴重的一處外洩，一個叫秘能之謎的法力元素，把它打散了。"
L["The Grave Knight"] = "墓地騎士"
L["Melisara"] = "梅里薩拉"
L["Melisara in Tarren Mill didn't care what became of Dalaran. What she cared about was Atrexis, a traitor to the Forsaken and a frighteningly good necromancer, raising an army of the dead in the city's underbelly under the Kirin Tor's noses. She wanted it understood that the Dark Lady's reach goes everywhere. I found Atrexis down in the sewers and passed the message on."] = "塔倫米爾的梅里薩拉根本不在乎達拉然會怎麼樣。她在乎的是亞崔希斯，一個背叛了被遺忘者、死靈法術又精通得嚇人的傢伙，正在城市的底層，就在祈倫托的眼皮底下召集一支亡靈大軍。她要讓人明白，黑暗女王的手伸得到任何地方。我在下水道裡找到了亞崔希斯，把這句話帶到了。"
L["Opportunistic Education"] = "機會教育"
L["Rexxie Copperclutch"] = "瑞克希‧銅鉗"
L["just inside the Dalaran sewers"] = "達拉然下水道入口內"
L["Just inside the sewers I met Rexxie Copperclutch, a goblin who took one look at me and decided we were in the same line of work. Rexxie's plan was to lift a secret arcane tome from the mages' libraries and split the profits. I brought back The Founding of Dalaran. Rexxie said it would barely sell at a tourist stall and asked whether I'd just grabbed the first book on the shelf. I had. It's being gilded and sold as an archmage's anyway."] = "才剛進下水道，我就遇到了瑞克希‧銅鉗，一個哥布林，看了我一眼就認定我們是同行。瑞克希的計畫是從法師們的圖書館裡偷一本秘傳的秘法典籍，然後分贓。我帶回來的是《達拉然的建立》。瑞克希說這玩意兒擺在觀光客的攤位上都賣不出去，問我是不是隨手抓了書架上的第一本。我是。反正它現在正被鍍上金邊，當成某位大法師的藏書出售。"
L["Source of Power"] = "力量的泉源"
L["Doctor Martin Felben"] = "馬丁‧費爾本醫生"
L["Doctor Martin Felben in the Apothecarium heard that Dalaran's own constructs were attacking it and saw an opportunity. An army of arcane-powered abominations, he reasoned, would impress the Dark Lady and might get him the Royal Apothecary Society to run. The constructs weren't going to hand over their cores, so I took six cracked ones without asking. Felben was delighted, which is never a good sign."] = "煉金區的馬丁‧費爾本醫生聽說達拉然自己的構造體在攻擊這座城，覺得這是個機會。照他的推論，一支以秘法驅動的憎惡體大軍能讓黑暗女王刮目相看，說不定還能讓他接手皇家藥劑師協會。構造體不會乖乖交出核心，所以我沒打招呼就拿了六個碎裂的。費爾本高興得不得了，這從來都不是什麼好兆頭。"
L["The Arcane Mote"] = "秘法微粒"
L["Archmage Modera thinks it only fair that you carry the good word, and the mote, to Archmage Celindra in the Violet Citadel. The Council of Six may not like how Modera went about things."] = "大法師莫德菈認為，由你把好消息連同微粒一起帶給紫羅蘭城塞的大法師瑟琳卓，才算公平。六人議會未必喜歡莫德菈的做事方式。"
L["Magus Wordeen Voidglare in Tarren Mill thinks the Kirin Tor will pay anything to get the mote back, and he knows what he wants for it. Take it to Archmage Modera's image outside Dalaran and see what the mages offer."] = "塔倫米爾的魔導師沃迪恩‧虛無之光認為，為了拿回微粒，祈倫托出什麼價都願意，而他很清楚自己想要什麼。把它帶到達拉然城外大法師莫德菈的影像那裡，看看法師們開出什麼條件。"
L["Modera admitted the Council of Six wouldn't be pleased to hear what she'd been doing behind their backs. She also didn't think they could argue with the results. The city had settled enough for the wards to come down, and she thought it only fair that I be the one to deliver the good word, so this time I went in through the front with the mote in my pack.\n\nArchmage Celindra greeted me in the Violet Citadel with \"Yes? I am quite busy.\" The mote got her attention. I left the citadel a friend of the Kirin Tor, which is more than most people get for going in through the sewers."] = "莫德菈承認，六人議會要是聽說她背著他們做的事，不會高興。可是她也不認為他們能對結果說三道四。城裡已經穩定到可以撤下結界了，她覺得由我去報這個好消息才算公平，所以這一次，我背著裝有微粒的背包，從正門走了進去。\n\n紫羅蘭城塞裡的大法師瑟琳卓用一句「什麼事？我很忙。」迎接了我。微粒讓她提起了興趣。我離開城塞時成了祈倫托的朋友，對一個從下水道鑽進來的人來說，這待遇比大多數人好多了。"
L["Wordeen had been thinking while I was away. Sneaking into the city of mages was all very well, he said, but it was time to negotiate. The Kirin Tor knew things that made his own research look thin, and he wanted the Horde let into their order. The mote was his price, and he was sure they would pay anything to get it back.\n\nSo I carried it back out to Modera's image by the lake, under orders to drive a hard bargain with an archmage whose city I'd just helped save. The mote went back to its owners. The Horde got a promise that there might be room for it in Dalaran one day, and Wordeen will have to make that last."] = "我不在的時候，沃迪恩一直在琢磨。他說，偷偷溜進法師之城固然不錯，但現在該談判了。祈倫托知道的東西，讓他自己的研究顯得很單薄，他想讓部落也能加入他們的組織。微粒就是他開的價碼，他確信為了拿回它，他們什麼都肯付。\n\n於是我把它帶回湖邊交給莫德菈的影像，奉命跟一位大法師狠狠討價還價，而她的城市我才剛幫忙救下來。微粒回到了主人手裡。部落得到了一個承諾，說總有一天，達拉然或許會有部落的一席之地。沃迪恩只能靠這句話撐上一陣子了。"
L["Friend of the Kirin Tor"] = "祈倫托的朋友"
L["Shrewd Negotiations"] = "精明交涉"
L["Lost in the Thicket"] = "迷失灌木叢"
L["A dig crew went up into the Wetlands highlands, and the news coming back down has dried up. In Menethil Harbor and in Lakeshire, families are waiting to hear from people who went up there. At Hammerfall there's a rumor that the Dragonmaw are planning something in the same hills.\n\nRethiel the Greenwarden says the land up there is sick. The Deathstalkers want someone to go and look before they move."] = "一支挖掘隊上了濕地的高地，從那裡傳下來的消息斷了。在米奈希爾港和湖畔鎮，都有人家在等上山的親人捎來音訊。落錘鎮那邊則有傳聞說，龍喉氏族正在同一片山裡謀劃著什麼。\n\n綠色守衛者雷希耶爾說，那上面的土地病了。亡靈哨兵想先找個人去看看，再決定要不要行動。"
L["Caitlin Grassman's husband went up into the Wetlands highlands to see a grass a dig crew had told him about, and he hasn't come home to Menethil Harbor. In Lakeshire, Dorin Songblade's brother took a crew of diggers into the same hills, and his letters have stopped coming.\n\nOut in the marsh, Rethiel the Greenwarden can feel something wrong with the land, and the creatures up in the hills are taking it badly."] = "凱特林‧格拉斯曼的丈夫上了濕地的高地，去看一支挖掘隊跟他提起的一種草，到現在都沒有回到米奈希爾港。在湖畔鎮，多林‧桑布雷德的兄弟帶著一隊挖掘工進了同一片山，他的信也不再寄來了。\n\n在沼澤深處，綠色守衛者雷希耶爾感覺得到這片土地出了問題，而山上的生物對此反應很糟。"
L["Word has reached Hammerfall that the Dragonmaw are planning something in the Wetlands, and the Deathstalkers want to know more before they move. Their agent is waiting in the hills above the Dragonmaw camp for anyone with the nerve to help.\n\nIn Orgrimmar, Borstan has seen the size of the raptor talons coming back from a dig in the Wetlands highlands, and would like to know how the rest of the raptor tastes."] = "落錘鎮收到消息，說龍喉氏族正在濕地謀劃著什麼，亡靈哨兵想多了解一些再行動。他們的密探就在龍喉營地上方的山丘上，等著有膽量的人去幫忙。\n\n在奧格瑪，伯斯坦見過從濕地高地的挖掘場運回來的迅猛龍爪子有多大，很想知道這種迅猛龍身上其他部位是什麼味道。"
L["Wetlands / Excavation Site: Wetlands"] = "濕地 / 挖掘場：濕地"
L["Tramping Paws"] = "踐踏之爪"
L["Rethiel the Greenwarden"] = "綠色守衛者雷希耶爾"
L["east of the Dun Modr road, Wetlands"] = "丹莫德大路以東，濕地"
L["Whelgar's Excavation Site, Wetlands"] = "維爾加挖掘場（濕地）"
L["the hills above the Dragonmaw camp, Wetlands"] = "龍喉營地上方的山丘，濕地"
L["the Drag, Orgrimmar"] = "暗巷區（奧格瑪）"
L["the Skywatcher Plateau, Mulgore"] = "天空守望者高原（莫高雷）"
L["The Greenwarden"] = "綠色守衛者"
L["Out in the marsh east of the Dun Modr road lives Rethiel the Greenwarden, who watches over the Wetlands and could use a hand. First Mate Fitzsimmons in Menethil Harbor knows the way, but would rather you didn't go."] = "丹莫德大路以東的沼澤裡，住著守護濕地的綠色守衛者雷希耶爾，眼下正缺個幫手。米奈希爾港的大副費茲西蒙斯認得路，不過寧願你別去。"
L["Rethiel the Greenwarden lives out in the marsh east of the Dun Modr road, and told me the roots and ferns spoke well of me. I've had worse references. The land was weeping from festered wounds, Rethiel said, and I was to heal it.\n\nMost of the wound was Mosshide gnolls. There were more of them all the time, cutting down trees and warming themselves with the burning wood, so I thinned them out and took away the flints they used to start their fires. Rethiel meant to smash every one and throw the pieces into the sea.\n\nThe fen creepers were the rest of it. Rethiel called them blisters on the land and wanted them settled back into the marsh, and I obliged. By the end the Greenwarden's faith in my people, which had been tested before, was coming back."] = "綠色守衛者雷希耶爾住在丹莫德大路以東的沼澤裡，說樹根和蕨草都對我評價不錯。我拿過比這更差的推薦信。雷希耶爾說，這片土地正因潰爛的傷口而哭泣，要我去治好它。\n\n傷口大半是蘚皮豺狼人。牠們越來越多，砍倒樹木，再燒著木頭取暖，所以我把牠們清掉一批，又拿走了牠們用來生火的打火石。雷希耶爾打算把這些打火石一塊塊砸碎，再把碎片丟進海裡。\n\n剩下的是沼澤爬行者。雷希耶爾管牠們叫大地上的膿皰，想讓牠們重新安息在沼澤裡，我照辦了。到最後，綠色守衛者對我族人的信心，那份曾經受過考驗的信心，又回來了。"
L["First Mate Fitzsimmons"] = "大副費茲西蒙斯"
L["First Mate Fitzsimmons in Menethil Harbor knew where to find the Greenwarden, out in the marsh east of the Dun Modr road, and seemed to hope I wasn't really going. I was. The first mate also told me to leave my money behind. I kept it, and the Greenwarden never mentioned it."] = "米奈希爾港的大副費茲西蒙斯知道去哪裡找綠色守衛者，就在丹莫德大路以東的沼澤裡，而且似乎盼著我其實不會去。我去了。大副還叫我把錢留下再走。我沒留，綠色守衛者也從來沒提過這件事。"
L["Fire Taboo"] = "火焰管制"
L["Blisters on the Land"] = "大地上的膿皰"
L["Young Crocolisk Skins"] = "小鱷魚皮"
L["James Halloran"] = "詹姆士‧哈洛倫"
L["James Halloran, the tanner in Menethil Harbor, ships cured crocolisk skins to ports all over the world and was running short of the soft ones that come off young crocolisks. I went out into the marsh and came back with a stack. Halloran called them superb and wanted to start curing them at once, but had more work for me first."] = "米奈希爾港的皮匠詹姆士‧哈洛倫把鞣好的鱷魚皮運往世界各地的港口，眼下正缺小鱷魚身上那種軟皮。我去沼澤裡繞了一圈，帶回來一疊。哈洛倫說這些皮好極了，恨不得馬上動手鞣製，不過在那之前，還有別的活要我做。"
L["The Highland Dig"] = "高地挖掘場"
L["Caitlin Grassman in Menethil Harbor hasn't seen her husband since he went up into the highlands, and Dorin Songblade in Lakeshire hasn't heard from his brother, who led a dig crew into the same hills. Rethiel the Greenwarden is worried about those hills too."] = "米奈希爾港的凱特林‧格拉斯曼自從丈夫上了高地，就再也沒見過他；湖畔鎮的多林‧桑布雷德也一直沒有兄弟的消息，他的兄弟帶著一支挖掘隊進了同一片山。綠色守衛者雷希耶爾也在為那片山擔心。"
L["Zaruk at Hammerfall has heard the Dragonmaw are planning something in the Wetlands, and a Deathstalker agent is waiting in the hills above their camp for help. Borstan in Orgrimmar wants meat from the raptors at the dig in the highlands."] = "落錘鎮的札魯克聽說龍喉氏族正在濕地謀劃著什麼，一名亡靈哨兵密探正在他們營地上方的山丘上等人幫忙。奧格瑪的伯斯坦則想要高地挖掘場那些迅猛龍的肉。"
L["So there's an alchemist in Menethil Harbor, Caitlin Grassman, whose husband climbs mountains to pick her herbs. When a dig crew came through talking about towering grass in the highlands, he went to see it and stayed gone.\n\nDorin Songblade, the armorer in Lakeshire, had a brother up in those hills with diggers from Loch Modan. Dorin would have gone along if not for a pile of girdles to refit. His brother always wrote, and this time he hadn't.\n\nThe dig was in shambles after a run of accidents. Caitlin's husband was alive and very glad to see me. Dorin's brother was in a tent, dead. He had Dorin's face, and DLS carved into the stock of his gun.\n\nFor the Greenwarden I brought back the root core of a Highland Horror. Something ancient was stirring under those hills, Rethiel said, and the diggers should stop digging for their own good."] = "米奈希爾港有個鍊金術師，叫凱特林‧格拉斯曼，她丈夫會爬上山去幫她採草藥。有一支挖掘隊路過，說起高地上有高得嚇人的草，他就去看了，然後一去不回。\n\n湖畔鎮的護甲匠多林‧桑布雷德有個兄弟，帶著洛克莫丹來的挖掘工在那片山裡。要不是有一堆腰帶等著改，多林本來也會一起去。他兄弟向來會寫信，這一次卻沒有。\n\n接連出了幾次意外之後，挖掘場一片狼藉。凱特林的丈夫還活著，見到我高興極了。多林的兄弟躺在一頂帳篷裡，已經死了。他長著和多林一樣的臉，槍托上刻著DLS。\n\n我替綠色守衛者帶回了一隻高地之懼的根系核心。雷希耶爾說，那片山底下有什麼古老的東西正在甦醒，挖掘工為了自己好，該停手了。"
L["Word reached Hammerfall that the Dragonmaw were planning a show in the Wetlands, the kind where a dragon is made to do as it's told. The Deathstalkers won't move on a rumor, so I met their agent in the hills above the camp. She asked if I was the courageous few and told me to keep my voice down.\n\nThe Dragonmaw at the dig thought they'd found a way back to power. I cleared out enough of them for the Deathstalkers to slip in and took a dispatch off one of their casters, which the agent snatched out of my hand. They were hoping to win over Rend. She called that a waste of effort and the news well worth the Dark Lady's time. I'm not to talk about the mission, so I'll stop there.\n\nBorstan in Orgrimmar got the raptor meat and wondered what those raptors had been eating to marble like that."] = "落錘鎮收到消息，說龍喉氏族打算在濕地辦一場表演，就是逼一頭龍乖乖聽話的那種。亡靈哨兵不會憑一句傳聞就行動，所以我去營地上方的山丘見了他們的密探。她問我是不是「少數勇者」，又叫我說話小聲一點。\n\n挖掘場裡的龍喉獸人以為自己找到了重掌權力的門路。我清掉了夠多的龍喉獸人，好讓亡靈哨兵溜進去，又從他們的一個施法者身上拿到一份急件，密探一把就從我手裡搶了過去。他們希望拉攏雷德。她說這是白費力氣，但這消息很值得黑暗女王花時間聽一聽。這次任務我不能多談，就說到這裡吧。\n\n奧格瑪的伯斯坦拿到了迅猛龍肉，琢磨著那些迅猛龍平常都吃了些什麼，才長出這麼漂亮的油花。"
L["Seeking Caitlin"] = "尋找凱特林"
L["Llana"] = "菈娜"
L["Llana, who sells reagents in Astranaar, swaps notes on rare plants with an alchemist in Menethil Harbor. The alchemist's last letter said her husband had joined a dig that was turning up signs of some long-lost grass, and then said nothing more about it. So I sailed to the Wetlands to ask. Caitlin Grassman guessed Llana was wondering about the seeds she'd been promised, but she had a bad feeling about that dig herself."] = "阿斯特蘭納賣施法材料的菈娜，常和米奈希爾港的一位鍊金術師交換珍稀植物的筆記。那位鍊金術師在上一封信裡說，她丈夫加入了一支挖掘隊，那裡挖出了某種失傳已久的草的痕跡，之後就再也沒提這件事。於是我搭船去了濕地問個究竟。凱特林‧格拉斯曼猜菈娜是在惦記答應給的種子，不過她自己對那個挖掘場也有種不好的預感。"
L["Lost in the Thicket Things"] = "迷失在灌木叢中"
L["Caitlin Grassman"] = "凱特林‧格拉斯曼"
L["Songblade Search"] = "尋找桑布雷德"
L["Dorin Songblade"] = "多林‧桑布雷德"
L["Horrors in the Highland"] = "高地之懼"
L["Highland Hides"] = "高地龍皮"
L["James Halloran had heard about the ruins up in the highlands and the raptors living around them. The raptors could hide all they liked, as far as Halloran was concerned, so long as they had hides. I brought back four. They'll make good trim, I'm told, and I got to try on the tanner's stock and pick something in trade."] = "詹姆士‧哈洛倫聽說了高地上的廢墟，還有住在廢墟周圍的迅猛龍。在哈洛倫看來，那些迅猛龍愛怎麼躲就怎麼躲，只要身上有皮就行。我帶回來四張。聽說這些皮能做成上好的滾邊，而我還能試穿皮匠的存貨，挑一件當作交換。"
L["Dragonmaw Rumors"] = "龍喉傳聞"
L["Open the Maw"] = "撬開龍喉"
L["Deathstalker Agent"] = "亡靈哨兵密探"
L["Changing Tastes"] = "換換口味"
L["Borstan"] = "伯斯坦"
L["Carried Home"] = "帶回家"
L["Ardin Grassman, at the far end of the dig, has something for you to carry home to his wife in Menethil Harbor. In Lakeshire, Dorin Songblade is waiting to hear about his brother."] = "在挖掘場的盡頭，亞丁‧格拉斯曼有樣東西要你帶回米奈希爾港，交給他的妻子。在湖畔鎮，多林‧桑布雷德正等著他兄弟的消息。"
L["Caitlin's husband needed a rest before he could walk out on his own, along the path I'd cleared. While he rested he braided some reeds into a heart and asked me to take it to her, and to tell her he'd be home soon. Caitlin held it close and started planning him a hearty supper.\n\nBefore I left the dig I covered Daewyn with his cloak. Then I went to Lakeshire and told Dorin. He blamed himself for staying behind. He'd been making gear for his brother as a surprise, and finished it after Daewyn had already gone. He couldn't bring himself to sell it or rework it, so he gave it to me."] = "凱特林的丈夫得先歇一歇，才能沿著我清出來的路自己走出去。歇著的時候，他用蘆葦編了一顆心，託我帶給她，還要我告訴她，他很快就回家。凱特林把它緊緊捧在懷裡，開始盤算給他做一頓豐盛的晚餐。\n\n離開挖掘場之前，我用戴文的斗篷蓋住了他。然後我去了湖畔鎮，告訴了多林。多林怪自己當初留了下來。他一直在幫兄弟做一套裝備，想給對方一個驚喜，可是等他做完，戴文已經動身走了。他既不忍心賣掉，也不忍心改製，就把它給了我。"
L["Heartwoven"] = "編織之心"
L["Ardin Grassman"] = "亞丁‧格拉斯曼"
L["Excavation Site: Wetlands"] = "挖掘場：濕地"
L["Fallen in the Fen"] = "死於沼地"
L["Daewyn Songblade"] = "戴文‧桑布雷德"
L["Old Light"] = "古老之光"
L["Something at the far end of the dig is worth carrying out, if you can get to it. Prospector Whelgar's excavation site in the Wetlands is close by, and the prospector will want a close look at whatever you bring."] = "挖掘場盡頭有樣東西值得帶出來，前提是你到得了那裡。濕地的勘察員維爾加的挖掘場就在附近，不管你帶回什麼，這位勘察員都會想仔細看看。"
L["Something at the far end of the dig is worth carrying out, if you can get to it. The elders on Thunder Bluff's Elder Rise know old things better than anyone, and will want to see it."] = "挖掘場盡頭有樣東西值得帶出來，前提是你到得了那裡。雷霆崖長者高地上的長者們比誰都懂古老的東西，一定會想看看。"
L["The stone machine at the far end of the dig left a piece of itself behind when it went down. It was made of something I'd never handled and threw light around like a kaleidoscope, so I took it to Whelgar's camp outside. The prospector was impressed I'd lived and wanted a good look at it.\n\nThe marks on it looked like titan work. A find like that belonged in the Hall of Explorers, Whelgar said, with the finder's name written in the museum catalogue. High Explorer Magellas admired the keepers' marks on it and wrote my name down. There's a catalogue in Ironforge with me in it now, right next to a rock."] = "挖掘場盡頭的那臺石頭機器倒下時，留下了自己的一塊碎片。它的材質我從沒摸過，還像萬花筒一樣四處折射光芒，所以我把它帶到了外面維爾加的營地。這位勘察員對我能活著回來很是佩服，想好好看一看它。\n\n上面的紋路看起來像泰坦的手筆。維爾加說，這樣的發現應該送進探險者大廳，發現者的名字也要寫進博物館的目錄。資深探險家麥格拉斯欣賞了上面守護者的印記，記下了我的名字。現在，鐵爐堡有一本目錄裡寫著我，就在一塊石頭旁邊。"
L["The stone machine at the far end of the dig left a shard of itself behind when it went down. It threw light around like a kaleidoscope and felt older than anything I'd ever held, and the people who know about old things live on the Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff.\n\nBashana Runetotem called it fascinating, more than a carving, and sent me on to Muln Earthfury of the Earthen Ring, up on the Skywatcher Plateau. Muln said there were memories in its light, and that it had waited lifetimes to be understood. The Earthen Ring will look after it and study it, and pass on what it has to say once they can hear it."] = "挖掘場盡頭的那臺石頭機器倒下時，留下了自己的一塊碎片。它像萬花筒一樣四處折射光芒，摸起來比我拿過的任何東西都古老，而懂得古老東西的人，都住在雷霆崖的長者高地上。\n\n巴珊娜‧符文圖騰說它很迷人，不只是一件雕刻，然後要我去找陶土議會的穆倫‧地怒，就在天空守望者高原上。穆倫說它的光裡有記憶，它已經等了好幾輩子，等著被人理解。陶土議會會照看它、研究它，等他們聽得懂了，再把它要說的話傳下去。"
L["Lost Relic Carry"] = "肩負失落聖物"
L["Prehistoric Prism"] = "史前稜石"
L["Prospector Whelgar"] = "勘察員維爾加"
L["Elder Knowledge"] = "長者知識"
L["Earthen Echo"] = "土靈迴響"
L["Bashana Runetotem"] = "巴珊娜‧符文圖騰"
L["An Ancient Grudge"] = "遠古的怨恨"
L["Beldin Steelgrill in Kharanos has heard about a campfire on the hills above Gol'Bolar Quarry, high up where it looks down over the whole quarry. It's probably nothing, but Beldin would like someone to go up and see who's sitting by it.\n\nFrom there the trail leads back to Ironforge and down beneath it, past the High Seat to the Hall of Thanes, a part of the city most visitors never see. Take a few friends along for that."] = "卡拉諾斯的貝爾丁‧鋼架聽說，古博拉採掘場上方的山上有一堆營火，位置很高，能俯瞰整個採掘場。八成沒什麼事，不過貝爾丁還是想找個人上去看看，是誰坐在火邊。\n\n從那裡出發，線索會把你帶回鐵爐堡，再往下深入地底，經過至高王座，一直到族長之廳，那是這座城裡大多數訪客從沒見過的地方。去那裡的時候，帶上幾個朋友。"
L["Dun Morogh / Ironforge"] = "丹莫洛 / 鐵爐堡"
L["A Visitor to Dun Morogh"] = "來丹莫洛的訪客"
L["Beldin Steelgrill"] = "貝爾丁‧鋼架"
L["Steelgrill's Depot, Kharanos, Dun Morogh"] = "鋼架補給站，卡拉諾斯，丹莫洛"
L["the Tundrid Hills above Gol'Bolar Quarry, Dun Morogh"] = "古博拉採掘場上方的坦德利丘陵，丹莫洛"
L["Old Ironforge, beneath the High Seat, Ironforge"] = "至高王座下方的舊鐵爐堡，鐵爐堡"
L["the bridge before the Hall of Thanes, Old Ironforge, Ironforge"] = "族長之廳前的橋，舊鐵爐堡，鐵爐堡"
L["Farsen's Watch"] = "法森的遠視能力"
L["Beldin Steelgrill at Steelgrill's Depot in Kharanos has heard about a fire burning on the high ground above Gol'Bolar Quarry, to the east. It's probably a harmless camp, and Beldin would still like someone to climb up and say hello, one way or the other."] = "卡拉諾斯鋼架補給站的貝爾丁‧鋼架聽說，東邊古博拉採掘場上方的高地上燒著一堆火。八成只是個無害的營地，但貝爾丁還是希望有人爬上去打個招呼，不管結果如何。"
L["The camp on the hill above Gol'Bolar Quarry belonged to Earthseer Farsen, a Wildhammer visiting from Aerie Peak, who greeted me like an old friend. Farsen had noticed Dark Irons creeping around Dun Morogh and, instead of explaining, lent me far sight. I floated over the hills for a while looking down at spies and troggs. There were more of them, Farsen said, than you can see from the sky.\n\nSo I went east to Ironband's Compound and dealt with the spies. One carried a map of tunnels that all met under Ironforge, marked in Dark Iron runes I couldn't read. Then the wind spoke to me in a dwarf's voice and said Farsen needed to see it.\n\nI took it back up the hill. The spies had been scouts, according to the earthseer, and the Dark Irons meant to break into the city's vaults. I was told to hurry."] = "古博拉採掘場上方山丘的營地，屬於大地先知法森，一位從鷹巢山來訪的蠻錘矮人，招呼我就像招呼老朋友一樣。法森注意到黑鐵矮人在丹莫洛四處潛行，卻沒有解釋，而是把遠視之力借給了我。我在山丘上空飄了一陣子，俯瞰著底下的間諜和穴居人。法森說，實際的數量比從天上看到的還要多。\n\n於是我往東去了鐵環營地，解決了那些間諜。其中一個帶著一張地道圖，所有地道都在鐵爐堡底下交會，上面標著我看不懂的黑鐵符文。接著，風用一個矮人的聲音對我說，法森需要看看這張圖。\n\n我把它帶回了山上。照大地先知的說法，那些間諜只是斥候，黑鐵矮人打算闖進城裡的寶庫。我被告知要快一點。"
L["Beldin Steelgrill in Kharanos had heard from a mountaineer about a fire up on the hills above Gol'Bolar Quarry. Probably nothing, Beldin said. If the campers were friendly, no harm done, and if they weren't, I'd know how to handle it."] = "卡拉諾斯的貝爾丁‧鋼架聽一個登山客說，古博拉採掘場上方的山上有一堆火。貝爾丁說，八成沒什麼事。要是露營的人友善，那就沒什麼損失；要是不友善，我也知道該怎麼對付。"
L["Earthseer Farsen"] = "大地先知法森"
L["Nip 'Em in the Bud"] = "防患於未然"
L["Underground Map"] = "地底地圖"
L["the Dark Iron Spies, Ironband's Compound, Dun Morogh"] = "黑鐵間諜所在處，鐵環營地，丹莫洛"
L["The Hall of Thanes"] = "族長之廳"
L["Earthseer Farsen is sure the Dark Irons are after Ironforge's vaults, and their map's tunnels meet in the Hall of Thanes, beneath the High Seat. Take friends and get there first. King Magni, an old friend of Farsen's, will want a report."] = "大地先知法森確信黑鐵矮人盯上了鐵爐堡的寶庫，而他們地圖上的地道都在至高王座底下的族長之廳交會。帶上朋友，搶先趕到那裡。麥格尼國王是法森的老朋友，會想聽你的報告。"
L["Off the High Seat, past a lot of cobwebs and a fair bit of lava, is the Hall of Thanes, where Ironforge keeps its old lords. Lorekeeper Afadra Dunwall had work to do down there and no patience for ghosts. Something had woken the dead, and I was to settle them.\n\nMost of them were just angry. One was polite. A ghostly attendant begged me to help Faldrim Anvilmar, the thane, who couldn't rest for an old grudge. Faldrim had no interest in resting. My friends and I insisted.\n\nI brought the Dark Iron commander's head up to King Magni, with the earthseer's regards, along with a tablet I'd found behind a vault door. It was the treaty that ended the War of the Three Hammers. Magni pointed out that the Bronzebeards and the Wildhammers both signed it, and the Dark Irons never did."] = "從至高王座出去，穿過一大堆蜘蛛網和不少岩漿，就是族長之廳，鐵爐堡把它的古代族長都安置在那裡。博學者阿法德菈‧丹沃爾在底下有工作要做，對鬼魂毫無耐心。有什麼東西驚醒了死者，我得讓他們安分下來。\n\n大多數鬼魂只是在發怒。有一個很有禮貌。一位鬼魅侍者懇求我幫幫族長法爾椎‧安威瑪，他因為一樁舊怨無法安息。法爾椎對安息毫無興趣。我和朋友們堅持要他安息。\n\n我把黑鐵指揮官的頭帶上去交給了麥格尼國王，附上大地先知的問候，還有一塊我在一扇寶庫門後面找到的石板。那是結束三錘之戰的條約。麥格尼指出，銅鬚和蠻錘都在上面簽了名，而黑鐵從來沒簽過。"
L["Old Ironforge Incursion"] = "舊鐵爐堡入侵"
L["Afadra Dunwall"] = "阿法德菈‧丹沃爾"
L["Important Heirlooms"] = "重要的傳家寶"
L["Thom Filch"] = "湯姆‧菲爾奇"
L["Thom Filch, a gnome by the bridge, claimed to have been patrolling the vaults when the Dark Irons came up from below in mole machines and left valuables lying about. Important cultural heirlooms, Thom called them, rubbing both hands together, and every one would be catalogued and returned to its proper place. I collected eight. Thom paid as promised, and afterward I found I was better thought of in Gadgetzan, which is a long way from Ironforge."] = "湯姆‧菲爾奇是橋邊的一個地精，聲稱黑鐵矮人坐著鑽地機從地底冒出來的時候，自己正在寶庫巡邏，結果他們把貴重物品丟得到處都是。湯姆管這些叫重要的文化遺產，一邊說一邊搓著兩隻手，還說每一件都會登記造冊，物歸原處。我收集了八件。湯姆照約定付了錢，後來我發現自己在加基森的名聲變好了，那地方離鐵爐堡可遠著呢。"
L["Ghostly Attendant"] = "鬼魅侍者"
L["the Hall of Thanes, Ironforge"] = "族長之廳（鐵爐堡）"
L["The Treaty of Understanding"] = "諒解條約"
L["the Reliquary of Kings, the Hall of Thanes"] = "諸王聖物室（族長之廳）"
L["Blackfathom Villainy"] = "黑澗深淵中的惡魔"
L["On Ashenvale's Zoram Strand, the ruins of an old night elf temple run down under the sea. The naga have moved into its flooded halls, and the rumors say they aren't alone down there.\n\nThe Argent Dawn wants to know what is going on in Blackfathom Deeps, and so does the Earthen Ring. Both could use someone willing to go in and look."] = "在梣谷的左拉姆海岸，一座古老的夜精靈神殿廢墟一路延伸到海底。納迦已經搬進了它被淹沒的大廳，而傳聞說，底下不只有他們。\n\n銀色黎明想知道黑澗深淵裡發生了什麼事，陶土議會也一樣。雙方都需要一個願意進去看看的人。"
L["Rumors have reached Darnassus that the naga in Blackfathom Deeps, a drowned temple on the coast of Ashenvale, have joined forces with the Twilight's Hammer. The Argent Dawn sent a scout to look into it weeks ago and is still waiting for a report.\n\nStart with Dawnwatcher Shaedlass, at the Argent Dawn's embassy in Darnassus. Ironforge and Auberdine each have an errand down there as well."] = "有傳聞傳到了達納蘇斯，說黑澗深淵裡的納迦已經和暮光之錘聯手，那是梣谷海岸邊一座被淹沒的神殿。銀色黎明幾週前就派了一名斥候去調查，到現在還在等報告。\n\n先去達納蘇斯的銀色黎明大使館找哨兵沙德拉斯。鐵爐堡和奧伯丁也各有一件差事要在那底下辦。"
L["At Zoram'gar Outpost, on the coast of Ashenvale, Je'neu Sancrea of the Earthen Ring needs help. A little way up the strand lies Blackfathom Deeps, a drowned temple full of naga, and the naga have been prying crystals out of its walls. Je'neu would like to know why.\n\nTsunaman, at Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains, can send you on your way."] = "在梣谷海岸的左拉姆加前哨站，陶土議會的耶努薩克雷需要幫助。沿著海岸往前走不遠，就是黑澗深淵，一座滿是納迦的被淹沒的神殿，而那些納迦一直在從牆上撬水晶。耶努想知道這是為什麼。\n\n石爪山脈烈日石居的圖納曼可以送你上路。"
L["Ashenvale / Darnassus / Stonetalon Mountains / Thunder Bluff / Blackfathom Deeps"] = "梣谷 / 達納蘇斯 / 石爪山脈 / 雷霆崖 / 黑澗深淵"
L["Blackfathom Deeps"] = "黑澗深淵"
L["Trouble in the Deeps"] = "幫助耶努薩克雷"
L["Tsunaman"] = "圖納曼"
L["Sun Rock Retreat, Stonetalon Mountains"] = "烈日石居（石爪山脈）"
L["Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale"] = "左拉姆加前哨站（梣谷）"
L["the Argent Dawn's embassy, Craftsmen's Terrace, Darnassus"] = "銀色黎明大使館，工匠區，達納蘇斯"
L["inside Blackfathom Deeps, Zoram Strand, Ashenvale"] = "黑澗深淵內部，左拉姆海岸，梣谷"
L["Tsunaman, at Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains, has word that Je'neu Sancrea of the Earthen Ring needs help. Je'neu is at Zoram'gar Outpost, far off on the western shore of Ashenvale, where the Horde isn't especially welcome."] = "石爪山脈烈日石居的圖納曼得到消息，陶土議會的耶努薩克雷需要幫助。耶努在左拉姆加前哨站，遠在梣谷的西岸，那裡的人可不怎麼歡迎部落。"
L["Tsunaman, up at Sun Rock Retreat, had word that Je'neu Sancrea of the Earthen Ring needed help on the coast of Ashenvale, and gave me directions to match. Through Windshear Crag or north through the Barrens, then west across the forest until it runs out at the sea. I was also told to be careful, which for the Horde in Ashenvale goes without saying.\n\nZoram'gar Outpost is a small camp on the Zoram Strand. Je'neu was there and pleased that Tsunaman had sent help. We had matters to discuss, he said, and most of them were up the beach in Blackfathom Deeps."] = "烈日石居的圖納曼得到消息，陶土議會的耶努薩克雷在梣谷海岸需要幫助，指給我的路也跟這件事一樣遠。穿過風剪峭壁，或者往北穿過貧瘠之地，然後向西橫越森林，一直走到森林在海邊到了盡頭為止。圖納曼還叮嚀我要小心，對身在梣谷的部落來說，這話根本不用說。\n\n左拉姆加前哨站是左拉姆海岸上的一座小營地。耶努就在那裡，很高興圖納曼派了幫手來。他說我們有些事要談，大部分都在海灘那頭的黑澗深淵裡。"
L["Dawnwatcher Shaedlass, at the Argent Dawn's embassy in Darnassus, sent a scout to Blackfathom Deeps weeks ago and is still waiting for a report. Argent Guard Manados, at the same embassy, wants the Twilight's Hammer down there paid a visit."] = "達納蘇斯銀色黎明大使館的哨兵沙德拉斯幾週前派了一名斥候去黑澗深淵，到現在還在等報告。同一座大使館裡的銀月守衛瑪納杜斯，希望有人去底下拜訪一下暮光之錘。"
L["Je'neu Sancrea, at Zoram'gar Outpost, has heard that the naga of Blackfathom Deeps are prying sapphires off the walls of its first tunnels, and would rather they stopped. The Deeps lie a short way north along the Zoram Strand."] = "左拉姆加前哨站的耶努薩克雷聽說，黑澗深淵的納迦正在從入口那幾條隧道的牆上撬藍寶石，希望他們住手。黑澗深淵就在沿著左拉姆海岸往北不遠的地方。"
L["The Argent Dawn keeps an embassy in Darnassus, and one of its Dawnwatchers, Shaedlass, had mislaid a scout. Thaelrid had gone to Blackfathom Deeps weeks before to look into the naga and the Twilight's Hammer and hadn't reported back. A guard standing nearby asked me to bring back some cultists' pendants while I was at it.\n\nI found Thaelrid far inside, alive and out of strength. The place had been a temple of Elune, Thaelrid said, until the corruption of an Old God seeped up into its moonwell and the Old God's servant rose out of the water. Now the cult and the naga held it together, and the cult's leader, Kelris, was sacrificing innocents to that servant for power.\n\nI took the head of Kelris back to Darnassus. The Argent Dawn had long since put him down as dead or missing, and I'd made half of that true."] = "銀色黎明在達納蘇斯設有一座大使館，那裡有位哨兵叫沙德拉斯，把一名斥候給弄丟了。塞爾瑞德幾週前去黑澗深淵調查納迦和暮光之錘，一直沒回來報告。旁邊站著的一名守衛請我順便帶些教徒的墜飾回來。\n\n我在深處找到了塞爾瑞德，還活著，但已經筋疲力盡。塞爾瑞德說，這裡曾是伊露恩的神殿，直到一位上古之神的腐化滲進了月井，那位上古之神的僕從從水中升起。如今暮光教派和納迦一起盤踞在這裡，教派的首領克爾里斯正把無辜的人獻祭給那個僕從，換取力量。\n\n我把克爾里斯的頭顱帶回了達納蘇斯。銀色黎明早就把他記為死亡或失蹤了，我讓其中一半成了真。"
L["Je'neu Sancrea started me off just inside the Deeps, where the naga had been prying sapphires off the cave walls. I pried them off first. Je'neu could feel water spirits clinging to them, and wanted a fathom core from the flooded ruins too.\n\nIn the Deeps I also came by a damp note in very poor handwriting. All the priestesses were to bring the crystals to whoever wrote it, and with their power, one day, the world would return to the rule of the Old Gods. The note gave Je'neu a name to go with the trouble, Lorgus Jett of the Twilight's Hammer. I found Lorgus in the Deeps, and that was the end of that plan.\n\nFurther in, an Argent Dawn guard who could barely stand asked me to take the head of the cult's leader, Kelris, to Thunder Bluff. I did, and the tauren there were thoroughly disgusted with him."] = "耶努薩克雷要我先從黑澗深淵的入口附近下手，那裡的納迦一直在從洞壁上撬藍寶石。我搶在他們前頭撬了下來。耶努感覺得到水之靈附著在上面，還想要被淹沒的廢墟裡的一顆深淵之核。\n\n在深淵裡，我還撿到一張潮濕的便箋，字跡潦草得厲害。所有女祭司都要把水晶交給寫這張便箋的人，憑著水晶的力量，總有一天，世界將回歸上古之神的統治。這張便箋讓耶努替這樁麻煩對上了一個名字，暮光之錘的洛古斯‧傑特。我在深淵裡找到了洛古斯，那個計畫也就到此為止了。\n\n再往裡走，一名幾乎站不起來的銀色黎明守衛請我把教派首領克爾里斯的頭顱送到雷霆崖。我送去了，那裡的牛頭人對他厭惡透頂。"
L["In Search of Thaelrid"] = "尋找塞爾瑞德"
L["Dawnwatcher Shaedlass"] = "哨兵沙德拉斯"
L["Argent Guard Thaelrid"] = "銀月守衛塞爾瑞德"
L["Twilight Falls"] = "暮光之錘的末日"
L["Argent Guard Manados"] = "銀月守衛瑪納杜斯"
L["Knowledge in the Deeps"] = "深淵中的知識"
L["Gerrig Bonegrip, down in the Forlorn Cavern in Ironforge, collects lore. Old lore, the sort that opens doorways and can wake Those Who Sleep. Gerrig had heard the Lorgalis Manuscript was lying at the bottom of Blackfathom Deeps and promised not to forget me for it, not even after the end days. I brought it up. Gerrig was overjoyed and is having copies made for all the brothers and sisters, whoever they are."] = "鐵爐堡荒棄的洞穴裡的葛利‧硬骨收集學識。古老的學識，那種能打開門戶、能喚醒沉睡者的東西。葛利聽說洛迦里斯手稿就躺在黑澗深淵的最底層，答應我絕不會忘了這份功勞，就算到了末日也不會。我把它帶了上來。葛利欣喜若狂，正在替所有的兄弟姊妹抄寫副本，不管他們是誰。"
L["Researching the Corruption"] = "研究墮落"
L["Gershala Nightwhisper"] = "戈沙拉‧夜語"
L["Gershala Nightwhisper, in Auberdine, is worried about the blood elves and their demon magic, and wanted to know what the same sort of thing had already done to the naga and the satyrs. Blackfathom Deeps has plenty of both, so I came back with eight corrupted brain stems. Gershala thanked me for my selflessness and got straight to work. I left before the work got interesting."] = "奧伯丁的戈沙拉‧夜語很擔心血精靈和他們的惡魔魔法，想知道同樣的東西已經對納迦和薩特造成了什麼影響。黑澗深淵裡這兩種都多得是，所以我帶回來八塊墮落者的腦幹。戈沙拉感謝我的無私，馬上動手忙了起來。在工作變得有意思之前，我就走了。"
L["The Heart of the Void"] = "虛空之心"
L["Blackfathom Pearl"] = "黑澗深淵珍珠"
L["the depths of Blackfathom Deeps, Ashenvale"] = "黑澗深淵深處，梣谷"
L["Past Kelris, at the far end of the Deeps, waited Aku'mai, the servant of the Old Gods. When it died it left a pearl behind, and Dawnwatcher Selgorm in Darnassus called the kill the stuff of real heroes. The pearl went off to be studied at once, for whatever it could tell about the Void."] = "越過克爾里斯，在深淵的最深處，等著的是上古之神的僕從阿庫麥爾。牠死後留下了一顆珍珠，達納蘇斯的哨兵塞爾高姆說，這一仗是真正英雄的手筆。珍珠立刻被送去研究，看它能透露多少關於虛空的事。"
L["The Essence of Aku'Mai"] = "阿庫麥爾水晶"
L["Je'neu Sancrea"] = "耶努薩克雷"
L["Amongst the Ruins"] = "廢墟之間"
L["Allegiance to the Old Gods"] = "上古之神的僕從"
L["Damp Note"] = "潮濕的便箋"
L["Blackfathom Deeps, Ashenvale"] = "黑澗深淵（梣谷）"
L["Baron Aquanis"] = "阿奎尼斯男爵"
L["Strange Water Globe"] = "奇怪的水球"
L["Baron Aquanis, a water elemental in the Deeps, left a strange globe behind when it fell. Foul water sloshed about inside, and nothing I did would so much as scratch it. Je'neu Sancrea had long suspected the Baron of being corrupted, and said the globe would show by what, and how. I came away with the Earthen Ring's warmest regards and something more useful besides."] = "阿奎尼斯男爵是深淵裡的一個水元素，倒下時留下了一個奇怪的水球。裡面晃蕩著汙濁的水，我怎麼弄都沒辦法在上面留下一道刮痕。耶努薩克雷早就懷疑男爵受了腐化，說這個水球能顯示出它是被什麼腐化的，又是怎麼腐化的。我帶走了陶土議會最熱情的問候，還有一些更實用的東西。"
L["Past Kelris, at the far end of the Deeps, waited Aku'mai, the servant of the Old Gods. It left a pearl behind when it died, and Bashana Runetotem in Thunder Bluff called that a mighty service to all of Kalimdor. The pearl was to be studied at once, for what it might say about the Void, and I was sent off to walk with the Earth Mother."] = "越過克爾里斯，在深淵的最深處，等著的是上古之神的僕從阿庫麥爾。牠死後留下了一顆珍珠，雷霆崖的巴珊娜‧符文圖騰說，這是對整個卡林多的莫大貢獻。珍珠要立刻拿去研究，看它能透露些什麼關於虛空的事，而我在一句「願大地之母與你同行」中被打發上了路。"
L["The Mad King"] = "瘋王"
L["Gnomeregan, the gnomes' city under Dun Morogh, was lost to a trogg invasion and a radiation leak, and its people fled to Tinker Town in Ironforge. The machines they left behind are still running down there.\n\nThe exiles want a cure, and their belongings back. In Orgrimmar, the goblins have heard about a new gnomish rig and want its blueprints. Either errand takes you all the way to the bottom of the city."] = "諾姆瑞根是地精們在丹莫洛地底的城市，因為穴居人入侵和輻射外洩而淪陷，城裡的居民逃到了鐵爐堡的地精區。他們留下的機器至今仍在底下運轉。\n\n流亡者們想要解藥，也想拿回自己的東西。在奧格瑪，哥布林們聽說了一種新型的地精鑽探設備，想弄到它的藍圖。不管接哪件差事，都得一路下到城市的最底層。"
L["Gnomeregan, the gnomes' city under Dun Morogh, was lost to troggs and a radiation leak, and its people now live as exiles in Tinker Town, in Ironforge. Gnoarn, one of them, lost a splendid head of hair in the leak and wants the city back.\n\nStart with Gnoarn, and follow the exiles' requests down into Gnomeregan, where High Tinker Mekkatorque has business of his own."] = "諾姆瑞根是地精們在丹莫洛地底的城市，因為穴居人和輻射外洩而淪陷，城裡的居民如今流亡在鐵爐堡的地精區。其中一位叫諾恩，在外洩中失去了一頭漂亮的頭髮，想要奪回城市。\n\n先去找諾恩，然後順著流亡者們的請求深入諾姆瑞根，大工匠梅卡托克在那裡也有自己的事要辦。"
L["Two years ago, gnome engineering was mostly good for a punch line. Now the gnomes have built a rig better than any goblin shredder, and Nogg, in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, wants the blueprints.\n\nThe blueprints are in Gnomeregan, under the mountains of Dun Morogh, a long way from home. Sovik, beside Nogg, knows a faster way in than walking."] = "兩年前，地精的工程學基本上只配當笑柄。如今地精造出了一種比任何哥布林伐木機都好的鑽探設備，而奧格瑪榮譽谷的諾格想要它的藍圖。\n\n藍圖在諾姆瑞根，在丹莫洛的群山底下，離家很遠。諾格身邊的索維克知道一條比走路快的路。"
L["Ironforge / Dun Morogh / Orgrimmar / Stranglethorn Vale / Gnomeregan"] = "鐵爐堡 / 丹莫洛 / 奧格瑪 / 荊棘谷 / 諾姆瑞根"
L["The Day After"] = "災難之後"
L["Gnoarn"] = "諾恩"
L["Tinker Town, Ironforge"] = "地精區（鐵爐堡）"
L["the Cathedral of Light, Stormwind"] = "光明大教堂（暴風城）"
L["Darnassus"] = "達納蘇斯"
L["Windshear Crag, Stonetalon Mountains"] = "風剪峭壁（石爪山脈）"
L["the Valley of Honor, Orgrimmar"] = "榮譽谷（奧格瑪）"
L["Gnoarn, in Tinker Town in Ironforge, lost a magnificent head of hair to the radiation leak in Gnomeregan and blames the troggs for all of it. He thinks the city can still be saved, and Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos is working on how."] = "鐵爐堡地精區的諾恩在諾姆瑞根的輻射外洩中失去了一頭漂亮的頭髮，並把這一切都怪到穴居人頭上。他認為這座城市還有救，而卡拉諾斯的奧齊‧電環正在研究要怎麼救。"
L["There's a gnome in Tinker Town called Gnoarn, bald as an egg, who will tell you that before the radiation leak in Gnomeregan he had the only gnomefro in all of Azeroth. Then he shakes his fist and curses the troggs.\n\nHe sent me to Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos, who stood right beside him when the bolt hit and remembers the hair coming out in clumps. Ozzie and a partner called Razzle were close to some kind of cure, or else the recipe for a very strong rum, and couldn't say which until they'd tested it.\n\nThe test needed fallout off the irradiated troggs around Gnomeregan, so I filled a leaden phial with the green glow. Ozzie had a captured leper gnome lined up to be cured, and was expecting a full head of hair on the side. I was told to stand back, and I stood well back."] = "地精區有個叫諾恩的地精，禿得像顆雞蛋，他會告訴你，在諾姆瑞根輻射外洩之前，他頂著全艾澤拉斯獨一無二的地精爆炸頭。說完他就揮著拳頭詛咒穴居人。\n\n他要我去找卡拉諾斯的奧齊‧電環，那道輻射擊中時，奧齊就站在他旁邊，還記得他的頭髮一撮一撮往下掉。奧齊和一個叫拉佐的搭檔已經快研究出某種解藥了，要不然就是一種勁道很強的蘭姆酒配方，不試一下他們也說不準是哪一個。\n\n試驗需要諾姆瑞根周圍那些受輻射的穴居人身上的放射塵，所以我往一個鉛瓶裡灌滿了那種綠光。奧齊已經抓來一個麻瘋地精，準備拿來治病，順便還指望能長出一頭濃密的頭髮。我被告知站遠一點，我站得遠遠的。"
L["Gnogaine"] = "諾恩"
L["Ozzie Togglevolt"] = "奧齊‧電環"
L["The Transpolyporter"] = "多極傳送器"
L["Gnomes have built a rig better than any goblin shredder, and Nogg, in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, wants the blueprints out of Gnomeregan. Gnomeregan is a long walk through dwarf country. Sovik, beside Nogg, has a quicker way to send you."] = "地精造出了一種比任何哥布林伐木機都好的鑽探設備，而奧格瑪榮譽谷的諾格想從諾姆瑞根弄出它的藍圖。去諾姆瑞根得穿過矮人的地盤走很遠的路。諾格身邊的索維克有更快的辦法把你送過去。"
L["Nogg was sore about gnomes. Two years ago their engineering was mostly good for a punch line, and now they'd built a rig better than every goblin shredder. Nogg wanted the blueprints, which were locked in a safe deep in Gnomeregan, and only the mekgineer sitting beside it knew the combination.\n\nSovik, next to Nogg, had the travel sorted. Sovik and a partner in Booty Bay had built the Transpolyporter 6000 for the trip.\n\nThe partner was Scooty, who showed the machine off like a new boat and said it had only exploded a dozen or so times. If it went up with me on it, I was promised, it would be quick and painless. Scooty tuned a goblin transponder to my size and weight and mentioned a few side effects, none of them permanent anymore. After that, all I had to do was step on the pad."] = "諾格一提起地精就來氣。兩年前，他們的工程學基本上只配當笑柄，現在他們卻造出了一種比所有哥布林伐木機都好的鑽探設備。諾格想要那份藍圖，藍圖鎖在諾姆瑞根深處的一個保險箱裡，只有坐在旁邊的那位機電師知道密碼。\n\n諾格旁邊的索維克已經把路線安排好了。索維克和藏寶海灣的一個搭檔為這趟旅程造了一臺多極傳送器6000型。\n\n那個搭檔就是斯庫提，炫耀這臺機器就像炫耀一艘新船，說它總共才爆炸過十來次。我得到保證，要是它連我一起炸了，過程會又快又不痛。斯庫提照我的身高體重調好了一臺哥布林傳送器，還提了幾種副作用，說現在已經沒有一種是永久性的了。之後，我只需要踩上傳送臺就行了。"
L["Rig Wars"] = "設備之戰"
L["Nogg"] = "諾格"
L["Chief Engineer Scooty"] = "主工程師斯庫提"
L["Sovik"] = "索維克"
L["Gnomer-gooooone!"] = "出發！諾姆瑞根！"
L["Scooty"] = "斯庫提"
L["The King of Nothing"] = "一無所有的國王"
L["Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos isn't finished with Gnomeregan's fallout, and the exiles in Tinker Town have a long list of things left behind in the city. High Tinker Mekkatorque, in Tinker Town, has a harder job, at the very bottom of it."] = "卡拉諾斯的奧齊‧電環還沒跟諾姆瑞根的放射塵打完交道，地精區的流亡者們也列了一長串落在城裡的東西。地精區的大工匠梅卡托克手上的工作更難，就在城市的最底層。"
L["Nogg's blueprints are in a safe at the bottom of Gnomeregan, and the only one with the combination is the mekgineer who sits beside it. Between you and the safe lies a whole city of troggs and machines that never got switched off."] = "諾格要的藍圖在諾姆瑞根最底層的一個保險箱裡，唯一知道密碼的，是坐在保險箱旁邊的那位機電師。在你和保險箱之間，隔著一整座滿是穴居人和從沒關掉過的機器的城市。"
L["Ozzie's verdict on my first phial was that there wasn't enough in it and what there was had gone impure. The troggs weren't glowing hard enough. I was to get it straight from the tap, off the slimes and horrors deep in Gnomeregan, and that stuff falls apart if you look at it wrong. It took more than one try to bottle. Ozzie looked me over afterwards, impressed that I still had all my limbs.\n\nHigh Tinker Mekkatorque had trusted Mekgineer Thermaplugg, and Thermaplugg had betrayed him and every gnome with him and taken the city. King of nothing, the High Tinker called him. The job was to kill him.\n\nI went all the way down and did it. Mekkatorque likes to think the last thing through Thermaplugg's head was my foot, and I've seen no reason to correct that."] = "奧齊對我第一瓶東西的評價是量不夠，剩下的那點也已經不純了。那些穴居人發的光還不夠亮。我得直接從源頭取貨，從諾姆瑞根深處的軟泥怪和恐魔身上弄，而那玩意兒你多看它一眼都會分解。我試了不只一次才裝進瓶子。事後奧齊把我上下打量了一遍，對我四肢健全頗為佩服。\n\n大工匠梅卡托克曾經信任機電師瑟瑪普拉格，而瑟瑪普拉格背叛了大工匠，背叛了跟著大工匠的每一個地精，奪走了這座城市。大工匠管他叫「一無所有的國王」。任務是殺了他。\n\n我一路下到最底層，解決了他。梅卡托克喜歡認為，瑟瑪普拉格腦子裡閃過的最後一樣東西是我的腳，我也找不到什麼理由去糾正這個說法。"
L["The gnomes are gone from Gnomeregan, but their machines kept running, and getting through the place took a while.\n\nThe mekgineer with Nogg's combination was Thermaplugg, at the very bottom, and he wasn't taking callers. I took the combination off him the hard way and opened the safe beside him. The rig blueprints were inside.\n\nNogg had known all along I could do it, and wanted me to know that Sovik had had doubts. Then Nogg cleared his throat and got to the point. Every gnomish innovation in that rig would be pulled apart and studied until it was a goblin innovation, and the next shredders would carry the lot."] = "地精們已經離開了諾姆瑞根，可是他們的機器還在運轉，穿過那地方花了好一陣子。\n\n知道諾格要的密碼的機電師就是瑟瑪普拉格，待在最底層，不見客。我用硬手段從他身上拿到了密碼，打開了他旁邊的保險箱。鑽探設備的藍圖就在裡面。\n\n諾格說早就知道我辦得到，還特地讓我知道，索維克曾經有過懷疑。然後諾格清了清喉嚨，說到了正題。那臺設備裡的每一項地精創新，都會被拆開來研究，直到變成哥布林的創新，下一批伐木機會把這些全都裝上。"
L["Ozzie's verdict on my first phial was that there wasn't enough in it and what there was had gone impure. The troggs weren't glowing hard enough. I was to get it straight from the tap, off the slimes and horrors deep in Gnomeregan, and that stuff falls apart if you look at it wrong. It took more than one try to bottle. Ozzie looked me over afterwards, impressed that I still had all my limbs.\n\nHigh Tinker Mekkatorque had trusted Mekgineer Thermaplugg, and Thermaplugg had betrayed him and every gnome with him and taken the city. King of nothing, the High Tinker called him. The job was to kill him.\n\nI went all the way down and did it, and brought his engineering notes back for the High Tinker. Mekkatorque likes to think the last thing through Thermaplugg's head was my foot, and I've seen no reason to correct that."] = "奧齊對我第一瓶東西的評價是量不夠，剩下的那點也已經不純了。那些穴居人發的光還不夠亮。我得直接從源頭取貨，從諾姆瑞根深處的軟泥怪和恐魔身上弄，而那玩意兒你多看它一眼都會分解。我試了不只一次才裝進瓶子。事後奧齊把我上下打量了一遍，對我四肢健全頗為佩服。\n\n大工匠梅卡托克曾經信任機電師瑟瑪普拉格，而瑟瑪普拉格背叛了大工匠，背叛了跟著大工匠的每一個地精，奪走了這座城市。大工匠管他叫「一無所有的國王」。任務是殺了他。\n\n我一路下到最底層，解決了他，還把他的工程學筆記帶回來交給了大工匠。梅卡托克喜歡認為，瑟瑪普拉格腦子裡閃過的最後一樣東西是我的腳，我也找不到什麼理由去糾正這個說法。"
L["The gnomes are gone from Gnomeregan, but their machines kept running, and getting through the place took a while.\n\nThe mekgineer with Nogg's combination was Thermaplugg, at the very bottom, and he wasn't taking callers. I took the combination off him the hard way and opened the safe beside him. The rig blueprints were inside. Thermaplugg's engineering notes came out with me too, and those went to Nogg as well.\n\nNogg had known all along I could do it, and wanted me to know that Sovik had had doubts. Then Nogg cleared his throat and got to the point. Every gnomish innovation in that rig would be pulled apart and studied until it was a goblin innovation, and the next shredders would carry the lot."] = "地精們已經離開了諾姆瑞根，可是他們的機器還在運轉，穿過那地方花了好一陣子。\n\n知道諾格要的密碼的機電師就是瑟瑪普拉格，待在最底層，不見客。我用硬手段從他身上拿到了密碼，打開了他旁邊的保險箱。鑽探設備的藍圖就在裡面。瑟瑪普拉格的工程學筆記也被我一併帶了出來，同樣交給了諾格。\n\n諾格說早就知道我辦得到，還特地讓我知道，索維克曾經有過懷疑。然後諾格清了清喉嚨，說到了正題。那臺設備裡的每一項地精創新，都會被拆開來研究，直到變成哥布林的創新，下一批伐木機會把這些全都裝上。"
L["The Only Cure is More Green Glow"] = "更多的輻射塵！"
L["The Grand Betrayal"] = "大叛徒"
L["High Tinker Mekkatorque"] = "大工匠梅卡托克"
L["Thermaplugg's Engineering Notes"] = "瑟瑪普拉格的工程學筆記"
L["Tinkmaster Overspark"] = "工匠大師歐沃斯巴克"
L["Brother Sarno"] = "薩爾諾修士"
L["Save Techbot's Brain!"] = "拯救尖端機器人！"
L["Tinkmaster Overspark built Techbot to help out around Gnomeregan, and when the city fell a stray spark flipped its positronic brain to negatronic, so every kind habit it had now runs backwards. I brought Overspark its memory core. Overspark told the core not to feel bad, promised to have it fixed, and went looking for the plug to a hydro-jack swivel spanner."] = "工匠大師歐沃斯巴克造了尖端機器人，在諾姆瑞根幫忙打雜，城市淪陷時，一顆亂竄的火花把它的正電子大腦翻成了負電子大腦，於是它所有的好習慣現在都反過來了。我把它的記憶體核心帶給了歐沃斯巴克。歐沃斯巴克叫核心別難過，保證會把它修好，然後就去找液壓旋轉扳手的插頭了。"
L["Klockmort's Essentials"] = "幫助科勞莫特"
L["Mathiel"] = "瑪希爾"
L["Essential Artificials"] = "基礎模組"
L["Klockmort Spannerspan"] = "科勞莫特‧鋼尺"
L["In the rush out of Gnomeregan, the gnomes left behind every last essential artificial, a little part their tinkers and smiths used in nearly everything. Klockmort Spannerspan in Tinker Town needed a dozen for some new experiments, and they were deep in the city, shut up in things called artificial extrapolators. I opened enough of them. Klockmort said my bravery had moved gnomish research forward by a leap and a bound."] = "地精們匆忙逃出諾姆瑞根時，把所有的基礎模組都落下了，那是他們的工匠和鐵匠幾乎每樣東西都要用上的小零件。地精區的科勞莫特‧鋼尺需要十二個來做些新實驗，而它們都在城市深處，關在一種叫模組推演器的東西裡。我打開了夠多的推演器。科勞莫特說，我的勇氣讓地精的研究突飛猛進。"
L["Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators"] = "陀螺式挖掘機"
L["Shoni the Shilent in Stormwind had a whole fleet of gyrodrillmatic excavationators to get to Dun Morogh and nowhere near enough parts. By Shoni's account the robots in Gnomeregan roam about like cattle on an open range, so I went and rounded up two dozen sets of robo-mechanical guts. Shoni was pleased. That was one excavationator fixed, with 398 to go."] = "暴風城的舒尼有一整隊陀螺式挖掘機要運到丹莫洛，零件卻遠遠不夠。照舒尼的說法，諾姆瑞根的機器人就像開闊牧場上的牛群一樣四處遊蕩，所以我去圍捕了二十四副機械內膽。舒尼很高興。這下修好了一臺挖掘機，還剩三百九十八臺。"
L["Castpipe's Task"] = "卡斯派普的任務"
L["Gaxim Rustfizzle"] = "加克希姆‧鏽嘶"
L["Gaxim Rustfizzle in Stonetalon, a proud member of the Enlightened Assembly of Arcanology, Alchemy and Engineering Sciences, sent me to Ironforge to help Master Mechanic Castpipe. Castpipe wasn't in the Assembly, Gaxim conceded, but was smart enough that the job had an eighty-four percent chance of being important. Good odds, by Gaxim's reckoning."] = "石爪山脈的加克希姆‧鏽嘶是秘法、鍊金與工程科學啟蒙協會的一名自豪會員，派我去鐵爐堡幫大機械師卡斯派普的忙。加克希姆承認，卡斯派普不是協會成員，但夠聰明，所以這份差事有百分之八十四的機率很重要。照加克希姆的算法，這機率相當不錯。"
L["Data Rescue"] = "搶救資料"
L["Master Mechanic Castpipe"] = "大機械師卡斯派普"
L["Master Mechanic Castpipe had left a great deal of data behind in Gnomeregan and wanted one piece of it back, on a prismatic punch card from a Matrix Punchograph 3005-D deep in the city. Getting into that terminal meant clearance from the lesser ones, and each of those wanted a punch card the gnomes had also left behind. I worked my way up from white to prismatic. Castpipe called the data immeasurably important and said my service would be long remembered. I couldn't tell you what was on it."] = "大機械師卡斯派普在諾姆瑞根落下了大量資料，想拿回其中一份，存在城市深處一臺矩陣打孔電腦3005-D型的彩色穿孔卡片上。要進那臺終端機，得先拿到低階終端機的權限，而每臺低階終端機都要一張地精們同樣落在城裡的穿孔卡片。我從白色卡片一路換到了彩色卡片。卡斯派普說這些資料重要得無法估量，還說我的貢獻會被長久銘記。至於上面到底是什麼，我也說不上來。"
L["A Fine Mess"] = "一團混亂"
L["Kernobee"] = "克努比"
L["Kernobee woke up among the troggs, where some Dark Iron dwarves had thrown the poor wretch after a beating, and wanted out. I led the way to the Clockwerk Run exit, and from there Kernobee made for Ratchet with word that the Dark Irons had a hand in that super rig. Telling Scooty in Booty Bay was my part. Scooty rewarded me, a touch grudgingly, with gear meant to help against that good-for-nothing backstabber Thermaplugg."] = "克努比在穴居人中間醒了過來，這個可憐的傢伙被幾個黑鐵矮人揍了一頓，丟到了那裡，一心只想出去。我帶路走到發條小徑的出口，克努比從那裡動身前往棘齒城，帶去了黑鐵矮人插手那臺超級鑽探設備的消息。告訴藏寶海灣的斯庫提是我的事。斯庫提給了我獎勵，稍微有點不情願，是一些用來對付那個一無是處、背後捅刀的瑟瑪普拉格的裝備。"
L["Grime-Encrusted Ring"] = "髒兮兮的戒指"
L["One of the Dark Iron dwarves in Gnomeregan was carrying a ring so caked in grime that I couldn't tell what it was made of, though something under there had a gleam. The gnomes holding out in the city have a machine for exactly that, the Sparklematic 5200. I put the ring in and paid. It ground and jerked about so violently I worried for it, then stopped with a cheerful ding and opened to show a small box tied with a red bow. It gift wraps, too."] = "諾姆瑞根的一個黑鐵矮人身上帶著一枚戒指，結滿了汙垢，我連它是什麼材質都看不出來，不過底下有什麼東西在閃光。城裡堅守的地精們正好有一臺專門做這個的機器，超級清潔器5200型。我把戒指放進去，付了錢。機器嘎吱作響，劇烈地抖來抖去，我都替它擔心，然後它開心地「叮」了一聲停下，打開後露出一個繫著紅色蝴蝶結的小盒子。它還會包禮物。"
L["The Sparklematic 5200!"] = "超級清潔器5200型！"
L["The Sparklematic 5200"] = "超級清潔器5200型"
L["the Clean Zone, Gnomeregan"] = "清潔區（諾姆瑞根）"
L["The plaque on the Sparklematic 5200 promises to put the shine back in shine-tastic, for three silver a go. I had a grime-encrusted find of my own from the city, so in it went with the coins. The machine surged to life, and its frame groaned as it lurched from side to side, as if it meant to wander off with my valuables."] = "超級清潔器5200型上的銘牌保證，每次只要三枚銀幣，就能讓閃亮重新閃亮起來。我從城裡也帶出了一件髒兮兮的東西，於是把它和硬幣一起塞了進去。機器猛地啟動，機身左搖右晃，嘎吱作響，好像打算帶著我的貴重物品自己走掉。"
L["Return of the Ring"] = "戒指歸來"
L["Inside the band of the cleaned ring were the seal of Ironforge and the initials TdK, which led me to Talvash del Kissel in the Mystic Ward. He knew it at once. He'd made several like it in a little shop in Gnomeregan before the city went up, and this one might have belonged to someone who never got out. When I said a Dark Iron had been carrying it, Talvash reckoned that put a new layer of conspiracy on the nine already floating about, and that the authorities ought to hear."] = "清洗乾淨的戒指內側刻著鐵爐堡的印記和縮寫TdK，這讓我找到了秘法區的塔瓦斯德‧基瑟爾。他一眼就認了出來。在城市毀滅之前，他在諾姆瑞根的一家小店裡做過好幾枚這樣的戒指，這一枚的主人也許沒能逃出來。我說是一個黑鐵矮人帶著它的，塔瓦斯德認為，這替原本就滿天飛的九層陰謀又添了一層，應該讓當局知道。"
L["Gnome Improvement"] = "地精的手藝"
L["Talvash offered to improve the ring for thirty silver, which became thirty silver plus a silver bar and a moss agate, since his own stock had dried up. I brought them. He added a silver and agate lattice and swore he'd normally charge ten times as much. One day, once he's out of the hole he's unjustly in, he means to make the finest trinkets in Azeroth for everyone."] = "塔瓦斯德提出花三十銀幣幫我改良這枚戒指，後來變成了三十銀幣外加一塊銀錠和一塊綠瑪瑙，因為他自己的存貨已經用光了。我把東西帶了過去。他加了一道銀和瑪瑙的格紋，發誓說平常要收十倍的價錢。他打算總有一天，等他從這個被冤枉陷進去的困境裡爬出來，替所有人打造全艾澤拉斯最好的飾品。"
L["Inside the band of the cleaned ring were the seal of Orgrimmar and three letters still legible, NOG. I knew a Nogg in the Valley of Honor. It wasn't Nogg's ring, as it happened, but the Dark Iron part interested Nogg a great deal. Maybe, Nogg reckoned, the gnomes had stolen the Dark Irons' crazy golem plans to build that rig, and the Dark Irons would be wanting payback."] = "清洗乾淨的戒指內側刻著奧格瑪的印記，還有三個依稀可辨的字母，NOG。我認識榮譽谷的一個諾格。結果那並不是諾格的戒指，不過諾格對黑鐵矮人那部分非常感興趣。諾格琢磨著，也許地精是偷了黑鐵矮人那些瘋狂的傀儡設計圖，才造出了那臺鑽探設備，而黑鐵矮人會想要報復。"
L["Nogg's Ring Redo"] = "諾格的手藝"
L["For the tip about the Dark Irons, Nogg offered to improve the ring, which was probably the simple work of some gnome. I brought the silver bar and moss agate Nogg asked for, plus thirty silver for the trouble, and got the ring back with a silver and agate lattice and more magic in it than before. Nogg reckoned the Dark Irons were a fair lead on how the gnomes had suddenly come down with goblin-like inspiration."] = "作為黑鐵矮人那條消息的回報，諾格提出要改良這枚戒指，反正那八成只是哪個地精的簡單手藝。我帶來了諾格要的銀錠和綠瑪瑙，外加三十銀幣辛苦費，拿回來的戒指多了一道銀和瑪瑙的格紋，魔力也比以前更強了。諾格認為，地精怎麼突然有了哥布林式的靈感，黑鐵矮人是條不錯的線索。"
L["Hidden Enemies"] = "隱藏的敵人"
L["Thrall will not tolerate traitors in Orgrimmar, and he is sure there are some. The Burning Blade, an old demon-worshipping cult of the orcs, still keeps a cave in Durotar, and the Warchief suspects its reach goes much further into his city.\n\nHis own agents would be recognized, so he wants a new face for the work. Start in Grommash Hold, and follow the trail out to Skull Rock and down beneath the city into Ragefire Chasm."] = "索爾絕不容忍奧格瑪裡有叛徒，而他確信城裡就有。燃刃氏族是獸人一個崇拜惡魔的古老教派，至今仍在杜洛塔占著一個山洞，大酋長懷疑它的勢力早已深入他的城市。\n\n他自己的手下會被認出來，所以他需要一張新面孔來辦這件事。從葛羅瑪許堡開始，順著線索去骷髏石，再下到城市底下的怒焰裂谷。"
L["Orgrimmar / Durotar / Thunder Bluff / Undercity / Ragefire Chasm"] = "奧格瑪 / 杜洛塔 / 雷霆崖 / 幽暗城 / 怒焰裂谷"
L["Ragefire Chasm"] = "怒焰裂谷"
L["Skull Rock"] = "骷髏石"
L["Thrall suspects there are traitors in Orgrimmar, and he'd rather not show his hand by sending agents they already know. He wants a new face for the job. Find the Warchief in Grommash Hold, where he has an errand for you at Skull Rock."] = "索爾懷疑奧格瑪裡有叛徒，他不想派對方早就認識的手下去，免得打草驚蛇。他需要一張新面孔來辦這件事。到葛羅瑪許堡去找大酋長，他在骷髏石有件差事要交給你。"
L["Thrall knows there are traitors in Orgrimmar, and he wanted a face the cult had never seen. I was young and unknown, which for once counted in my favor.\n\nThe Burning Blade keep a cave at Skull Rock, where one of them carried a small rune that marks a lieutenant. I brought it to Thrall, who said I reminded him of himself when he was younger.\n\nNext the rune went to Neeru Fireblade, a warlock in the Cleft of Shadow. Thrall knows Neeru leads the cult and leaves him in place on purpose. Neeru welcomed me in, his ranks growing too fast for him to remember faces, and called Thrall a fool. He sends Thrall's people into the chasm under the city against the Searing Blade, he said, which kills off Thrall's followers and tests the cultists. Two of the Searing Blade's leaders were the ones he valued.\n\nThrall wanted every word of it."] = "索爾知道奧格瑪裡有叛徒，他想要一張教派從沒見過的面孔。我年輕，又沒什麼名氣，這一次總算成了優勢。\n\n燃刃氏族在骷髏石占著一個山洞，其中一個人身上帶著一枚小小的符文，那是軍官的標誌。我把它交給索爾，他說我讓他想起了年輕時的自己。\n\n接下來，符文被送到了暗影裂口的術士尼爾魯‧火刃那裡。索爾知道尼爾魯就是教派的首腦，故意讓他留在原位。尼爾魯歡迎我入夥，他的隊伍擴張得太快，他根本記不住誰是誰，他還罵索爾是個蠢貨。他說，他把索爾的人派到城底下的裂谷裡去對付灼刃，這樣既能除掉索爾的追隨者，又能考驗教徒。灼刃的首領裡，有兩個是他看重的。\n\n索爾一個字都不想漏掉。"
L["The Lieutenant's Insignia"] = "軍官的徽章"
L["Neeru's Reaction"] = "尼爾魯的反應"
L["Thrall, in Grommash Hold, wants two leaders of the Searing Blade killed in Ragefire Chasm, under the Cleft of Shadow, without anyone in the Cleft finding out who did it. Rahauro in Thunder Bluff and Varimathras in the Undercity have business in the chasm too."] = "葛羅瑪許堡的索爾要你去怒焰裂谷殺掉灼刃的兩名首領，裂谷就在暗影裂口底下，而且不能讓暗影裂口的任何人發現是誰做的。雷霆崖的拉哈羅和幽暗城的瓦里瑪薩斯在裂谷裡也各有事要辦。"
L["Neeru had let slip which two of the Searing Blade he valued, and Thrall decided they would go first. One was a satyr. The other was Jergosh, and Thrall had to stop and think what Jergosh was. A warlock, he believed. In Ragefire Chasm that narrows it down very little.\n\nThe way into the chasm is in the Cleft of Shadow, a short walk from Neeru's door, and Neeru was not to learn who had done it. So I strolled past his door on my way to kill his two favorites, doing my best impression of a lieutenant on cult business.\n\nBoth died down there. Back in Grommash Hold, Thrall's people had already told him the caverns were in disarray and Neeru was more than agitated. Thrall allowed that he wasn't displeased, and called it a dent in Neeru's armor."] = "尼爾魯說溜了嘴，透露了他看重灼刃的哪兩個人，索爾決定先拿他們開刀。一個是薩特。另一個是耶戈什，索爾得停下來想想耶戈什是什麼。他覺得是個術士。在怒焰裂谷，這幾乎等於沒說。\n\n裂谷的入口就在暗影裂口，離尼爾魯的門口沒幾步路，而且不能讓尼爾魯知道是誰做的。於是我悠哉地從他門口走過，去殺他最寵愛的兩個手下，盡我所能地扮演一個替教派辦事的軍官。\n\n兩個都死在了底下。回到葛羅瑪許堡，索爾的人已經告訴他，洞穴裡亂成了一團，尼爾魯也不只是有點焦躁。索爾承認他並非不滿意，說這是在尼爾魯的鎧甲上砸出了一個凹痕。"
L["Bazzalan and Jergosh"] = "巴札蘭和耶戈什"
L["Slaying the Beast"] = "饑餓者塔拉加曼"
L["Neeru Fireblade"] = "尼爾魯‧火刃"
L["Neeru Fireblade had a job of his own for me in the chasm. The Warchief, he explained, had charged him with rooting out the demonic influence in Orgrimmar, and the Burning Blade was only one of the threats. He kept a straight face the whole time. The Searing Blade answered to a felguard called Taragaman the Hungerer, and Neeru wanted the heart. I brought it, and Neeru promised to tell Thrall of my success himself."] = "尼爾魯‧火刃在裂谷裡也有一份自己的差事要交給我。他解釋說，大酋長責成他剷除奧格瑪的惡魔影響，而燃刃氏族只是威脅之一。他從頭到尾都板著一張臉。灼刃聽命於一個叫饑餓者塔拉加曼的惡魔守衛，尼爾魯想要牠的心臟。我帶回來了，尼爾魯答應會親自向索爾報告我的成功。"
L["Testing an Enemy's Strength"] = "試探敵人"
L["Rahauro"] = "拉哈羅"
L["Rahauro, on Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff, speaks for Magatha Grimtotem. Troggs had been coming up out of the lava tunnels under Orgrimmar, and Magatha, ever benevolent, had sent diplomats to make peace. The troggs killed them. The next envoy was me, and there are sixteen fewer troggs now, half of them shamans. Rahauro said it might be worth finding out someday what the troggs actually want."] = "雷霆崖長者高地上的拉哈羅是瑪加薩‧恐怖圖騰的代言人。穴居人一直從奧格瑪底下的熔岩隧道裡冒出來，向來仁慈的瑪加薩派了外交官去講和。穴居人把他們殺了。下一個使者就是我，現在穴居人少了十六個，其中一半是薩滿。拉哈羅說，也許哪天值得弄清楚，穴居人到底想要什麼。"
L["Searching for the Lost Satchel"] = "尋找背包"
L["Magatha had also lost one of her own in the chasm. Maur Grimtotem had found something peculiar down there while trying to talk to the troggs, and never came back up to show her what. I found what was left of him. Clubs or fists, by the look of it. The troggs hadn't taken a thing he carried, having no interest in property that I could see."] = "瑪加薩還在裂谷裡失去了一個自己人。瑪爾‧恐怖圖騰在底下試著跟穴居人溝通時發現了某樣奇特的東西，卻再也沒能上來給她看看是什麼。我找到了他的遺骸。從樣子看，是被棍棒或拳頭打死的。穴居人沒拿走他身上的任何東西，就我所見，牠們對財物毫無興趣。"
L["Returning the Lost Satchel"] = "歸還背包"
L["Maur Grimtotem"] = "瑪爾‧恐怖圖騰"
L["Maur still had a satchel gripped tight in both arms, as if he'd spent the whole beating protecting it. I got it loose and carried it up to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff. Magatha had left word that whoever found her clansman should be rewarded, and Rahauro saw to it."] = "瑪爾的雙臂仍緊緊抱著一個背包，好像挨打的整個過程中都在護著它。我把它掰了出來，帶到雷霆崖交給拉哈羅。瑪加薩留過話，誰找到她的族人都該得到獎賞，拉哈羅照辦了。"
L["The Power to Destroy..."] = "毀滅之力"
L["Varimathras, in the Undercity's Royal Quarter, explained that the Legion likes to give its followers gifts, and that the Dark Lady feels some of them would be better off in her hands. The Searing Blade had two spellbooks she wished to borrow. Varimathras made the quotation marks around borrow quite audible. I brought back Spells of Shadow and Incantations from the Nether, and the Searing Blade shouldn't expect either one back."] = "幽暗城皇家區的瓦里瑪薩斯解釋說，燃燒軍團喜歡送禮物給追隨者，而黑暗女王覺得，其中有些禮物還是放在她手裡比較好。灼刃有兩本法術書，她想借來用用。瓦里瑪薩斯說「借」這個字的時候，引號簡直聽得見。我帶回了《暗影法術研究》和《扭曲虛空的魔法》，灼刃就別指望哪一本還能回去了。"
L["Word from Ragefire Chasm has reached the Cleft of Shadow, and Neeru Fireblade is said to be in a foul temper. Thrall, in Grommash Hold, sees a chance to put you closer to Neeru while the warlock is rattled."] = "怒焰裂谷的消息已經傳到了暗影裂口，據說尼爾魯‧火刃正大發雷霆。葛羅瑪許堡的索爾看到了一個機會，可以趁這位術士心神不寧時，讓你離他更近一步。"
L["Thrall wanted me closer to Neeru while Neeru was rattled. With two of his leaders dead he might be short of help, and Thrall hoped he'd ask me for some. I was to go back to the Cleft and not be too obvious about it.\n\nNeeru snapped at me before he saw who it was, then apologized. His anger, he said, rivaled a rabid kodo bull's. Some of Thrall's do-gooders had caught his leaders unaware, and he blamed himself for sending travelers down there at all. I kept my face very still.\n\nThen he named me one of his lieutenants. The chasm was mostly a loss now, but his agents in the Barrens and Ashenvale would start on something new. Thrall hadn't heard of the Shadow Council in Ashenvale and put his spies on it.\n\nBoth of them said they'd call on me soon. I'm hoping they don't pick the same day."] = "索爾想趁尼爾魯心神不寧的時候，讓我離他更近一些。兩個首領死了，他可能缺人手，索爾希望他會找我幫忙。我要回暗影裂口去，別表現得太明顯。\n\n尼爾魯沒看清是誰就衝著我發火，然後又道了歉。他說，他的怒火堪比一頭發瘋的科多公牛。索爾手下的幾個好事之徒打了他的首領們一個措手不及，他怪自己當初根本就不該派旅行者下去。我把臉繃得紋絲不動。\n\n接著他任命我為他的軍官之一。裂谷現在大致算是丟了，但他在貧瘠之地和梣谷的手下會著手一件新的事。索爾沒聽說過梣谷的暗影議會，便派了他的密探去盯著。\n\n兩個人都說很快會再找我。但願他們別挑同一天。"
L["Return to Neeru"] = "回去找尼爾魯"
L["Report to Thrall"] = "向索爾覆命"
L["Thorns of the Razorfen"] = "剃刀荊棘"
L["In the far south of the Barrens, the quilboar of the Razorfen live in warrens of giant thorns. In Razorfen Kraul their crone, Charlga Razorflank, is raising an army, and she has made enemies a long way from the Barrens.\n\nStart in the Kraul. When it's done with, follow the thorns further south to Razorfen Downs, where the quilboar have been keeping strange company."] = "在貧瘠之地的最南端，剃刀部族的野豬人住在巨型荊棘叢構成的地穴裡。在剃刀沼澤，牠們的老太婆卡爾加‧刺肋正在召集一支軍隊，她在離貧瘠之地很遠的地方也樹立了不少敵人。\n\n先去剃刀沼澤。辦完那邊的事，再順著荊棘往南走，去剃刀高地，那裡的野豬人一直在跟一些奇怪的傢伙打交道。"
L["In the far south of the Barrens, the quilboar of the Razorfen live in warrens of giant thorns, and in Razorfen Kraul their crone, Charlga Razorflank, is raising an army. Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet has a job in there, and you'll find other reasons once you're inside.\n\nWhen the Kraul is done with, follow the thorns further south to Razorfen Downs, where the quilboar have been keeping strange company."] = "在貧瘠之地的最南端，剃刀部族的野豬人住在巨型荊棘叢構成的地穴裡，在剃刀沼澤，牠們的老太婆卡爾加‧刺肋正在召集一支軍隊。棘齒城的麥伯克‧米希瑞克斯在那裡面有份差事，進去之後，你還會找到別的理由。\n\n辦完剃刀沼澤的事，再順著荊棘往南走，去剃刀高地，那裡的野豬人一直在跟一些奇怪的傢伙打交道。"
L["In the far south of the Barrens, the quilboar of the Razorfen live in warrens of giant thorns, and in Razorfen Kraul their crone, Charlga Razorflank, is raising an army. Auld Stonespire, in Thunder Bluff, would like her heart.\n\nWhen the Kraul is done with, follow the thorns further south to Razorfen Downs, where the quilboar have been keeping strange company."] = "在貧瘠之地的最南端，剃刀部族的野豬人住在巨型荊棘叢構成的地穴裡，在剃刀沼澤，牠們的老太婆卡爾加‧刺肋正在召集一支軍隊。雷霆崖的奧爾德‧石塔想要她的心臟。\n\n辦完剃刀沼澤的事，再順著荊棘往南走，去剃刀高地，那裡的野豬人一直在跟一些奇怪的傢伙打交道。"
L["The Barrens / Feralas / Thunder Bluff / Undercity / Stormwind / Razorfen Kraul / Razorfen Downs"] = "貧瘠之地 / 菲拉斯 / 雷霆崖 / 幽暗城 / 暴風城 / 剃刀沼澤 / 剃刀高地"
L["Razorfen Kraul"] = "剃刀沼澤"
L["Blueleaf Tubers"] = "藍葉薯"
L["the Lower Rise, Thunder Bluff"] = "下層高地（雷霆崖）"
L["the Tradesmen's Terrace, Darnassus"] = "貿易區（達納蘇斯）"
L["a hill outside Razorfen Downs, The Barrens"] = "剃刀高地外的山丘，貧瘠之地"
L["the Magic Quarter, Undercity"] = "魔法區（幽暗城）"
L["The Crone of the Kraul"] = "剃刀沼澤的乾癟老太婆"
L["The quilboar of the Razorfen have grown a warren of giant thorns in the southern Barrens, Razorfen Kraul, and they don't welcome visitors. Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet wants some tubers dug up in there all the same, and has a gopher to lend for it."] = "剃刀部族的野豬人在貧瘠之地南部長出了一片巨型荊棘構成的地穴，也就是剃刀沼澤，牠們可不歡迎訪客。儘管如此，棘齒城的麥伯克‧米希瑞克斯還是想從裡面挖些塊莖出來，還有一隻地鼠可以借你用。"
L["Auld Stonespire, on the Lower Rise in Thunder Bluff, remembers when the tauren lived in the southern Barrens, and holds a grudge against the crone who rules Razorfen Kraul there now. In Ratchet, Mebok Mizzyrix has a smaller job in the same thorns."] = "雷霆崖下層高地的奧爾德‧石塔還記得牛頭人住在貧瘠之地南部的日子，對如今在那裡統治剃刀沼澤的老太婆一直懷恨在心。在棘齒城，麥伯克‧米希瑞克斯在同一片荊棘裡有件小一點的差事。"
L["Somewhere in Razorfen Kraul I picked up the journal of a dwarf named Henrig Lonebrow, who had no further use for it. I took it to Falfindel Waywarder at Thalanaar, on the Feralas border. Falfindel mourned a brave soul and then got down to business.\n\nThe crone who rules the Kraul, Charlga Razorflank, was raising an army in there, and there wasn't time to send to Darnassus for help. Falfindel wanted her medallion as proof she was finished.\n\nSo back into the thorns I went. Charlga kept a great many quilboar between herself and the door, and the medallion came away with me in the end. Falfindel was glad the Alliance could get on with its work there, and started wondering aloud whether treachery had a hand in the rot in that ground. I left Falfindel to it."] = "在剃刀沼澤的某個地方，我撿到了一個名叫亨里格‧獨眉的矮人的日記，他已經用不上了。我把它帶給了菲拉斯邊境薩蘭納爾的法芬德爾。法芬德爾為一個勇敢的靈魂哀悼了一番，然後開始談正事。\n\n統治剃刀沼澤的老太婆卡爾加‧刺肋正在裡面召集一支軍隊，已經來不及派人去達納蘇斯求援了。法芬德爾想要她的大獎章，作為她已經完蛋的證據。\n\n於是我又回到了荊棘叢裡。卡爾加在自己和門口之間布置了一大堆野豬人，最後大獎章還是被我帶走了。法芬德爾很高興聯盟可以繼續在那裡的工作，又開始自言自語，琢磨那片土地的腐爛是不是有背叛在作祟。我讓法芬德爾自己慢慢琢磨。"
L["Auld Stonespire in Thunder Bluff has a long memory. The tauren lived on holy land in the southern Barrens for decades before they were driven out, and Auld has never forgiven it. These days the crone Charlga Razorflank rules down there from Razorfen Kraul and is raising an army. Auld wanted her heart, and said it would be enough to die in peace.\n\nThe Kraul is a maze of thorns as thick as tree trunks, full of quilboar who seemed to know what I'd come for, and Charlga was at the far end of it.\n\nI carried the heart back to Thunder Bluff. Auld was satisfied that the Razorfen finally knew what the tauren had felt. Driving a people from holy ground, Auld told me, is a sin that earns its vengeance. Then came the thanks, very solemn, with the heart still in Auld's hand."] = "雷霆崖的奧爾德‧石塔記性很好。牛頭人在貧瘠之地南部的聖地上生活了幾十年，後來被趕了出去，奧爾德從來沒有原諒過。如今，老太婆卡爾加‧刺肋在剃刀沼澤統治著那裡，正在召集一支軍隊。奧爾德想要她的心臟，說有了它就足以安心地死去了。\n\n剃刀沼澤是一座迷宮，荊棘粗得像樹幹，裡面滿是野豬人，牠們似乎知道我是來做什麼的，而卡爾加就在迷宮的最深處。\n\n我把心臟帶回了雷霆崖。奧爾德很滿意，覺得剃刀部族終於明白了牛頭人當年的感受。奧爾德告訴我，把一個民族趕出聖地，是一樁必遭報應的罪孽。接著是致謝，非常莊重，那顆心臟還握在奧爾德手裡。"
L["Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet sent me into Razorfen Kraul with a crate full of holes and an owner's manual I was told to read first, so I read it. Out of the crate came a snufflenose gopher, and a poke with the command stick set it rooting for blueleaf tubers while I kept the quilboar off it. Mebok wanted the crate and the stick back along with the six tubers, and got all of it."] = "棘齒城的麥伯克‧米希瑞克斯要我帶著一個滿是孔洞的箱子和一本說明書進剃刀沼澤，還交代我先讀說明書，於是我讀了。箱子裡鑽出一隻地鼠，用指揮棒戳牠一下，牠就開始拱土找藍葉薯，我則負責把野豬人擋在一邊。麥伯克要我把箱子和指揮棒連同六塊藍葉薯一起帶回去，全都拿到了。"
L["A Vengeful Fate"] = "奧爾德的報復"
L["Auld Stonespire"] = "奧爾德‧石塔"
L["Willix the Importer"] = "進口商威利克斯"
L["near Charlga Razorflank, Razorfen Kraul"] = "卡爾加‧刺肋附近，剃刀沼澤"
L["Willix the Importer, a goblin, had gone into Razorfen Kraul after blueleaf tubers for Mebok Mizzyrix and ended up held in a tent not far from Charlga Razorflank. I walked Willix out. The whole way there was a running complaint about the quilboar and the smell, and warnings about trouble that tended to arrive at the same moment as the trouble. Outside, Willix thanked me and announced a good long rest before the trip back to Ratchet."] = "進口商威利克斯是個哥布林，為了替麥伯克‧米希瑞克斯找藍葉薯進了剃刀沼澤，結果被關在離卡爾加‧刺肋不遠的一頂帳篷裡。我領著威利克斯走了出來。一路上抱怨個不停，嫌野豬人，嫌臭味，還不停地警告有麻煩，可是警告往往跟麻煩同時到。到了外面，威利克斯向我道謝，宣布要先好好睡上一大覺，再動身回棘齒城。"
L["Mortality Wanes"] = "臨終遺言"
L["Heralath Fallowbrook"] = "赫拉斯‧靜水"
L["Heralath Fallowbrook lay in the Kraul not far from Charlga Razorflank and didn't have long. A quilboar had taken the pendant Heralath shared with Treshala, Heralath's wife in Darnassus, and Heralath wanted it found and taken home to her with word of the death. I found it on one of the quilboar and carried both to the Tradesmen's Terrace. Treshala wouldn't believe it at first, then said the grief would be carried and Heralath's work would go on, and asked to be left alone to mourn. I went."] = "赫拉斯‧靜水躺在剃刀沼澤裡離卡爾加‧刺肋不遠的地方，時日無多了。一個野豬人搶走了赫拉斯和塔莎拉共有的墜飾，塔莎拉是赫拉斯在達納蘇斯的妻子，赫拉斯希望把墜飾找回來，連同自己的死訊一起帶回家交給她。我在一個野豬人身上找到了墜飾，把兩樣都帶到了貿易區。塔莎拉起初不肯相信，後來說會扛起這份悲痛，赫拉斯的工作也會繼續下去，然後請我讓她獨自哀悼。我走了。"
L["Lonebrow's Journal"] = "亨里格的日記"
L["Falfindel Waywarder"] = "法芬德爾"
L["A Host of Evil"] = "邪惡之地"
L["Myriam Moonsinger keeps watch from a hill near the entrance to Razorfen Downs, at the bottom of the Barrens. A diplomat has set up outside the Downs and is drawing a crowd, and Myriam would like the crowd smaller."] = "麥雷姆‧月歌在貧瘠之地最南端剃刀高地入口附近的一座山丘上守望。一個外交官在高地外面安營紮寨，引來了一大群人，麥雷姆希望這群人少一點。"
L["Charlga Razorflank was carrying a small scroll under an insignia you don't recognize. Varimathras, in the Royal Quarter of the Undercity, may know it. Near the entrance to Razorfen Downs, Myriam Moonsinger could use a hand with the crowd gathering there."] = "卡爾加‧刺肋身上帶著一卷小卷軸，上面的徽記你不認得。幽暗城皇家區的瓦里瑪薩斯也許認得。在剃刀高地的入口附近，麥雷姆‧月歌需要有人幫忙對付聚集在那裡的人群。"
L["Myriam Moonsinger had been sitting on a hill outside Razorfen Downs, keeping an eye on a diplomat. Ambassador Malcin, Myriam suspected, was Scourge, and handed out undeath to anyone who came asking for it. Plenty came. Every day more of them crept out of the briars to stand near the ambassador, quilboar and Death's Head cultists both, and Myriam was in no position to fight that many alone.\n\nI took eight of each kind off the crowd. Myriam thanked me and said that seeing the diplomat's power up close only proved the Scourge were among the worst threats Azeroth had ever faced. Then it was back to watching and studying, and I was pointed at the cave below the hill, the one shaped like a boar's mouth, with the suggestion that I take friends."] = "麥雷姆‧月歌一直坐在剃刀高地外的一座山丘上，盯著一個外交官。麥雷姆懷疑，瑪克林大使是天譴軍團的人，誰去找他要不死之身，他就給誰。去的人還真不少。每天都有更多人從荊棘叢裡爬出來，站到大使身邊，有野豬人，也有亡首教徒，麥雷姆一個人根本打不過那麼多。\n\n我從人群裡把每一種各解決了八個。麥雷姆向我道謝，說近距離見識了這個外交官的力量，只證明了天譴軍團是艾澤拉斯有史以來最可怕的威脅之一。然後又回去繼續觀察和研究了，而我被指向山下那個形狀像野豬嘴巴的洞穴，還附帶一句建議，最好帶上朋友。"
L["The crone had been carrying a small scroll under an insignia I didn't recognize. Varimathras did. Down in the Royal Quarter, the dreadlord asked whether it had come off Charlga, who rules the Kraul.\n\nIt was a letter from Ambassador Malcin, a diplomat to Lordaeron before things changed and a servant of the Scourge since. The letter called Charlga My Lady and offered her the Barrens and more if the Scourge could do as it liked there, and Malcin would wait outside Razorfen Downs to talk it over. If the Scourge wanted a foothold in Kalimdor, Varimathras said, it fell to the Horde to answer.\n\nMalcin was waiting where the letter said, among quilboar and cultists hungry for the bargain. A watcher on the hill above wanted that crowd thinner, so I thinned it on the way through, and Malcin's head went back to the Undercity with me."] = "老太婆身上帶著一卷小卷軸，上面的徽記我不認得。瓦里瑪薩斯認得。在皇家區裡，這位恐懼魔王問我，它是不是從統治剃刀沼澤的卡爾加身上拿來的。\n\n那是瑪克林大使寫的一封信，此人在世道改變之前是派駐羅德隆的外交官，之後就成了天譴軍團的僕從。信裡稱卡爾加為「我的女士」，承諾只要天譴軍團能在貧瘠之地為所欲為，就把貧瘠之地乃至更多的土地給她，瑪克林會在剃刀高地外面等著跟她詳談。瓦里瑪薩斯說，如果天譴軍團想在卡林多站穩腳步，那就該由部落來回應。\n\n瑪克林就在信上說的地方等著，身邊是一群渴望這筆交易的野豬人和教徒。山上的一個守望者希望那群人少一些，所以我在穿過去的路上順手削減了一番，瑪克林的頭顱跟著我回到了幽暗城。"
L["An Unholy Alliance"] = "邪惡的盟友"
L["Small Scroll"] = "小卷軸"
L["Myriam Moonsinger"] = "麥雷姆‧月歌"
L["Extinguishing the Idol"] = "封印神像"
L["Somewhere in Razorfen Downs, in a cage the Scourge haven't got round to emptying, a stranger named Belnistrasz is still alive and has a proposal for whoever reaches the cage first."] = "在剃刀高地的某個地方，有一個天譴軍團還沒來得及清空的籠子，裡面關著一個叫貝尼斯特拉茲的陌生人，到現在還活著，對第一個找到籠子的人有個提議。"
L["Deep in Razorfen Downs, in a cage, I found Belnistrasz. The stranger had fully expected to die in there or end up as a meal for the Scourge, and was very glad to see me, as people in cages generally are. Home, I gathered, was a long way from the Barrens.\n\nBefore anything else, Belnistrasz handed me an oathstone. Among Belnistrasz's kind an agreement made over one of those is a serious bond, and to take the job I had to give it back. I gave it back.\n\nThe job was the quilboar idol. Belnistrasz meant to shut it down with a ritual, and a ritual means standing in one place for a long while as the whole of the Downs comes to object. I stood in front and objected back. When the ritual was done the idol was finished, and we wound things up at Belnistrasz's brazier."] = "在剃刀高地深處的一個籠子裡，我找到了貝尼斯特拉茲。這位陌生人原本以為必死無疑，或者會成為天譴軍團的一頓大餐，見到我非常高興，關在籠子裡的人通常都這樣。我猜，對方的家鄉離貧瘠之地很遠。\n\n在做任何事之前，貝尼斯特拉茲先遞給我一塊誓言石。在貝尼斯特拉茲的族人之間，對著這種石頭立下的約定是一種莊重的約束，要接下這份差事，我就得把它還回去。我還回去了。\n\n差事就是那座野豬人神像。貝尼斯特拉茲打算用一場儀式封印它，而儀式意味著在一個地方站上很久，整個剃刀高地的東西都會跑來抗議。我站在前面，抗議回去。儀式結束時，神像也就完了，我們在貝尼斯特拉茲的火盆旁收了尾。"
L["Scourge of the Downs"] = "剃刀高地的天譴軍團"
L["Belnistrasz"] = "貝尼斯特拉茲"
L["a cage in Razorfen Downs"] = "剃刀高地裡的一個籠子"
L["The Coldbringer"] = "寒冰使者"
L["Archbishop Benedictus, in the Cathedral of Light in Stormwind, has had grim reports out of Razorfen Downs and wants the power behind them put down. The archbishop is asking for volunteers willing to go all the way to the bottom."] = "暴風城光明大教堂的大主教本尼迪塔斯收到了來自剃刀高地的嚴峻報告，想把背後的力量剷除掉。大主教正在徵召願意一路深入到最底層的志願者。"
L["Andrew Brownell, in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity, has studied the master of Razorfen Downs closely enough to want the skull, and would like it fetched up from the very bottom of the Downs."] = "幽暗城魔法區的安德魯‧布隆奈爾對剃刀高地的主人研究得夠透徹，想要那顆頭骨，希望有人從高地的最底層把它取上來。"
L["Archbishop Benedictus had heard enough about Razorfen Downs. The quilboar there had made a pact with the Scourge, and the pact had bred things worse than either of them. Over all of it sat a lich called Amnennar the Coldbringer, and the archbishop wanted the union ended along with him.\n\nSo down I went, to the very bottom of the Downs, where Amnennar waited in a cold he seems to carry with him. It was a long fight and I did most of it with numb fingers. He went down in the end.\n\nBack at the Cathedral of Light, Benedictus thanked me and said the Scourge would think twice before trying to swell its ranks that way again. I left with the archbishop's blessing of the Light, which was warm, at least."] = "大主教本尼迪塔斯對剃刀高地的事已經聽夠了。那裡的野豬人和天譴軍團訂了協約，這協約孕育出了比兩者都更糟的東西。凌駕於這一切之上的，是一個叫『寒冰使者』亞門納爾的巫妖，大主教想讓這個聯盟和他一起完蛋。\n\n於是我下去了，一直下到剃刀高地的最底層，亞門納爾就在那裡，在一片他似乎隨身攜帶的寒氣中等著。那是一場漫長的戰鬥，我大部分時間都是用凍僵的手指在打。最後他還是倒下了。\n\n回到光明大教堂，本尼迪塔斯向我道謝，說天譴軍團以後再想用這種辦法擴充隊伍，就得三思了。我帶著大主教的聖光祝福離開，至少它是溫暖的。"
L["Andrew Brownell, in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity, laid out Razorfen Downs for me like a lecture. The quilboar there had thrown in with the Scourge, and the lich who ruled them, Amnennar the Coldbringer, moved them about with his mind. He also had a line straight to Ner'zhul. Brownell wanted that line cut, and the skull brought back to show for it.\n\nThe bottom of the Downs was colder than anything in the Barrens has a right to be, and Amnennar did his best to keep it that way for a long, long fight. The skull came home with me.\n\nBrownell's view was that a lich's loyalty never wavers, and that loyalty of that sort only ever leads to its own destruction."] = "幽暗城魔法區的安德魯‧布隆奈爾向我講解剃刀高地，就像在上課。那裡的野豬人投靠了天譴軍團，而統治牠們的巫妖，『寒冰使者』亞門納爾，能用意念驅使牠們。他還有一條直通耐奧祖的線。布隆奈爾想把那條線切斷，並把頭骨帶回來作為憑證。\n\n剃刀高地的底層冷得超出了貧瘠之地該有的程度，而亞門納爾在一場漫長又漫長的戰鬥中盡力讓它維持這樣。頭骨跟著我回了家。\n\n布隆奈爾的看法是，巫妖的忠誠從不動搖，而那種忠誠只會走向自我毀滅。"
L["Bring the Light"] = "與聖光同在"
L["Archbishop Benedictus"] = "大主教本尼迪塔斯"
L["Bring the End"] = "寒冰之王"
L["Andrew Brownell"] = "安德魯‧布隆奈爾"
L["The Coldbringer's Eye"] = "寒冰使者之眼"
L["Archmage Lan'dalock in Dalaran wanted the Coldbringer's Eye brought out of Razorfen Downs. It sat in a blue orb behind Amnennar, which made Amnennar the first step of the errand. Once he was out of the way the orb gave it up, and I carried it all the way to the Alterac Mountains for the archmage."] = "達拉然的大法師朗達拉克想把寒冰使者之眼從剃刀高地帶出來。它放在亞門納爾身後的一個藍色球體裡，所以這趟差事的第一步就是亞門納爾。等他不礙事了，球體就交出了寒冰使者之眼，我一路把它帶到奧特蘭克山脈，交給了大法師。"
L["Sutara Plainstalker"] = "蘇塔拉‧平原行者"
L["Sutara Plainstalker, an Earthen Ring quartermaster in Mulgore, wanted the Coldbringer's Eye fetched from Razorfen Downs. It sat in a blue orb behind Amnennar, so Amnennar had to be dealt with first, and I was headed that way regardless. With the lich gone the orb let go of it, and I took it back across the Barrens to Sutara."] = "莫高雷的蘇塔拉‧平原行者是陶土議會的軍需官，想要從剃刀高地取回寒冰使者之眼。它放在亞門納爾身後的一個藍色球體裡，所以得先解決亞門納爾，反正我本來就要往那邊去。巫妖一死，球體就鬆開了它，我帶著它穿過貧瘠之地，交給了蘇塔拉。"
-- Profession stories: Master of the Wild Leather, The Mithril Order, The Pledge of Secrecy
L["The Mithril Order"] = "祕銀會"
L["Galvan the Ancient, a dwarf smith of the old school, left Booty Bay long ago, but the order he belongs to still keeps members in town, looking for a successor.\n\nYour trainer can point you their way, south into the jungles of Stranglethorn, and in time you'll have to choose between armor and weapons."] = "加爾文是一位老派的矮人鐵匠，很久以前就離開了藏寶海灣，但他所屬的那個組織至今仍有成員留在鎮上，物色著接班人。\n\n你的訓練師可以為你指路，南下荊棘谷的叢林。日後，你還得在護甲和武器之間做出選擇。"
L["Years ago a dwarf named Galvan trained Hank the Hammer, then left for Booty Bay, and Hank promised to pass the teaching on. Hank still keeps that promise, in Stormwind's Dwarven District.\n\nFrom there the road runs south to Stranglethorn and Gadgetzan before it brings you back to the Great Forge in Ironforge, where armorsmiths and weaponsmiths each want you for their own."] = "多年前，一位名叫加爾文的矮人教過巨錘漢克，之後便去了藏寶海灣。漢克答應過他，要把這門手藝傳下去。如今漢克仍在暴風城的矮人區信守著這個承諾。\n\n路從那裡往南，經過荊棘谷和加基森，最後把你帶回鐵爐堡的大鍛爐。在那裡，護甲鍛造師和武器鑄造師都想把你收歸門下。"
L["Orokk Omosh, in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, is the last of twenty generations of Omosh smiths and wants the family recipes to outlive him. Aturk the Anvil, a few steps away, has older ways to teach.\n\nFrom there the road runs south to Stranglethorn and Gadgetzan before it brings you back to the Valley of Honor, where armorsmiths and weaponsmiths each want you for their own."] = "奧格瑪榮譽谷的奧羅克‧沃姆什是沃姆什家族二十代鐵匠中的最後一位，他希望家傳的配方能比他活得更久。幾步之外的鐵砧阿圖爾克，則有更古老的技藝可以傳授。\n\n路從那裡往南，經過荊棘谷和加基森，最後把你帶回榮譽谷。在那裡，護甲鍛造師和武器鑄造師都想把你收歸門下。"
L["Stranglethorn Vale / Tanaris / Winterspring"] = "荊棘谷 / 塔納利斯 / 冬泉谷"
L["The Origins of Smithing"] = "鍛造的起源"
L["Hank the Hammer"] = "巨錘漢克"
L["between Zul'Gurub and the Mosh'Ogg Ogre Mound, Stranglethorn Vale"] = "祖爾格拉布與莫什奧格巨魔山之間，荊棘谷"
L["Joys of Omosh"] = "沃姆什的喜悅"
L["Twenty generations of Omosh have held the hammer Orokk Omosh holds now, in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, and he has no heir for the family recipes. Bring your best bronze work and show him you could carry them on."] = "奧格瑪榮譽谷的奧羅克‧沃姆什手裡那把錘子，已經在沃姆什家族傳了二十代，可他沒有繼承人來接手家傳的配方。帶上你最好的青銅作品，向他證明你能把它們傳下去。"
L["There's a smith in the Valley of Honor named Orokk Omosh. Twenty generations of Omosh have held the same hammer, and Orokk is the last of them, with the family recipes and no one to leave them to. He looked me over and decided I would have to do.\n\nThe recipes cost me more bronze than I knew Orgrimmar had, and then iron. Every delivery bought one set of barbaric iron plans and a short speech about the fear I'd see in my enemies' eyes. Once he said I was like his own grandfather, Chief Gorokk, and I took that kindly.\n\nThe last family secret was a dance. Orokk was not crying, he told me, there was soot in his eye. Then he taught me the Omosh Dance of Joy, and was panting a bit by the end. I still do it at the forge when a piece comes out right."] = "榮譽谷有個鐵匠，叫奧羅克‧沃姆什。同一把錘子在沃姆什家傳了二十代，奧羅克是最後一個，守著家傳的配方，卻沒人可以託付。他把我上下打量了一番，認定只好將就用我了。\n\n那些配方花掉的青銅，比我以為整個奧格瑪有的還多，後來又換成了鐵。每交一批貨，就換來一份野人鐵設計圖，外加一小段演說，講我會在敵人眼中看到怎樣的恐懼。有一次他說我像他的祖父戈羅克酋長，我就當是句好話收下了。\n\n家族的最後一個秘密是一支舞。奧羅克告訴我，他沒哭，是眼睛進了灰。然後他教了我沃姆什的喜悅之舞，跳到最後自己還有點喘。直到現在，每當有件東西打得順手，我還會在鍛爐邊跳上一段。"
L["Barbaric Battlements"] = "野人裝甲"
L["Orokk Omosh"] = "奧羅克‧沃姆什"
L["On Iron Pauldrons"] = "鐵肩鎧"
L["Trampled Under Foot"] = "踩在腳下"
L["Horns of Frenzy"] = "瘋狂之角"
L["Hank the Hammer, in Stormwind's Dwarven District, was trained by a dwarf named Galvan, who made Hank promise to teach any smith with the will to go further. For six golden scale bracers, Hank will show you where smithing comes from."] = "暴風城矮人區的巨錘漢克師從一位名叫加爾文的矮人。加爾文要漢克答應過，要教導每一個有心更進一步的鐵匠。打造六副金鱗護腕，漢克就會讓你明白鍛造的起源。"
L["Aturk the Anvil, in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, remembers the days of crushed skulls and has little use for peacetime. Bring four steel breastplates and four steel helms, and he will give you a taste of war."] = "奧格瑪榮譽谷的鐵砧阿圖爾克還記得那些碾碎頭顱的日子，對太平歲月提不起什麼興趣。帶四套鋼質胸甲和四頂鋼質頭盔給他，他會讓你嘗嘗戰爭的滋味。"
L["Hank the Hammer learned the trade from Galvan, a dwarf who left for Booty Bay years ago. For six golden scale bracers, Hank taught me where smithing comes from. It never comes from here, I was told, twice, and only from here. I still couldn't tell you which here was which.\n\nThen Hank gave me an insignia to take to McGavan at the Booty Bay smithy. McGavan kept it and swore by Blackhoof's back hair that I was worthy of the Mithril Order. What I got back was a pin to show Galvan, far to the north.\n\nGalvan teaches mining before smithing, so every lesson started with forty bars of mithril. Truesilver got a lecture to itself. He calls it the great silver deceiver, and spent more than ten years in the Alterac Mountains learning why. When my arms worked again, he sent me on to Gadgetzan."] = "巨錘漢克的手藝是跟加爾文學的，那個矮人多年前就去了藏寶海灣。我交了六副金鱗護腕，漢克就教我鍛造從何而來。他告訴我，它從來不是從這裡來的，這話說了兩遍，然後又說它只從這裡來。哪個「這裡」是哪個，我到現在也說不上來。\n\n接著漢克給了我一枚徽章，要我帶去藏寶海灣的鐵匠鋪找馬克迦文。馬克迦文把徽章留下了，還以黑蹄的背毛起誓，說我配得上祕銀會。我換回來的是一枚別針，要拿去給遠在北邊的加爾文看。\n\n加爾文先教採礦，再教鍛造，所以每堂課都從四十塊秘銀錠開始。真銀還單獨占了一堂課。照他的說法，真銀根本不是真的，為了弄明白這一點，他在奧特蘭克山脈待了十多年。等我的胳膊又能動了，他就打發我去了加基森。"
L["Aturk the Anvil remembers grinding the bones of fallen enemies into filament powder, and hasn't made peace with the Warchief's peace. For four steel breastplates and four helms, Aturk taught me orcish war leggings and made it plain I was a disappointment.\n\nAturk's neighbor was more cheerful, and knew a guy who knew a guy at the smithy in Booty Bay. That was McGavan, who kept the insignia I'd been handed and swore by Blackhoof's back hair that I was worthy of the Mithril Order. I got a pin in exchange, and directions north to Galvan.\n\nGalvan teaches mining before smithing, so every lesson started with forty bars of mithril. Truesilver got a lecture to itself. He calls it the great silver deceiver, and spent more than ten years in the Alterac Mountains learning why. When my arms worked again, he sent me on to Gadgetzan."] = "鐵砧阿圖爾克還記得把倒下的敵人的骨頭磨成粉做燈絲的日子。大酋長已經跟舊敵講和，他自己卻到現在也沒跟這份和平講和。我交了四套鋼質胸甲和四頂頭盔，阿圖爾克教了我獸人護腿的做法，還毫不掩飾地表示我讓他很失望。\n\n阿圖爾克的鄰居要開朗得多，他認識一個人，那人又認識藏寶海灣鐵匠鋪裡的一個人。鐵匠鋪裡的那位就是馬克迦文。他把我帶去的徽章留下了，以黑蹄的背毛起誓，說我配得上祕銀會。我換回一枚別針，還有往北去找加爾文的路線。\n\n加爾文先教採礦，再教鍛造，所以每堂課都從四十塊秘銀錠開始。真銀還單獨占了一堂課。照他的說法，真銀根本不是真的，為了弄明白這一點，他在奧特蘭克山脈待了十多年。等我的胳膊又能動了，他就打發我去了加基森。"
L["The Old Ways"] = "古老的技藝"
L["Aturk the Anvil"] = "鐵砧阿圖爾克"
L["Booty Bay or Bust!"] = "藏寶海灣之旅！"
L["Ox"] = "奧克斯"
L["In Search of Galvan"] = "尋找加爾文"
L["McGavan"] = "馬克迦文"
L["Smelt On, Smelt Off"] = "鐵匠必修課"
L["The Great Silver Deceiver"] = "白花花的銀子"
L["The Art of the Imbue"] = "灌魔工藝"
L["Galvan's Finest Pupil"] = "加爾文的得意門生"
L["The Mithril Kid"] = "秘銀小子"
L["Galvan has sent you to Gadgetzan, in Tanaris, to meet Trenton Lighthammer, the old smith's finest pupil. Trenton can teach you about ornate mithril, and has a blacksmithing championship to get ready for."] = "加爾文打發你去塔納利斯的加基森，見見這位老鐵匠最得意的學生特倫頓‧輕錘。特倫頓能教你華麗秘銀的手藝，而且他還得為一場鐵匠冠軍賽做準備。"
L["Trenton Lighthammer is known in Gadgetzan as the Mithril Kid. Galvan had taught each of us half of the ornate mithril set and left us to find each other, and Trenton saw the plan straight away. So we traded, piece for piece, until we both knew all of it.\n\nThe boots meant the most to Trenton. At last year's All-Valley Blacksmithing Championship, a rival from the Venture Co. Foundry swept his leg, and ornate mithril boots kept him going to the win. This year he wanted the pants too. When we were done, Trenton declared me unsweepable.\n\nAfter that I stood and watched Trenton work. Then I was handed an insignia very like the one I'd given McGavan, and named a blacksmith of the Mithril Order. Galvan had the last word, and a signet worth far more than what I'd given up."] = "特倫頓‧輕錘在加基森人稱秘銀小子。加爾文把華麗秘銀套裝拆成兩半，我們倆各教一半，然後讓我們自己去找對方。特倫頓一下子就看穿了這個安排。於是我們一件換一件，直到兩人都學全了。\n\n對特倫頓來說，最要緊的是那雙靴子。去年的全谷鐵匠冠軍賽上，風險投資公司來的一個對手給了他一記掃堂腿，是華麗秘銀戰靴讓他撐到最後拿下冠軍。今年他連束褲也想要。等我們換完，特倫頓宣布我從此掃不倒了。\n\n之後我就站在一旁看特倫頓幹活。然後有人遞給我一枚徽章，跟我當初交給馬克迦文的那枚很像，我也就成了祕銀會的一名鐵匠。最後的話由加爾文來說，他還給了我一枚徽記，比我當初交出去的那枚徽章值錢多了。"
L["A Good Head On Your Shoulders"] = "罩帽和護肩"
L["The World At Your Feet"] = "世界在你腳下"
L["Did You Lose This?"] = "祕銀會的認可"
L["Expert Blacksmith!"] = "鍛造專家!"
L["Armorsmith or Weaponsmith"] = "護甲鍛造師還是武器鑄造師"
L["At the Great Forge in Ironforge, Grumnus Steelshaper trains armorsmiths and Ironus Coldsteel trains weaponsmiths. You can follow only one of them, so hear both out. From level 50, weaponsmiths can seek out three masters in Everlook, in Winterspring."] = "在鐵爐堡的大鍛爐，格魯努斯‧削鋼訓練護甲鍛造師，埃隆努斯‧冷鋼訓練武器鑄造師。兩人之中你只能跟隨一位，所以不妨把兩邊的話都聽完。到了50級，武器鑄造師還可以去冬泉谷的永望鎮拜訪三位大師。"
L["In Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, Okothos Ironrager trains armorsmiths and Borgosh Corebender trains weaponsmiths. You can follow only one of them, so hear both out. From level 50, weaponsmiths can seek out three masters in Everlook, in Winterspring."] = "在奧格瑪的榮譽谷，奧克索斯‧鐵怒訓練護甲鍛造師，伯古西訓練武器鑄造師。兩人之中你只能跟隨一位，所以不妨把兩邊的話都聽完。到了50級，武器鑄造師還可以去冬泉谷的永望鎮拜訪三位大師。"
L["At the Great Forge there are two trainers who will take a smith further, and each thinks the other went wrong. Grumnus Steelshaper calls armor the smart decision. Ironus Coldsteel says weaponsmiths are the ones with all the gold, and was stacking coins into neat piles while saying it.\n\nBoth wanted a pile of finished work before they'd teach a thing, and a smith only gets to pick one of them. I made my choice and the work to go with it. Which one I took is between me and my anvil.\n\nUp in Everlook, three masters each teach a single weapon to weaponsmiths who bring them a trophy from a dungeon. Picking one of them closes the other two doors for good."] = "大鍛爐有兩位訓練師能帶鐵匠更進一步，而且都覺得對方走錯了路。格魯努斯‧削鋼說選護甲才是明智之舉。埃隆努斯‧冷鋼說錢都讓武器鑄造師賺走了，說這話的時候，他正把金幣一疊疊碼得整整齊齊。\n\n兩人都要先看到一堆成品才肯教，而一個鐵匠只能選其中一位。我做了選擇，也打好了與之相配的活兒。至於選的是哪位，那是我和我的鐵砧之間的事。\n\n在北邊的永望鎮，有三位大師各教一種武器，教的是能從地城帶回戰利品的武器鑄造師。選了其中一位，另外兩扇門就永遠關上了。"
L["In the Valley of Honor there are two trainers who will take a smith further. Okothos Ironrager makes armor for the satisfaction of it, and means to pound steel until there's no breath left to do it with. Borgosh Corebender makes weapons and dreams of a hammer fit for a Warchief, a life's work still in progress.\n\nBoth wanted a pile of finished work first, and both offered one last chance to back out. I made my choice and the work to go with it. Which one I took is between me and my anvil.\n\nUp in Everlook, three masters each teach a single weapon to weaponsmiths who bring them a trophy from a dungeon. Picking one of them closes the other two doors for good."] = "榮譽谷有兩位訓練師能帶鐵匠更進一步。奧克索斯‧鐵怒打造護甲，圖的是那份滿足感，打算一直敲打鋼鐵，直到再也喘不上氣為止。伯古西打造武器，夢想著打出一把配得上大酋長的錘子，這份畢生的事業至今還沒完工。\n\n兩人都要先看到一堆成品，也都給了我最後一次反悔的機會。我做了選擇，也打好了與之相配的活兒。至於選的是哪位，那是我和我的鐵砧之間的事。\n\n在北邊的永望鎮，有三位大師各教一種武器，教的是能從地城帶回戰利品的武器鑄造師。選了其中一位，另外兩扇門就永遠關上了。"
L["The Art of the Armorsmith"] = "護甲鍛造師的藝術"
L["I took up armor. Grumnus Steelshaper went over my stack of ornate mithril and told me there was no turning back after this, and that it wasn't too late to become a toy maker. A weaponsmith, he meant. I've had a forge tan ever since."] = "我選了護甲。格魯努斯‧削鋼把我那一疊華麗秘銀仔細看了一遍，告訴我這一步踏出去就不能回頭了，現在改行當玩具匠也還來得及。他說的玩具匠，指的是武器鑄造師。從那以後，我臉上就一直帶著鍛爐烤出來的顏色。"
L["Okothos Ironrager"] = "奧克索斯‧鐵怒"
L["I took up armor. Okothos Ironrager checked my ornate mithril and offered me one last chance to back out. I didn't take it, and was wished a lifetime of glory, which I've been working through one helm at a time."] = "我選了護甲。奧克索斯‧鐵怒檢查了我的華麗秘銀，給了我最後一次反悔的機會。我沒要，於是他祝我一生榮耀。這份榮耀，我正一頂頭盔一頂頭盔地慢慢掙。"
L["The Way of the Weaponsmith"] = "武器鑄造師之道"
L["Ironus Coldsteel"] = "埃隆努斯‧冷鋼"
L["I took up weapons. Ironus Coldsteel had customers waiting and took my axes and maces almost before I'd set them down, then told me to pay attention. I've had customers waiting myself ever since, and I'm still looking for all that gold."] = "我選了武器。埃隆努斯‧冷鋼那邊有顧客等著，我的斧頭和錘子還沒放穩，他就拿走了，然後要我專心聽好。從那以後，我這邊也一直有顧客等著，可他說的那些金子，我還在找。"
L["Borgosh Corebender"] = "伯古西"
L["I took up weapons. Borgosh Corebender looked over my work and offered me a last chance to back out, then told me to prepare to be consumed by knowledge. He wasn't wrong. Some nights I dream in axe heads."] = "我選了武器。伯古西看過我的活兒，給了我最後一次反悔的機會，然後要我準備好被知識吞沒。他沒說錯。有些晚上，我連做夢都是斧頭。"
L["Sweet Serenity"] = "甜美的平靜"
L["Lilith the Lithe"] = "輕盈的莉莉絲"
L["Lilith the Lithe sent me into the Scarlet Bastion in Stratholme, where the Crimson Hammersmith guards the recipe for a hammer called Serenity with his life. He meant it. I brought Lilith his apron and became a hammersmith, with the sword and the axe closed to me from then on."] = "輕盈的莉莉絲派我去斯坦索姆的血色十字軍堡壘。那裡的紅衣鑄錘師用性命守護著一把名叫「平靜」的錘子的配方。他是說到做到的。我把他的圍裙帶回給莉莉絲，成了一名鑄錘大師，從此劍和斧的門都對我關上了。"
L["Snakestone of the Shadow Huntress"] = "沃許加斯的菊石"
L["Kilram"] = "基爾拉姆"
L["Kilram has a scar from Vosh'gajin, the shadow huntress of Blackrock Spire, and warned me not to let her beauty fool me. I brought back her snakestone, which the legend says keeps an axe razor sharp for a thousand years. Kilram made me an axesmith for it, and the sword and the hammer were closed to me for good."] = "基爾拉姆身上有道疤，是黑石塔的暗影獵手沃許加斯留下的。他提醒我別被她的美貌騙了。我把她的菊石帶了回來，傳說這東西能讓一把斧頭鋒利千年不鈍。基爾拉姆因此讓我成了鑄斧大師，劍和錘的門從此永遠對我關上了。"
L["Corruption"] = "腐蝕"
L["Seril Scourgebane"] = "亡靈殺手瑟里爾"
L["Seril Scourgebane was short with me, and said there was a reason for it. The Black Guard, Baron Rivendare's skeletal elite, had stolen the plans for the great blade Corruption, and their swordsmith in Stratholme was keeping them. I destroyed him and brought his insignia back to Everlook, and Seril made me a swordsmith. The hammer and the axe are closed to me now."] = "亡靈殺手瑟里爾對我愛理不理，還說這是有原因的。黑衣守衛，也就是瑞文戴爾男爵手下的骷髏精銳，偷走了巨劍「腐蝕」的設計圖，交給他們在斯坦索姆的鑄劍師保管。我消滅了他，把他的徽記帶回永望鎮，瑟里爾就讓我成了鑄劍大師。如今錘和斧的門都對我關上了。"
L["The Pledge of Secrecy"] = "保密協議"
L["Past a certain point, engineering splits into two schools. Gnome engineers build devices meant to make life easier, and goblin engineers build explosives and the guns to go with them. Each school guards its schemata from the other, so you can learn one and never the other.\n\nYour engineering trainer has a manual on the subject and strong views on which school a sensible engineer would join. Read it and make up your own mind. Then take the manual to the master of the school you want."] = "工程學到了一定程度，就會分成兩派。地精工程師製造讓生活更方便的裝置，哥布林工程師則製造炸藥，外加配套的槍械。兩派都不讓對方看到自己的結構圖，所以你只能學其中一派，另一派永遠學不到。\n\n你的工程學訓練師有一本講這件事的手冊，對明智的工程師該加入哪一派也有很強烈的看法。讀完手冊，自己拿主意，然後把手冊交給你想加入的那一派的大師。"
L["Stormwind / Ironforge / Undercity / Stranglethorn Vale / Tanaris"] = "暴風城 / 鐵爐堡 / 幽暗城 / 荊棘谷 / 塔納利斯"
L["Gnome Engineering"] = "地精工程學"
L["Lilliam Sparkspindle"] = "利廉姆‧火軸"
L["the Rogues' Quarter, Undercity"] = "盜賊區（幽暗城）"
L["Show Your Work"] = "工作成果"
L["Your engineering trainer has a manual for you, and an opinion to go with it. From here the craft splits into a gnome school and a goblin school, and you can only join one. Read the manual before you choose."] = "你的工程學訓練師有一本手冊要給你，還附贈一番見解。從這裡開始，這門手藝分成地精派和哥布林派，而你只能加入其中一派。做選擇之前，先把手冊讀一讀。"
L["Engineering only goes so far before it splits in two, gnome and goblin, and you have to pick. My trainer gave me a manual on it and made plain which school I ought to join. Gnomes build things to make life easier, says the manual, and some of them even work. Goblins build bombs and guns, which have the opposite problem. Join one school and the other keeps its schemata from you for good. The manual says so twice.\n\nBefore I learned a single schematic there was a pledge of lifelong secrecy to sign. I was told to think it over carefully. I read every line and signed.\n\nLast came the samples, because a master wants to see your work before handing over the good schemata. I spent a few long evenings at the bench. Mine passed, and I was given a membership card."] = "工程學學到一定程度就會一分為二，地精派和哥布林派，你得挑一邊。我的訓練師給了我一本講這件事的手冊，還明明白白地告訴我該加入哪一派。手冊上說，地精造東西是為了讓生活更方便，其中有些甚至真能用。哥布林造的是炸彈和槍，毛病正好反過來。加入一派，另一派的結構圖就永遠不會讓你碰。這一點手冊上說了兩遍。\n\n我還一張結構圖都沒學，就先得簽一份終生保密的協議。他們要我慎重考慮。我把每一行都讀了，然後簽了字。\n\n最後是交樣品，因為大師要先看看你的手藝，才肯把好的結構圖交給你。我在工作台前熬了幾個漫長的晚上。我的樣品過關了，拿到了一張會員卡。"
L["I took the manual to Tinkmaster Overspark in Tinker Town, who said he had all the time in the world, since all he does now is stand about while Gnomeregan sits in its cloud of radiation. Then he begged my pardon for the melodrama."] = "我把手冊帶到地精區，交給了工匠大師歐沃斯巴克。他說他有的是時間，反正如今諾姆瑞根籠罩在輻射雲裡，他每天只能在這裡乾站著。說完他又為自己這麼煽情向我道了歉。"
L["Graham Van Talen"] = "格拉哈姆‧範‧塔倫"
L["My trainer said that if I wanted to learn to make metal paperweights, Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay was the one to see. Oglethorpe opened by referring me to his barrister, in case I'd come about a homing robot through my wall. Gnomeregan, he told me, lost one of its greatest engineers the day he left."] = "我的訓練師說，要是我想學怎麼造金屬紙鎮，就去藏寶海灣找奧格索普‧奧布諾提斯。奧格索普一開口就要我有事去找他的律師，以防我是為了哪個歸巢機器人撞穿我家牆壁的事上門的。他告訴我，他離開的那天，諾姆瑞根就失去了一位最偉大的工程師。"
L["Overspark had signed the same pledge once, like every gnome engineer before me, and was delighted to have me in the fold."] = "歐沃斯巴克當年也簽過同樣的協議，在我之前的每一位地精工程師都簽過。看到我入了夥，他高興得很。"
L["Overspark's list ran to six mithril tubes and two advanced target dummies, among other things, so he could see where my work might be more gnomish. My card says I'm a member in good standing of the Mechanical Engineering Guild, Associated. I'd spell out the initials, but I signed a pledge."] = "歐沃斯巴克的清單上有六根秘銀管和兩個高級假人，還有些別的，這樣他就能看出我的手藝哪裡還可以再地精一點。我的卡上寫著，我是機械工程學聯合公會的正式會員。這名字的縮寫我本想唸給你們聽，可我簽過保密協議。"
L["Oglethorpe Obnoticus"] = "奧格索普‧奧布諾提斯"
L["Oglethorpe has no love for Gnomeregan's politics, or for one of its tinkmasters in particular, but he holds the pledge above all of that."] = "奧格索普對諾姆瑞根的政治毫無好感，對那裡的某位工匠大師尤其如此，但在他心裡，保密協議比這些都重要。"
L["Oglethorpe went over my mithril tubes and target dummies for gnomish technique. The card he gave me says I'm a member in good standing of the Mechanical Engineering Guild, Associated. I'd spell out the initials, but I signed a pledge."] = "奧格索普把我的秘銀管和假人翻來覆去地看，看的是夠不夠地精的手法。他給我的卡上寫著，我是機械工程學聯合公會的正式會員。這名字的縮寫我本想唸給你們聽，可我簽過保密協議。"
L["Goblin Engineering"] = "哥布林工程學"
L["I took the manual all the way to Gadgetzan, to Nixx Sprocketspring, who said he can smell a fresh recruit a mile off, like good blasting powder. Any fool can learn the basics, says Nixx, and Gnomeregan proves it. Goblin work takes a steady hand, and he leaned hard on the steady."] = "我把手冊一路帶到加基森，交給尼克斯‧斯普克斯賓。他說隔著老遠就能聞出新人的味道，就跟聞上好的火藥一樣。尼克斯說，基礎誰都能學，傻瓜也行，諾姆瑞根就是證明。哥布林的活兒要的是一雙穩當的手，「穩當」兩個字他咬得特別重。"
L["My trainer called goblin engineering the choice of every brilliant engineer, and I don't argue with compliments. Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan said he'd smelled me coming a mile off, like good blasting powder, and that goblin work takes a steady hand. He said steady louder than the rest."] = "我的訓練師說，哥布林工程學是所有明智的工程師都會選的一派。別人誇我，我從不頂嘴。加基森的尼克斯‧斯普克斯賓說，我還在老遠他就聞到我來了，就跟聞上好的火藥一樣，還說哥布林的活兒要的是一雙穩當的手。「穩當」這兩個字，他說得比別的字都響。"
L["Nixx Sprocketspring"] = "尼克斯‧斯普克斯賓"
L["Nixx kept it simple. It was a one-way trip, he said, and if I was ready, I should hop aboard."] = "尼克斯說得很簡單。他說這是一趟單程旅行，要是我準備好了，就趕緊上船吧。"
L["Nixx asked for forty assorted explosives and five explosive sheep, and told me to keep the safeties armed. My card says I'm a member in good standing of the Goblin Experimental Engineering Korporation, with a K. I suspect the initials came first."] = "尼克斯要了四十顆各式各樣的炸彈和五隻自爆綿羊，還叮囑我保險一定要扣好。我的卡上寫著，我是哥布林實驗工程學協會的正式會員。這名字的縮寫唸起來正好是個詞，我懷疑他們是先想好了縮寫，才湊出的全名。"
L["Master of the Wild Leather"] = "蠻皮護甲大師"
L["Two leatherworkers in Feralas know how to stitch wildvines into armor, and whichever one teaches you will want you working for them while you learn, paying for each pattern in finished leather.\n\nBeyond Wild Leather the trade divides into three high arts, each with a master of its own, and a leatherworker only ever gets to learn one of them."] = "菲拉斯有兩位製皮師懂得如何把野葡萄縫進護甲裡。不管哪一位教你，都會要你邊學邊替他幹活，每一張圖樣都得用做好的皮件來換。\n\n蠻皮之後，這門手藝分成三門高深的技藝，各有各的大師，而一個製皮師這輩子只能學其中一門。"
L["Pratt McGrubben, at Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas, knows how to stitch wildvines into armor. He'll teach you, if you don't mind working for him while you learn and paying for each pattern in finished leather.\n\nBeyond Wild Leather the trade divides into three high arts, each with a master of its own, and a leatherworker only ever gets to learn one of them."] = "菲拉斯羽月要塞的普拉特‧馬克格魯比懂得如何把野葡萄縫進護甲裡。他願意教你，只要你不介意邊學邊替他幹活，每一張圖樣都用做好的皮件來換。\n\n蠻皮之後，這門手藝分成三門高深的技藝，各有各的大師，而一個製皮師這輩子只能學其中一門。"
L["Jangdor Swiftstrider, at Camp Mojache in Feralas, knows how to stitch wildvines into armor. He'll teach you, if you don't mind working for him while you learn and paying for each pattern in finished leather.\n\nBeyond Wild Leather the trade divides into three high arts, each with a master of its own, and a leatherworker only ever gets to learn one of them."] = "菲拉斯莫沙徹營地的杉多爾‧迅蹄懂得如何把野葡萄縫進護甲裡。他願意教你，只要你不介意邊學邊替他幹活，每一張圖樣都用做好的皮件來換。\n\n蠻皮之後，這門手藝分成三門高深的技藝，各有各的大師，而一個製皮師這輩子只能學其中一門。"
L["Feralas / Darnassus / Thunder Bluff / Azshara / Searing Gorge / Badlands / Arathi Highlands / Stranglethorn Vale"] = "菲拉斯 / 達納蘇斯 / 雷霆崖 / 艾薩拉 / 灼熱峽谷 / 荒蕪之地 / 阿拉希高地 / 荊棘谷"
L["Wild Leather Armor"] = "蠻皮護甲"
L["Pratt McGrubben"] = "普拉特‧馬克格魯比"
L["the Craftsmen's Terrace, Darnassus"] = "工匠區（達納蘇斯）"
L["southern Azshara"] = "艾薩拉南部"
L["eastern Badlands"] = "荒蕪之地東部"
L["southeastern Searing Gorge"] = "灼熱峽谷東南部"
L["western Arathi Highlands"] = "阿拉希高地西部"
L["Thalanaar, Feralas"] = "薩蘭納爾（菲拉斯）"
L["southeast of Grom'gol, Stranglethorn Vale"] = "格羅姆高東南方，荊棘谷"
L["Pratt McGrubben, at Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas, thinks you're getting good with leather. He knows how to work wildvines into armor and will teach you, though you'll be working for him a while, and he wants ten pieces of thick leather to start."] = "菲拉斯羽月要塞的普拉特‧馬克格魯比覺得你的製皮手藝越來越好了。他懂得如何把野葡萄做進護甲裡，也願意教你，不過你得替他幹上一陣子活，而且一開始他就要十塊厚皮。"
L["Word of your leatherwork has reached Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache in Feralas. He knows how to work wildvines into armor and will teach you, though you'll be working for him a while, and he wants ten pieces of thick leather to start."] = "你的製皮手藝已經傳到了菲拉斯莫沙徹營地的杉多爾‧迅蹄耳中。他懂得如何把野葡萄做進護甲裡，也願意教你，不過你得替他幹上一陣子活，而且一開始他就要十塊厚皮。"
L["Pratt McGrubben teaches Wild Leather at Feathermoon Stronghold, and warned me up front that I'd be working for him while I learned. I pictured sweeping the shop. He meant armor, made by me and handed to him in pairs of turtle scale and nightscape, with a wildvine tucked into every order.\n\nThe wildvines are the trick. They're potent and chaotic, so whatever you stitch one into comes out strong in ways you can't call in advance. Pratt calls the result second to none, guaranteed.\n\nWith every pattern paid for but one, Pratt wrote a letter and sent me to his own teacher, Telonis, in Darnassus. Telonis read it and allowed that Pratt reminds him of a night elf sometimes, which I took to be the warmest thing Darnassus says about a human. Then the cloak pattern was mine. Few in the world know it, Telonis says."] = "普拉特‧馬克格魯比在羽月要塞教蠻皮手藝，一開始就跟我講明了，學的時候得替他幹活。我還以為是掃掃店鋪。他說的是護甲，由我來做，龜鱗的、夜色的，都是兩件一交，每筆訂單裡還得塞上一株野葡萄。\n\n門道全在野葡萄上。這東西力量強大又混亂無序，不管縫進什麼裡面，做出來的東西都會很強，只是強在哪裡，事先誰也說不準。普拉特說，這樣做出來的東西無與倫比，包你滿意。\n\n除了最後一張，所有圖樣我都付了帳。普拉特寫了一封信，要我去達納蘇斯找他自己的老師泰龍尼斯。泰龍尼斯讀完信，承認普拉特有時候讓他想起一個夜精靈。我覺得在達納蘇斯，這大概是對人類最熱情的評價了。接著，披風的圖樣就歸我了。泰龍尼斯說，世上知道這張圖樣的人可不多。"
L["Jangdor Swiftstrider teaches Wild Leather at Camp Mojache, and warned me up front that I'd be working for him while I learned. I pictured hauling hides. He meant armor, made by me and handed to him in pairs of turtle scale and nightscape, with a wildvine tucked into every order.\n\nThe wildvines are the trick. They're potent and chaotic, so whatever you stitch one into comes out strong in ways you can't call in advance. Jangdor calls the result second to none, guaranteed.\n\nWith every pattern paid for but one, Jangdor wrote a letter and sent me up to Thunder Bluff, to Una, who brought him into the craft. Una read it and was pleased to see one of her finest students with a student of his own. I was pleased to get the cloak pattern. Few in the world know it, Una says."] = "杉多爾‧迅蹄在莫沙徹營地教蠻皮手藝，一開始就跟我講明了，學的時候得替他幹活。我還以為是搬搬獸皮。他說的是護甲，由我來做，龜鱗的、夜色的，都是兩件一交，每筆訂單裡還得塞上一株野葡萄。\n\n門道全在野葡萄上。這東西力量強大又混亂無序，不管縫進什麼裡面，做出來的東西都會很強，只是強在哪裡，事先誰也說不準。杉多爾說，這樣做出來的東西無與倫比，包你滿意。\n\n除了最後一張，所有圖樣我都付了帳。杉多爾寫了一封信，要我上雷霆崖去找猶納，當年就是她帶他入的行。猶納讀完信，很高興看到自己最出色的學生之一也帶起了學生。我呢，很高興拿到了披風的圖樣。猶納說，世上知道這張圖樣的人可不多。"
L["Wild Leather Shoulders"] = "蠻皮護肩"
L["Wild Leather Vest"] = "蠻皮外衣"
L["Wild Leather Helmet"] = "蠻皮頭盔"
L["Wild Leather Boots"] = "蠻皮長靴"
L["Wild Leather Leggings"] = "蠻皮護腿"
L["Pratt McGrubben, Feathermoon Stronghold, then Telonis, Darnassus"] = "普拉特‧馬克格魯比，羽月要塞，接著前往泰龍尼斯，達納蘇斯"
L["Jangdor Swiftstrider"] = "杉多爾‧迅蹄"
L["Jangdor Swiftstrider, Camp Mojache, then Una, Thunder Bluff"] = "杉多爾‧迅蹄，莫沙徹營地，接著前往猶納，雷霆崖"
L["The Three Arts"] = "三門技藝"
L["The leatherworking trade has three high arts, and you may learn only one. Peter Galen in Azshara teaches dragonscale. Sarah Tanner in Searing Gorge teaches elemental leatherworking, and Caryssia Moonhunter at Thalanaar in Feralas teaches tribal. Each has a price for taking you on."] = "製皮這一行有三門高深的技藝，而你只能學其中一門。艾薩拉的彼得‧加林教龍鱗製皮，灼熱峽谷的薩拉‧坦尼教元素製皮，菲拉斯薩蘭納爾的凱雷希亞‧獵月教部族製皮。想拜他們為師，各有各的代價。"
L["The leatherworking trade has three high arts, and you may learn only one. Thorkaf Dragoneye in the Badlands teaches dragonscale. Brumn Winterhoof in the Arathi Highlands teaches elemental leatherworking, and Se'Jib in Stranglethorn Vale teaches tribal. Each has a price for taking you on."] = "製皮這一行有三門高深的技藝，而你只能學其中一門。荒蕪之地的索卡夫‧龍眼教龍鱗製皮，阿拉希高地的布魯姆‧冰蹄教元素製皮，荊棘谷的瑟伊布教部族製皮。想拜他們為師，各有各的代價。"
L["At the top, the leatherworking trade splits three ways, and each way has a master of its own. Every one of them asks for the same promise before teaching you a thing. Learn this art and the other two are closed to you for good.\n\nI thought it over longer than I'd admit to a customer. Then I made up my mind, gathered what my new master wanted, and went to make the promise."] = "製皮這一行做到頂，就分成三條路，每條路都有自己的大師。他們每一位在教你任何東西之前，都要你先許下同一個承諾。學了這門，另外兩門就永遠與你無緣。\n\n我考慮了很久，久到我不會跟顧客承認。然後我拿定主意，備齊了新師父要的東西，去許下了那個承諾。"
L["Dragonscale Leatherworking"] = "龍鱗製皮"
L["Peter Galen"] = "彼得‧加林"
L["Peter Galen, out in Azshara, teaches dragonscale and wanted two kinds of proof before taking me on. Samples of my best scorpid work came first, two breastplates and two pairs of gloves. Then ten worn dragonscales, to show I could get hold of the staple of the trade. Peter said it takes a strong will to make a permanent decision like mine. It takes a fair number of scorpids, too."] = "遠在艾薩拉的彼得‧加林教龍鱗製皮，收我之前要兩樣證明。先是我最好的蠍殼作品的樣品，兩件胸甲和兩副手套。然後是十片龍鱗，證明我弄得到這一行最基本的材料。彼得說，要做出像我這樣永久的決定，需要很強的意志。其實還需要不少蠍子。"
L["Thorkaf Dragoneye"] = "索卡夫‧龍眼"
L["Thorkaf Dragoneye teaches dragonscale out in the Badlands and wanted to see my scorpid work first, two breastplates and two pairs of gloves. Those I could make. The ten worn dragonscales I had to go out and find, which I suspect was the point. Once Thorkaf had the lot, the other two arts were closed to me, and I've been working in mail ever since."] = "索卡夫‧龍眼在荒蕪之地教龍鱗製皮，他想先看看我的蠍殼作品，兩件胸甲和兩副手套。這些我做得出來。那十片龍鱗就得我自己出門去找了，我懷疑這才是重點。等索卡夫拿齊了東西，另外兩門技藝就對我關上了門，從那以後我就一直在做鎖甲。"
L["Elemental Leatherworking"] = "元素製皮"
L["Sarah Tanner"] = "薩拉‧坦尼"
L["Sarah Tanner teaches elemental leatherworking in Searing Gorge and wanted proof that I was in tune with the elements, which meant bringing two each of their purest essences. Fire, water, earth and wind. I got them the usual way, off the elementals themselves. Sarah said the elements accepted me. They hadn't seemed to at the time."] = "薩拉‧坦尼在灼熱峽谷教元素製皮，她要我證明自己與元素心意相通，也就是把它們最純粹的精華各帶兩份回來。火、水、土、風。我用的是老辦法，直接從元素生物身上弄。薩拉說元素接納了我。當時可一點也看不出來。"
L["Brumn Winterhoof"] = "布魯姆‧冰蹄"
L["Brumn Winterhoof teaches elemental leatherworking out in the Arathi Highlands, and a place cost two each of the elements' essences, hearts of fire, globes of water, cores of earth and breaths of wind. I got them the usual way, off the elementals themselves, who had opinions about it. Once Brumn had them all, the other two arts were closed to me."] = "布魯姆‧冰蹄在阿拉希高地教元素製皮，想拜他為師，就得交上火焰之心、純水之球、大地之核和風之氣息各兩份。我用的是老辦法，直接從元素生物身上弄，它們對此頗有意見。等布魯姆收齊了，另外兩門技藝就對我關上了門。"
L["Tribal Leatherworking"] = "部族製皮"
L["Caryssia Moonhunter"] = "凱雷希亞‧獵月"
L["Caryssia Moonhunter teaches tribal leatherworking at Thalanaar, on the eastern edge of Feralas, and asked first for an offering to nature. Nature, it seems, wanted my finest Wild Leather, a vest and a helmet. I'd have liked to see nature wear them. Caryssia took them on nature's behalf and promised I'd soon be bending it to my will."] = "凱雷希亞‧獵月在菲拉斯東邊的薩蘭納爾教部族製皮，她先要我向自然獻上一份祭品。看來自然想要的是我最好的蠻皮作品，一件外衣和一頂頭盔。我倒真想看看自然穿上它們是什麼樣子。凱雷希亞代自然收下了，還向我保證，用不了多久我就能讓自然聽我使喚。"
L["Se'Jib"] = "瑟伊布"
L["Se'Jib teaches tribal leatherworking southeast of Grom'gol, in Stranglethorn, and asked first for an offering to nature. Nature wanted my finest Wild Leather, a vest and a helmet. I'd have liked to see nature wear them. Se'Jib took them on nature's behalf, and after that the other two arts were closed to me."] = "瑟伊布在荊棘谷格羅姆高的東南邊教部族製皮，他先要我向自然獻上一份祭品。自然想要的是我最好的蠻皮作品，一件外衣和一頂頭盔。我倒真想看看自然穿上它們是什麼樣子。瑟伊布代自然收下了，從那以後，另外兩門技藝就對我關上了門。"
-- WoW Forever secret: The Dawn Waker
L["The Dawn Waker"] = "黎明喚醒者"
L["An old ring from Zephras Isle, dented, with Kaldorei writing worn into the band. A hilt in the ruins of Ban'aethal that only shows itself by torchlight. Ealaane Nimbuswalker knows something about the blade that once fit it.\n\nThis is a secret, and its end hasn't been found yet. The trail crosses Kalimdor as far as anyone has followed it, and some of it takes a group."] = "一枚來自微風島的舊戒指，坑坑疤疤，指環上的卡多雷文字已經磨得很淺。班奈薩爾廢墟裡有一把劍柄，只在火光下才會現身。伊菈安‧雲行者知道一些關於那把曾與它相配的劍刃的事。\n\n這是一個秘密，結局至今還沒有人找到。就大家目前追到的地方而言，這條線索橫跨了卡林多，有些路段還得組隊才能走。"
L["Zephras Isle / Darkshore / Ashenvale / Shen'dralas / Feralas / Azshara / Winterspring / Mount Hyjal"] = "微風島 / 黑海岸 / 梣谷 / 申德拉斯 / 菲拉斯 / 艾薩拉 / 冬泉谷 / 海加爾山"
L["The Ancient Hilt"] = "遠古劍柄"
L["Ancient Hilt"] = "遠古劍柄"
L["the Ruins of Ban'aethal, Zephras Isle"] = "班奈薩爾廢墟，微風島"
L["the Grove of the Ancients, Darkshore"] = "古樹之林，黑海岸"
L["Zoram Strand, Ashenvale"] = "左拉姆海岸，梣谷"
L["The Ancient Heirloom"] = "古老傳家寶"
L["Rorian the Dayseeker hands an old ring to every Skyborne who comes of age in Thendal Village, and another lies upstairs in a house close by. Wear it, carry a Night Watchman's Torch into the ruins of Ban'aethal, and see what the light turns up. Ealaane Nimbuswalker will want to hear about it."] = "在坦德爾村，每個成年的天裔精靈都會從『尋日者』羅里安手中拿到一枚舊戒指，附近一棟房子的樓上還放著另一枚。戴上它，帶著暗夜守衛者火炬走進班奈薩爾廢墟，看看火光會照出什麼。伊菈安‧雲行者會想聽聽這件事的。"
L["I came by an old ring on Zephras Isle. It's dented, and the inside of the band carries a line of Kaldorei script worn so thin I could barely read it. I put it on because it fit.\n\nThere's a dragon asleep in the ruins of Ban'aethal and a hilt there that only shows up by torchlight. I let the dragon sleep and took the hilt to Ealaane Nimbuswalker. She went quiet for a while, then asked me to find the blade that belonged with it.\n\nThe blade wasn't anywhere you'd look on purpose, and I looked in a lot of places before I found it. Ealaane gave it its name, Eluvi'ana, the Night Dancer, and handed it back to me with the hilt. She watched the hilt until I put it away."] = "我在微風島弄到了一枚舊戒指。上面有凹痕，指環內側刻著一行卡多雷文字，磨得太淺，我差點認不出來。我把它戴上了，因為大小正合適。\n\n班奈薩爾廢墟裡睡著一條龍，那裡還有一把劍柄，只在火光下才會現身。我讓那條龍接著睡，把劍柄帶去給伊菈安‧雲行者。她沉默了好一陣子，然後請我去找那把本該和它配成一對的劍刃。\n\n那把劍刃不在任何人會特意去找的地方，我找了很多地方才找到。伊菈安為它取了名字，伊露維娜，夜之舞者，然後把它連同劍柄一起還給我。在我把劍柄收起來之前，她的目光一直沒離開過它。"
L["Ancient Heirloom"] = "古老傳家寶"
L["Get the Ancient Heirloom. Rorian the Dayseeker gives one to the Skyborne once they come of age, and another lies on the top floor of a house close by."] = "取得古老傳家寶。『尋日者』羅里安會把它交給成年的天裔精靈，附近一棟房子的頂樓還放著另一枚。"
L["Eluvi'ana"] = "伊露維娜"
L["Ealaane Nimbuswalker"] = "伊菈安‧雲行者"
L["The Befouled Water Globe"] = "受汙染的水球"
L["The naga in Darkshore's Ruins of Mathystra each carry a piece of an old amulet. Put it together and take it to the water by the ruins, and something that has guarded them a long time will come up to meet you."] = "黑海岸瑪塞斯特拉廢墟的納迦，每個身上都帶著一塊舊護符的碎片。把護符拼起來，帶到廢墟旁的水邊，某個守護這片廢墟已久的東西就會浮上來見你。"
L["Baron Aquanis, a water elemental in the flooded halls of Blackfathom Deeps, guards a globe of strange water. Je'neu Sancrea of the Earthen Ring, at Zoram'gar Outpost, would very much like to see it."] = "阿奎尼斯男爵是一隻水元素，待在黑澗深淵被水淹沒的大廳裡，守著一顆奇怪的水球。陶土議會的耶努薩克雷就在左拉姆加前哨站，他非常想看看這顆水球。"
L["The naga in the Ruins of Mathystra carry an old amulet around in pieces, a few to each naga. Twenty pieces later I had the whole thing, and at the water by the ruins it called up Baron Marinous. He came up angry and didn't last, and he left a clouded glass globe behind.\n\nI took the globe to Onu in the Grove of the Ancients. Onu held it a long while before giving it back, and by then the water inside had gone dark and foul. I've carried it around ever since."] = "瑪塞斯特拉廢墟的納迦帶著一枚舊護符到處跑，只不過是拆成碎片帶的，每個納迦身上幾塊。湊滿二十塊之後，我拼出了完整的護符，在廢墟旁的水邊，它把馬里諾斯男爵召了上來。他一上來就怒氣沖沖，沒撐多久，留下了一顆霧濛濛的玻璃水球。\n\n我把水球帶到古樹之林交給安努。安努捧著它過了很久才還給我，那時裡面的水已經變得又黑又臭。從那以後，我就一直帶著它。"
L["Baron Aquanis keeps to the flooded halls of Blackfathom Deeps. He's a water elemental, so keeping to anything is a loose way to put it. He left a globe of strange water behind, and Je'neu Sancrea of the Earthen Ring wanted a look.\n\nJe'neu studied it for a long time. When I asked for the globe back, he gave it to me. The water inside had gone dark and foul, and I've carried it around ever since."] = "阿奎尼斯男爵一直待在黑澗深淵那些被淹沒的大廳裡。他是一隻水元素，說他「待」在哪裡，本來就只是個大概的說法。他留下了一顆奇怪的水球，陶土議會的耶努薩克雷想看一看。\n\n耶努薩克雷研究了很久。我開口要回水球，他就還給了我。裡面的水已經變得又黑又臭，從那以後我就一直帶著它。"
L["Mathystral Amulet"] = "瑪塞斯特拉護符"
L["the Ruins of Mathystra, Darkshore"] = "瑪塞斯特拉廢墟，黑海岸"
L["Collect 20 Mathystral Amulet Fragments from the naga in the Ruins of Mathystra and put the amulet together."] = "從瑪塞斯特拉廢墟的納迦身上收集20塊瑪塞斯特拉護符碎片，把護符拼合起來。"
L["Baron Marinous"] = "馬里諾斯男爵"
L["Clouded Water Globe"] = "雲霧水球"
L["the water by the Ruins of Mathystra, Darkshore"] = "瑪塞斯特拉廢墟旁的水邊，黑海岸"
L["Befouled Water Globe"] = "受汙染的水球"
L["Onu"] = "安努"
L["Speak with Onu again and ask for the globe back."] = "再次與安努交談，要回水球。"
L["Speak with Je'neu Sancrea again and ask for the globe back."] = "再次與耶努薩克雷交談，要回水球。"
L["The Highborne Spirit"] = "高等精靈靈魂"
L["Wear the old ring on Zoram Strand, in Ashenvale, with the befouled globe in your pack, and you won't be alone on the beach for long."] = "背包裡裝著那顆受汙染的水球，戴上舊戒指前往梣谷的左拉姆海岸，你在海灘上不會孤單太久。"
L["On Zoram Strand, with the ring on my finger and the globe in my pack, I met a Highborne spirit who had been waiting a very long time for someone carrying exactly that. He sent me up the Tower of Althalaxx in Darkshore.\n\nAthrikus Narassin keeps the top of that tower, and he kept the key to the strongbox behind him on his belt. Inside the box was his tome. I brought it back to the beach, and the spirit sent me on to Shen'dralas."] = "在左拉姆海岸，我手上戴著戒指，背包裡裝著水球，遇見了一個高等精靈的靈魂。他等了很久很久，等的就是帶著這兩樣東西的人。他要我去爬黑海岸的奧薩拉克斯之塔。\n\n埃瑟里克斯·納拉辛佔據著那座塔的塔頂，他身後那個保險箱的鑰匙，原本掛在他的腰帶上。箱子裡是他的典籍。我把它帶回海灘，那個靈魂又打發我去了申德拉斯。"
L["Narassin's Tome"] = "納拉辛的典籍"
L["Highborne Spirit"] = "高等精靈靈魂"
L["Wear the Ancient Heirloom and speak with the Highborne Spirit on Zoram Strand while carrying the Befouled Water Globe. Then take the Azsharan Key from Athrikus Narassin at the top of the Tower of Althalaxx in Darkshore and open the strongbox behind him."] = "攜帶受汙染的水球，戴上古老傳家寶，與左拉姆海岸的高等精靈靈魂交談。接著從黑海岸奧薩拉克斯之塔頂端的埃瑟里克斯·納拉辛身上取得艾薩拉鑰匙，打開他身後的保險箱。"
L["Synthesis"] = "合成"
L["Mordent Evenshade, outside the temple in Shen'dralas, knows what Narassin's Tome is for. Bring him the tome with the hilt, the Night Dancer and the globe, and he'll tell you what it takes to make the water clean again. Some of it takes a group of five."] = "申德拉斯神殿外的莫登特‧暮影知道納拉辛的典籍有什麼用處。把典籍連同劍柄、夜之舞者和水球一起帶給他，他會告訴你要怎樣才能讓水恢復潔淨。其中有些事需要五人隊伍。"
L["Mordent Evenshade read Narassin's tome and told me the globe needed a Star of Elune, an Abyssal Mote and the Tears of Anguish, none of them anywhere near Shen'dralas.\n\nThe star sat in a vault in the ogre temple in southern Feralas, a vault you only see with the ring on. Opening it took five of us, four pulling switches around the temple at once and one at the vault. The mote was in a chest at the bottom of the sea off Azshara. The tears came off the Highborne ghosts at Lake Kel'theril, and only some of them had any to give."] = "莫登特‧暮影讀了納拉辛的典籍，告訴我這顆水球需要一顆伊露恩之星、一顆深淵微粒，還有苦痛之淚，而這些東西沒有一樣在申德拉斯附近。\n\n那顆星放在菲拉斯南部巨魔神殿的一座寶庫裡，那座寶庫只有戴著戒指才看得見。打開它要五個人，四個人在神殿各處同時拉下開關，一個人守在寶庫前。微粒在艾薩拉外海海底的一個箱子裡。淚水是從凱斯利爾湖的高等精靈鬼魂身上拿到的，而且不是每個鬼魂都有得給。"
L["Star of Elune"] = "伊露恩之星"
L["the ogre temple in southern Feralas"] = "菲拉斯南部的巨魔神殿"
L["Wear the Ancient Heirloom and find the Shen'dralar Vault on the temple's ground floor. Four Ancient Switches around the temple must be pulled at the same moment to open it, so bring four friends."] = "戴上古老傳家寶，在神殿一樓找到辛德拉寶庫。要打開它，必須同時拉下神殿各處的四個遠古開關，所以帶上四個朋友。"
L["Abyssal Mote"] = "深淵微粒"
L["under the water off Azshara"] = "艾薩拉外海的水下"
L["Finish the quests that begin with Kirith and end with Azsharite, then open the Abyssal Chest under the water in Azshara."] = "完成從「基利斯」開始、到「艾薩拉水晶」結束的系列任務，然後打開艾薩拉水下的深淵寶箱。"
L["Tears of Anguish"] = "苦痛之淚"
L["Lake Kel'theril, Winterspring"] = "凱斯利爾湖，冬泉谷"
L["Once Mordent Evenshade has told you what the globe needs, take the Tears of Anguish from the Anguished Highborne and Suffering Highborne at Lake Kel'theril."] = "在莫登特‧暮影告訴你水球需要什麼之後，從凱斯利爾湖的痛苦的高等精靈和受難的高等精靈身上取得苦痛之淚。"
L["The Shrine of Coalescence"] = "聚合聖壇"
L["With the star, the mote and the tears in hand, Mordent sends you to Hyjal, to the Shrine of Coalescence."] = "伊露恩之星、深淵微粒和苦痛之淚都已到手，莫登特要你前往海加爾山的聚合聖壇。"
L["At the Shrine of Coalescence in Hyjal I laid out the star, the mote and the tears and used the globe, and the water inside it cleared.\n\nWith the water clear I could see what the globe was. It held the last of an elemental that once guarded a Highborne city, and I had met that elemental at the bottom of its own ruins and killed it. When I brought the globe back to Shen'dralas, Mordent didn't hold that against me."] = "在海加爾山的聚合聖壇，我擺好了星、微粒和淚水，用了水球，裡面的水就變清了。\n\n水清了，我才看出這顆水球是什麼。裡面裝著一個元素最後殘存的部分，它曾經守護過一座高等精靈的城市，而我在它自己的廢墟底下遇見了它，還把它殺了。我把水球帶回申德拉斯的時候，莫登特倒也沒為這件事跟我計較。"
L["Cleansed Water Globe"] = "淨化的水球"
L["the Shrine of Coalescence, Mount Hyjal"] = "聚合聖壇，海加爾山"
L["Take the Star of Elune, the Abyssal Mote and the Tears of Anguish to the Shrine of Coalescence in Hyjal, and use the Befouled Water Globe there."] = "把伊露恩之星、深淵微粒和苦痛之淚帶到海加爾山的聚合聖壇，在那裡使用受汙染的水球。"
L["The Two Blades"] = "兩把劍"
L["Mordent has heard the clean globe out, and sends you to the last prince of Eldre'Thalas in Dire Maul. Prince Tortheldrin remembers two blades. This is as far as anyone has followed the Dawn Waker so far."] = "莫登特聽完了淨化後的水球要說的話，要你去厄運之槌找埃德薩拉斯的最後一位王子。托塞德林王子記得兩把劍。到目前為止，大家追尋黎明喚醒者，也只走到這一步。"
L["Mordent sent me to Dire Maul, to Prince Tortheldrin, who spoke of two blades, Eluvi'ana and Eluvi'tor, and of knowledge kept for those honored in his court. I had one of the blades on my belt already.\n\nLorekeeper Lydros made me an Arcanum of Binding out of a libram, a black diamond, two brilliant shards and an arcane crystal, and I bound the old hilt with it. When I went back, the prince gave me a scrawled note. It's a short riddle. Day has to wake where night dances, and something has to be cast in flames born of air.\n\nThat's where the trail stops for now, for me and for everyone else hunting it. I keep the hilt and the Night Dancer together, in case the answer turns up."] = "莫登特要我去厄運之槌找托塞德林王子。王子說起了兩把劍，伊露維娜和伊露維托，還說起一些只留給他宮廷中受敬重之人的學識。其中一把劍，早就掛在我的腰帶上了。\n\n博學者萊德羅斯用一本聖典、一顆黑鑽石、兩塊魔光碎片和一塊秘法水晶，替我做了一份束縛秘藥，我用它束縛了那把舊劍柄。我回去之後，王子給了我一張潦草的字條，上面是一個簡短的謎語。白晝必須在黑夜起舞之處醒來，還有某樣東西必須在生於空氣的火焰中鑄成。\n\n線索暫時就斷在這裡，對我是這樣，對其他所有追尋它的人也是。我把劍柄和夜之舞者放在一起，以防哪天答案自己冒出來。"
L["Libram of Binding"] = "束縛聖典"
L["Dire Maul, Feralas"] = "厄運之槌，菲拉斯"
L["Scrawled Note"] = "潦草的字條"
L["Prince Tortheldrin"] = "托塞德林王子"
L["Use the Arcanum of Binding on the Ancient Hilt, then speak with Prince Tortheldrin again. The note's riddle is still unsolved."] = "對遠古劍柄使用束縛秘藥，然後再次與托塞德林王子交談。字條上的謎語至今無人解開。"
-- WoW Forever: Strahnbrad Mystery
L["Strahnbrad Mystery"] = "斯坦恩布萊德謎團"
L["Strahnbrad is a ruined town in the Alterac Mountains, and the Syndicate runs its business from there. The Syndicate is a gang of thieves led by Alterac's old nobility. Southshore wants them gone, and Tarren Mill has put a price on one of their barons.\n\nThe gang has a mystery of its own. The casters in Strahnbrad pass around a singed note about the old bellows at the town forge, which are said to come to life when no one is watching."] = "斯坦恩布萊德是奧特蘭克山脈中一座成了廢墟的小鎮，辛迪加就在那裡做生意。辛迪加是一夥由奧特蘭克舊貴族領導的盜賊。南海鎮想除掉他們，塔倫米爾則對他們的一位男爵發出了懸賞。\n\n這夥人自己也有一樁謎團。斯坦恩布萊德的施法者們傳閱著一張燒焦的紙條，說的是鎮上熔爐邊那對舊風箱，據說沒人看著的時候，它們就會活過來。"
L["Southshore's last magistrate was murdered, and the killers were never found. Magistrate Henry Maleb, the new one, is almost certain they were hired by the Syndicate, a gang of thieves led by the old nobles of fallen Alterac.\n\nThe Syndicate keeps a camp in the mountains north of Tarren Mill and its headquarters in the ruins of Strahnbrad. Maleb would like to begin with the camp."] = "南海鎮的上一任鎮長遭到謀殺，兇手始終沒有找到。新任的赫尼·馬雷布鎮長幾乎可以肯定，兇手是辛迪加僱來的。辛迪加是一夥盜賊，首領是已經覆滅的奧特蘭克王國的舊貴族。\n\n辛迪加在塔倫米爾以北的山裡有一處營地，總部則設在斯坦恩布萊德的廢墟中。馬雷布想先從營地下手。"
L["A wanted poster in Tarren Mill names Baron Vardus, one of the old Alterac nobles who lead the Syndicate, a gang of thieves in the mountains to the north. High Executor Darthalia wants his head.\n\nThe Syndicate's headquarters is the ruined town of Strahnbrad. The casters there pass around a singed note about the old bellows at the town forge, which are said to come to life when no one is watching."] = "塔倫米爾的一張通緝告示上寫著瓦杜斯男爵的名字。他是領導辛迪加的奧特蘭克舊貴族之一，辛迪加則是北邊山裡的一夥盜賊。高階執行官達薩利亞想要他的人頭。\n\n辛迪加的總部設在成了廢墟的小鎮斯坦恩布萊德。那裡的施法者們傳閱著一張燒焦的紙條，說的是鎮上熔爐邊那對舊風箱，據說沒人看著的時候，它們就會活過來。"
L["Alterac Mountains / Hillsbrad Foothills"] = "奧特蘭克山脈 / 希爾斯布萊德丘陵"
L["Syndicate Assassins"] = "辛迪加刺客"
L["Magistrate Henry Maleb"] = "赫尼·馬雷布鎮長"
L["the Syndicate camp at Sofera's Naze, Alterac Mountains"] = "索菲亞高地的辛迪加營地，奧特蘭克山脈"
L["the wanted poster in Tarren Mill, Hillsbrad Foothills"] = "塔倫米爾的通緝告示，希爾斯布萊德丘陵"
L["Southshore's new magistrate, Henry Maleb, has the job because the last one was murdered. The killers were never found, but Maleb's clues point to a Syndicate camp in the mountains north of Tarren Mill. Find him in the town hall."] = "南海鎮的新任鎮長赫尼·馬雷布能坐上這個位子，是因為上一任遭人謀殺。兇手始終沒有找到，但馬雷布掌握的線索指向塔倫米爾以北山裡的一處辛迪加營地。去市政廳找他吧。"
L["Southshore's new magistrate has the job because the last one was murdered, and Henry Maleb is almost certain the Syndicate paid for it. His clues led to a Syndicate camp in the mountains north of Tarren Mill, so I went up and started on their footpads and thieves.\n\nOn a table in the camp at Sofera's Naze lay a list of supplies, everything from food to masks and poison, wanted in a hurry for what it called an important mission against Southshore. Maleb found it very troubling and decided the Syndicate had declared war on his town.\n\nThe gang is run by Alterac's old nobles, who hide among the common members. You tell them apart by the signet ring, Maleb said. I brought seven back from the ruins of Strahnbrad, and the magistrate said the Syndicate was now just a gang of thugs. I'd thought of them that way from the start."] = "南海鎮的新鎮長能坐上這個位子，是因為上一任遭人謀殺，而赫尼·馬雷布幾乎可以肯定，出錢的是辛迪加。他的線索指向塔倫米爾以北山裡的一處辛迪加營地，於是我上了山，先從他們的劫匪和竊賊下手。\n\n索菲亞高地營地裡的一張桌子上放著一份補給清單，從食物到面具和毒藥應有盡有，要得很急，說是為了一項針對南海鎮的重要任務。馬雷布覺得這件事非常令人不安，認定辛迪加已經向他的小鎮宣戰了。\n\n這夥人由奧特蘭克的舊貴族掌管，他們藏在普通成員中間。馬雷布說，要靠徽記之戒才能認出他們。我從斯坦恩布萊德的廢墟裡帶回了七枚，鎮長說辛迪加現在不過是一群暴徒了。我從一開始就是這麼看他們的。"
L["Foreboding Plans"] = "預備行動計畫"
L["Syndicate Documents"] = "辛迪加文件"
L["Noble Deaths"] = "貴族之死"
L["Baron Vardus"] = "瓦杜斯男爵"
L["Shadowy Assassins still slip into Southshore now and then, and one of them carries a contract. Take it and bring it to Magistrate Maleb in the town hall, who will want to know whose name is on it."] = "暗影刺客仍會不時潛入南海鎮，其中一個身上帶著一份契約。把它拿到手，交給市政廳裡的馬雷布鎮長，他會想知道上面寫的是誰的名字。"
L["A wanted poster in Tarren Mill names Baron Vardus, one of the old Alterac nobles who lead the Syndicate up in the mountains. High Executor Darthalia will pay for his head."] = "塔倫米爾的一張通緝告示上寫著瓦杜斯男爵的名字，他是在山裡領導辛迪加的奧特蘭克舊貴族之一。高階執行官達薩利亞會為他的人頭付賞金。"
L["The Syndicate hadn't given up on Southshore. Their assassins still slipped into town now and then, and one I killed was carrying a contract, which seems careless for someone in that trade. I took it to Maleb.\n\nAfter reading it, the magistrate wanted the head of Baron Vardus, one of the nobles who lead the Syndicate. Vardus moves around the Alterac Mountains, so finding him took some walking, and getting the head off him took less time than that. I brought it back down to Southshore and handed it over."] = "辛迪加並沒有放過南海鎮。他們的刺客仍會不時溜進鎮裡，我殺掉的一個身上還帶著一份契約，對幹這一行的人來說，這可有點粗心。我把契約交給了馬雷布。\n\n鎮長讀完之後，想要瓦杜斯男爵的人頭，他是領導辛迪加的貴族之一。瓦杜斯在奧特蘭克山脈裡四處走動，所以找他費了不少腳力，把他的頭拿下來倒沒花那麼久。我把頭帶回山下的南海鎮，交了上去。"
L["There's a wanted poster up in Tarren Mill for Baron Vardus. The Syndicate is a gang of thieves led by what's left of Alterac's nobility, and Vardus is one of those nobles. The poster still calls him Baron, which is more courtesy than most wanted men get.\n\nHigh Executor Darthalia wanted his head. Vardus moves around the Alterac Mountains, so finding him took some walking, and getting the head off him took less time than that. I carried it back down to Tarren Mill and collected the bounty from Darthalia."] = "塔倫米爾貼著一張瓦杜斯男爵的通緝告示。辛迪加是一夥盜賊，領頭的是奧特蘭克貴族的殘餘，瓦杜斯就是其中之一。告示上還尊稱他一聲男爵，大多數通緝犯可沒這份禮遇。\n\n高階執行官達薩利亞想要他的人頭。瓦杜斯在奧特蘭克山脈裡四處走動，所以找他費了不少腳力，把他的頭拿下來倒沒花那麼久。我把頭帶回山下的塔倫米爾，從達薩利亞那裡領了賞金。"
L["Assassin's Contract"] = "刺客的契約"
L["the Shadowy Assassins, Southshore, Hillsbrad Foothills"] = "暗影刺客所在處，南海鎮，希爾斯布萊德丘陵"
L["Baron's Demise"] = "男爵之死"
L["WANTED: Baron Vardus"] = "通緝：瓦杜斯男爵"
L["The Syndicate's casters in Strahnbrad carry a singed note. Rumor has it the old bellows at the town forge come to life when no one is watching. The note is scorched as if by fire magic, and the forge might want a taste of the same."] = "斯坦恩布萊德的辛迪加施法者身上帶著一張燒焦的紙條。傳言說，鎮上熔爐邊的舊風箱會在沒人看著的時候活過來。紙條像是被火焰魔法燒焦的，那座熔爐說不定也想嘗嘗同樣的滋味。"
L["One of the Syndicate's casters in Strahnbrad had a singed note on them. According to the note, the old bellows at the town forge had a mind of their own and came to life when no one was watching. Whoever wrote it wanted the matter cleared up before coming back, ghost story or not.\n\nSo I went and watched the bellows. They did nothing, which to be fair is what the rumor said they'd do. Then I gave each of them some fire. A flare went up over my head both times, and after the second an ancient fire elemental came out of the top of the forge and landed between them.\n\nIt was made of fire and didn't mind more of it, so I put it out the hard way. Afterward I took my findings down to Kundric Zanden, the town historian in Southshore."] = "斯坦恩布萊德的一個辛迪加施法者身上帶著一張燒焦的紙條。照紙條上的說法，鎮上熔爐邊那對舊風箱有自己的主意，沒人看著的時候就會活過來。寫紙條的人希望在自己回來之前把這件事弄清楚，管它是不是鬼故事。\n\n於是我去盯著那對風箱看。它們什麼也沒做，說句公道話，傳言裡本來就是這麼說的。然後我給它們各來了一把火。兩次都有一道火光從我頭頂升起，第二次之後，一個遠古火元素從熔爐頂上冒了出來，落在兩個風箱中間。\n\n它本身就是火做的，再多點火也不在乎，所以我只好硬碰硬地把它撲滅。之後我下山去了南海鎮，把我的發現告訴了鎮上的歷史學家昆迪瑞克·贊德恩。"
L["One of the Syndicate's casters in Strahnbrad had a singed note on them. According to the note, the old bellows at the town forge had a mind of their own and came to life when no one was watching. Whoever wrote it wanted the matter cleared up before coming back, ghost story or not.\n\nSo I went and watched the bellows. They did nothing, which to be fair is what the rumor said they'd do. Then I gave each of them some fire. A flare went up over my head both times, and after the second an ancient fire elemental came out of the top of the forge and landed between them.\n\nIt was made of fire and didn't mind more of it, so I put it out the hard way. Afterward I took my findings down to Shara Blazen in Tarren Mill."] = "斯坦恩布萊德的一個辛迪加施法者身上帶著一張燒焦的紙條。照紙條上的說法，鎮上熔爐邊那對舊風箱有自己的主意，沒人看著的時候就會活過來。寫紙條的人希望在自己回來之前把這件事弄清楚，管它是不是鬼故事。\n\n於是我去盯著那對風箱看。它們什麼也沒做，說句公道話，傳言裡本來就是這麼說的。然後我給它們各來了一把火。兩次都有一道火光從我頭頂升起，第二次之後，一個遠古火元素從熔爐頂上冒了出來，落在兩個風箱中間。\n\n它本身就是火做的，再多點火也不在乎，所以我只好硬碰硬地把它撲滅。之後我下山回到塔倫米爾，把我的發現告訴了莎拉·布拉森。"
L["the Syndicate Wizards and Argus Shadow Mages, Strahnbrad, Alterac Mountains"] = "辛迪加巫師和阿古斯暗影法師所在處，斯坦恩布萊德，奧特蘭克山脈"
