L["The spirit totem wasn't enough, it turned out. Bath'rah wanted voodoo in it, and the strongest voodoo around was in the feathers of six trolls down in the Sunken Temple. They were still using them. I took them anyway.\n\nBath'rah worked the feathers into the totem and announced it was about time a troll got a full night's rest, then handed me something from a long life of collecting, for my trouble. The spirits of that place still don't care for Bath'rah. Now they have to get past the totem first."] = "結果，光有靈魂圖騰還不夠。巴斯拉想在裡面加點巫毒，而附近最強的巫毒，就在沉沒的神廟底下六個食人妖的羽毛裡。他們還在用那些羽毛呢。我還是拿走了。\n\n巴斯拉把羽毛編進圖騰，宣布也該讓食人妖好好睡上一整晚了，然後從他漫長一生累積的收藏裡拿了一樣東西給我，當作辛苦費。那地方的靈魂到現在還是看巴斯拉不順眼。只不過現在，它們得先過圖騰這一關。"
L["Master Gadrin turned the spider god's true name into a spell of summoning and sent me to read it at the altar of Shadra'Alor, deep in Witherbark country. I read it, and Shadra came. The Witherbark get their strongest venom from her. Now so did I.\n\nApothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill was delighted. One drop had killed nearly two dozen rabbits, he told me, though he admitted some of them had been very small. He wanted a sample sent to his superior in the Undercity, so I carried it there, and the Royal Apothecary Society called my service undeniable. Nobody asked the rabbits."] = "加德林大師把蜘蛛之神的真名化為一道召喚法術，派我到枯木食人妖地盤深處的沙德拉洛祭壇去唸。我唸了，沙德拉就來了。枯木食人妖最強的毒液就是從她那裡取得的。這回我也取得了。\n\n塔倫米爾的藥劑師林度恩樂壞了。他跟我說，一滴就毒死了將近兩打兔子，不過他也承認，其中有幾隻個頭很小。他想把樣本送去給他在幽暗城的上司，所以我把它送了過去，皇家藥劑師協會說我的貢獻無可否認。沒人問過兔子的意見。"
L["Grimshade kept his end of the bargain. He asked for room to work and warned me that if the ritual went wrong, I'd better close my eyes. It didn't. Sharpbeak was in a cage at the top of Jintha'Alor, and the high priestess of the Vilebranch trolls had the key.\n\nGryphon Master Talonaxe took the news about as calmly as a dwarf can, which is to say not at all. So up I went, all the way to the top of Jintha'Alor, took the key off the priestess, and opened the cage.\n\nSharpbeak's parents flew home with him and fussed over him like new parents, and Talonaxe admitted to a little mist in the eyes. The gryphons of Aerie Peak will sing my name, he says, for a long, long time."] = "格希德遵守了約定。他要我讓出空間讓他做事，還警告我，要是儀式出了差錯，我最好閉上眼睛。沒出差錯。沙普比克被關在辛薩羅山頂的一個籠子裡，鑰匙在邪枝食人妖的高階女祭司手上。\n\n獅鷲獸管理員沙拉克·鷹斧聽到這消息，拿出了一個矮人所能有的全部冷靜，也就是說，完全沒有。於是我上去了，一路爬到辛薩羅的最頂端，從女祭司身上拿走鑰匙，打開了籠子。\n\n沙普比克的爸媽帶著牠飛回家，圍著牠團團轉，像頭一回當爸媽似的，鷹斧也承認自己眼眶有點濕。他說，鷹巢山的獅鷲會傳唱我的名字，很久很久。"
L["Through an oathstone of the green dragonflight, a dragon named Itharius spoke straight into my mind. If I gave him the gem that had chained what was left of Eranikus, we would work together to redeem him. I gave it up. Itharius said my choices so far had been the right ones, and that my deeds from here on would decide whether that continued. No pressure.\n\nFirst we needed to speak with Eranikus through the gem, so Itharius sent me to the far east of Winterspring, to a medium named Umbranse who speaks for the dead. Umbranse was willing. But his best augury device had been taken from him, and without it there was nothing to be done.\n\nI'm still waiting to hear who took it."] = "透過一塊綠龍軍團的誓言石，一條名叫伊薩里奧斯的龍直接在我腦海裡說話。他說，只要我把那顆禁錮著伊蘭尼庫斯殘存部分的寶石交給他，我們就能一起救贖伊蘭尼庫斯。我交出去了。伊薩里奧斯說，我到目前為止的選擇都是對的，至於接下來還能不能一直對下去，就看我往後的所作所為了。一點壓力都沒有。\n\n首先我們得透過寶石跟伊蘭尼庫斯對話，所以伊薩里奧斯派我到冬泉谷的最東邊，去找一個名叫阿姆布蘭希的靈媒，他能替死者發聲。阿姆布蘭希很願意幫忙。可是他最好的占卜器具被人拿走了，少了它，什麼都做不成。\n\n到底是誰拿走的，我還在等消息。"
L["The discs from Uldaman had a sequel. Their glyphs mentioned Uldum, a place in the Tanaris desert most people call a myth, and the scholars back home wanted me to carry the discs to its sealed gates and see what happened. Nobody could say what would. They seemed to think that was the exciting part.\n\nAt the gates I touched a pedestal, the discs hummed in my pack, and another stone watcher sprang up, every bit as polite as the first. It was a guardian of entry, it said, and my discs were missing the Plates of Uldum.\n\nNobody knows where the plates are. The scholars put the whole thing on hold and paid me an honorarium. Uldum beckons, they told me. It'll have to keep beckoning."] = "奧達曼的圓盤還有續集。圓盤上的符文提到了奧丹姆，一個位在塔納利斯沙漠、大多數人都當成神話的地方。家鄉那邊的學者們想要我把圓盤帶到它那扇被封印的大門前，看看會發生什麼事。沒人說得準會發生什麼。他們似乎覺得這才是最刺激的部分。\n\n到了門口，我碰了一下石座，背包裡的圓盤嗡嗡作響，接著又冒出一個石衛兵，跟第一個一樣彬彬有禮。它說它是入口的守護者，還說我的圓盤少了奧丹姆板片。\n\n沒人知道那些板片在哪裡。學者們把整件事擱置下來，付了我一筆酬金。他們說，奧丹姆在召喚。那就讓它繼續召喚吧。"
L["Divine Retribution"] = "神聖的懲戒"
L["The Flawless Flame"] = "無瑕之焰"
L["Forging the Shaft"] = "鑄造火炬桿"
L["The Flame's Casing"] = "烈焰之盒"
L["The Torch of Retribution"] = "懲戒火炬"
L["Squire Maltrake"] = "侍衛瑪特拉克"
L["Set Them Ablaze!"] = "燒掉它們！"
L["Trinkets..."] = "打開箱子…"
L["Broodling Essence"] = "雛龍精華"
L["Chillwind Horns"] = "冰風奇美拉角"
L["Return to Tinkee"] = "返回丁奇身邊"
L["Velarok Windblade"] = "維拉若克‧溫布雷"
L["Hoard of the Black Dragonflight"] = "黑龍的財寶"
L["Battered Dwarven Skeleton"] = "殘破的矮人骷髏"
L["Tinkee Steamboil at Flame Crest had invented the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 and wanted eight broodling essences caught with it from the black broodlings of the Burning Steppes. I caught them. Then Tinkee had a letter for Felnok Steelspring in Everlook, Felnok wanted eight uncracked chillwind horns, and what came of it was a package that had to go all the way back to Flame Crest. Gnomes invent things. Couriers walk them around."] = "烈焰峰的丁奇·斯迪波爾發明了龍靈採集器900型，要我拿它去燃燒平原的黑色雛龍身上抓八份雛龍精華。我抓到了。接著丁奇有封信要交給永望鎮的菲諾克，菲諾克又要八支完整的冰風奇美拉角，最後換來的是一個包裹，還得一路送回烈焰峰。地精負責發明東西，跑腿的負責帶著它們到處走。"
L["Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold had found pieces of a tablet left by the Twilight's Hammer and wanted the rest. I brought eight fragments, and the restored tablet went to Hermit Ortell, who once ran with the cult and now lives alone out in the desert. Ortell wanted the three chapters of the Twilight Lexicon to read the rest of it. The cultists carrying them did not hand them over politely."] = "塞納里奧城堡的地理學家拉克斯班找到了暮光之錘留下的一塊石板的幾片碎片，想把剩下的也湊齊。我帶回了八塊碎片，修補好的石板則送到了隱士奧泰爾手上，他以前跟著那個教派混過，現在一個人住在沙漠裡。奧泰爾想要暮光詞典的三章，才讀得懂石板上其餘的內容。帶著那幾章的教徒，可沒有客客氣氣地把東西交出來。"
L["Dorn Plainstalker in Thousand Needles tests people before trusting them. Faith meant stepping off a plank high over the canyon. Endurance meant Grenka's claw, strength meant the fragments of Rok'Alim, and lore meant a trip to Braug Dimspirit in the Stonetalon Mountains, who sent me after the Legacy of the Aspects and then asked me a question about it. I answered right. Braug sent me on to Parqual Fintallas in the Undercity, who had one more test waiting."] = "千針石林的多恩·平原行者在信任一個人之前，會先考驗對方。信仰，就是從高懸在峽谷上方的木板一步踏出去。耐力是格林卡的爪子，力量是羅卡里姆的碎片，知識則得跑一趟石爪山去找布勞格·幽魂，他派我去找《巨龍的遺產》，然後針對這本書問了我一個問題。我答對了。布勞格接著把我送去幽暗城找帕科瓦·芬塔拉斯，那裡還有一道試煉在等著我。"
L["Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity needed a pile of kraul guano from Razorfen Kraul. I didn't ask what for. I brought it, Faranell was thrilled, and there was more work after that."] = "幽暗城的大藥劑師法拉尼爾需要一堆剃刀沼澤的沼澤蝙蝠的糞便。我沒問要拿來做什麼。我把東西帶了回去，法拉尼爾高興得不得了，之後還有更多工作等著我。"
L["Caretaker Alen at Light's Hope Chapel told me the dead of Stratholme can't rest, and that a man named Egan was trying to do something about it. All anyone knew was that Egan had last been seen around Stratholme, so that's where I looked."] = "聖光之願禮拜堂的護理者奧林告訴我，斯坦索姆的亡者無法安息，而有個叫伊根的人正想為此做點什麼。大家只知道伊根最後一次被人看見是在斯坦索姆附近，所以我就往那裡找去了。"
L["Nathanos Blightcaller doesn't hand out favors. First I had to go to the Quel'Lithien lodge in the north of the Eastern Plaguelands for the Quel'Thalas Registry, and thin out the rangers, pathstriders and woodsmen camped there. Then Nathanos wanted Duskwing, a bat that hunts north of Marris Stead, or at least a patch of its fur. After that, apparently, we could talk."] = "納薩諾斯‧凋零者可不會隨便施恩於人。首先，我得去東瘟疫之地北部的奎爾林斯小屋拿回奎爾薩拉斯名冊，順便把在那裡紮營的遊俠、巡路者和護林者清掉一批。接著納薩諾斯要暗翼蝠，一隻在瑪瑞斯農場北邊獵食的蝙蝠，至少也要牠身上的一塊皮。據說辦完這些，我們就可以好好談談了。"
L["Marvon Rivetseeker had left something called the Stone Circle in a workshop in Ratchet and wanted it fetched. I fetched it, and Marvon had plans for it."] = "瑪爾馮·瑞文斯克把一個叫石環的東西留在棘齒城的工坊裡，想找人去拿回來。我拿回來了，而瑪爾馮對它早有打算。"
L["Brohann Caskbelly of the Explorers' League in Stormwind wanted the Temple of Atal'Hakkar found, and the trail started in the Hinterlands. High Thane Falstad Wildhammer at Aerie Peak sent me to Gryphon Master Talonaxe, who sent me to Rhapsody Shindigger, who knew a tale about the temple and would tell it for a cocktail of roc gizzards, groddoc livers and ironfur livers. I brought the ingredients, heard the tale, and carried a fragment of an Atal'ai tablet back to Brohann."] = "暴風城探險者協會的布羅哈恩·鐵桶想找到阿塔哈卡神廟，而線索得從辛特蘭開始追。鷹巢山的男爵族長弗斯塔德·蠻錘把我派去找獅鷲獸管理員沙拉克·鷹斧，鷹斧又把我派去找拉普索迪·鐵鏟。拉普索迪知道一個關於那座神廟的故事，只要給他一杯用大鵬的砂囊、格羅多克猩猩的肝臟和鐵鬃熊的肝臟調成的雞尾酒，他就肯講。我帶來了材料，聽完了故事，再把一塊阿塔萊石板碎片帶回去交給布羅哈恩。"
L["Fel'zerul in Stonard wanted to know more about the trolls at the Pool of Tears, and sent me to collect ten of their Atal'ai artifacts. Fel'zerul couldn't make sense of them and sent me with the bundle to an Atal'ai exile hiding in the Hinterlands, who could. Then I took what the exile had to say back to Stonard."] = "斯通納德的費澤盧爾想多了解淚水之池那些食人妖的底細，派我去收集十件他們的阿塔萊神器。費澤盧爾看不懂那些東西，就要我把那包神器帶去給一個躲在辛特蘭的阿塔萊流放者，那人看得懂。然後我再把流放者說的話帶回斯通納德。"
L["Before anyone at Chillwind Camp would talk to me about Scholomance, Commander Ashlam Valorfist wanted Sorrow Hill cleared of skeletal flayers and slavering ghouls, and then the four watchtowers of Andorhal marked with a beacon torch, standing in each doorway in turn. Only then did the commander mention the school."] = "在冰風營地，想要有人跟我談通靈學院，得先過指揮官阿胥拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特這一關：他要我把悔恨嶺的骷髏剝皮者和被奴役的食屍鬼清乾淨，再拿信號火炬去標記安多哈爾的四座哨塔，每一座都得輪流站到門口去標。直到這時，指揮官才提起那所學校。"
L["Before High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark would talk to me about Scholomance, the Scarlet Crusade's camp between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears had to lose its command tent and gain a Scourge banner, and the four watchtowers of Andorhal had to be marked with a beacon torch, from each doorway in turn. Only then did the executor mention the school."] = "在亡靈壁壘，想讓高階執行官德靈頓跟我談通靈學院，得先辦好兩件事：血色十字軍在費爾斯通農場和達爾松之淚之間的營地，要少一頂指揮帳篷、多一面天譴軍團的戰旗；安多哈爾的四座哨塔，要用信號火炬做上標記，每一座都得輪流站到門口去標。直到這時，執行官才提起那所學校。"
L["Prospector Stormpike in Ironforge sent me to Prospector Ironband in Loch Modan, who was worried about a prospector called Agmond, missing out in the Badlands. I found him. He was dead, killed by a trogg called Murdaloc, so I dealt with Murdaloc and twelve of his Stonevault bonesnappers and reported back to Ironband."] = "鐵爐堡的勘察員塔伯斯·雷矛把我派去洛克莫丹找勘察員基恩薩·鐵環，鐵環正為一個叫阿戈莫德的勘察員擔心，他在荒蕪之地失蹤了。我找到他了。他已經死了，是被一個叫莫達洛克的穴居人殺的，所以我收拾了莫達洛克和他手下十二個石窟斷骨者，再回去向鐵環報告。"
L["In Searing Gorge, Velarok Windblade told me a story about the black dragonflight and asked for help paying them back. Paying them back took four hearts of flame, four globes of golem oil, eight thorium-plated daggers and a Symbol of Ragnaros, all for the Torch of Retribution. Squire Maltrake then had me carry it into the four sentry towers and set each one ablaze, and the chest that opened afterwards held a black dragonflight molt. Cyrus Therepentous in the Burning Steppes wanted to see it."] = "在灼熱峽谷，維拉若克·溫布雷跟我講了一段關於黑龍軍團的往事，請我幫他報這個仇。報這個仇，要用上四份烈焰之心、四份魔像之油、八把瑟銀匕首和一個拉格納羅斯符記，全都是為了打造懲戒火炬。接著侍衛瑪特拉克要我帶著火炬走進四座哨塔，一座一座點火燒掉，事後打開的箱子裡放著一張黑龍軍團之皮。燃燒平原的塞勒斯·薩雷芬圖斯想看看它。"
L["Thunderheart in Kargath sent me into Blackrock Mountain first, to the quarry, where Overmaster Pyron kept watch over the way into the depths. Pyron fell, and the way in was open."] = "卡加斯的桑德哈特先派我進黑石山，到採石場去，征服者派隆就在那裡把守著通往深淵的路。派隆倒下了，路也就通了。"
L["Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania in Kargath wanted ten fractured elemental shards from the golems and elementals of the Burning Steppes. I brought them, and Theodora sent a sample with me to Lotwil Veriatus, camped to the east of Kargath."] = "卡加斯的塞朵拉·穆瓦丹尼想要十塊斷裂的元素碎片，得從燃燒平原的機械傀儡和元素生物身上取得。我把碎片帶了回來，塞朵拉便要我帶著一份樣本，去找在卡加斯東邊紮營的魯特維爾·沃拉圖斯。"
L["Before he told me anything, the old man in the cottage wanted his corner of the Eastern Plaguelands cleaned up: fifteen slabs of meat from the carrion grubs and devourers, thirty plaguebats out of the sky, and a pack of plaguehounds, runts and all. Then he talked."] = "在告訴我任何事之前，小屋裡的老人想先把他在東瘟疫之地的那一角清理乾淨：從腐肉蟲和腐肉吞噬者身上弄來十五塊肉，從天上打下三十隻瘟疫蝙蝠，再收拾一群瘟疫犬，連幼犬也不放過。然後他才開口。"
-- END CONTENT STRINGS
